msgid "Typed I/O: devices and execution contracts"
msgstr "类型化 I/O：设备与执行合同"

msgid "Use this index to open declarations from public headers. Select a supported part, Board and mode through the [support matrix](../../delivery/support.md), then follow that mode's design contract and the header's call requirements. A public header or optional method does not authorize every provider or device."
msgstr "通过本索引打开公共头中的声明。先按[支持矩阵](../../delivery/support.md)选择已支持的精确型号、Board 和模式，再遵守该模式的设计合同与头文件调用要求。公共头或可选方法的存在不授予所有 provider 或器件相同能力。"

msgid "Factory lookup returns an existing immutable face without starting hardware. Controllers, child endpoints and optional faces retain their declared identities; querying a face does not activate media or acquire a memory bank. Vendor Handles and mutable provider state remain private."
msgstr "Factory 查询只返回既有不可变 face，不启动硬件。控制器、子 endpoint 与可选 face 各自保留声明的身份；查询 face 不激活介质，也不取得存储 bank。厂商 Handle 和可变 provider 状态保持私有。"

msgid "Find the selected interface"
msgstr "查找所选接口"

msgid "Task"
msgstr "任务"

msgid "Public headers"
msgstr "公共头"

msgid "Samples, camera storage and finite audio"
msgstr "采样、相机存储与有限音频"

