msgstr "`block.h`, `block_async.h`, `sdio_io.h`, `flash.h`, `flash_async.h`, `flash_maintenance.h`, `nand.h`, `external_bus.h`, `memory_window.h`, `parallel16.h`"

msgid "Calendar and backup resources"
msgstr "日历与备份资源"

msgid "`rtc.h`, `rtc_aux.h`"
msgstr "`rtc.h`, `rtc_aux.h`"

msgid "Timed outputs and finite waveforms"
msgstr "定时输出与有限波形"

msgid "`advanced_pwm.h`, `pwm_group.h`, `timer_pulse.h`, `timer_sequence.h`, `timer_capture.h`"
msgstr "`advanced_pwm.h`, `pwm_group.h`, `timer_pulse.h`, `timer_sequence.h`, `timer_capture.h`"

msgid "USB packets, activation and explicit roles"
msgstr "USB 包、激活与显式角色"

msgid "`usb_device.h`, `usb_host.h`, `usb_otg.h`, `usb_activation.h`, `usb_profile.h`"
msgstr "`usb_device.h`, `usb_host.h`, `usb_otg.h`, `usb_activation.h`, `usb_profile.h`"

msgid "Borrowing, progress and observation"
msgstr "借用、进展与观察"

msgid "`stream.h`, `frame_stream.h`, `dma.h`, `wake.h`, `observation.h`, `diagnostic.h`"
msgstr "`stream.h`, `frame_stream.h`, `dma.h`, `wake.h`, `observation.h`, `diagnostic.h`"

msgid "Lengths, numeric word order, frame geometry and result counts belong to each face. Accepted requests and buffers remain borrowed until acquire-observed SETTLED; cancellation, timeout and DMA completion do not revoke a borrow. Caller-owned streams and derived memory pointers also need their own joined release. The [I/O ownership design](../../design/io-evolution.md) explains these relationships; declarations below remain the signature authority."
msgstr "长度、数值字序、帧几何和结果计数由各 face 定义。已接纳的请求及缓冲区持续被借用，直到通过 acquire 观察到 SETTLED；取消、超时与 DMA 完成都不撤销借用。调用者持有的流和派生存储指针也须各自完成 join 后归还。[I/O 所有权设计](../../design/io-evolution.md)说明这些关系；下列声明仍是签名的权威来源。"

msgid "Use the header's required executor, preparation method and live time domain. Explicit service advances finite transfers and failed drain; the library does not create a product worker. Restart and epoch rules belong to the selected provider. [RTC](../../design/f407-rtc.md), [serial wire modes](../../design/uart-wire-modes.md), [SPI frames](../../design/spi-frame-modes.md) and [capture/audio](../../design/f407-capture-audio.md) describe their exact arming, final-access and recovery boundaries."
msgstr "使用公共头要求的执行者、准备方法与活跃时间域。显式 service 推进有限传输及失败排空；库不创建产品 worker。重启和 epoch 规则由所选 provider 定义。[RTC](../../design/f407-rtc.md)、[串行线模式](../../design/uart-wire-modes.md)、[SPI 帧](../../design/spi-frame-modes.md)及 [capture/audio](../../design/f407-capture-audio.md)说明其精确 arm、最终访问与恢复边界。"

msgid "I2C target exchanges use `i2c_target.h` and borrow complete bounded requests. WRITE_READ supplies a precomputed response across one repeated START. The [F407 target contract](../../design/f407-i2c-target.md) defines own addresses, optional PEC/ARA, IRQ latency and full drain. Product command tables, ARP and Host Notify remain external."
msgstr "I2C target 交换通过 `i2c_target.h` 借用完整的有界请求。WRITE_READ 通过一次 repeated START，在接收后发送预计算响应。[F407 target 合同](../../design/f407-i2c-target.md)定义自身地址、可选 PEC／ARA、IRQ 延迟与完整排空。产品命令表、ARP 和 Host Notify 仍由外部提供。"

msgid "Media activation, function selection, memory-window leases and permanent startup backing are distinct operations. A block session does not turn an SDIO function into sector media. A CPU-window lease grants only its declared bank access; startup backing remains held while its static objects exist. See [physical storage](../../design/f407-storage.md) and [FSMC](../../design/f407-fsmc.md) before selecting those interfaces."
msgstr "介质激活、function 选择、存储窗口 lease 与永久启动后备存储是不同操作。块会话不把 SDIO function 转为扇区介质。CPU window lease 只授予声明的 bank 访问；启动后备存储在静态对象存续期间始终被持有。选择这些接口前先读[物理存储](../../design/f407-storage.md)与 [FSMC](../../design/f407-fsmc.md) 合同。"

msgid "For RS485, pair `nx_factory_uart_ref()` and `nx_factory_uart_tx_validator_ref()` with the same exact UART identity and transport context. The caller owns DE, setup/hold timing and joined shutdown; the {ref}`RS485 contract <uart__rs485_8h>` defines the composition. IRQ timestamps and sampled GPIO levels remain observations, with the source quality defined by the selected provider and the [infrared contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/infrared/README.md)."
msgstr "RS485 必须将 `nx_factory_uart_ref()` 与 `nx_factory_uart_tx_validator_ref()` 配对到完全相同的 UART 身份和传输 context。调用者负责 DE、setup／hold 时序及完成 join 的关闭；{ref}`RS485 合同 <uart__rs485_8h>`定义该组合。IRQ 时间戳和采样 GPIO 电平仍是观察值，其来源质量由所选 provider 与[红外合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/infrared/README.md)定义。"

msgid "USB Device and Host use distinct packet faces. An explicitly managed OTG role owns the selected core/PHY and exposes the ready face for its current generation. The [USB ownership contract](../../design/usb-device.md) defines PHY speeds, PIO or HS AHB DMA, power handover and optional ST Core bridges."
msgstr "USB Device 和 Host 使用独立的 packet face。显式 managed OTG 角色拥有选定 core／PHY，并为当前 generation 提供 ready face。[USB 所有权合同](../../design/usb-device.md)定义 PHY 速度、PIO 或 HS AHB DMA、供电交接及可选 ST Core 桥接。"

msgid "Native controls in `model.h`, `spi_dma_model.h` and `rtc_lptim_model.h` are host test interfaces. They establish no MCU discovery or physical support."
msgstr "`model.h`、`spi_dma_model.h` 与 `rtc_lptim_model.h` 中的 Native 控制属于 host 测试接口，不建立 MCU 发现能力或物理支持。"

msgid "block.h"
msgstr "block.h"

msgid "Synchronous sector I/O with explicit partial progress."
msgstr "具有显式部分进度的同步扇区 I/O。"

msgid "Author  Nexus Team"
msgstr "作者  Nexus Team"

msgid "Nexus Team"
msgstr "Nexus Team"

msgid "Enums"
msgstr "枚举"

msgid "Availability never substitutes for physical card-detect evidence."
msgstr "可用状态不能代替物理卡检测证据。"

msgid "Values:"
msgstr "取值："

msgid "Functions"
msgstr "函数"

msgid "Query admitted media geometry without starting an operation."
msgstr "查询已准入的介质几何，不启动操作。"

msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

msgid "[in] Initialized exact media session, serialized by its owner."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的精确介质会话，由其所有者串行执行。"

msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

msgid "Geometry valid until session stop/reinitialization, or NULL."
msgstr "几何有效至会话停机或重新初始化；也可能返回 NULL。"

msgid "Observe the owner state without asserting physical card presence."
msgstr "观察所有者状态，不断言物理卡存在。"

msgid "[in] Selected face under the same serialized owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一串行所有者管理的选定接口。"

msgid "Actual state, or UNAVAILABLE for an invalid/missing state method."
msgstr "实际状态；状态方法无效或缺失时返回 UNAVAILABLE。"

msgid "Explicitly discover one card after infrastructure cold preparation."
msgstr "在基础设施冷态准备完成后显式发现一张卡。"

msgid "Factory lookup and Platform startup never discover or replace media. Geometry is unavailable before activation. A different card requires explicit stop and activation; errors never silently reprobe a socket."
msgstr "Factory 查找和 Platform 启动不发现或更换介质。激活前几何不可用。更换卡需要显式停机再激活；发生错误时不静默重新探测卡座。"

msgid "[inout] Same serialized Thread owner; no existing live session."
msgstr "[inout] 同一串行 Thread 所有者；不存在既有有效会话。"

msgid "[in] Finite absolute provider-clock deadline."
msgstr "[in] provider 时钟域中的有限绝对 deadline。"

msgid "Success after exact card identification and geometry admission; failure retains any unproved controller/session cleanup owner."
msgstr "精确卡身份和几何准入后成功；失败保留任何尚未证明完成的控制器/会话清理责任。"

msgid "Read whole sectors synchronously with a finite absolute deadline."
msgstr "在有限绝对截止时间内同步读取完整扇区。"

msgid "No data pointer remains borrowed after return in this synchronous profile. Media/controller uncertainty may independently retain their owner, pins and gates and make stop refuse. No DMA is implied."
msgstr "在此同步配置中，返回后不保留任何数据指针借用。介质或控制器状态不确定可独立保留其所有者、引脚和时钟门责任，并使停机拒绝。不隐含 DMA 能力。"

msgid "[inout] Single privileged Thread owner; no ISR or reentrancy."
msgstr "[inout] 单个特权 Thread 所有者；禁止 ISR 或重入。"

msgid "[in] Logical sector index, never a byte address."
msgstr "[in] 逻辑扇区索引，不是字节地址。"

msgid "[out] Aligned caller storage, disjoint from provider/MMIO."
msgstr "[out] 对齐的调用方存储，与 provider/MMIO 分离。"

msgid "[in] Accessible bytes, at least blocks times block_bytes."
msgstr "[in] 可访问字节数，至少为 blocks 乘以 block_bytes。"

msgid "[in] Positive bounded count accepted by the selected provider."
msgstr "[in] 所选 provider 接受的正数有界计数。"

msgid "Status and confirmed whole-block prefix; current failed block may have changed. REJECTED parameters have zero hardware effects."
msgstr "状态与已确认的完整块前缀；当前失败块可能已经改变。REJECTED 参数不产生硬件效果。"

msgid "Write sectors; memory completion alone never proves media ready."
msgstr "写入扇区；内存访问完成本身不证明介质就绪。"

msgid "Return ends CPU buffer access but not uncertain media programming; UNCERTAIN retains controller responsibility. No atomicity, power-loss recovery or durability beyond the selected protocol is promised."
msgstr "返回结束 CPU 缓冲区访问，但不结束尚未确定的介质编程；UNCERTAIN 保留控制器责任。不承诺原子性、掉电恢复或超出所选协议的持久性。"

msgid "[inout] Single Thread owner with an admitted writable session."
msgstr "[inout] 单个 Thread 所有者，具有已准入的可写会话。"

msgid "[in] Logical sector index, checked before command writes."
msgstr "[in] 逻辑扇区索引，在命令写入前检查。"

msgid "[in] Aligned immutable caller storage until this call returns."
msgstr "[in] 对齐且不可变的调用方存储，持续有效至本次调用返回。"

msgid "[in] Accessible source bytes, at least the selected extent."
msgstr "[in] 可访问源字节数，至少覆盖所选范围。"

msgid "[in] Positive bounded count; no erase or product policy."
msgstr "[in] 正数有界计数；不包含擦除或产品策略。"

msgid "Status and whole blocks confirmed after card programming readiness. A failed current block may already have modified media."
msgstr "状态与卡编程就绪后确认的完整块。当前失败块可能已修改介质。"

msgid "Observe protocol readiness without replaying a prior failed write."
msgstr "观察协议就绪状态，不重放先前失败的写入。"

msgid "[inout] Same initialized media session and serialized owner."
msgstr "[inout] 同一已初始化介质会话和串行所有者。"

msgid "Success only after proved host/media readiness; failure retains uncertainty and never upgrades a prior transfer outcome."
msgstr "只有证明主机/介质就绪后才成功；失败保留不确定状态，绝不提升先前传输结果。"

msgid "Quiesce a session; a timeout never authorizes clock/pad withdrawal."
msgstr "使会话静止；超时不授权撤出时钟或引脚。"

msgid "[inout] Same owner, live through a refused stop/retry."
msgstr "[inout] 同一所有者，在停机拒绝和重试期间持续有效。"

msgid "Success after actual publisher/media withdrawal, or failure with provider cleanup responsibility retained. Platform cold close owns subsequent pad and gate restoration."
msgstr "实际发布方/介质撤出后成功；失败则保留 provider 清理责任。Platform 冷态关闭负责随后恢复引脚和时钟门。"

msgid "Record externally established physical removal of this exact card."
msgstr "记录由外部确认的这张精确卡的物理移除。"

msgid "Board owns detect and debounce. A timeout does not prove removal. Call after synchronous I/O has returned, or under the asynchronous owner's execution serialization. Outstanding borrows remain live. Explicit stop then activation is required before a replacement card."
msgstr "Board 负责 detect 与消抖。超时不证明移除。应在同步 I/O 返回后调用，或遵循异步 owner 的执行串行化。未结束的借用继续有效。更换卡之前必须显式 stop，再 activation。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized privileged unmasked Thread owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一串行化、特权且未屏蔽中断的 Thread 模式所有者。"

msgid "Success invalidates geometry and begins any required host drain."
msgstr "成功使 geometry 失效，并开始所需的 host 排空。"

msgid "Media geometry remains immutable during one initialized session."
msgstr "一个已初始化会话内的介质几何保持不可变。"

msgid "Public Members"
msgstr "公共成员"

msgid "Confirmed whole-block prefix; failed block bytes are unspecified."
msgstr "已确认的完整块前缀；失败块中的字节未指定。"

msgid "Shared readonly methods for one serialized execution owner."
msgstr "单个串行执行所有者的共享只读方法。"

msgid "Immutable face; lookup never starts clocks or accesses media."
msgstr "不可变接口；查找不启动时钟或访问介质。"

msgid "block_async.h"
msgstr "block_async.h"

msgid "Finite block borrows with explicit IRQ and DMA drain."
msgstr "具有显式 IRQ 与 DMA 排空的有限块借用。"

msgid "Admit a complete finite block request without allocation or workers."
msgstr "接纳完整的有限块请求，不分配存储或创建 worker。"

msgid "Initialize base with nx_request_initialize/prepare. Entire descriptor and payload remain stable until acquire-observed SETTLED. IRQ/DMA completion alone never releases them. The ordinary face owns explicit activation, sync and stop of the same media session."
msgstr "先以 nx_request_initialize/prepare 初始化 base。完整描述符和 payload 保持稳定，直到通过 acquire 观察到 SETTLED。单独的 IRQ／DMA 完成不释放它们。普通 face 负责同一介质会话的显式 activation、sync 和 stop。"

msgid "[in] Single privileged unmasked Thread execution owner."
msgstr "[in] 唯一的特权、未屏蔽中断的 Thread 模式执行所有者。"

msgid "[inout] READY descriptor, finite deadline and aligned span."
msgstr "[inout] READY 描述符、有限 deadline 与对齐 span。"

msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; rejection retains nothing and has no effect."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；拒绝不保留任何引用，也不产生效果。"

msgid "Request cancellation while retaining every borrowed reference."
msgstr "请求取消，同时保留每个借用引用。"

msgid "Cross-task controls use external stable slots and epochs. This call does not cancel a physical card programming pulse or release storage."
msgstr "跨任务控制使用外部稳定 slot 与 epoch。本调用不取消物理卡的编程脉冲，也不释放存储。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized execution owner as submit/service."
msgstr "[in] 与 submit/service 相同的串行化执行所有者。"

msgid "[inout] Exact live descriptor, never a stale pointer."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的活跃描述符，不能是过期指针。"

msgid "SUCCESS begins drain; STATE for another request."
msgstr "SUCCESS 开始排空；其他请求返回 STATE。"

msgid "Advance card readiness, deadlines and final source withdrawal."
msgstr "推进卡就绪、deadline 和最终来源撤回。"

msgid "No worker is created. Failed drain leaves QUARANTINED storage live; later service can retry the same cleanup. SETTLED is final access."
msgstr "不创建 worker。排空失败时 QUARANTINED 存储继续有效，后续 service 可重试同一清理。SETTLED 是最终访问。"

msgid "[in] Same privileged unmasked Thread executor."
msgstr "[in] 同一特权、未屏蔽中断的 Thread 模式执行者。"

msgid "Report externally established physical removal of this exact card."
msgstr "报告由外部确认的这张精确卡的物理移除。"

msgid "This is not a presence probe or debounce policy. Remove invalidates geometry; no replacement is admitted until explicit stop/activation. Removal never revokes an outstanding payload borrow."
msgstr "这不是存在性探测或消抖策略。Remove 使 geometry 失效；显式 stop/activation 之前不接纳替换卡。移除从不撤销未结束的 payload 借用。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized Thread owner, after Board detect evidence."
msgstr "[in] 同一串行化 Thread 模式所有者，已有 Board detect 证据。"

msgid "SUCCESS records removal and begins any needed host drain."
msgstr "SUCCESS 记录移除并开始所需的 host 排空。"

msgid "Stable caller descriptor and payload stay borrowed until SETTLED."
msgstr "调用者的稳定描述符和 payload 持续被借用，直到 SETTLED。"

msgid "Optional finite transport shares the ordinary block session."
msgstr "可选有限传输共享普通 block 会话。"

msgid "Immutable identity; queries and lookup never start media."
msgstr "不可变身份；查询和 lookup 从不启动介质。"

msgid "external_bus.h"
msgstr "external_bus.h"

msgid "Explicit shared external-controller lifecycle face."
msgstr "显式共享外部控制器生命周期接口。"

msgid "Software ownership phase; it never proves physical device fitting."
msgstr "软件所有权阶段，不证明物理器件实装。"

msgid "Observe the selected bus owner's software phase."
msgstr "观察所选总线所有者的软件阶段。"

msgid "No preparation, device discovery or bank acquisition is implicit. PREPARED is not physical clock or timing proof."
msgstr "不隐式准备、发现设备或取得 Bank。PREPARED 不证明物理时钟或时序。"

msgid "[in] Stable face under the same serialized task executor"
msgstr "[in] 同一串行任务执行者管理的稳定接口"

msgid "Actual ownership phase, UNAVAILABLE for a missing method"
msgstr "实际所有权阶段；缺少方法时返回 UNAVAILABLE"

msgid "Withdraw selected banks and only the acquired bus effects."
msgstr "撤出所选 Bank 以及仅已取得的总线效果。"

msgid "All endpoint consumers and CPU users must join first. Timeout never revokes a derived pointer. Cold Platform release restores the shared pad lease only afterward."
msgstr "必须先汇合所有端点消费者和 CPU 使用者。超时不撤销派生指针。之后才由 Platform 冷态释放恢复共享引脚租约。"

msgid "[in] Same exclusive controller owner, storage still alive"
msgstr "[in] 同一独占控制器所有者，存储仍有效"

msgid "SUCCESS after complete withdrawal, BUSY while a bank loan remains, or exact error retaining unfinished responsibility"
msgstr "完整撤出后返回 SUCCESS；Bank 借用仍存在时返回 BUSY，或返回保留未完成责任的精确错误"

msgid "One readonly method table; callbacks receive the actual bus owner."
msgstr "单个只读方法表；回调接收实际总线所有者。"

msgid "Immutable controller face, distinct from every child bank endpoint."
msgstr "不可变控制器接口，与每个子 Bank 端点区分。"

msgid "parallel16.h"
msgstr "parallel16.h"

msgid "Settled 16-bit command and data endpoint."
msgstr "同步 16 位命令与数据端点。"

msgid "Send one complete command-register word."
msgstr "发送一个完整命令寄存器字。"

msgid "Partial device effects can survive a failure. No reset, command replay, worker, DMA or GPIO control is implied."
msgstr "失败后可能保留部分设备效果。不隐含复位、命令重放、工作线程、DMA 或 GPIO 控制。"

msgid "[in] Live exact bank under its serialized owner"
msgstr "[in] 由串行所有者管理的有效精确 Bank"

msgid "[in] Native command word, not a byte-count address"
msgstr "[in] 本机命令字，不是按字节计数的地址"

msgid "[in] Finite absolute provider-clock deadline"
msgstr "[in] provider 时钟域中的有限绝对 deadline"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, UNSUPPORTED or provider failure"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、UNSUPPORTED 或 provider 失败"

msgid "Write one settled data-register word sequence."
msgstr "写入一段已完成的数据寄存器字序列。"

msgid "Every return ends buffer access. It does not revoke the bank lease or prove physical panel state. Consumer and bus lifecycle must join before shared infrastructure withdrawal."
msgstr "每次返回都结束缓冲区访问，但不撤销 Bank 租约或证明物理面板状态。撤出共享基础设施前必须汇合消费者和总线生命周期。"

msgid "[in] Same live bank and task executor"
msgstr "[in] 同一有效 Bank 和任务执行者"

msgid "[in] Aligned immutable span, disjoint from known controls"
msgstr "[in] 对齐的不可变区间，与已知控制对象分离"

msgid "[in] Positive word count within the selected mode bound"
msgstr "[in] 所选模式边界内的正数字数"

msgid "[out] Distinct exact completed word prefix"
msgstr "[out] 分离的精确已完成字前缀"

msgid "[in] One finite absolute deadline for the sequence"
msgstr "[in] 整段序列共用的单个有限绝对截止时间"

msgid "SUCCESS only for count words; provider error may report a shorter prefix. Parameter rejection preserves output."
msgstr "只有完成 count 个字才返回 SUCCESS；provider 错误可报告较短前缀。参数拒绝保留输出。"

msgid "Read one settled data-register word sequence."
msgstr "读取一段已完成的数据寄存器字序列。"

msgid "Dummy-read/command sequencing belongs to the device protocol. This endpoint never interprets a controller ID."
msgstr "空读与命令顺序属于设备协议。此端点不解释控制器 ID。"

msgid "[out] Aligned writable storage, disjoint from controls"
msgstr "[out] 对齐的可写存储，与控制对象分离"

msgid "[in] Positive selected word count"
msgstr "[in] 选定的正数字数"

msgid "SUCCESS only for count words; failed-prefix bytes outside transferred are unspecified. Parameter rejection preserves transferred and performs no access."
msgstr "只有完成 count 个字才返回 SUCCESS；transferred 以外失败前缀中的字节未指定。参数拒绝保留 transferred 且不执行访问。"

msgid "Shared immutable methods for one 16-bit parallel endpoint."
msgstr "单个 16 位并行端点的共享不可变方法。"

msgid "Words are native halfwords; the selected physical route fixes command/data addresses and electrical bus timing. Methods use one serialized task executor and one finite absolute clock domain. No span survives a return, including failure. SUCCESS requires the whole requested word prefix."
msgstr "字是本机半字；所选物理路线固定命令/数据地址和电气总线时序。方法使用单个串行任务执行者和单个有限绝对时钟域。每次返回都不保留任何区间，包括失败。SUCCESS 要求完成请求的全部字前缀。"

msgid "Stable readonly face; lookup acquires no bus or bank lease."
msgstr "稳定只读接口；查找不取得总线或 Bank 租约。"

msgid "memory_window.h"
msgstr "memory_window.h"

msgid "Exact caller-owned CPU memory-window leases."
msgstr "由调用方持有的精确 CPU 内存窗口租约。"

msgid "Borrow one complete admitted CPU memory window."
msgstr "借用一个完整且已准入的 CPU 内存窗口。"

msgid "CPU accessibility is not physical retention or timing qualification. No heap pool or automatic SRAM test exists."
msgstr "CPU 可访问性不等于物理保持或时序资格。不提供堆池或自动 SRAM 测试。"

msgid "[in] Live selected bank under one serialized task owner"
msgstr "[in] 单个串行任务所有者管理的有效选定 Bank"

msgid "[inout] Fresh zero stable disjoint caller storage"
msgstr "[inout] 新鲜、清零、稳定且分离的调用方存储"

msgid "SUCCESS with exact address/bytes/epoch, or rejection with lease and hardware unchanged"
msgstr "SUCCESS 并提供精确 address/bytes/epoch；或拒绝且租约与硬件不变"

msgid "Release the original loan after all direct users joined."
msgstr "所有直接使用者汇合后归还原始借用。"

msgid "The provider enforces identity and orders prior CPU access before later bank withdrawal. It cannot detect a caller violating the join precondition by reusing a raw pointer."
msgstr "provider 强制身份匹配，并将先前 CPU 访问排序在随后 Bank 撤出之前。它无法检测调用方通过复用原始指针违反汇合前置条件的行为。"

msgid "[in] Exact same bank identity that granted the loan"
msgstr "[in] 授予借用的完全相同 Bank 身份"

msgid "[inout] Original stable lease storage, never a copied token"
msgstr "[inout] 原始稳定租约存储，不能使用复制的令牌"

msgid "[in] Generation captured on the original acquisition"
msgstr "[in] 原始取得时捕获的代次"

msgid "SUCCESS or exact stale/foreign/release rejection; failed release retains the original responsibility"
msgstr "SUCCESS 或精确的过期、外来或归还拒绝；归还失败保留原始责任"

msgid "Read selected bank geometry without acquiring a loan."
msgstr "读取选定 Bank 几何，不取得借用。"

msgid "This performs no memory test or implied initialization. startup_backing never grants an exclusive whole-bank loan."
msgstr "不执行内存测试或隐式初始化。startup_backing 不授予独占整 Bank 借用。"

msgid "[in] Stable selected face under its serialized owner."
msgstr "[in] 由串行所有者管理的稳定选定接口。"

msgid "[out] Distinct aligned caller output, preserved on input rejection; provider errors may leave it unchanged."
msgstr "[out] 分离且对齐的调用方输出，输入拒绝时保持不变；provider 错误可能保留其原值。"

msgid "SUCCESS with readonly facts, STATE before facts exist, UNSUPPORTED for a missing method or exact provider failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS 并提供只读事实；事实尚不存在时返回 STATE，缺少方法时返回 UNSUPPORTED，或返回精确 provider 失败。"

msgid "Stable exclusive direct-access loan; zero before acquire."
msgstr "稳定的独占直接访问借用；取得前清零。"

msgid "Do not copy a live lease or alter fields. owner is opaque provider identity, not a public device pointer. CPU accesses use address directly without per-load dispatch. This first profile permits CPU data read/write only; it does not grant DMA, executable, allocator or C-runtime startup backing. Join all derived pointer users before release. A timeout or lost pointer never proves that those users have stopped."
msgstr "不得复制有效租约或修改字段。owner 是不透明的 provider 身份，不是公共设备指针。CPU 直接使用 address 访问，每次加载不经分派。首个配置只允许 CPU 数据读写，不授予 DMA、执行、分配器或 C 运行时启动支撑能力。释放前必须汇合所有派生指针使用者。超时或指针丢失不证明这些使用者已经停止。"

msgid "Readonly physical geometry, never permission to use bytes."
msgstr "只读物理几何，不授予字节使用权限。"

msgid "startup_backing marks memory with live startup objects. A whole-bank runtime loan is unsupported for that profile. Geometry does not authorize DMA, probing or allocation."
msgstr "startup_backing 标识具有有效启动对象的内存。此配置不支持整 Bank 运行时借用。几何不授权 DMA、探测或分配。"

msgid "Immutable methods for one exact selected memory bank."
msgstr "单个精确选定内存 Bank 的不可变方法。"

msgid "Immutable face; lookup does not acquire, clear or test memory."
msgstr "不可变接口；查找不取得、清除或测试内存。"

msgid "chip.h"
msgstr "chip.h"

msgid "Read-only observed silicon identity without runtime storage."
msgstr "无需运行时存储的只读硅片身份观察。"

msgid "Read the selected SoC's physical identity into independent storage."
msgstr "读取所选 SoC 的物理身份到独立存储。"

msgid "Bounded privileged task/ISR read, including masked context. No clocks, allocation, preparation or retained references. The selected Platform supplies this symbol; CPU-only Runtime does not supply a SoC backend. UID is public silicon identity, not authentication. The device/revision fields do not prove an exact package or ordering code. Explicit Native test support reports UNSUPPORTED without inventing physical identity."
msgstr "有界的特权 task／ISR 读取，包含已屏蔽中断的上下文。不启用时钟，不分配存储，不需准备，也不保留引用。符号由所选 Platform 提供；CPU-only Runtime 不提供 SoC 后端。UID 是公开的硅片身份，不提供认证证明。device／revision 字段不能证明精确封装或完整订货号。显式 Native 测试支撑返回 UNSUPPORTED，不编造物理身份。"

msgid "[out] Aligned caller-owned output; changed only on success."
msgstr "[out] 对齐且由调用方拥有的输出；仅在成功时修改。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT or UNSUPPORTED; no cached fallback values."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT 或 UNSUPPORTED；不使用缓存回退值。"

msgid "Raw identity words, revision and actual factory Flash capacity."
msgstr "原始身份字、revision 与实际出厂 Flash 容量。"

msgid "crc.h"
msgstr "crc.h"

msgid "Serialized CRC-32 of an explicit sequence of 32-bit words."
msgstr "对明确的 32 位字序列执行串行 CRC-32 计算。"

msgid "Compute fixed CRC-32 without byte-order or padding inference."
msgstr "计算固定 CRC-32，不推断字节顺序或补齐规则。"

msgid "Polynomial is 0x04C11DB7, initial state 0xffffffff, no reflection and no final XOR. An empty sequence returns the initial state. This is a word sequence contract, not an arbitrary CRC or Ethernet byte stream. No allocation, IRQ, DMA or retained references; inputs, output and face remain stable through this synchronous call. A timeout discards the partial calculation; each new call begins with a fresh initial state. Caller storage is disjoint from provider state and hardware controls."
msgstr "多项式为 0x04C11DB7，初始状态为 0xffffffff，不反射且无 final XOR。空序列返回初始状态。这是数值字序列合同，不是任意 CRC 或 Ethernet 字节流接口。不分配存储，不使用 IRQ／DMA，也不保留引用；输入、输出和接口在该同步调用期间保持稳定。超时丢弃部分计算；每次新调用从全新初始状态开始。调用方存储与 provider state 和硬件控制区分离。"

msgid "[in] Initialized face with one serialized privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 具有单一串行特权 task owner 的已初始化接口。"

msgid "[in] Aligned immutable 32-bit values, consumed MSB first. NULL is permitted only for an empty sequence."
msgstr "[in] 对齐且不可变的 32 位数值，MSB 优先处理。仅空序列允许 NULL。"

msgid "[in] Number of words, not bytes; no implicit trailing padding."
msgstr "[in] 数值字的数量，不是字节数；不隐式补齐尾部。"

msgid "[in] Absolute live Core deadline, including final readback."
msgstr "[in] 当前 Core 时域的绝对 deadline，包含最终读回。"

msgid "[out] Independent aligned output, changed only on success."
msgstr "[out] 独立且对齐的输出，仅在成功时修改。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, CONTEXT, TIMEOUT, IO or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE、CONTEXT、TIMEOUT、IO 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Shared immutable methods receive the selected controller context."
msgstr "共享的不可变方法接收所选 controller 的 context。"

msgid "Stable controller identity; lookup never resets the calculator."
msgstr "稳定的 controller 身份；查询不会 reset 计算器。"

msgid "dac.h"
msgstr "dac.h"

msgid "Raw DAC output, explicit triggers and digital observation."
msgstr "原始 DAC 输出、显式触发与数字观察。"

msgid "One serialized task owner controls a port. Factory lookup has no hardware effect. Digital codes do not measure voltage, settling, precision or the external load."
msgstr "端口由单一任务所有者串行控制。factory 查找不产生硬件副作用。数字码不测量电压、建立时间、精度或外部负载。"

msgid "Defines"
msgstr "宏定义"

msgid "Input storage encoding, distinct from the 12-bit digital output."
msgstr "输入的存储编码；与 12 位数字输出的表示方式相区分。"

msgid "Optional deterministic hardware waveform, never an entropy source."
msgstr "可选的确定性硬件波形，不能用作熵源。"

msgid "Query fixed raw format and authorized channels without starting I/O."
msgstr "查询固定原始格式与授权通道，不启动 I/O。"

msgid "[in] Stable initialized face; serialized task owner."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且已初始化的接口；由串行任务 owner 使用。"

msgid "[out] Independent output storage, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出存储；拒绝时保持原值。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Stage one input code; left alignment is encoded by the provider."
msgstr "暂存一个输入码；左对齐由 provider 编码。"

msgid "No buffer is retained. Triggered output waits for a later trigger; waveform offsets must leave room for the selected amplitude."
msgstr "不保留 buffer。触发模式的输出等待后续触发；波形偏移必须为所选幅度保留空间。"

msgid "[in] Selected controller under one serialized task owner."
msgstr "[in] 由一个串行任务 owner 控制的所选控制器。"

msgid "[in] Physical channel 1 or 2, authorized by this face."
msgstr "[in] 此接口授权的物理通道 1 或 2。"

msgid "[in] 0..255 for u8 or 0..4095 for either 12-bit storage format."
msgstr "[in] u8 为 0..255，两种 12 位存储格式均为 0..4095。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, PERMISSION, STATE, CONTEXT or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、PERMISSION、STATE、CONTEXT 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Stage both channels using one hardware dual-data write."
msgstr "通过一次硬件双通道数据写入暂存两个通道。"

msgid "No retained buffers. A common trigger determines simultaneous output; atomic staging alone does not establish analog simultaneity."
msgstr "不保留 buffer。公共触发决定同时输出；原子暂存本身不能证明模拟输出同时变化。"

msgid "[in] Exclusive owner authorized for both channels."
msgstr "[in] 同时获得两个通道授权的独占 owner。"

msgid "[in] Channel-one input code in the selected raw unit."
msgstr "[in] 按所选原始单位表示的通道 1 输入码。"

msgid "[in] Channel-two input code in the selected raw unit."
msgstr "[in] 按所选原始单位表示的通道 2 输入码。"

msgid "Enable selected outputs and their explicitly owned trigger source."
msgstr "启用所选输出及其显式拥有的触发源。"

msgid "Failure may retain enabled hardware; stop/close must observe release. Declared digital startup does not qualify an unknown analog load."
msgstr "失败后可能保留已启用硬件；stop／close 必须观察释放。声明的数字启动完成不代表未知模拟负载已通过验证。"

msgid "[in] Prepared exclusive task owner; no concurrent controls."
msgstr "[in] 已准备的独占任务 owner；禁止并发控制。"

msgid "[in] Positive for an owned timer; zero for direct/software."
msgstr "[in] 使用独占定时器触发时采样率须为正；direct／software 模式须为零。"

msgid "[in] Absolute monotonic deadline including startup delay."
msgstr "[in] 包括启动延时的绝对单调 deadline。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY, STATE, TIMEOUT, IO, CONTEXT or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY、STATE、TIMEOUT、IO、CONTEXT 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Emit one common software trigger for an authorized channel mask."
msgstr "为授权通道掩码发出一次公共软件触发。"

msgid "This never substitutes for an external trigger or a DMA request."
msgstr "此操作不能替代外部触发或 DMA 请求。"

msgid "[in] Running software-trigger owner, serialized task context."
msgstr "[in] 运行中的软件触发 owner；串行任务上下文。"

msgid "[in] Nonempty NX_DAC_CHANNEL_* mask within authorization."
msgstr "[in] 授权范围内的非空 NX_DAC_CHANNEL_* 掩码。"

msgid "Stop progression and hold selected idle codes until full close."
msgstr "停止推进并保持所选空闲码，直至完整 close。"

msgid "BUSY/failure retains hardware responsibility. Full Platform release later disables the DAC and restores its selected original pin fields."
msgstr "BUSY／失败保留硬件责任。后续完整 Platform 释放才禁用 DAC 并恢复所选原引脚字段。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized owner, with all caller storage still live."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行 owner，调用者存储须仍然存活。"

msgid "[in] Absolute deadline for the digital idle observation."
msgstr "[in] 数字空闲观察的绝对 deadline。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, BUSY, TIMEOUT, IO or CONTEXT."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE、BUSY、TIMEOUT、IO 或 CONTEXT。"

msgid "Read digital DOR and declared timer division, not analog voltage."
msgstr "读取数字 DOR 和声明的 timer 分频，不读取模拟电压。"

msgid "[in] Initialized task owner; no concurrent state mutation."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的任务 owner；禁止并发修改状态。"

msgid "[out] Independent snapshot; u8 input reads back as code<<4."
msgstr "[out] 独立快照；u8 输入回读为 code<<4。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, CONTEXT or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE、CONTEXT 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Immutable selected facts; no physical qualification is inferred."
msgstr "不可变的所选事实；不由此推导物理资格。"

msgid "DOR codes always use 12-bit right alignment, including u8 input."
msgstr "DOR 码始终使用 12 位右对齐，u8 输入也如此。"

msgid "Shared immutable operations; callbacks receive instance context."
msgstr "共享的不可变方法表；回调接收实例 context。"

msgid "Face and caller/provider storage outlive all uses and full close."
msgstr "接口及调用者／provider 存储必须存活至所有使用和完整 close 结束。"

msgid "dac_tx.h"
msgstr "dac_tx.h"

msgid "Borrowed encoded DAC frames under one serialized owner."
msgstr "由单个串行 owner 借用的编码 DAC 帧。"

msgid "Transport selection is static. No allocation, queue or worker is created by preparation or interface lookup."
msgstr "静态选择传输实现。准备请求或查询接口都不分配存储，也不创建队列或 worker。"

msgid "Prepare an unborrowed descriptor without copying encoded frames."
msgstr "准备尚未借出的描述符，不复制编码帧。"

msgid "Serialized task owner only. Preparation does not touch hardware or validate an unknown provider's memory reachability or frequency."
msgstr "仅由串行 task owner 调用。准备不访问硬件，也不验证未知 provider 的内存可达性或频率。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized READY or consumed SETTLED storage."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化为 READY 或已消费的 SETTLED 存储。"

msgid "[in] Independent immutable frames, live through settlement."
msgstr "[in] 独立且不可变的帧，保持有效至结清。"

msgid "[in] Nonzero byte extent; provider validates frame geometry."
msgstr "[in] 非零字节长度；provider 验证帧布局。"

msgid "[in] Nonzero requested hardware trigger frequency."
msgstr "[in] 非零的目标硬件触发频率。"

msgid "[in] Absolute live Core deadline, never a duration."
msgstr "[in] 当前 Core 时域的绝对 deadline，不是持续时间。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE; rejection leaves the descriptor intact."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝时描述符保持不变。"

msgid "Admit one direct finite or circular transfer selected by the port."
msgstr "准入由端口静态选定的直接有限或循环传输。"

msgid "REJECTED retains nothing. ACCEPTED borrows until acquire-observed SETTLED, including timeout and quarantine. Service must be progressed. Finite SUCCESS includes the last digital latch, not analog settling. The first trigger outputs the declared idle code before frame zero is fetched. Delayed service can repeat the final code; finite mode does not promise exactly length/frame-size analog conversions. A finite tail may pause and restart the exclusively owned trigger timer, extending the last interval; finite output is not strictly periodic. Circular transfers settle only after cancellation, stop or failure. Circular byte progress describes the final cycle's consumed prefix, not total playback. DMA progress never counts digital conversions."
msgstr "REJECTED 不保留引用。ACCEPTED 持续借用至 acquire 观察到 SETTLED，超时或隔离期间亦如此。调用方必须推进 service。有限 SUCCESS 包含最后数字锁存，不表示模拟稳定。第一个 trigger 在取入第零帧前输出声明的 idle。延迟 service 可重复末码；有限模式不承诺恰好 length/frame-size 次模拟转换。有限尾部可暂停并重启独占触发 timer，延长最后间隔，因此有限输出不严格等周期。循环传输仅在取消、停止或失败后结清。循环字节进度表示最后一轮已消耗的前缀，不是总播放量。DMA 进度不统计数字转换次数。"

msgid "[in] Initialized face owned by this serialized task executor."
msgstr "[in] 由该串行 task executor 拥有的已初始化接口。"

msgid "[inout] READY descriptor and immutable encoded payload."
msgstr "[inout] READY 描述符与不可变的编码 payload。"

msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED, including later hardware start failure; INVALID, BUSY, STATE, CONTEXT, TIMEOUT, PERMISSION or UNSUPPORTED is REJECTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED，包含随后发生硬件启动失败的情况；INVALID、BUSY、STATE、CONTEXT、TIMEOUT、PERMISSION 或 UNSUPPORTED 表示 REJECTED。"

msgid "Request withdrawal; this never revokes the descriptor or frame loan."
msgstr "请求撤回；这不会撤销描述符或帧的借用。"

msgid "Cross-task controls require a separate stable slot/epoch adapter."
msgstr "跨 task 控制需要独立的稳定 slot/epoch 适配器。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized executor and stable instance face."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行 executor 和稳定的实例接口。"

msgid "[inout] Exact live descriptor, retained through SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的有效描述符，保留至 SETTLED。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, BUSY, CONTEXT or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE、BUSY、CONTEXT 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Progress deadlines, final digital latch and complete withdrawal."
msgstr "推进 deadline、最后数字锁存和完整撤回。"

msgid "No hidden worker or blocking completion wait. An IRQ is a hint; request state is authoritative. An invalid or absent method is a no-op. The matching DAC control face owns stop, idle code and observation."
msgstr "没有隐藏 worker 或阻塞完成等待。IRQ 只是提示；请求状态是权威条件。无效或缺失的方法不执行操作。对应 DAC 控制接口负责 stop、idle code 和观察。"

msgid "[in] Same nonreentrant serialized task owner; stable storage."
msgstr "[in] 同一个不可重入的串行 task owner；存储保持稳定。"

msgid "Bind an explicit IRQ hint target while the controller is idle."
msgstr "在 controller 空闲时绑定显式 IRQ 提示目标。"

msgid "The provider validates actual publisher priorities. Target and context outlive attachment and all publishers; shutdown/detachment joins them. A hint never returns a borrow or substitutes for latched request state."
msgstr "provider 验证实际发布源的优先级。目标及其 context 持续存活至解除绑定并 join 所有发布者；停机或解除绑定会 join 发布者。提示不会归还借用，也不能替代锁存的请求状态。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized task owner with all IRQ storage live."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行 task owner，所有 IRQ 存储保持有效。"

msgid "[in] Borrowed immutable target, or NULL to detach it."
msgstr "[in] 被借用的不可变目标，或用 NULL 解除绑定。"

msgid "[in] Selected backend's unshifted IRQ ceiling."
msgstr "[in] 所选后端未移位的 IRQ ceiling。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, BUSY, CONTEXT, PERMISSION or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE、BUSY、CONTEXT、PERMISSION 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Query when the caller should next progress service."
msgstr "查询调用方下次应推进 service 的时间。"

msgid "This is a scheduling hint, not a completion or recovery guarantee. A quarantined request still requires the caller's recovery policy."
msgstr "这只是调度提示，不保证完成或恢复。被隔离的请求仍需由调用方执行恢复策略。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized task owner; no concurrent controls."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行 task owner；没有并发控制。"

msgid "Absolute live Core deadline; NEVER means wait for a new IRQ/control."
msgstr "当前 Core 时域的绝对 deadline；NEVER 表示等待新的 IRQ 或控制。"

msgid "Descriptor and immutable encoded frames remain live until SETTLED."
msgstr "描述符和不可变编码帧持续存活至 SETTLED。"

msgid "Raw CPU writes use unshifted codes. This separate transfer interface borrows hardware-encoded frames without conversion or a bounce buffer. Single u8 frames are bytes; single 12-bit frames are uint16_t, with code in bits 11:0 or 15:4. Dual u8 frames put channel 1 in bits 7:0 and channel 2 in bits 15:8. Dual 12-bit uint32_t frames place each channel in its own 16-bit lane, using the selected alignment. Unused bits must be zero; the caller owns that invariant without a hidden whole-buffer conversion/validation pass. Length observations are bytes."
msgstr "CPU 原始码写入使用未移位码。独立的传输接口借用硬件编码帧，不转换，也不使用 bounce buffer。单通道 u8 帧使用 byte；单通道 12 位帧使用 uint16_t，码位于 11:0 或 15:4。双通道 u8 帧的通道 1 位于 7:0，通道 2 位于 15:8。双通道 12 位 uint32_t 帧为每个通道使用独立 16 位 lane，并遵循所选对齐方式。未使用位必须为零；调用方负责该不变量，接口不隐式遍历整个缓冲区转换或验证。长度以字节观察。"

msgid "Shared immutable methods receive the selected instance context."
msgstr "共享的不可变方法接收所选实例的 context。"

msgid "Stable optional transfer face; CPU-only modes need no TX storage."
msgstr "稳定的可选传输接口；仅 CPU 模式无需 TX 存储。"

msgid "adc.h"
msgstr "adc.h"

msgid "Reviewed ADC single-shot and low-rate polling scans."
msgstr "已审查的 ADC 单次采样与低速轮询扫描。"

msgid "Query the fixed reviewed ADC sequence and raw-count format."
msgstr "查询固定、已审查的 ADC 序列与原始计数格式。"

msgid "[in] Single-shot/low-rate scan provider."
msgstr "[in] 单次或低速扫描 provider。"

msgid "[out] Resolution, declared reference and sequence length."
msgstr "[out] 分辨率、声明的参考值及序列长度。"

msgid "Success or INVALID."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID。"

msgid "Read fixed channel order and complete-scan timing facts."
msgstr "读取固定通道顺序与完整扫描的时序事实。"

msgid "[in] Initialized timing-capable provider."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化且支持时序信息的 provider。"

msgid "[out] Cold read-only facts; no acquisition starts."
msgstr "[out] 冷态只读事实；不会启动采集。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Attach optional observer storage before acquisition starts."
msgstr "采集开始前附加可选观察者存储。"

msgid "Stop and join before detach/reclaim. No hidden allocation; polling and finite modes need no observation storage."
msgstr "分离或回收前，先停止并等待相关访问者退出。没有隐藏分配；轮询及有限模式无需观察存储。"

msgid "[in] Initialized continuous provider, one task owner."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的连续采集 provider，由一个任务所有者控制。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized stable caller storage, or NULL to detach. Provider validates exact stream count at start."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且稳定的调用方存储；传入 NULL 表示分离。provider 在启动时验证精确的 stream 数量。"

msgid "Success or BUSY/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "成功或 BUSY/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Query one live consumer loan's software completion record."
msgstr "查询一个存活消费者借用的软件完成记录。"

msgid "[in] Same stable observer-capable provider."
msgstr "[in] 同一个稳定且支持观察的 provider。"

msgid "[in] Same stream's currently acquired immutable block."
msgstr "[in] 同一 stream 当前已取得的不可变 block。"

msgid "[out] Copied epoch, ordinal, observed time and gap flag. This is never a hardware sample aperture timestamp."
msgstr "[out] 复制的 epoch、序号、观察时间和间隙标志。这绝不是硬件采样孔径时间戳。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED, output unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED；拒绝时输出不变。"

msgid "Sample the fixed single/scan sequence by bounded polling."
msgstr "通过有界轮询采样固定单次／扫描序列。"

msgid "CPU-active task-only acquisition. A provider may require privileged, unmasked Thread mode. Reference voltage, sampling error and maximum rate need physical qualification."
msgstr "采用 CPU 主动轮询，仅限任务上下文采样。具体 provider 可要求特权且未屏蔽中断的 Thread 模式。参考电压、采样误差和最高速率需要实物验证。"

msgid "[inout] Single execution owner; fixed channel/sample-time setup."
msgstr "[inout] 唯一执行所有者；通道及采样时间配置固定。"

msgid "[out] Raw counts in configured channel order."
msgstr "[out] 按配置通道顺序排列的原始计数。"

msgid "[in] Sample capacity at least channel_count."
msgstr "[in] 样本容量至少为 channel_count。"

msgid "[in] Absolute clock-domain deadline."
msgstr "[in] 时钟域中的绝对 deadline。"

msgid "[out] Complete valid samples; remaining output is untouched."
msgstr "[out] 完整有效样本；其余输出保持不变。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/BUSY/TIMEOUT/IO/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED. No caller buffer or count pointer is retained on return. A failed hardware stop returns IO and can retain device cleanup; new samples stay BUSY until its owner completes cleanup. Completed samples remain described by count."
msgstr "返回成功或 INVALID/BUSY/TIMEOUT/IO/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED。返回后不再保留调用者的缓冲区或 count 指针。硬件停止失败返回 IO，并可保留设备清理责任；责任者完成清理前，新采样保持 BUSY。count 仍描述已经完成的样本。"

msgid "Start selected trigger/block acquisition with caller storage."
msgstr "使用调用者存储启动选定的触发／块采集。"

msgid "Blocks contain native uint16_t raw counts in channel order. Capacities and lengths are multiples of a complete scan; DMA domains/alignment and physical rate require separate evidence."
msgstr "block 包含按通道顺序排列的原生 uint16_t 原始计数。容量及长度必须为完整扫描的整数倍；DMA 域、对齐和物理速率需要独立证据。"

msgid "[in] Trigger/block-capable provider, one task executor."
msgstr "[in] 支持触发及 block 的 provider，由一个任务执行者控制。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized immutable-consumer block mechanism."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、供消费者不可变访问的 block 机制。"

msgid "[in] Positive requested complete-scan rate; provider rejects rates outside its declared timer/ADC capability."
msgstr "[in] 请求的完整扫描速率，为正值；超出所声明定时器或 ADC 能力的速率由 provider 拒绝。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/BUSY/UNSUPPORTED before buffer admission."
msgstr "缓冲区准入前返回成功或 INVALID/BUSY/UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Stop trigger and memory sources without revoking consumer loans."
msgstr "停止触发与内存写入源，不撤销消费者借用。"

msgid "Consumer READY/BORROWED blocks must still be drained/released."
msgstr "消费者的 READY/BORROWED block 仍须排空或释放。"

msgid "[in] Same acquisition executor; retain storage on BUSY."
msgstr "[in] 同一个采集执行者；BUSY 时保留存储。"

msgid "Success proves source detach, BUSY retains producer storage, UNSUPPORTED for a polling-only provider."
msgstr "成功证明源已分离；BUSY 保留生产者存储；仅支持轮询的 provider 返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Explicitly resume discrete block acquisition after consumer drain."
msgstr "消费者排空后，显式恢复离散块采集。"

msgid "No task, retry or hidden rearm is created. Block modes state their trigger gaps; continuous zero-gap capture requires a separately declared hardware capability and qualification."
msgstr "不会创建任务、重试或隐藏的重新 arm。block 模式明确说明触发间隙；连续无间隙捕获需要另外声明的硬件能力及资格验证。"

msgid "[in] Same single task executor as start and stop."
msgstr "[in] 与 start 和 stop 相同的唯一任务执行者。"

msgid "Success when an engine is armed, BUSY during source drain or free-block backpressure, STATE after acquisition stops."
msgstr "引擎已 arm 时返回成功；源排空或空闲 block 背压期间返回 BUSY；采集停止后返回 STATE。"

msgid "Attach an optional hint sink after checking publisher IRQ priority."
msgstr "检查发布者 IRQ 优先级后，附加可选提示接收端。"

msgid "Block/error predicates latch before notifications. Stop and join publishers and waiters before reclaiming old sink storage."
msgstr "先锁存 block 或错误条件，再通知。回收旧 sink 存储前，停止并等待发布者及等待者退出。"

msgid "[in] Initialized block-capable provider, one task executor."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化且支持 block 的 provider，由一个任务执行者控制。"

msgid "[in] Immutable borrowed target or NULL to detach."
msgstr "[in] 不可变的借用目标；NULL 表示分离。"

msgid "[in] Optional additional unshifted kernel-safe priority floor; cannot weaken generated policy. PRIMASK kernel targets require zero. Ignored without kernel calls."
msgstr "[in] 可选的额外未移位内核安全优先级数值下限；不得削弱生成策略。PRIMASK 内核目标要求为零。不调用内核时忽略。"

msgid "Success or CONTEXT/STATE/PERMISSION/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "成功或 CONTEXT/STATE/PERMISSION/UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Raw count facts; nominal Vref is not a calibrated physical measurement."
msgstr "原始计数事实；标称 Vref 不是经过校准的物理测量。"

msgid "Immutable complete-scan timing facts for the selected mode."
msgstr "选定模式下不可变的完整扫描时序事实。"

msgid "sample_times are codes into sample_cycles, in channel order. scan_cycles includes each channel's sample and conversion. Clock declarations and cycle counts describe scheduling; they do not establish electrical accuracy or sample aperture timestamps. Arrays remain valid through provider lifetime."
msgstr "sample_times 按通道顺序保存 sample_cycles 的采样码。scan_cycles 包含各通道的采样及转换周期。时钟声明和周期数描述调度，不建立电气精度或采样孔径时间戳的事实。数组在 provider 整个生命周期内保持有效。"

msgid "Shared read-only methods using one provider state."
msgstr "使用同一个提供者状态的共享只读方法。"

msgid "Methods follow each public operation's ownership contract. Missing optional methods report UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "各方法遵循对应公共操作的所有权合同。缺失的可选方法返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Immutable interface pointing to caller-owned state."
msgstr "指向调用者自有状态的不可变接口。"

msgid "Face and state outlive callers, IRQs and retained borrows. Factory lookup neither initializes nor acquires hardware."
msgstr "接口和状态的生命周期覆盖调用方、IRQ 及保留的借用。工厂查找既不初始化，也不取得硬件。"

msgid "adc_format.h"
msgstr "adc_format.h"

msgid "Explicit integer sample representation and scan layout."
msgstr "明确的整数采样表示与扫描布局。"

msgid "Integer encoding; no implicit voltage or floating-point conversion."
msgstr "整数编码；不隐式转换电压或浮点数。"

msgid "Byte order is explicit, independently of the executing CPU."
msgstr "显式声明字节序，与执行代码的 CPU 无关。"

msgid "Hardware conversion group; descriptive facts do not enable it."
msgstr "硬件转换组；描述性事实不会启用该组。"

msgid "Trigger identity is not a sample aperture timestamp."
msgstr "触发身份不是采样孔径时间戳。"

msgid "Validate a complete immutable layout without reading sample storage."
msgstr "验证完整的不可变布局，不读取采样存储。"

msgid "[in] Readable naturally aligned layout, retained by caller."
msgstr "[in] 可读、自然对齐的布局，由调用方保持有效。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; no allocation, hardware access or retained loan."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；不分配、不访问硬件，也不保留借用。"

msgid "Decode one integer from a caller-owned or consumer-acquired scan."
msgstr "从调用者拥有或消费者已取得的扫描数据中解码一个整数。"

msgid "No pointer is retained. Input/output/format overlap and wrapping spans reject before access. Sample loads have bounded1..4 byte work. This operation performs neither calibrated engineering-unit conversion nor synchronization with an active producer. The consumer owns that join."
msgstr "不保留任何指针。输入、输出或 format 重叠，以及地址回绕的范围，均在访问前拒绝。样本装载的工作量有界，为 1..4 字节。此操作既不转换为经过校准的工程单位，也不与活跃生产者同步；消费者负责完成该访问的同步／退出等待。"

msgid "[in] Valid immutable uniform-channel scan description."
msgstr "[in] 有效且不可变、通道布局一致的扫描描述。"

msgid "[in] Readable storage; any producer/DMA access must be joined."
msgstr "[in] 可读存储；必须先等待所有生产者或 DMA 访问结束。"

msgid "[in] Positive exact multiple of scan_stride, including padding."
msgstr "[in] 为 scan_stride 的正整数倍，包含填充。"

msgid "[in] Zero-based complete scan index."
msgstr "[in] 从零开始的完整扫描索引。"

msgid "[in] Zero-based channel position in provider order."
msgstr "[in] 按 provider 顺序从零开始的通道位置。"

msgid "[out] Separate aligned output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立且已对齐的输出，被拒绝时保持不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; all32-bit unsigned/signed raw values fit int64_t."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；全部 32 位无符号或有符号原始值均可容纳于 int64_t。"

msgid "Immutable uniform-channel integer layout, independent of ADC faces."
msgstr "各通道存储格式一致的不可变整数布局，与 ADC 接口独立。"

msgid "storage_bytes is1..4; significant_bits is1..32 within that storage. lsb_bits names discarded low bits, not an arithmetic scaling factor. sample_stride and scan_stride include explicit padding in bytes. channel_count retains the provider's separately declared channel order. Software triggers use identity0; hardware trigger identities are nonzero assembly-local IDs, never addresses or a promise of physical timing. Group/trigger declarations describe an already supported provider mode; validating a layout does not add support to a device or configure it."
msgstr "storage_bytes 为 1..4；significant_bits 在该存储范围内为 1..32。lsb_bits 表示丢弃的低位，不是算术缩放因子。sample_stride 和 scan_stride 以字节计，包含显式填充。channel_count 保持 provider 另行声明的通道顺序。软件触发使用 identity0；硬件触发标识是非零、装配内局部的 ID，绝不是地址或物理时序承诺。group 或 trigger 声明描述 provider 已支持的模式；验证布局不会为设备增加支持，也不会配置设备。"

msgid "adc_group.h"
msgstr "adc_group.h"

msgid "Optional finite whole-sequence integer ADC acquisition."
msgstr "可选的有限完整序列整数 ADC 采集。"

msgid "Prepare caller storage without hardware access or retained borrow."
msgstr "准备调用者存储，不访问硬件，也不保留借用。"

msgid "Request and frames are distinct. Preparation reads no sample bytes and does not prove a DMA domain or chip mode. All previous observers must be joined before reuse. NX_DEADLINE_NEVER is rejected."
msgstr "请求与帧存储彼此独立。准备过程不读取样本字节，也不证明 DMA 域或芯片模式成立。复用前必须等待所有先前的观察者退出。拒绝 NX_DEADLINE_NEVER。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized READY or fully consumed SETTLED storage."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化为 READY，或已完全消费的 SETTLED 存储。"

msgid "[out] Aligned nonempty raw output including explicit padding."
msgstr "[out] 已对齐、非空的原始输出，包含显式填充。"

msgid "[in] Positive nonwrapping span; provider validates exact layout."
msgstr "[in] 长度为正且地址不回绕的范围；由 provider 验证精确布局。"

msgid "[in] Positive whole-frame count, not a raw rank count."
msgstr "[in] 正的完整帧数，不是原始 rank 数。"

msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline in platform monotonic domain."
msgstr "[in] 平台单调时间域中的有限绝对 deadline。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE, rejected request remains unchanged."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；被拒绝的请求保持不变。"

msgid "Accept and start one selected finite acquisition under a sole owner."
msgstr "由唯一所有者接受并启动一次选定的有限采集。"

msgid "Accepted descriptor is caller-immutable; caller cannot access frames until acquire-observed SETTLED. Priming may write this entire span but never publishes prime data as valid. Post-admission arm failure keeps the borrow until actual drain. Without trusted completion timestamps, completion first observed at/after deadline is TIMEOUT. One-frame injected profiles deliberately prevent a second trigger/JDR overwrite."
msgstr "请求被接受后，调用方不得修改描述符；只有以 acquire 语义观察到 SETTLED 后，才能访问帧存储。预转换可能写入整个范围，但不会将预转换数据发布为有效数据。准入后的 arm 失败仍保留借用，直到实际排空。没有可信完成时间戳时，首次在 deadline 时刻或之后观察到完成即为 TIMEOUT。单帧 injected 配置有意防止第二次触发及 JDR 覆盖。"

msgid "[in] Initialized selected face with immutable retained facts."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的选中接口，其保留配置事实不可变。"

msgid "[inout] Exact READY descriptor and exclusive writable span."
msgstr "[inout] 精确处于 READY 的描述符及独占可写范围。"

msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED, including immediate SETTLED failure. Other results reject without pointer retention or residual new effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示已 ACCEPTED，包括立即进入 SETTLED 的失败。其他结果表示拒绝，不保留指针，也不留下新的残余效果。"

msgid "Start cancellation without revoking the accepted storage borrow."
msgstr "开始取消，不撤销已接受的存储借用。"

msgid "The first terminal fault/cancel/timeout remains authoritative."
msgstr "最先出现的终结故障、取消或超时保持最终决定权。"

msgid "[in] Same stable selected face and serialized privileged task."
msgstr "[in] 同一个稳定的选中接口，并由串行化的特权任务调用。"

msgid "[inout] Exact current accepted request, still live."
msgstr "[inout] 当前已接受且仍然存活的精确请求。"

msgid "SUCCESS starts/observes cancellation; it does not imply SETTLED."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示开始或观察到取消，不代表已经 SETTLED。"

msgid "Make bounded prime/acquisition/drain progress without hidden waits."
msgstr "推进有界的预转换、采集和排空，不包含隐藏等待。"

msgid "No request or output is reclaimed while sources, ADC, DMA or IRQs may still reference it. QUARANTINED requests remain owned and retryable."
msgstr "只要各源、ADC、DMA 或 IRQ 仍可能引用请求或输出，就不得回收它们。QUARANTINED 请求仍归当前所有者持有，可重试排空。"

msgid "SUCCESS after progress/settlement, BUSY during outstanding drain, or an error with retained recovery responsibility."
msgstr "推进或结算后返回 SUCCESS；排空尚未完成时返回 BUSY；或返回错误并保留恢复责任。"

msgid "Stop the current request, prove drain and clear a recoverable fault."
msgstr "停止当前请求、证明排空并清除可恢复故障。"

msgid "Stop is not cold close: pads, common clock, internal-source enables and provider storage remain retained until platform joined close. A fully stopped face can accept another request with the same static selection. A pending platform close keeps admission sealed."
msgstr "Stop 不是 cold close：pad、公共时钟、内部来源 enable 与 provider 存储持续保留，直到平台完成 join 后 close。完全停止的 face 可用相同静态选择接纳下一请求。待处理的平台 close 继续封闭准入。"

msgid "SUCCESS only after final request detach; BUSY/IO keeps all leases."
msgstr "仅在最终请求分离后返回 SUCCESS；BUSY/IO 保留全部租约。"

msgid "Copy actual selected facts and current retained owner state."
msgstr "复制实际选定事实与当前保留的所有者状态。"

msgid "Observing idle/fault does not release a request or any cold lease."
msgstr "观察到空闲或故障不会释放请求或任何冷租约。"

msgid "[in] Same initialized selected face, unique task executor."
msgstr "[in] 同一个已初始化的选中接口，由唯一任务执行者调用。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Complete raw frame span with an explicit finite request lifetime."
msgstr "完整的原始帧存储跨度，具有明确的有限请求生命周期。"

msgid "base.transferred counts complete frames, never bytes or individual ranks. SUCCESS means exactly frame_count; errors guarantee zero valid frames. Partial DMA/JEOC progress does not publish a valid prefix."
msgstr "base.transferred 统计完整帧，不统计字节或单个 rank。SUCCESS 表示恰好完成 frame_count 帧；错误时报告的保证有效帧数为零。部分 DMA/JEOC 进度不会发布为有效前缀。"

msgid "Exclusive producer storage, including padding."
msgstr "独占的生产者存储，包含填充。"

msgid "Exact frame_count * info.format.scan_stride."
msgstr "精确等于 frame_count * info.format.scan_stride。"

msgid "Positive complete frames, within selected bound."
msgstr "完整帧数量，必须为正且不超过选定上限。"

msgid "Cold selected rank order, actual integer layout and scheduling facts."
msgstr "冷态选定的 rank 顺序、实际整数布局与调度事实。"

msgid "Arrays belong to immutable selected facts and outlive this port. A physical rank can be discarded padding required by silicon errata; format describes only valid logical results. No implicit data packing, engineering units, aperture timestamp or trigger counter is promised."
msgstr "数组属于不可变的选中配置事实，其生命周期长于此端口。物理 rank 可能是芯片勘误要求丢弃的填充；format 仅描述有效逻辑结果。不承诺隐式数据打包、工程单位、采样孔径时间戳或触发计数器。"

msgid "Logical rank order, including repeats."
msgstr "逻辑 rank 顺序，包含重复项。"

msgid "Actual per-channel sampling codes."
msgstr "实际逐通道采样编码。"

msgid "Sampling-code lookup, immutable."
msgstr "不可变的采样编码查找表。"

msgid "Complete scan cost; zero for an unknown interleaved span."
msgstr "完整 scan 成本；交错 span 未知时为零。"

msgid "Zero for software; not an aperture."
msgstr "软件触发时为零；不表示采样孔径。"

msgid "Converter ID per logical result, or NULL."
msgstr "每个逻辑结果的 converter ID，或 NULL。"

msgid "Selected minimum spacing."
msgstr "所选最小间隔。"

msgid "DMA access can exceed one sample."
msgstr "DMA 访问范围可超过一个 sample。"

msgid "Shared read-only selected methods; ordinary ADC tables do not grow."
msgstr "共享只读的选定方法；普通 ADC 方法表不增加。"

msgid "A privileged task serializes every call. IRQs only record bounded facts in the same unique physical owner. No allocation, pool, implicit task, automatic rearm or runtime discovery is provided."
msgstr "由一个特权任务串行化所有调用。IRQ 只在同一个唯一物理所有者中记录有界事实。不提供分配、池、隐式任务、自动重新 arm 或运行时发现。"

msgid "Immutable selected face, sharing one const table across instances."
msgstr "不可变的选定接口，多个实例共享同一 const 方法表。"

msgid "Face/context/configuration outlive every request, vector and retained close. Existing ordinary ADC or PWM/ADC faces cannot expose the same leased ADC. A factory only returns this existing object."
msgstr "接口、上下文和配置的生命周期覆盖每个请求、向量及保留责任的关闭过程。现有普通 ADC 或 PWM/ADC 接口不得暴露同一个已租用的 ADC。工厂仅返回此既有对象。"

msgid "adc_observer.h"
msgstr "adc_observer.h"

msgid "Optional caller-owned ADC publication observations."
msgstr "调用者拥有的可选 ADC 发布观察。"

msgid "Initialize fresh unborrowed optional observation storage."
msgstr "初始化全新、尚未借用的可选观察存储。"

msgid "[out] Aligned fresh control, not published to readers."
msgstr "[out] 已对齐的新控制对象，尚未发布给读者。"

msgid "[out] Distinct aligned exact record array."
msgstr "[out] 独立且已对齐、大小精确的记录数组。"

msgid "[in] Positive count; must equal the selected stream count."
msgstr "[in] 正数量；必须等于选中 stream 的数量。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/CONTEXT; rejected outputs stay untouched."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/CONTEXT；被拒绝的输出保持不变。"

msgid "Provider-only cold bind validates every metadata/payload span before the first DMA loan."
msgstr "仅提供者可执行的冷绑定；第一次 DMA 借用之前验证每个元数据／载荷范围。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized exclusive observation control."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的独占观察控制对象。"

msgid "[in] Exact initialized stream, no outstanding loans."
msgstr "[in] 精确的已初始化 stream，且没有尚未归还的借用。"

msgid "[in] Provider's stable complete private state span."
msgstr "[in] provider 稳定且完整的私有状态范围。"

msgid "[in] Positive exact state byte count."
msgstr "[in] 正的精确状态字节数。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/BUSY, without a partial retained bind."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/BUSY，不留下部分保留的绑定。"

msgid "Provider-only record before matching release-publication."
msgstr "仅提供者可执行的记录，必须先于对应的 release 发布。"

msgid "[inout] Bound exact producer-owned control."
msgstr "[inout] 已绑定、由精确生产者持有的控制对象。"

msgid "[in] Still FILLING, with a proved detached memory target."
msgstr "[in] 仍为 FILLING，且已证明内存目标已分离。"

msgid "[in] Finite software observation in the same clock domain; NX_DEADLINE_NEVER is not an observed time."
msgstr "[in] 同一时钟域中的有限软件观察值；NX_DEADLINE_NEVER 不属于观察到的时间。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE/EXHAUSTED without wrapping identities or changing a rejected record."
msgstr "成功，或返回 INVALID/STATE/EXHAUSTED；不使身份回绕，也不改变被拒绝的记录。"

msgid "Read only a currently acquired block's exact epoch record."
msgstr "只读取当前已取得块的准确 epoch 记录。"

msgid "[in] Stable bound observation control."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且已绑定的观察控制对象。"

msgid "[in] Same stream's live immutable consumer loan."
msgstr "[in] 同一 stream 中仍存活且不可变的消费者借用。"

msgid "[out] Complete copy; untouched on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 完整副本；拒绝时不变。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE for a missing/stale/released loan."
msgstr "成功；借用缺失、陈旧或已释放时返回 INVALID/STATE。"

msgid "Provider-only unbind after all producer/consumer loans join."
msgstr "全部生产者／消费者借用完成 join 后，仅提供者可解除绑定。"

msgid "[inout] Stable initialized control; NULL is allowed."
msgstr "[inout] 稳定且已初始化的控制对象；允许 NULL。"

msgid "Success or BUSY retaining the bound stream."
msgstr "成功，或返回 BUSY 并保留已绑定的 stream。"

msgid "One loan's software observation, never a sample aperture."
msgstr "一个借用的软件观察，绝不表示采样孔径。"

msgid "observed_at uses the platform monotonic clock after target detach readback. IRQ delivery and publication latency are included. sequence counts observed valid block records, not timer triggers, samples or guessed missed scans."
msgstr "observed_at 使用目标分离读回之后的平台单调时钟，包含 IRQ 递送及发布延迟。sequence 统计观察到的有效 block 记录，不统计定时器触发、样本或推测的漏失扫描。"

msgid "Optional caller-owned observer control and exact records."
msgstr "调用者拥有的可选观察者控制与准确记录。"

msgid "Initialize before attaching; internal fields belong to one producer. Records and control remain live through successful provider stop and all consumer releases. No default stream, slot or finite provider storage is enlarged."
msgstr "附加前先初始化；内部字段属于一个生产者。记录和控制对象必须保持存活，直到 provider 成功停止且全部消费者归还借用。不会扩大默认 stream、slot 或有限 provider 的存储。"

msgid "advanced_pwm.h"
msgstr "advanced_pwm.h"

msgid "Optional fixed complementary PWM with latched break."
msgstr "可选固定互补 PWM 与锁存刹车。"

msgid "Stage duty against the fixed declared PSC/ARR and complementary pair."
msgstr "依据固定声明的 PSC/ARR 与互补通道对暂存占空比。"

msgid "Shadow duty becomes effective at the next update. Hardware deadtime encoding must exactly represent the cold-configured tDTS count; PSC does not scale deadtime. This API does not certify pin timing."
msgstr "影子 duty 在下一次 update 时生效。硬件死区编码必须精确表示冷配置的 tDTS 计数；PSC 不会缩放死区。此 API 不认证引脚时序。"

msgid "[in] One serialized privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 一个串行化的特权任务所有者。"

msgid "[in] Zero through the maintained period, inclusive."
msgstr "[in] 从零到维护中的周期值，含两端。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT; no base-clock reconfiguration."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT；不重新配置基础时钟。"

msgid "Enable outputs only with inactive break and no latched fault."
msgstr "仅刹车未激活且无锁存故障时启用输出。"

msgid "Automatic output reenabling and irreversible hardware LOCK are prohibited. A break never silently starts outputs again."
msgstr "禁止自动重新使能输出及不可逆的硬件 LOCK。break 绝不会静默重新启动输出。"

msgid "[in] Privileged task owner of reviewed pin/clock/vector leases."
msgstr "[in] 已审查引脚、时钟及向量租约的特权任务所有者。"

msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY/STATE/IO/CONTEXT; failure retains ownership."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 BUSY/STATE/IO/CONTEXT；失败时保留所有权。"

msgid "Disable/read back master output and both channel sources."
msgstr "禁用并读回主输出与两个通道源。"

msgid "Cold assembly keeps the reviewed inactive-pin and shared-vector leases until success and IRQ quiescence. A latched break survives stop."
msgstr "冷装配保留已审查的非活动引脚及共享向量租约，直到成功且 IRQ 静止。已锁存的 break 在停止后仍保留。"

msgid "[in] Privileged task owner, no concurrent duty/lifecycle calls."
msgstr "[in] 特权任务所有者；不得并发调用 duty 或生命周期操作。"

msgid "SUCCESS proves output source detachment; BUSY retains responsibility."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明输出源已分离；BUSY 保留责任。"

msgid "Query staged duty, actual enable state and latched break facts."
msgstr "查询暂存占空比、实际启用状态与锁存刹车事实。"

msgid "[in] Privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 特权任务所有者。"

msgid "[out] Separate writable snapshot, never provider storage."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写的快照，绝不能是 provider 存储。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT。"

msgid "Clear a software fault only while disabled and BKIN is inactive."
msgstr "仅已禁用且 BKIN 未激活时清除软件故障。"

msgid "Physical input and pending hardware break are rechecked. Application recovery policy and external power safety remain outside Nexus."
msgstr "重新检查物理输入及待处理的硬件 break。应用恢复策略和外部电源安全由 Nexus 之外负责。"

msgid "[in] Privileged task recovery owner."
msgstr "[in] 执行恢复的特权任务所有者。"

msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY/STATE/IO/CONTEXT; does not enable outputs."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 BUSY/STATE/IO/CONTEXT；不会使能输出。"

msgid "Counts use the fixed post-prescaler clock; deadtime uses tDTS."
msgstr "计数使用固定预分频后的时钟；死区使用 tDTS。"

msgid "Shared immutable controls; configuration is a cold assembly fact."
msgstr "共享不可变控制；配置是冷装配事实。"

msgid "Immutable identity; controller state and configuration outlive IRQs."
msgstr "不可变身份；控制器状态与配置必须在所有 IRQ 完全退出前保持有效。"

msgid "audio.h"
msgstr "audio.h"

msgid "Finite I2S transmit, receive and full duplex DMA loans."
msgstr "有限 I2S 发送、接收与全双工 DMA 借用。"

msgid "Typedefs"
msgstr "类型定义"

msgid "Same immutable typed controller face for direct operation use."
msgstr "供直接操作使用的同一不可变 typed controller face。"

msgid "One finite block in the statically selected serial audio format."
msgstr "静态所选串行音频格式中的一个有限 block。"

msgid "Initialize/prepare base first. TX takes one exact immutable frame consumer loan; RX takes one FILLING loan from an idle framed stream. Full duplex requires both and equal complete frame storage lengths. Unselected directions must be NULL. Format conversion is never done. Sixteen bit samples use one native little endian halfword per slot; 24/32 bit samples use HIGH halfword then LOW halfword, in DMA order. For 24 bit data the low halfword has eight trailing padding bits. This is a sequence of halfwords, not native little endian uint32 PCM. I2S/left/right justified blocks contain both channel slots; PCM blocks contain complete single channel synchronization periods. Data length determines stored halfwords; wire padding is not stored. Finite master RX requires at least two stored halfwords. ACCEPTED borrows this request and both controls until SETTLED. Only proved serializer, DMA, IRQ and address withdrawal returns TX or publishes RX. Error/cancel reports zero and aborts RX after drain. An external slave clock that stops while a word remains can prevent drain indefinitely; timeout and failed stop NEVER revoke the loan."
msgstr "先初始化／prepare base。TX 取得一个精确的不可变 frame consumer 借用；RX 从空闲 framed stream 取得一个 FILLING 借用。全双工要求两者都有，且完整 frame 存储长度相等。未选择的方向必须为 NULL。绝不执行格式转换。16-bit sample 的每个 slot 使用一个原生小端 halfword；24／32-bit sample 按 DMA 次序先放 HIGH halfword，再放 LOW halfword。24-bit 数据的低 halfword 末尾有八个填充位。这是 halfword 序列，不是原生小端 uint32 PCM。I2S／左／右对齐 block 包含两个声道 slot；PCM block 包含完整的单声道同步周期。数据长度决定存储的 halfword 数；线上 padding 不存储。有限 master RX 至少需要两个已存储 halfword。ACCEPTED 借用本请求与两个控制对象，直到 SETTLED。只有证明串行器、DMA、IRQ 和地址均已撤回后，才归还 TX 或发布 RX。错误／取消报告零，并在排空后 abort RX。若外部 slave clock 在字尚未完成时停止，可能永远无法排空；超时和 stop 失败从不撤销借用。"

msgid "Exact rational nominal rate; external slave rate is unknown (0/0)."
msgstr "精确有理数 nominal rate；外部 slave rate 未知，为 0/0。"

msgid "This is prescaler arithmetic, not a physical clock measurement."
msgstr "这是预分频算术，不是物理时钟测量。"

msgid "Allocation-free serialized owner, driven by explicit service."
msgstr "不分配存储的串行化 owner，由显式 service 推进。"

msgid "Platform prepare acquires pads, DMA, I2S and an optional shared compatible PLLI2S lease. Factory lookup never opens hardware. Start external slave CK only after acquire-observed ACTIVE; WS must be at the selected idle channel boundary during preparation. ACTIVE in a slave TX mode includes a real DR prefill, three actual microsecond ticks and at least three peripheral clocks with idle CK/WS retained. Caller controls external electrical timing and stop/drain clocks. IRQs latch errors/completion, with no task creation. One privileged unmasked task serializes methods and resource lifecycle; explicit service progresses operations. Late IRQs cannot settle an old loan. stop cancels and joins the current block; failed drain retains full request/loan/resource storage. Platform close prevents further admission before attempting resource release. Join this owner before Platform stop or clock changes."
msgstr "Platform prepare 取得 pad、DMA、I2S，以及可选的共享兼容 PLLI2S lease。Factory 查询从不打开硬件。只有通过 acquire 观察到 ACTIVE 后，才启动外部 slave CK；准备期间 WS 必须保持所选空闲声道边界。在 slave TX 模式，ACTIVE 包含真实 DR 预填、三个真实微秒计时 tick，以及在 CK／WS 保持空闲时至少三个外设时钟。调用者控制外部电气时序及 stop／drain 所需时钟。IRQ 只锁存错误／完成，不创建任务。一个特权且未屏蔽中断的任务串行化全部方法和资源生命周期；显式 service 推进操作。迟到 IRQ 不能使旧借用 SETTLED。stop 取消并 join 当前 block；排空失败保留完整的请求／借用／资源存储。Platform close 先禁止后续准入，再尝试归还资源。Platform stop 或改变时钟之前，必须先 join 本 owner。"

msgid "Immutable controller identity; vendor Handles remain private."
msgstr "不可变 controller 身份；厂商 Handle 保持私有。"

msgid "can.h"
msgstr "can.h"

msgid "Classic CAN value frames and caller-owned mailbox requests."
msgstr "经典 CAN 值帧与调用者拥有的邮箱请求。"

msgid "Validate and copy a classic frame into unborrowed request storage."
msgstr "验证并复制经典帧到未被借用的请求存储。"

msgid "Task owner only; failure retains no reference and changes no frame."
msgstr "仅限任务所有者；失败时不保留引用，也不更改帧。"

msgid "[in] Value copied here; remote data bytes are ignored."
msgstr "[in] 在此复制的值；忽略 remote 帧数据字节。"

msgid "[in] Absolute provider-clock deadline, including admission."
msgstr "[in] provider 时钟中的绝对 deadline，包含准入时间。"

msgid "Success, INVALID for nonclassic frame, STATE while borrowed."
msgstr "成功；非经典帧返回 INVALID；借用期间返回 STATE。"

msgid "Admit one frame into one of three hardware mailboxes."
msgstr "将一个帧准入到三个硬件邮箱之一。"

msgid "Serialized privileged task owner, incoming IRQ masks clear. REJECTED retains nothing. TXOK plus completed/empty hardware proves success."
msgstr "串行化的特权任务所有者，进入时 IRQ 屏蔽位须清零。REJECTED 不保留任何内容。TXOK 加上硬件已完成或已空，才证明成功。"

msgid "[in] Stable immutable face and private storage."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且不可变的接口及私有存储。"

msgid "[inout] READY value request, kept alive until SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] READY 值请求，保持存活直到 SETTLED。"

msgid "Success means ACCEPTED, not on-wire completion; other results reject."
msgstr "成功表示 ACCEPTED，不表示已完成线上发送；其他结果均为拒绝。"

msgid "Request abort without revoking a borrowed request."
msgstr "请求中止，不撤销请求借用。"

msgid "Abort may race real transmission; observed TXOK remains SUCCESS. Failed abort remains QUARANTINED and must keep storage alive."
msgstr "中止可能与真实发送竞争；已观察到 TXOK 时仍为 SUCCESS。中止失败保持 QUARANTINED，必须保持存储存活。"

msgid "[in] Stable face owned by the serialized task executor."
msgstr "[in] 由串行任务执行者拥有的稳定接口。"

msgid "[inout] Live request previously accepted by this instance."
msgstr "[inout] 先前由本实例接受且仍存活的请求。"

msgid "Success requests drain; STATE for an unrelated request."
msgstr "成功表示请求排空；无关请求返回 STATE。"

msgid "Process latched completions and absolute timeout/drain deadlines."
msgstr "处理锁存完成状态与绝对超时／排空截止时间。"

msgid "Bounded three-mailbox/six-frame work, no worker, blocking or replay."
msgstr "工作量限于三个邮箱／六帧；无 worker、阻塞或重放。"

msgid "[in] Serialized task-owner face with incoming masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 串行任务所有者接口，进入时屏蔽位须清零。"

msgid "Success, STATE before start, CONTEXT for an illegal caller."
msgstr "成功；启动前返回 STATE；非法调用者返回 CONTEXT。"

msgid "Consume value events without overwriting earlier unconsumed facts."
msgstr "消费值事件，不覆盖此前尚未消费的事实。"

msgid "Each bounded record copy has a short metadata exclusion; pending loss is ordered after older records and before future frames."
msgstr "每次有界记录复制均以短临界区排除元数据并发访问；待发布的丢失边界排在较旧记录之后、后续帧之前。"

msgid "[in] Stable instance; one task consumer owns this operation."
msgstr "[in] 稳定实例；此操作由一个任务消费者拥有。"

msgid "[out] Caller capacity; no retained output reference."
msgstr "[out] 调用方容量；不保留输出引用。"

msgid "[in] Nonzero number of event records."
msgstr "[in] 非零的事件记录数量。"

msgid "[out] Number copied; EMPTY means zero available."
msgstr "[out] 已复制数量；EMPTY 表示没有可用记录。"

msgid "Success, EMPTY, INVALID or CONTEXT."
msgstr "成功、EMPTY、INVALID 或 CONTEXT。"

msgid "Copy authoritative error/admission state, even when RX is full."
msgstr "即使 RX 已满，仍复制权威错误／准入状态。"

msgid "Task-only, bounded; bus-off is latched until explicit recovery."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，工作量有界；bus-off 被锁存，直到显式恢复。"

msgid "[in] Live instance and storage."
msgstr "[in] 存活的实例和存储。"

msgid "[out] Unretained value output."
msgstr "[out] 不保留引用的值输出。"

msgid "Success, INVALID or CONTEXT."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 CONTEXT。"

msgid "Close admission, abort TX and detach IRQ/RX publishers."
msgstr "关闭准入、中止 TX、撤离 IRQ/RX 发布者。"

msgid "Never resets the shared primary controller to release a peer's loan. Retry after progress. Success ends provider access to RX/wake storage."
msgstr "绝不会为释放另一个所有者的借用而复位共享主控制器。推进后重试。成功表示 provider 不再访问 RX 或 wake 存储。"

msgid "[in] Serialized owner; external observers must also join."
msgstr "[in] 串行化的所有者；还须等待外部观察者退出。"

msgid "Success after hardware drain; BUSY retains requests/ring/wake loans."
msgstr "硬件排空后成功；BUSY 保留请求、环及 wake 借用。"

msgid "Explicitly reenter initialization after bus-off and complete drain."
msgstr "bus-off 且完整排空之后，显式重新进入初始化。"

msgid "No automatic recovery or retransmission; domain/filter identity stays."
msgstr "无自动恢复或重传；域及 filter 标识保持不变。"

msgid "[in] Started owner with no active/quarantined TX slots."
msgstr "[in] 已启动的所有者，且不存在 active 或 quarantined TX slot。"

msgid "Success after bounded hardware acknowledgement, BUSY while borrowed."
msgstr "有界硬件确认后成功；借用期间返回 BUSY。"

msgid "Borrow an optional wake target after checking all four actual IRQs."
msgstr "检查全部四个实际 IRQ 后，借用可选唤醒目标。"

msgid "No implicit OS policy; NULL detaches. Wake is only a hint. The sink must support both task service/cancel and configurable IRQ contexts."
msgstr "无隐式 OS 策略；NULL 表示分离。wake 仅为提示。sink 必须同时支持任务中的 service/cancel 及可配置 IRQ 上下文。"

msgid "[in] Serialized task owner, started and masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 串行任务所有者，已启动且屏蔽位清零。"

msgid "[in] Immutable target kept alive until successful stop/detach."
msgstr "[in] 不可变目标，保持存活直到成功停止或分离。"

msgid "[in] Additional numerical BASEPRI ceiling."
msgstr "[in] 附加的 BASEPRI 数值阈值。"

msgid "Success, BUSY while an earlier publisher is live, PERMISSION, INVALID or CONTEXT, with no new borrow on failure."
msgstr "成功；较早发布者仍存活时返回 BUSY；或返回 PERMISSION、INVALID、CONTEXT。失败时不产生新借用。"

msgid "Classic 2.0A/B value frame; DLC is always 0..8, never CAN FD."
msgstr "经典 2.0A/B 值帧；DLC 始终为 0..8，绝不是 CAN FD。"

msgid "Caller-owned frame copied at prepare; base must first be initialized."
msgstr "调用者拥有的帧在 prepare 时复制；必须先初始化 base。"

msgid "Value receive fact or ordered loss boundary."
msgstr "值接收事实或有序丢失边界。"

msgid "Timestamp is IRQ acquisition/report time, not hardware SOF. Hardware overrun proves only a lower bound. Raw DLC 9..15 is normalized to 8."
msgstr "时间戳是 IRQ 取得或报告时间，不是硬件 SOF。硬件 overrun 仅证明损失下限。原始 DLC 9..15 规范化为 8。"

msgid "Latched controller state, independent of receive-ring fullness."
msgstr "锁存控制器状态，与接收环是否已满无关。"

msgid "Shared immutable operations; execution owner serializes task methods."
msgstr "共享不可变操作；执行所有者串行执行 Task 方法。"

msgid "Immutable face; lookup does not allocate, start or acquire hardware."
msgstr "不可变接口面；查找不分配、不启动、不取得硬件。"

msgid "can_fd.h"
msgstr "can_fd.h"

msgid "Optional CAN FD value ports and retained hardware requests."
msgstr "可选 CAN FD 值接口与持续借用的硬件请求。"

msgid "Exact wire format; the classic interface remains independent."
msgstr "精确的线上格式；经典 CAN 接口保持独立。"

msgid "Validate and copy an exact frame into unborrowed request storage."
msgstr "验证精确帧并复制到尚未借用的请求存储。"

msgid "Serialized task owner. Failure changes no frame and creates no loan."
msgstr "串行任务所有者。失败时不更改帧，也不建立借用。"

msgid "[in] Whole value copied without retaining this address."
msgstr "[in] 复制完整值，不保留此地址。"

msgid "Success, INVALID for a malformed frame, STATE while borrowed."
msgstr "成功；帧格式错误时返回 INVALID；借用期间返回 STATE。"

msgid "Admit one exact value into a physical hardware transmit element."
msgstr "将一个精确值准入物理硬件发送元素。"

msgid "Serialized privileged task, incoming masks clear. No software FIFO ordering is implied by admission; a hardware queue arbitrates by ID."
msgstr "串行化的特权任务，进入时屏蔽位须清零。准入不隐含软件 FIFO 顺序；硬件队列按 ID 仲裁。"

msgid "[in] Stable immutable selected controller face."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且不可变的选中控制器接口。"

msgid "[inout] READY request retained until acquire SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] READY 请求，保留至以 acquire 语义观察到 SETTLED。"

msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; every failure rejects without effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；所有失败均无效果地拒绝。"

msgid "Request cancellation while preserving the accepted storage loan."
msgstr "请求取消，同时保留已接受的存储借用。"

msgid "Physical transmission may win cancellation and remain SUCCESS. Timeout/cancel do not release storage. Failed drain is QUARANTINED."
msgstr "物理发送可能先于取消完成，此时仍为 SUCCESS。超时或取消不会释放存储。排空失败为 QUARANTINED。"

msgid "[in] Selected face owned by the sole task executor."
msgstr "[in] 由唯一任务执行者拥有的选中接口。"

msgid "[inout] Exact request previously accepted by this instance."
msgstr "[inout] 先前由本实例接受的精确请求。"

msgid "Success requests drain, STATE rejects an unrelated request."
msgstr "成功表示请求排空；STATE 表示拒绝无关请求。"

msgid "Process bounded hardware facts and absolute deadline progress."
msgstr "处理有界的硬件事实与绝对截止时间进展。"

msgid "No hidden worker, retry or blocking wait. Wake remains only a hint."
msgstr "无隐藏 worker、重试或阻塞等待。wake 仍仅为提示。"

msgid "[in] Serialized privileged task face, incoming masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 串行化的特权任务接口，进入时屏蔽位须清零。"

msgid "Success, STATE while unavailable, CONTEXT for an illegal caller."
msgstr "成功；不可用时返回 STATE；非法调用者返回 CONTEXT。"

msgid "Copy ordered value events into unretained caller output storage."
msgstr "将有序值事件复制到不会被持续借用的调用者输出存储。"

msgid "Earlier retained records precede a pending loss boundary. Neither full receive storage nor a failed hint may erase protocol state."
msgstr "较早保留的记录排在待发布的丢失边界之前。接收存储已满或提示失败，都不得抹除协议状态。"

msgid "[in] Stable instance with one task consumer."
msgstr "[in] 稳定实例，由一个任务消费者使用。"

msgid "[out] Writable output, disjoint from all borrowed storage."
msgstr "[out] 可写输出，必须与全部借用存储不重叠。"

msgid "[in] Positive number of complete output event records."
msgstr "[in] 正的完整输出事件记录数。"

msgid "[out] Unretained number copied, disjoint from events."
msgstr "[out] 不保留引用的已复制数量，与 events 不重叠。"

msgid "Success, EMPTY with zero copied, INVALID, STATE or CONTEXT."
msgstr "成功；EMPTY 表示复制数量为零；或返回 INVALID、STATE、CONTEXT。"

msgid "Copy authoritative latched protocol and ownership state."
msgstr "复制权威的锁存协议状态与所有权状态。"

msgid "Task-only; a full event ring does not hide bus-off or error state."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文；事件环已满不会隐藏 bus-off 或错误状态。"

msgid "[in] Stable selected instance, including after successful stop."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的选中实例，包括成功停止之后。"

msgid "[out] Writable value, disjoint from all borrowed controls."
msgstr "[out] 可写值，与全部已借用控制对象不重叠。"

msgid "Success, INVALID or CONTEXT. Output is never retained."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 CONTEXT。绝不保留输出。"

msgid "Close admission, drain transmit loans and withdraw IRQ publishers."
msgstr "关闭准入、排空发送借用并撤离 IRQ 发布者。"

msgid "Never reset a shared peripheral domain to revoke another owner. Retry after physical progress. Stop success is not observer join."
msgstr "绝不可复位共享外设域来撤销另一所有者。物理推进后重试。停止成功不代表观察者已退出。"

msgid "[in] Sole task owner; separate observers must also join."
msgstr "[in] 唯一任务所有者；还须另行等待独立观察者退出。"

msgid "Success releases provider loans; failure retains incomplete leases."
msgstr "成功释放 provider 借用；失败保留尚未完成的租约。"

msgid "Recover the same hardware identity after complete transmit drain."
msgstr "完整排空发送后，恢复同一硬件身份。"

msgid "Explicit recovery never replays a frame or reassigns shared RAM."
msgstr "显式恢复绝不重放帧，也不重新分配共享 RAM。"

msgid "[in] Started task owner with no pending or quarantined request."
msgstr "[in] 已启动的任务所有者，且没有 pending 或 quarantined 请求。"

msgid "Success after bounded acknowledgement, BUSY while borrowed."
msgstr "有界确认后成功；借用期间返回 BUSY。"

msgid "Borrow a wake sink after validating the actual enabled IRQ source."
msgstr "验证实际启用的 IRQ 源后借用唤醒接收端。"

msgid "NULL detaches. Rejection preserves the earlier sink. Notification must be bounded and legal in both task and configurable IRQ contexts."
msgstr "NULL 表示分离。拒绝时保留先前的 sink。通知必须有界，并在任务及可配置 IRQ 上下文中均合法。"

msgid "[in] Sole task owner, started and incoming masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 唯一任务所有者，已启动且进入时屏蔽位清零。"

msgid "[in] Immutable sink retained through successful detach/stop."
msgstr "[in] 不可变 sink，保留直到成功分离或停止。"

msgid "Success, BUSY while publishing, PERMISSION, INVALID or CONTEXT."
msgstr "成功；发布期间返回 BUSY；或返回 PERMISSION、INVALID、CONTEXT。"

msgid "Value frame with an exact byte length, never raw or shifted DLC."
msgstr "具有精确字节长度的值帧，不使用原始或移位后的 DLC。"

msgid "FD admits0..8/12/16/20/24/32/48/64 bytes; no rounding or padding on wire. FD remote frames and classic BRS are invalid. A provider may reject a valid value when its selected hardware mode lacks that form."
msgstr "FD 接受 0..8/12/16/20/24/32/48/64 字节；在线上不向上取整或填充。FD remote 帧及经典帧 BRS 无效。选中硬件模式不支持某种形式时，provider 可以拒绝该形式的合法值。"

msgid "Prepare copies a complete value; accepted request stays borrowed."
msgstr "准备操作复制完整值；被接受的请求保持借用。"

msgid "Acquired value event, including observed transmitter ESI."
msgstr "已取得的值事件，包含观察到的发送者 ESI。"

msgid "acquired_us is provider acquisition time, never SOF. A disabled hardware counter reports raw0 plus TIMESTAMP_UNAVAILABLE. filter is the hardware index within the frame format's filter list. Hardware loss proves a lower bound; classic DLC9..15 normalizes to8 with a flag."
msgstr "acquired_us 是 provider 取得时间，绝不是 SOF。硬件计数器禁用时报告 raw0 及 TIMESTAMP_UNAVAILABLE。filter 是该帧格式 filter 列表中的硬件索引。硬件丢失证明的是下限；经典 DLC9..15 规范化为 8，并附带标志。"

msgid "Immutable mask filter; no product register or protocol policy."
msgstr "不可变掩码过滤器；不包含产品寄存器或协议策略。"

msgid "Latched protocol state; payload length never describes a frame count."
msgstr "锁存协议状态；载荷长度不表示帧数量。"

msgid "capture.h"
msgstr "capture.h"

msgid "Explicit camera snapshots and raw storage block streams."
msgstr "显式相机 snapshot 与 RAW 存储块流。"

msgid "One capture; every output is borrowed through observed SETTLED."
msgstr "一次捕获；每个输出持续被借用，直到观察到 SETTLED。"

msgid "Initialize/prepare base before submission. destination is an open, idle producer stream. For RAW, raw_frame binds that same stream to one contiguous complete image layout of exactly storage_bytes. For JPEG, raw_frame is NULL and storage_bytes is the writable capacity. Storage is a positive multiple of four, including owned tail padding. SUCCESS transfers the exact RAW storage length, or the JPEG DMA word prefix after FRAME, source/FIFO/bus and both IRQs actually drain. A JPEG prefix includes hardware zero padding in its final word; its length NEVER identifies JPEG codestream bytes. The caller parses JPEG. Errors publish no image and report zero bytes. Failed drain retains request, destination, frame metadata and every FILLING producer loan."
msgstr "提交前初始化／prepare base。destination 是已打开且空闲的 producer stream。RAW 模式下，raw_frame 将同一 stream 绑定到一个连续、完整且恰好为 storage_bytes 的图像布局。JPEG 模式下 raw_frame 为 NULL，storage_bytes 是可写容量。存储必须是正的四字节倍数，含归本 owner 所有的尾部 padding。SUCCESS 表示精确的 RAW 存储长度，或在 FRAME、来源／FIFO／总线和两个 IRQ 确实排空后返回的 JPEG DMA word 前缀。JPEG 前缀末字含硬件零填充；其长度从不表示 JPEG 码流字节数。调用者解析 JPEG。错误不发布图像，报告零字节。排空失败保留请求、destination、frame metadata 及每个 FILLING producer 借用。"

msgid "Selected camera operation; no sensor, clock or codec policy."
msgstr "所选 camera 操作；不提供 sensor、clock 或 codec 策略。"

msgid "One privileged serialized task owns every operation. IRQ entries only latch hardware observations in provider state. The caller continues service; no hidden worker or scheduler is created. Platform prepare acquires resources. stop joins the current capture source, FIFO, DMA, IRQs and addresses; Platform close releases the selected resources and closes further controller admission. BUSY/IO preserves all loans and cleanup receipts. Repeated service/stop is required when an external sensor delays CAPTURE exit until frame end. recover may reset only the exclusively owned capture peripheral after observing disabled DMA and detached IRQs; it never resets shared DMA. Recovery invalidates format configuration. Join and restart Platform before submitting a new capture after a successful recovery. Blocks are RAW storage chunks, NOT images or an exact frame counter. Missing replacement or ambiguous DMA bank progress halts with LOSS; READY/BORROWED blocks are never reused. Stop does not revoke consumer blocks, which remain with the original stream until explicitly freed. Stop this owner before stopping/reclocking its Platform time domain."
msgstr "一个特权串行化任务拥有全部操作。IRQ 入口只在 provider 状态中锁存硬件观察。调用者继续 service，不创建隐藏 worker 或调度器。Platform prepare 取得资源。stop join 当前捕获来源、FIFO、DMA、IRQ 和地址；Platform close 归还所选资源并关闭后续 controller 准入。BUSY／IO 保留全部借用和清理收条。若外部 sensor 将 CAPTURE 退出推迟到帧结束，必须反复 service／stop。recover 仅在观察到 DMA 已禁用且 IRQ 已分离后，才能复位独占的 capture 外设；绝不复位共享 DMA。恢复使格式配置失效。成功恢复后，提交下一次捕获前必须先 join 并重启 Platform。Block 是 RAW 存储块，不是图像，也不是精确帧计数。缺少替换块或 DMA bank 进展有歧义时，以 LOSS 停止；READY／BORROWED 块从不复用。Stop 不撤销 consumer block，块仍归原 stream，直到显式释放。在停止／重配 Platform 时间域时钟之前，先停止本 owner。"

msgid "Immutable selected controller face; context outlives every loan."
msgstr "不可变的所选 controller face；context 比每次借用活得更久。"

msgid "cycle_probe.h"
msgstr "cycle_probe.h"

msgid "Opt-in raw cycle observations without elapsed-time claims."
msgstr "显式选用的原始周期观察，不作经过时间承诺。"

msgid "Start one raw observation without enabling or resetting DWT."
msgstr "开始一次原始观察，不启用或复位 DWT。"

msgid "Configurable IRQ or unique task executor. Probe failure must never prevent real I/O dispatch, cancellation, service or retained drain."
msgstr "可配置 IRQ 或唯一任务执行者。probe 失败绝不可阻止真实 I/O 派发、取消、service 或保留责任的排空。"

msgid "[inout] Live, exclusive zero/previously completed sidecar."
msgstr "[inout] 存活且独占、为零或先前已完成的 sidecar。"

msgid "[inout] Zero/inactive token distinct from the complete probe."
msgstr "[inout] 为零或非活动的 token，必须与完整 probe 不重叠。"

msgid "SUCCESS even if the counter is unavailable; INVALID/STATE/BUSY rejects before counter access. Same-probe reentry is counted."
msgstr "即使计数器不可用仍返回 SUCCESS；INVALID/STATE/BUSY 在访问计数器前拒绝。统计同一 probe 的重入。"

msgid "Finish the exact token, publish raw facts and remove its reference."
msgstr "结束对应令牌，发布原始事实并移除其引用。"

msgid "No elapsed or budget validity is inferred from two counter values."
msgstr "不得仅从两个计数器值推导有效的 elapsed 或预算结论。"

msgid "[inout] Same stable sidecar supplied to begin."
msgstr "[inout] 与 begin 使用的同一个稳定 sidecar。"

msgid "[inout] Exact still-active token; not concurrently modified."
msgstr "[inout] 精确且仍活动的 token；不得并发修改。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE with another/inactive token."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID；使用其他或非活动 token 时返回 STATE。"

msgid "Copy bounded IRQ statistics under saved local interrupt exclusion."
msgstr "保存并恢复本地中断排除状态，在保护期间复制有界 IRQ 统计。"

msgid "Privileged task only. Incoming masks are restored. For a task service producer, use its same executor or join it before sampling; IRQ masks do not join a different preempted task. This is not SMP exclusion. No provider, payload, request or counter is accessed under the mask."
msgstr "仅限特权任务。恢复进入时的屏蔽状态。对于任务 service 生产者，采样须使用同一执行者，或先等待生产者退出；IRQ 屏蔽不会等待另一个被抢占任务退出。这不是 SMP 排他。屏蔽期间不访问 provider、payload、request 或计数器。"

msgid "[in] Stable same-CPU sidecar and live producer binding."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、位于同一 CPU 的 sidecar 及存活的生产者绑定。"

msgid "[out] Distinct aligned copied result, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立且已对齐的复制结果；拒绝时不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or CONTEXT for ISR/unprivileged callers."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID；ISR 或非特权调用者返回 CONTEXT。"

msgid "Dispatch exactly one word service step with optional raw observation."
msgstr "仅派发一个字服务步骤，可选记录原始观察。"

msgid "No additional ops table, worker, request or payload reference. Invalid observation never prevents dispatch. Caller proves complete private state, borrowed descriptors and buffers disjoint from observation storage; this API knows only face/method spans and context identity."
msgstr "无额外 ops 表、worker、请求或 payload 引用。无效观察绝不阻止派发。调用方须证明完整私有状态、借用描述符及缓冲区均与观察存储不重叠；此 API 只知道接口或方法范围及 context 标识。"

msgid "[in] Original stable face, methods and unique task executor."
msgstr "[in] 原有稳定接口、方法及唯一任务执行者。"

msgid "[inout] Optional live sidecar, or NULL to omit observation."
msgstr "[inout] 可选的存活 sidecar；NULL 表示省略观察。"

msgid "SUCCESS proves dispatch only; INVALID/UNSUPPORTED describes the face."
msgstr "SUCCESS 仅证明派发；INVALID/UNSUPPORTED 描述接口情况。"

msgid "Dispatch exactly one whole-CS DMA service step with raw observation."
msgstr "仅派发一个完整 CS 区间的 DMA 服务步骤，并记录原始观察。"

msgid "Same disjointness/executor rules as the word wrapper. No diagnostic failure releases a QUARANTINED loan or changes settlement authority."
msgstr "不重叠及执行者规则与 word wrapper 相同。诊断失败不会释放 QUARANTINED 借用，也不改变结算决定权。"

msgid "[in] Original enhanced controller and its unique task executor."
msgstr "[in] 原有增强控制器及其唯一任务执行者。"

msgid "[inout] Optional stable disjoint sidecar, or NULL."
msgstr "[inout] 可选、稳定且不重叠的 sidecar，或 NULL。"

msgid "SUCCESS after dispatch, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED for an invalid face."
msgstr "派发后返回 SUCCESS；无效接口返回 INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Copied raw counter facts; readable does not mean elapsed is known."
msgstr "复制的原始计数器事实；可读不表示经过时间已知。"

msgid "A pair is a modulo-2^32 residue, including preemption and probe cost. Neither wrap count, reset, rate nor epoch continuity is established. elapsed_known is always false. No field establishes a passed budget, IRQ arrival latency, exclusive CPU time or a physical WCET bound. attempts includes a currently active attempt; other totals describe completed attempts. Totals saturate rather than wrap."
msgstr "一对值是模 2^32 的余数，包含抢占及 probe 开销。不建立回绕次数、复位、频率或 epoch 连续性。elapsed_known 始终为 false。没有任何字段证明预算已满足、IRQ 到达延迟、独占 CPU 时间或物理 WCET 上界。attempts 包含当前活动尝试；其他总计描述已完成尝试。总计采用饱和而非回绕。"

msgid "Optional zero-initialized sidecar; no default provider state grows."
msgstr "可选的零初始化附属状态；默认提供者状态不增加。"

msgid "One physical vector or one unique task executor writes each sidecar. Different nested vectors require distinct sidecars. NMI, HardFault, other cores and other security states must not access this storage. Reset/reclaim only after all producers, tokens and readers have joined."
msgstr "每个 sidecar 由一个物理向量或一个唯一任务执行者写入。不同嵌套向量必须使用不同 sidecar。NMI、HardFault、其他核及其他安全状态不得访问此存储。只有全部生产者、token 和读者退出后，才能复位或回收。"

msgid "Zero-initialized stack token; do not copy or rebind while active."
msgstr "零初始化栈令牌；活动期间不得复制或重新绑定。"

msgid "diagnostic.h"
msgstr "diagnostic.h"

msgid "A valid request snapshot has a nonzero epoch and finite `observed_at`; its `deadline` may be `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` to mean no deadline. SERVICE facts require finite `last_service_at` and `observed_at` in the same monotonic domain, and a finite positive `maximum_service_gap_us`. Unknown groups stay unknown."
msgstr "有效 request 快照具有非零 epoch 和有限 `observed_at`；其 `deadline` 可以为 `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`，表示无期限。SERVICE 事实要求 `last_service_at` 与 `observed_at` 在同一单调时钟域中且均为有限值，`maximum_service_gap_us` 为有限正值。未知事实组保持未知。"

msgid "Explicit copied facts explain pending I/O without recovery."
msgstr "显式复制事实解释待处理 I/O，不执行恢复。"

msgid "Classify supplied observations without touching live I/O."
msgstr "分类给定观察，不访问实际 I/O。"

msgid "Task/IRQ bounded fixed work, no MMIO, locks, allocation, service or recovery. Deadline and quarantine never revoke an accepted borrow. Callers must still drain controls and join observers before storage reuse."
msgstr "任务／IRQ 中执行固定有界工作，不访问 MMIO、不加锁、不分配、不执行 service 或恢复。deadline 与 quarantine 从不撤销已接受的借用。重用存储前，调用者仍必须排空控制路径并 join observer。"

msgid "[in] Stable aligned copies; no pointer is retained."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且对齐的副本；不保留指针。"

msgid "[out] Aligned output distinct from every input span."
msgstr "[out] 已对齐输出，与全部输入区间分离。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID for malformed facts/alias, STATE for reversed service time. Rejection leaves output unchanged."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS；事实格式错误或发生别名时返回 INVALID；service 时间倒退时返回 STATE。拒绝保持输出不变。"

msgid "Optional stable reason key for exactly one finding bit."
msgstr "可选的稳定原因 key，仅接受一个 finding 位。"

msgid "Task/IRQ constant work, no formatting or allocation."
msgstr "任务／IRQ 中执行固定工作量，不格式化或分配。"

msgid "[in] One NX_IO_DIAG flag, never a combined mask."
msgstr "[in] 一个 NX_IO_DIAG 标志，不能是组合掩码。"

msgid "Immutable static text, or NULL for zero/unknown/many bits."
msgstr "返回不可变静态文本；零、未知位或多个位返回 NULL。"

msgid "Stable caller copies, with independently known fact groups."
msgstr "稳定的调用者副本，各事实组独立声明已知。"

msgid "request/stream may be NULL; their presence establishes the corresponding group. known accepts only LIFECYCLE, OWNER, SERVICE and OBSERVERS. Zero-initialized unknown values never establish readiness, health or a missed service. OWNER fields may come from an owner observer only when its diagnostic_result succeeded. They describe admission and pending work, not the cause of a BUSY service result. SERVICE timestamps use the same monotonic domain; both are finite and maximum_service_gap_us is a finite positive declared budget. This helper reads no clock itself. Copies remain stable throughout this call. Observations need not be simultaneous across devices."
msgstr "request／stream 可以为 NULL；存在时对应事实组即已知。known 仅接受 LIFECYCLE、OWNER、SERVICE 和 OBSERVERS。置零的未知值不能建立 ready、健康或漏调 service 的事实。OWNER 字段只有在 owner observer 的 diagnostic_result 成功时才能来自该观察；它们描述准入与待处理工作，不解释 service 返回 BUSY 的原因。SERVICE 时间戳使用同一单调时钟域，两者均为有限值，maximum_service_gap_us 是声明的有限正预算。该函数不自行读取时钟。副本在本次调用期间保持稳定；不同设备的观察不必同时发生。"

msgid "Independent findings and unavailable fact groups."
msgstr "独立 finding 与不可用事实组。"

msgid "Zero findings is not a health certificate. SETTLED does not establish successful I/O or joined observers. Outstanding stream blocks include producer, ready and consumer loans; cursor busy describes only the ordinary stream cursor. Loss is pending stream metadata in this snapshot, not a cumulative total; publication moves it into a later block."
msgstr "零 finding 不是健康证明。SETTLED 不建立 I/O 成功或 observer 已 join 的事实。未结清 stream 块包含生产者、ready 和消费者借用；cursor busy 仅描述普通 stream cursor。Loss 是此快照尚未发布的 stream 元数据，不是累计总数；发布会把它转移到之后的块中。"

msgid "dma.h"
msgstr "dma.h"

msgid "Explicit DMA memory domains, physical streams and drain facts."
msgstr "显式 DMA 内存域、物理流与排空事实。"

msgid "Transfer direction determines device access to caller memory."
msgstr "传输方向决定设备对调用者内存的访问。"

msgid "Validate an entire buffer within one explicit memory domain."
msgstr "验证整个缓冲区位于一个显式内存域内。"

msgid "Bounded task/IRQ check, no MMIO, allocation or side effects."
msgstr "任务或 IRQ 中的有界检查，无 MMIO、分配或副作用。"

msgid "[in] Immutable SoC domains kept alive for this call."
msgstr "[in] 不可变的 SoC 域，在此调用期间保持存活。"

msgid "[in] Positive number of domains."
msgstr "[in] 正的域数量。"

msgid "[in] Nonempty caller buffer; never borrowed by this helper."
msgstr "[in] 调用方的非空缓冲区；此 helper 绝不借用它。"

msgid "[in] Positive byte length, including all DMA accesses."
msgstr "[in] 正字节长度，包含所有 DMA 访问。"

msgid "[in] Nonzero power-of-two transfer alignment."
msgstr "[in] 非零且为 2 的幂的传输对齐。"

msgid "[in] Device reads or writes the supplied memory."
msgstr "[in] 设备读取或写入所提供的内存。"

msgid "Success, INVALID for malformed ranges/alignment or PERMISSION for a range outside the required DMA domain."
msgstr "成功；范围或对齐格式错误返回 INVALID；范围不在所需 DMA 域内返回 PERMISSION。"

msgid "Check an explicit owned reservation and its DMA payload."
msgstr "检查显式拥有的 reservation 及其 DMA payload。"

msgid "Bounded task/IRQ validation, no allocation/cache operation. Callers exclusively own all lines and padding until drain and acquire-observed SETTLED. This validates geometry only; it cannot prove ownership or replace provider admission, actual cache geometry, mode-specific length checks or cache maintenance. Cancellation never releases that obligation."
msgstr "任务／IRQ 中进行有界验证，不分配或操作 cache。调用者独占全部 cache line 和填充区域，直到排空并 acquire 观察到 SETTLED。此处仅验证几何，不能证明所有权，也不能替代 provider 准入、真实 cache 几何、模式长度检查或 cache 维护。取消不解除该义务。"

msgid "[in] Immutable reviewed SoC DMA domains, not retained."
msgstr "[in] 不可变且已复核的 SoC DMA 域，不保留。"

msgid "[in] Positive domain count."
msgstr "[in] 正的域数量。"

msgid "[in] Caller-owned reservation, distinct from live loans."
msgstr "[in] 调用者拥有的 reservation，与实际存活的借用区间分离。"

msgid "[in] Whole reservation bytes, including owned padding."
msgstr "[in] 完整 reservation 字节数，包含自有填充区域。"

msgid "[in] Positive payload size, at most capacity."
msgstr "[in] 正的 payload 长度，不超过 capacity。"

msgid "[in] Zero for no cache constraint, otherwise a reviewed power-of-two line size; address and capacity must be exact multiples. The helper never rounds ranges."
msgstr "[in] 零表示无 cache 约束；否则为已复核、二次幂的 cache line 大小，地址和 capacity 必须是其整数倍。辅助函数从不对区间取整。"

msgid "[in] Device access permission for the whole storage."
msgstr "[in] 完整存储的设备访问权限。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or PERMISSION; no memory access or borrow."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID 或 PERMISSION；不访问或借用内存。"

msgid "Reject duplicate physical streams in an assembled resource set."
msgstr "拒绝装配资源集合中重复的物理流。"

msgid "Cold conflict check; the selected SoC must validate all identities against its actual topology before using them. This helper does not infer silicon support or allocate."
msgstr "冷态冲突检查；选中 SoC 在使用前必须依据真实拓扑验证全部标识。此 helper 不推断芯片支持，也不分配。"

msgid "[in] Immutable resource list, not retained."
msgstr "[in] 不可变资源列表，不保留引用。"

msgid "[in] Resource count; zero allows a NULL list."
msgstr "[in] 资源数量；为零时允许 NULL 列表。"

msgid "Success, INVALID for a NULL nonempty list or reserved zero controller, BUSY for a duplicate physical engine."
msgstr "成功；非空列表为 NULL 或使用保留的零控制器时返回 INVALID；物理引擎重复时返回 BUSY。"

msgid "Require engine, IRQ and peripheral drain independently."
msgstr "分别要求 DMA 引擎、IRQ 与外设排空。"

msgid "The provider must observe actual registers and ordering before setting these facts. This helper does not stop hardware."
msgstr "provider 必须先观察实际寄存器及顺序，才能设置这些事实。此 helper 不会停止硬件。"

msgid "[in] Provider observations; not retained."
msgstr "[in] provider 的观察结果；不保留引用。"

msgid "Success only when all sources are detached and idle, BUSY while any source remains, INVALID for impossible counters."
msgstr "仅在全部源已分离且空闲时成功；任何源仍存在时返回 BUSY；不可能的计数器值返回 INVALID。"

msgid "Reviewed DMA-visible memory interval, never CPU accessibility."
msgstr "已审查的 DMA 可见内存区间，不等同于 CPU 可访问性。"

msgid "begin plus size must not wrap. Cache maintenance remains a provider responsibility on cached architectures."
msgstr "begin 加 size 不得回绕。在带缓存的架构上，缓存维护仍是 provider 的责任。"

msgid "Opaque physical engine and request selector identities."
msgstr "不透明物理引擎与请求选择器身份。"

msgid "Controller zero is reserved as invalid. Other values have provider-defined meanings; the SoC validates its topology. Two selectors on the same controller/stream conflict."
msgstr "控制器零保留为无效值。其他值的含义由 provider 定义；SoC 验证自身拓扑。同一 controller/stream 上的两个 selector 相互冲突。"

msgid "Independent facts required before memory borrow release."
msgstr "释放内存借用前必须独立满足的事实。"

msgid "remaining describes DMA memory transfers, not wire bytes. A zero counter never establishes peripheral_idle."
msgstr "remaining 描述 DMA 内存传输，不是线上字节。计数器为零绝不证明 peripheral_idle。"

msgid "encoder.h"
msgstr "encoder.h"

msgid "Optional raw modulo quadrature encoder observations."
msgstr "可选的原始模数正交编码器观察。"

msgid "Exact edge counting personality, never a freely combinable mask."
msgstr "精确的边沿计数模式，不是可任意组合的掩码。"

msgid "Enable only the two cold-selected encoder inputs and counter."
msgstr "仅启用冷装配选定的两个编码器输入与计数器。"

msgid "The provider never changes pins, rate, filtering or mode at runtime. Clock, pin and vector leases belong to cold assembly through close."
msgstr "provider 绝不在运行时改变引脚、速率、滤波或模式。时钟、引脚及向量租约从冷装配一直保持到关闭。"

msgid "[in] One serialized privileged Thread-mode owner."
msgstr "[in] 一个串行化的特权 Thread-mode 所有者。"

msgid "SUCCESS or error; a failed write keeps recovery responsibility."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或错误；写入失败保留恢复责任。"

msgid "Observe counter and input-source withdrawal before returning."
msgstr "观察计数器与输入源均已撤离后才返回。"

msgid "Stop preserves the raw position. It does not release cold resources."
msgstr "停止保留原始位置，不释放冷资源。"

msgid "[in] The same serialized privileged Thread-mode owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行化的特权 Thread-mode 所有者。"

msgid "SUCCESS proves source withdrawal; failure retains the session."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明源已撤回；失败保留会话。"

msgid "Read one modulo position without inferring travel across wraps."
msgstr "读取一个模数位置，不推断跨回绕的行程。"

msgid "observed_at is software observation time, not a sensor edge aperture. Direction, speed, mechanical zero and unbounded signed position need external sampling bounds and product policy. A read cannot reconstruct missed full wraps. No separately read DIR bit is an atomic edge history."
msgstr "observed_at 是软件观察时间，不是传感器边沿采样孔径。方向、速度、机械零位及无界有符号位置，需要外部采样约束和产品策略。一次读取无法重建漏掉的完整回绕。单独读取的 DIR 位不是原子边沿历史。"

msgid "[in] Serialized privileged Thread-mode owner."
msgstr "[in] 串行化的特权 Thread-mode 所有者。"

msgid "[out] Aligned separate output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 已对齐的独立输出；拒绝时不变。"

msgid "Report exact counter width and selected silicon filter codes."
msgstr "报告精确计数器位宽与选定的硅片过滤器编码。"

msgid "Filter codes and their kernel clock do not qualify noise rejection, physical edge rate or electrical sensor/Board behavior."
msgstr "滤波码及其内核时钟不构成抗噪声、物理边沿速率或传感器及 Board 电气行为的资格结论。"

msgid "One raw modulo counter and separate software observation time."
msgstr "一个原始模数计数值与独立的软件观察时间。"

msgid "Immutable input/filter facts and actual counter enable state."
msgstr "不可变输入／过滤器事实与实际计数器启用状态。"

msgid "Shared methods; no ring, request, allocation, callback or worker."
msgstr "共享方法；无环形缓冲、请求、分配、回调或工作线程。"

msgid "Immutable identity; exact private state owns the whole controller."
msgstr "不可变身份；精确的私有状态拥有整个控制器。"

msgid "entropy.h"
msgstr "entropy.h"

msgid "The entropy face supplies bounded, health-admitted source words. `nx_entropy_fill` uses a finite absolute deadline and erases the complete admitted output on a read failure. It does not allocate, create a worker or establish entropy quality; it is not a DRBG. A source's existence does not authorize full entropy credit for a cryptographic library. See the selected {ref}`F407 owner <stm32f407-entropy-construction>` for its typed factory, Platform lifecycle and clock prerequisites. Other retained SDKs do not grant an entropy provider."
msgstr "熵源 face 提供通过健康检查、受长度界限约束的原始字。`nx_entropy_fill` 使用有限的绝对 deadline，读取失败时清零全部已准入的输出。它不分配内存、不创建 worker，也不建立熵质量资格；它不是 DRBG。熵源存在不授权密码库按完整熵量计入这些数据。所选 {ref}`F407 owner <stm32f407-entropy-construction>` 说明其 typed factory、Platform 生命周期与时钟前提。其他保留的 SDK 不授予熵源 provider。"

msgid "Explicit entropy source and finite all-or-erased filling."
msgstr "显式熵源与有限的完整填充或全部擦除操作。"

msgid "Static two-pointer source face with private mutable state."
msgstr "含私有可变状态的静态双指针源接口。"

msgid "Caller serializes use and lifecycle; face/table/state outlive each call. No buffer or request is retained after return. Source enable, clock dependencies, recovery and stop belong to its explicit lifecycle owner, not to TLS or this face."
msgstr "调用方串行化使用和生命周期；接口、方法表和状态必须存活至每次调用结束。返回后不保留缓冲区或请求。源启用、时钟依赖、恢复和停止由显式生命周期所有者负责，不由 TLS 或此接口负责。"

msgid "Try to copy one complete source word without waiting."
msgstr "尝试复制一个完整源数据字，不等待。"

msgid "Invalid public spans reject before provider access. This wrapper cannot infer the extent of an opaque context; the caller proves its complete disjointness. Provider rejection never substitutes fixed values or timestamps for entropy."
msgstr "公共存储区间无效时，在访问 provider 前拒绝。此包装层无法推断不透明上下文的范围；调用方证明其完整区间互不重叠。provider 拒绝时绝不使用固定值或时间戳代替熵。"

msgid "[in] Live immutable face on its serialized task executor"
msgstr "[in] 在其串行任务执行器中使用的有效只读接口"

msgid "[out] Naturally aligned writable word, disjoint from face, table and the complete private provider state"
msgstr "[out] 自然对齐的可写数据字，与接口、方法表及完整 provider 私有状态互不重叠"

msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, IO, STATE, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED"
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、IO、STATE、INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED"

msgid "Fill exactly the requested bytes before a finite deadline."
msgstr "在有限截止时间前恰好填满请求的字节。"

msgid "Task-only synchronous polling; no heap, worker or OS wait. BUSY causes another clock-bounded poll. The supplied clock must continue advancing throughout the call; changing its domain or stopping its timer violates the contract. NX_DEADLINE_NEVER is rejected. Complete words are emitted least-significant byte first; unused final-word bytes are discarded. A zero-byte request validates face and clock but performs no clock/source access and accepts NULL output. Preflight rejection leaves output unchanged. Once admitted, any error erases the complete output using volatile writes; no partial entropy may be consumed. Output is disjoint from face/table/clock and all their opaque live contexts. This function detects known-span aliases, not opaque extents. Crypto libraries own conditioning, DRBGs and trust policy."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的同步轮询；无堆、工作线程或 OS 等待。BUSY 导致下一次受时钟约束的轮询。所提供时钟必须在整个调用期间持续推进；更换时间域或停止计时器违反合同。拒绝 NX_DEADLINE_NEVER。完整数据字按最低有效字节在前输出；最后一个字中未用的字节被丢弃。零字节请求验证接口与时钟，但不访问时钟或源，并允许 NULL 输出。准入前拒绝保持输出不变。准入后任何错误均通过 volatile 写擦除全部输出；不得消费部分熵。输出与接口、方法表、时钟及其全部有效不透明上下文互不重叠。本函数检测已知区间别名，不推断不透明对象的范围。调理、DRBG 和信任策略由密码库负责。"

msgid "[in] Live serialized source; no concurrent lifecycle change"
msgstr "[in] 有效的串行化源；不得并发生命周期变更"

msgid "[out] Writable byte span; NULL only for zero bytes"
msgstr "[out] 可写字节区间；仅零字节时允许 NULL"

msgid "[in] Exact required output size, not an entropy estimate"
msgstr "[in] 所需输出的准确大小，不是熵含量估计"

msgid "[in] Live monotonic microsecond clock in one stable domain"
msgstr "[in] 单一稳定时间域内有效的单调微秒时钟"

msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline in that clock domain"
msgstr "[in] 该时间域内的有限绝对截止时间"

msgid "SUCCESS only for a complete fill; TIMEOUT, IO, STATE or source error; INVALID/UNSUPPORTED for preflight rejection"
msgstr "仅完整填充返回 SUCCESS；否则为 TIMEOUT、IO、STATE 或源错误；准入前拒绝返回 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED"

msgid "Shared immutable entropy-source methods."
msgstr "共享的只读熵源方法。"

msgid "try_read is task-only and bounded, never waits for hardware. SUCCESS copies one complete health-admitted 32-bit word; BUSY means no word yet, IO means a source/health failure, STATE means unavailable/closed. Failure leaves output unchanged. The provider owns hardware health and initial sample handling. No deterministic fallback, conditioning, DRBG or cryptographic certification is implied."
msgstr "try_read 仅限任务上下文且执行有界，从不等待硬件。SUCCESS 复制一个完整、通过健康检查的 32 位数据字；BUSY 表示尚无数据字，IO 表示源或健康检查失败，STATE 表示不可用或已关闭。失败保持输出不变。provider 负责硬件健康检查与首样本处理。不隐含确定性回退、调理、DRBG 或密码学认证。"

msgid "ethernet.h"
msgstr "ethernet.h"

msgid "Caller-owned untagged Ethernet II frames and receive loans."
msgstr "调用者拥有的无标签 Ethernet II 帧与接收借用。"

msgid "Prepare an initialized, unborrowed request and its immutable frame."
msgstr "准备已初始化、未借用的请求及不可变帧。"

msgid "Task owner. Ethernet II only, 14..1514 bytes excluding FCS; no VLAN or length-coded 802.3. Failure changes no request or payload."
msgstr "任务所有者。仅支持 Ethernet II，不含 FCS 时为 14..1514 字节；不支持 VLAN 或以长度编码的 802.3。失败时不修改请求或 payload。"

msgid "[in] Immutable contiguous Ethernet II frame."
msgstr "[in] 不可变、连续的 Ethernet II 帧。"

msgid "[in] Bytes excluding FCS, from 14 through 1514."
msgstr "[in] 不含 FCS 的字节数，范围为 14..1514。"

msgid "[in] Absolute provider-clock deadline or NEVER."
msgstr "[in] provider 时钟中的绝对 deadline，或 NEVER。"

msgid "Success, INVALID for frame/overlap, STATE while borrowed."
msgstr "成功；帧或重叠问题返回 INVALID；借用期间返回 STATE。"

msgid "Admit one frame into caller-owned hardware descriptors."
msgstr "将一个帧准入到调用者拥有的硬件描述符。"

msgid "Privileged serialized task, masks clear. SUCCESS is ACCEPTED. Borrow includes request and frame until acquire-observed SETTLED. Completion reports MAC wire status, never delivery to another application."
msgstr "串行化的特权任务，屏蔽位清零。SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED。借用包含请求和帧，直到以 acquire 语义观察到 SETTLED。完成报告 MAC 线上状态，绝不表示另一应用已收到数据。"

msgid "[in] Stable face and live private assembly."
msgstr "[in] 稳定接口及存活的私有装配。"

msgid "[inout] Prepared storage borrowed on acceptance."
msgstr "[inout] 已准备的存储，在接受时借用。"

msgid "Success means ACCEPTED; BUSY/STATE/IO/invalid inputs reject."
msgstr "成功表示 ACCEPTED；BUSY/STATE/IO 或无效输入均为拒绝。"

msgid "Close TX admission and drain the shared TX engine without replay."
msgstr "关闭 TX 准入并排空共享 TX 引擎，不重放传输。"

msgid "Task owner. Cancel is controller-wide: other pending TX requests also become CANCELLED. It never revokes a borrow. Stuck sources quarantine. Apply a confirmed link again after successful drain to reopen TX."
msgstr "任务所有者。取消作用于整个控制器：其他待处理 TX 请求也变为 CANCELLED。绝不撤销借用。源卡住时进入隔离。成功排空后，重新应用已确认的链路事实，才重新开放 TX。"

msgid "[in] Serialized task-owner face."
msgstr "[in] 串行任务所有者接口。"

msgid "[inout] Live request accepted by this instance."
msgstr "[inout] 由本实例接受且仍存活的请求。"

msgid "Success requests drain; STATE for a foreign request."
msgstr "成功表示请求排空；外来请求返回 STATE。"

msgid "Task-owner bounded progress; no worker, lock, pool or wait."
msgstr "Task 所有者有界推进；不含执行任务、锁、池或等待。"

msgid "[in] Serialized task-owner face and live storage."
msgstr "[in] 串行任务所有者接口及存活的存储。"

msgid "Success, STATE before startup, or invalid context/input."
msgstr "成功；启动前返回 STATE；或返回无效上下文或输入错误。"

msgid "Task-consumer complete-frame loan; EMPTY creates no borrow."
msgstr "Task 消费者取得完整帧借用；EMPTY 不产生借用。"

msgid "[in] Stable started instance and one consumer."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且已启动的实例，以及一个消费者。"

msgid "[out] Exact immutable frame loan, not output storage borrow."
msgstr "[out] 精确且不可变的帧借用，而非对输出存储的借用。"

msgid "Success, EMPTY without a loan, or invalid state/context."
msgstr "成功；EMPTY 表示未取得借用；或返回无效状态或上下文错误。"

msgid "Final consumer access; stale, foreign and double releases reject."
msgstr "消费者最后一次访问；拒绝过期、外来及重复释放。"

msgid "A held descriptor is never rearmed, even at ring wrap or stop."
msgstr "已持有的描述符绝不重新 arm，即使环回绕或停止时也不例外。"

msgid "[in] The same provider identity as acquisition."
msgstr "[in] 与取得借用时相同的 provider 标识。"

msgid "[in] Exact acquired token after final consumer access."
msgstr "[in] 消费者最后一次访问结束后的精确已取得 token。"

msgid "Success, STATE for an altered token, or invalid input/context."
msgstr "成功；token 被修改时返回 STATE；或返回无效输入或上下文错误。"

msgid "Copy latched instance/link/error facts; output is not retained."
msgstr "复制锁存的实例／链路／错误事实；不保留输出。"

msgid "[in] Stable private instance."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的私有实例。"

msgid "[out] Unretained output, separate from all provider storage."
msgstr "[out] 不保留引用的输出，与全部 provider 存储分离。"

msgid "Success, INVALID for output alias, or CONTEXT."
msgstr "成功；输出别名返回 INVALID；或返回 CONTEXT。"

msgid "Apply external PHY observations, not auto-negotiate or invent link."
msgstr "应用外部 PHY 观察，不自动协商或虚构链路。"

msgid "Task owner; changing speed/duplex first requires explicit link-down and observed idle TX/RX engines and FIFOs. BUSY keeps the old mode. Reapplying an unchanged up fact is idempotent. Link-down closes admission and drains pending TX with IO; later up requires real quiescence. This is not a PHY power/reset/electrical proof."
msgstr "任务所有者；更改速率或双工模式前，必须显式 link-down，并观察到 TX/RX 引擎及 FIFO 空闲。BUSY 保留旧模式。重新应用未改变的 up 事实是幂等操作。link-down 关闭准入，以 IO 排空待处理 TX；后续 up 要求真实静止。这不构成 PHY 电源、复位或电气证明。"

msgid "[in] Observed up/speed/duplex fact, never a guess."
msgstr "[in] 已观察的 up、速率及双工事实，绝非猜测。"

msgid "Success, BUSY until real drain, or STATE/IO/context error."
msgstr "成功；真实排空前返回 BUSY；或返回 STATE/IO/上下文错误。"

msgid "Close admission and withdraw MAC/DMA/IRQ sources with readback."
msgstr "关闭准入，通过读回确认撤离 MAC/DMA/IRQ 源。"

msgid "Task owner. Closing rejects new RX loans; existing loans still release. BUSY retains hardware/storage/wake ownership; timeout quarantines pending TX. Held RX loans remain valid and must be released before SUCCESS. Caller joins IRQ/consumers before reclaiming storage."
msgstr "任务所有者。关闭时拒绝新的 RX 借用；既有借用仍可释放。BUSY 保留硬件、存储及 wake 所有权；超时隔离待处理 TX。已持有的 RX 借用仍有效，必须在 SUCCESS 前释放。调用方回收存储前，须等待 IRQ 及消费者退出。"

msgid "[in] Live face and all storage, including held loans."
msgstr "[in] 存活的接口和全部存储，包含已持有借用。"

msgid "Success releases sources; BUSY/IO retain remaining ownership."
msgstr "成功释放各源；BUSY/IO 保留剩余所有权。"

msgid "Bind an optional borrowed hint after actual IRQ-policy validation."
msgstr "验证实际 IRQ 策略后绑定可选借用提示。"

msgid "Task owner with no pending TX; notify is bounded and legal in IRQ. Service does not invoke the IRQ hint from a task. Detach after stop."
msgstr "没有待处理 TX 的任务所有者；notify 必须有界，并在 IRQ 中合法。service 不会在任务中调用 IRQ 提示。停止后再分离。"

msgid "[in] Started serialized task-owner face."
msgstr "[in] 已启动的串行任务所有者接口。"

msgid "[in] Borrowed IRQ hint; NULL requests detach."
msgstr "[in] 借用的 IRQ 提示；NULL 表示请求分离。"

msgid "[in] Exact configured unshifted syscall ceiling."
msgstr "[in] 精确配置的未移位 syscall 数值阈值。"

msgid "Success, BUSY while publishers live, or policy/context error."
msgstr "成功；发布者存活时返回 BUSY；或返回策略或上下文错误。"

msgid "Caller-owned immutable contiguous frame, excluding its hardware FCS."
msgstr "调用者拥有的不可变连续帧，不含硬件 FCS。"

msgid "Observed PHY fact, supplied explicitly by the external link owner."
msgstr "观察到的 PHY 事实，由外部链路所有者显式供给。"

msgid "Complete immutable frame; release requires this exact incarnation."
msgstr "完整不可变帧；释放必须匹配准确实例世代。"

msgid "data excludes FCS; storage stays live until matching release. Copying a token does not create a second loan. Timestamp is acquisition, not SOF."
msgstr "data 不含 FCS；存储保持存活直到匹配的 release。复制 token 不会建立第二个借用。时间戳为取得时间，不是 SOF。"

msgid "Latched facts survive receive backpressure and failed wake hints."
msgstr "锁存事实不因接收背压或唤醒提示失败而丢失。"

msgid "ethernet_frames.h"
msgstr "ethernet_frames.h"

msgid "Optional scatter-gather frame and MAC-clock loans."
msgstr "可选的 scatter-gather 帧及 MAC 时钟借用。"

msgid "Physical qualification is separate from software validation."
msgstr "实物资格验证与软件验证彼此独立。"

msgid "Capture diagnostics; UNKNOWN stamp remains unusable measurement."
msgstr "捕获诊断；UNKNOWN 时间戳仍不能用于测量。"

msgid "Explicit hardware TX checksum insertion; not an arbitrary CRC."
msgstr "显式硬件 TX checksum 插入，不是任意 CRC。"

msgid "Actual enhanced RX descriptor observations, never inferred validity."
msgstr "真实的增强 RX 描述符观察，不推断有效性。"

msgid "AVAILABLE requires actual ESA writeback with selected IPC offload. PAYLOAD bits encode 0=unprocessed, 1=UDP, 2=TCP, 3=ICMP. IPv6 has no header checksum. Bypassed, missing or malformed status grants no checksum assurance; consumers own protocol admission."
msgstr "AVAILABLE 要求实际 ESA 回写，且已选择 IPC offload。PAYLOAD 位编码 0=未处理、1=UDP、2=TCP、3=ICMP。IPv6 没有 header checksum。旁路、缺失或格式错误的状态不授予 checksum 保证；consumer 负责协议准入。"

msgid "Prepare unborrowed request storage without hardware effects."
msgstr "准备尚未借用的请求存储，不产生硬件效果。"

msgid "Serialized task owner. Validate nonempty fragments, overflow and the complete Ethernet II header across fragments; permit one in-band C-tag. Untagged length is 14..1514, tagged 18..1518, excluding FCS. Hardware inserts padding/FCS. Length-coded 802.3, QinQ and 0x88A8 reject. Failure preserves request and retains no references. Deadline is an absolute monotonic provider time, distinct from the PTP clock domain. Preparation selects CHECKSUM_NONE. Before submission the READY owner may explicitly choose checksum insertion on a provider that selects offload. IP_HEADER computes only the IP header. PAYLOAD requires the caller's pseudo-header checksum seed; FULL includes hardware pseudo header calculation. Hardware recognizes only its documented IPv4/IPv6 and TCP/UDP/ICMP formats; the caller owns packet contents and protocol policy. No software checksum fallback or packet repair is provided."
msgstr "串行化任务所有者。验证非空 fragment、溢出和跨 fragment 的完整 Ethernet II header；允许一个带内 C-tag。不含 FCS 时，无 tag 长度为 14..1514，有 tag 为 18..1518。硬件插入 padding／FCS。按长度编码的 802.3、QinQ 和 0x88A8 拒绝。失败保持请求不变，不保留引用。Deadline 使用 provider 的绝对单调时间，与 PTP 时钟域不同。Prepare 选择 CHECKSUM_NONE。提交前，READY owner 可在已选择 offload 的 provider 上显式选择 checksum 插入。IP_HEADER 只计算 IP header。PAYLOAD 需要调用者提供伪首部 checksum seed；FULL 包含硬件伪首部计算。硬件只识别手册规定的 IPv4／IPv6 与 TCP／UDP／ICMP 格式；调用者负责报文内容和协议策略。不提供软件 checksum fallback 或报文修复。"

msgid "ACCEPT one complete frame after all storage and slots are validated."
msgstr "验证全部存储与槽后，才 ACCEPT 一个完整帧。"

msgid "Task owner, privileged/unmasked; no pool, heap, worker or OS lock. REJECTED retains no references or OWN effects. ACCEPTED borrows request, fragment array and every payload until acquire-observed SETTLED. One returned descriptor does not prove wire completion. transferred is whole frame bytes on proven MAC success, otherwise zero."
msgstr "特权且未屏蔽中断的任务所有者；无池、堆、worker 或 OS 锁。REJECTED 不保留引用或 OWN 效果。ACCEPTED 借用请求、fragment 数组及每段 payload，直到以 acquire 语义观察到 SETTLED。归还一个描述符不证明线上发送完成。仅在已证明 MAC 成功时，transferred 才为完整帧字节数，否则为零。"

msgid "Request controller-wide TX withdrawal without replay."
msgstr "请求控制器范围内的 TX 撤离，不重放。"

msgid "Other pending TX are cancelled too; observed completed wire success can win. No cancellation revokes a borrow. Missing drain proof keeps QUARANTINED loans. This does not reset the shared MAC/PTP/RX owner."
msgstr "其他待处理 TX 也会取消；已观察到的线上发送成功可以优先成立。取消绝不撤销借用。缺少排空证明时保留 QUARANTINED 借用。不会复位共享的 MAC/PTP/RX 所有者。"

msgid "Bounded task progress; IRQ handles at most one descriptor per side."
msgstr "有界的任务进展；IRQ 每次在每个方向上最多处理一个描述符。"

msgid "Acquire one complete frame with whole-frame capacity admission."
msgstr "按完整帧容量准入，取得一个完整帧。"

msgid "One task consumer. EMPTY creates no loan; OVERFLOW for too few views leaves the complete frame queued and all outputs unchanged. Stop closes new acquisitions. Held descriptors are never rearmed at wrap or stop."
msgstr "一个任务消费者。EMPTY 不建立借用；views 太少时返回 OVERFLOW，完整帧仍留在队列中，全部输出不变。停止关闭新取得操作。已持有描述符在回绕或停止时均不重新 arm。"

msgid "Final consumer access; stale/altered/foreign/double release rejects."
msgstr "消费者的最终访问；拒绝过期、被修改、外来或重复释放。"

msgid "Copy latched facts to unretained output disjoint from every loan."
msgstr "将锁存事实复制到不保留的输出；输出与全部借用存储不重叠。"

msgid "Read a coherent current hardware counter in its own domain."
msgstr "在硬件计数器自身时钟域中读取一致的当前计数。"

msgid "No clock synchronization, UTC mapping, acquired-time fallback or PHY compensation. source is SERVICE_OBSERVATION, not an SFD event. The owner extends seconds wrap and rejects regression, overflow and ambiguous gaps; ticks are nanoseconds with rate1e9 and unknown uncertainty."
msgstr "既不提供时钟同步、UTC 映射或 PHY 补偿，也不以取得时间作为回退值。source 为 SERVICE_OBSERVATION，不是 SFD 事件。所有者扩展秒回绕，拒绝回退、溢出及有歧义的间隔；ticks 为纳秒，rate 为 1e9，不确定度未知。"

msgid "Apply explicit external PHY observation after real TX/RX quiet."
msgstr "在真实 TX/RX 静默后应用显式的外部 PHY 观察。"

msgid "Close admission and prove DMA/MAC/IRQ withdrawal before release."
msgstr "关闭准入，证明 DMA/MAC/IRQ 已撤离后才释放。"

msgid "Held RX and captured publishers retain ownership. Any failure keeps unfinished leases. Do not flush a nonempty TX FIFO to fake quiet. Caller joins all external producers/consumers/observers separately."
msgstr "已持有的 RX 借用及已取得引用的发布者保留所有权。任何失败均保留未完成租约。不得冲洗非空 TX FIFO 来伪造静止。调用方还须分别等待全部外部生产者、消费者及观察者退出。"

msgid "Explicit recovery by the exclusive MAC owner after failed drain."
msgstr "排空失败后，由独占 MAC 所有者显式恢复。"

msgid "Task owner; finite absolute deadline. Held RX or captured publishers return BUSY without reset. Reset acknowledgement is mandatory before detached pending TX can settle with their locked terminal cause; never report wire success without its actual status. No auto replay. Reset invalidates the old hardware clock epoch and records an RX gap. Source failure/timeout retains QUARANTINED loans and recovery responsibility."
msgstr "任务所有者；使用有限绝对 deadline。存在已持有 RX 借用或已取得引用的发布者时，返回 BUSY 且不复位。已分离的待处理 TX 以其锁定的终结原因结算前，必须确认复位；没有实际状态时绝不报告线上成功。无自动重放。复位使旧硬件时钟 epoch 失效，并记录 RX 间隙。源失败或超时保留 QUARANTINED 借用及恢复责任。"

msgid "Optional borrowed IRQ hint; validate actual priority, detach/join."
msgstr "可选的借用 IRQ 提示；验证实际优先级，撤离引用并等待发布者退出。"

msgid "Immutable TX fragment; its bytes remain borrowed until SETTLED."
msgstr "不可变的 TX 片段；其字节持续借用至 SETTLED。"

msgid "Single in-band 0x8100 C-tag; TCI is host-order, with PCP/DEI/VID."
msgstr "单个带内 0x8100 C-tag；TCI 使用主机字节序，含 PCP/DEI/VID。"

msgid "One whole L2 frame, excluding preamble, hardware pad and hardware FCS."
msgstr "一个完整 L2 帧，不含前导码、硬件填充和硬件 FCS。"

msgid "The fragment array and every fragment remain borrowed after ACCEPTED. Requested TX capture is optional: wire success may have an unavailable or corrupt stamp. Read stamp only after acquire-observed SETTLED."
msgstr "ACCEPTED 后，fragment 数组及每个 fragment 均保持借用。请求 TX 捕获是可选的：即使线上成功，时间戳仍可能不可用或损坏。仅在以 acquire 语义观察到 SETTLED 后读取时间戳。"

msgid "One complete receive loan over all descriptors of one frame."
msgstr "一个帧全部描述符上的完整接收借用。"

msgid "Output fragment views exclude FCS, even when FCS spans two buffers. The views array is an unretained output. Its underlying bytes stay immutable until exact release. Copying this token creates no loan."
msgstr "输出 fragment views 不包含 FCS，即使 FCS 跨越两个缓冲区。views 数组是不保留引用的输出；底层字节在精确 release 前保持不可变。复制此 token 不建立借用。"

msgid "Latched engine facts and selected clock epoch, not protocol state."
msgstr "锁存的引擎事实与选定时钟 epoch，不是协议状态。"

msgid "exti.h"
msgstr "exti.h"

msgid "Static EXTI line bindings, bounded event storage and drain."
msgstr "静态 EXTI 线路绑定、有界事件存储与排空。"

msgid "Read queued EXTI events from an exact static line binding."
msgstr "从准确静态线路绑定读取排队 EXTI 事件。"

msgid "[inout] One consumer; bounded configured IRQ-producer storage."
msgstr "[inout] 一个消费者；按配置有界的 IRQ 生产者存储。"

msgid "[out] Caller destination, never retained."
msgstr "[out] 调用方目的存储，绝不保留引用。"

msgid "[in] Destination event count."
msgstr "[in] 目的事件数量。"

msgid "[out] Copied events; loss is observable via event flags."
msgstr "[out] 已复制事件；可通过事件标志观察丢失。"

msgid "Success, EMPTY or INVALID. No debounce policy or callbacks."
msgstr "成功、EMPTY 或 INVALID。不提供消抖策略或回调。"

msgid "Observe this line's raw logical signal without events."
msgstr "观察此线路的原始逻辑信号，不消耗事件。"

msgid "Bounded task/IRQ observation, no waiting or callback. GPIO sources report the physical pad; internal sources report their documented raw output, independent of edge or active polarity. No event is consumed and no pending bit cleared. Output must be disjoint from faces, operations, provider storage and MMIO. Direct hardware providers may require privilege. Failed stop retains the source until proven cleanup; successful stop ends level access. A missing optional method does not synthesize a level from the event queue."
msgstr "在任务或 IRQ 中执行有界观察，不等待或回调。GPIO 源报告物理引脚，内部源报告其文档规定的原始输出，不受边沿或有效极性影响。不消耗事件或清除 pending。输出必须与接口、操作表、provider 存储和 MMIO 分离。直接硬件 provider 可要求特权。停止失败保留信号源直至证明清理完成；停止成功后不能再查询电平。缺少可选方法时不从事件队列合成电平。"

msgid "[in] Initialized exact line; serialized against stop/rebind."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的精确线路；与 stop/rebind 串行执行。"

msgid "[out] Caller-owned sample, unchanged on error, never retained."
msgstr "[out] 调用方持有的样本，错误时不变，且不保留引用。"

msgid "Success or INVALID, STATE, CONTEXT or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "Success 或 INVALID、STATE、CONTEXT、UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Disable the line source, clear pending and drain its handler."
msgstr "禁用线路源、清除 pending 并排空处理函数。"

msgid "Failed withdrawal may already have disabled part of the source. Retry and observe success before reclaiming event or wake storage. Face and state remain live while a shared dispatch domain still refers to them."
msgstr "撤回失败时，可能已经禁用了部分源。回收事件或 wake 存储前须重试并观察到成功。共享派发域仍引用接口或状态期间，二者均须保持存活。"

msgid "[inout] Execution owner; consumer/writers must quiesce first."
msgstr "[inout] 执行所有者；消费者及写入者必须先静止。"

msgid "Success proves no remaining accesses to event storage; BUSY or IO retains storage, wake targets and cleanup responsibility. Shared vectors preserve other lines."
msgstr "成功证明不再访问事件存储；BUSY 或 IO 保留存储、wake 目标及清理责任。共享向量保留其他线路。"

msgid "Attach or detach an explicit event/loss IRQ wake target."
msgstr "附加或解除显式事件／丢失 IRQ 唤醒目标。"

msgid "Actual shared-vector priority must satisfy the target. Stop and join publishers before freeing old target storage. Wake callbacks observe already-latched event or loss facts."
msgstr "实际共享向量优先级必须满足目标要求。释放旧目标存储前，先停止并等待发布者退出。wake 回调观察的是已锁存的事件或丢失事实。"

msgid "[in] Initialized line, controlled by one task executor."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的 line，由一个任务执行者控制。"

msgid "[in] Immutable live target, or NULL to detach."
msgstr "[in] 不可变且存活的目标；NULL 表示分离。"

msgid "Edge facts; timestamp precision and coalescing are provider-specific."
msgstr "边沿事实；时间戳精度与合并行为由提供者决定。"

msgid "LOSS is an independent boundary after older buffered facts and before later facts. Its edge is invalid; its timestamp is detection/report time, never a reconstructed missing edge. For COALESCED facts, edge may derive from the sampled raw source after an IRQ and does not represent complete edge history."
msgstr "LOSS 是较早缓存事实与后续事实之间的独立边界。其 edge 无效，timestamp 是检测或报告时刻，不能重建丢失的边沿。COALESCED 事实的 edge 可以来自 IRQ 后采样的原始信号，不代表完整边沿历史。"

msgid "flash.h"
msgstr "flash.h"

msgid "Full physical Flash geometry and explicit bounded regions."
msgstr "完整物理 Flash 几何与显式有界区域。"

msgid "Physical programming requirements beyond unit alignment."
msgstr "超出单元对齐要求的物理编程约束。"

msgid "Query exact physical Flash geometry without side effects."
msgstr "无副作用地查询准确物理 Flash 几何。"

msgid "[in] Selected exact-density physical Flash provider."
msgstr "[in] 选中的精确密度物理 Flash provider。"

msgid "Immutable geometry, or NULL for invalid port."
msgstr "不可变几何信息；端口无效时返回 NULL。"

msgid "Read bounded physical Flash without retaining destination."
msgstr "有界读取物理 Flash，不保留目标存储。"

msgid "[in] Fixed provider; no concurrent erase/program."
msgstr "[in] 固定 provider；不得并发擦除或编程。"

msgid "[in] Physical relative offset."
msgstr "[in] 物理相对偏移。"

msgid "[out] Destination not retained beyond return."
msgstr "[out] 目标存储；返回后不再保留。"

msgid "[in] Byte count; zero permitted with NULL data."
msgstr "[in] 字节数；为零时允许 data 为 NULL。"

msgid "Success or INVALID; no access on rejected range/overflow."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；范围被拒绝或发生回绕时不进行访问。"

msgid "Program aligned physical Flash and settle all hardware pulses."
msgstr "对齐编程物理 Flash，并结清全部硬件脉冲。"

msgid "Task-only CPU-active operation. Product owns execution-from- Flash stall, watchdog and power-loss policy. No RAM fake on MCU."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文、由 CPU 主动执行的操作。从 Flash 执行时的停顿、看门狗和掉电策略由产品负责。MCU 上不以 RAM 模拟 Flash。"

msgid "With NX_FLASH_PROGRAM_REQUIRES_FRESH_ERASE, each programmed unit needs a successful erase and no later program pulse. Reading all 0xff cannot prove this on ECC Flash. A failed or interrupted pulse consumes its unit until the next successful sector erase. The caller owns this provenance; providers keep no implicit erase-history bitmap."
msgstr "使用 NX_FLASH_PROGRAM_REQUIRES_FRESH_ERASE 时，每个待编程单元必须经过成功擦除，且擦除后尚未经历任何编程脉冲。在带 ECC 的 Flash 上，读到全 0xff 不能证明这一点。失败或中断的脉冲会消耗该单元，直到下次成功擦除所属扇区。调用方负责此来源证明；provider 不维护隐式擦除历史位图。"

msgid "All-0xff input units must not issue a program pulse. A provider may reject a visibly non-erased destination."
msgstr "输入全为 0xff 的单元不得触发编程脉冲。provider 可以拒绝从可见内容判断尚未擦除的目标。"

msgid "[inout] Single execution owner with valid voltage/clock policy."
msgstr "[inout] 具有有效电压/时钟策略的唯一执行所有者。"

msgid "[in] Program-unit aligned physical offset."
msgstr "[in] 按编程单元对齐的物理偏移。"

msgid "[in] Aligned-length input retained only until return."
msgstr "[in] 长度已对齐的输入，仅借用到返回。"

msgid "[in] Positive program-unit multiple."
msgstr "[in] 正的编程单元整数倍。"

msgid "[in] Absolute deadline checked between hardware pulses."
msgstr "[in] 在硬件脉冲之间检查的绝对 deadline。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/TIMEOUT/IO. Return proves no remaining buffer/hardware access; an active pulse cannot be preempted."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/TIMEOUT/IO。返回证明已无缓冲区或硬件访问；已开始的脉冲不能被抢占。"

msgid "Erase a whole physical sector range with pulse settlement."
msgstr "擦除完整物理扇区范围，并结清脉冲。"

msgid "[inout] Single execution owner."
msgstr "[inout] 唯一执行所有者。"

msgid "[in] Exact sector-start physical offset."
msgstr "[in] 精确位于扇区起点的物理偏移。"

msgid "[in] Positive sum of whole sectors."
msgstr "[in] 若干完整扇区长度之和，且为正值。"

msgid "[in] Absolute deadline checked between erase pulses."
msgstr "[in] 在擦除脉冲之间检查的绝对 deadline。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/TIMEOUT/IO; partial erase is possible on timeout/error. Return waits for current pulse to become idle."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/TIMEOUT/IO；超时或错误可能只完成部分擦除。返回前等待当前脉冲进入空闲。"

msgid "Validate region bounds against physical geometry."
msgstr "根据物理几何验证区域边界。"

msgid "[in] Explicit caller-owned region description."
msgstr "[in] 调用方显式持有的区域描述。"

msgid "Success or INVALID; erase geometry is checked per operation."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；每次操作分别检查擦除几何。"

msgid "Read within an explicit physical region."
msgstr "在显式物理区域内读取。"

msgid "[in] Valid region."
msgstr "[in] 有效区域。"

msgid "[in] Region-relative byte offset."
msgstr "[in] 相对于区域的字节偏移。"

msgid "[out] Destination buffer."
msgstr "[out] 目标缓冲区。"

msgid "[in] Byte count."
msgstr "[in] 字节数。"

msgid "Success or INVALID without access outside the region."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID，不访问区域以外的地址。"

msgid "Program within an explicitly writable physical region."
msgstr "在显式可写物理区域内编程。"

msgid "[in] Valid writable region."
msgstr "[in] 有效且可写的区域。"

msgid "[in] Region-relative aligned offset."
msgstr "[in] 相对于区域的已对齐偏移。"

msgid "[in] Input buffer; borrowed until return only."
msgstr "[in] 输入缓冲区；仅借用到返回。"

msgid "[in] Aligned positive length."
msgstr "[in] 已对齐的正长度。"

msgid "[in] Absolute pulse deadline."
msgstr "[in] 绝对脉冲 deadline。"

msgid "Success, INVALID/PERMISSION or underlying pulse result."
msgstr "成功、INVALID/PERMISSION 或底层脉冲操作的结果。"

msgid "Erase whole physical sectors within a writable region."
msgstr "在可写区域内擦除完整物理扇区。"

msgid "[in] Explicit valid writable region."
msgstr "[in] 显式有效且可写的区域。"

msgid "[in] Region-relative sector boundary."
msgstr "[in] 相对于区域的扇区边界。"

msgid "[in] Sum of whole sector lengths."
msgstr "[in] 完整扇区长度之和。"

msgid "Erase sector geometry, with offset relative to full physical Flash."
msgstr "擦除扇区几何，偏移相对于完整物理 Flash。"

msgid "Read-only physical geometry; platform reserves no product storage."
msgstr "只读物理几何；平台不预留产品存储。"

msgid "program_flags states additional unit requirements. Zero does not waive the selected provider's programming rules."
msgstr "program_flags 声明额外的单元要求。零值不免除所选 provider 的编程规则。"

msgid "Explicit consumer-selected bounds; no implicit product partition."
msgstr "消费者显式选择的边界，不含隐式产品分区。"

msgid "flash_async.h"
msgstr "flash_async.h"

msgid "Optional finite physical Flash pulses with retained drain."
msgstr "可选的有限物理 Flash 脉冲与保留的排空责任。"

msgid "Explicit finite program or whole-sector erase operation."
msgstr "显式有限 program 或完整 sector erase 操作。"

msgid "Prepare a finite request without accessing payload or hardware."
msgstr "准备有限请求，不访问 payload 或硬件。"

msgid "Join all previous observers before reuse; no allocation occurs."
msgstr "复用前先完成所有旧观察者的 join；不分配存储。"

msgid "[in] Explicit program or erase."
msgstr "[in] 显式 program 或 erase。"

msgid "[in] Physical byte offset; provider checks geometry."
msgstr "[in] 物理字节 offset；provider 检查 geometry。"

msgid "[in] Program input, NULL for erase; disjoint from request."
msgstr "[in] Program 输入，erase 时为 NULL；与请求分离。"

msgid "[in] Positive byte count; provider checks alignment/sectors."
msgstr "[in] 正字节数；provider 检查对齐／sector。"

msgid "[in] Finite absolute Core monotonic deadline."
msgstr "[in] 有限的绝对 Core 单调 deadline。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE with request unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "SUCCESS，或 INVALID／STATE；拒绝时请求保持不变。"

msgid "Admit one finite operation, retaining storage only on SUCCESS."
msgstr "接纳一次有限操作，仅在 SUCCESS 时保留存储。"

msgid "Rejection creates no borrow or new hardware effect. SETTLED proves the pulse idle and final provider access. Deadline is not drain."
msgstr "拒绝不建立借用，也不产生新硬件效果。SETTLED 证明脉冲已空闲且 provider 已完成最终访问。Deadline 不是排空。"

msgid "[in] Live selected same-Flash face, serialized task context."
msgstr "[in] 活跃、已选择且对应同一 Flash 的 face，串行化任务上下文。"

msgid "[inout] Exact READY descriptor and immutable input."
msgstr "[inout] 精确 READY 描述符和不可变输入。"

msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED, including immediate settled failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED，包括立即 SETTLED 的失败。"

msgid "Prevent further pulses while allowing the current pulse to drain."
msgstr "禁止后续脉冲，同时允许当前脉冲排空。"

msgid "First observed terminal cause wins; storage stays borrowed until idle."
msgstr "首个观察到的终止原因锁定；存储持续被借用，直到空闲。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized owner as submit."
msgstr "[in] 与 submit 相同的串行化所有者。"

msgid "[inout] Exact live accepted descriptor."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的活跃已接纳描述符。"

msgid "SUCCESS starts cancellation; it does not imply settlement."
msgstr "SUCCESS 开始取消，不表示已经 SETTLED。"

msgid "Make bounded pulse/drain progress without sleeping or rearming."
msgstr "有界推进脉冲／排空，不休眠或重新 arm。"

msgid "Caller schedules service; there is no hidden IRQ, worker or queue."
msgstr "调用者调度 service；没有隐藏 IRQ、worker 或队列。"

msgid "[in] Same privileged serialized task owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一特权串行化任务所有者。"

msgid "SUCCESS after progress/settlement; BUSY while draining or IO with retained QUARANTINED storage when hardware cannot prove idle."
msgstr "进展／SETTLED 后为 SUCCESS；排空期间为 BUSY，硬件无法证明空闲时为 IO，并保留 QUARANTINED 存储。"

msgid "Seal admission and cancel/drain any current finite operation."
msgstr "封闭准入，取消／排空当前有限操作。"

msgid "This does not close the physical bank. Cold close is a separate platform operation and cannot withdraw a busy physical pulse."
msgstr "这不关闭物理 bank。Cold close 是独立的平台操作，不能撤回忙碌的物理脉冲。"

msgid "SUCCESS only after request detach; BUSY/IO retains all responsibility."
msgstr "只有请求分离后才 SUCCESS；BUSY／IO 保留全部责任。"

msgid "Caller-owned finite operation; base.transferred counts bytes."
msgstr "调用者持有的有限操作；base.transferred 以字节计数。"

msgid "Request and program input remain immutable/borrowed until observed SETTLED, including cancellation, deadline and hardware faults. A pulse cannot be cancelled. Partial success is the completed prefix only; interrupted/failed physical units require caller recovery policy."
msgstr "请求与 program 输入保持不可变并持续被借用，直到观察到 SETTLED；取消、deadline 和硬件故障也遵循此规则。脉冲不能取消。部分成功只表示已完成前缀；中断／失败的物理单元需要调用者的恢复策略。"

msgid "Static methods of the same physical Flash owner, no queue/worker."
msgstr "同一物理 Flash owner 的静态方法，不创建队列／worker。"

msgid "Immutable optional face; synchronous Flash contract is unchanged."
msgstr "不可变可选 face；同步 Flash 合同保持原样。"

msgid "One privileged task serializes this face, the associated Flash face and cold lifecycle. Configuration/state/faces outlive every retained request. Factory lookup neither initializes nor acquires hardware."
msgstr "一个特权任务串行化本 face、相关 Flash face 与 cold lifecycle。配置／状态／face 比每个保留请求活得更久。Factory 查询既不初始化，也不取得硬件。"

msgid "flash_maintenance.h"
msgstr "flash_maintenance.h"

msgid "Explicit physical OTP and option maintenance contract."
msgstr "显式物理 OTP 与 option 维护合同。"

msgid "Destructive effects must each be acknowledged by the caller."
msgstr "每种破坏性效果都必须由调用者逐项确认。"

msgid "Protection levels are semantic values, never vendor encodings."
msgstr "保护等级是语义值，绝不是厂商编码。"

msgid "Copy physical maintenance state without retaining output storage."
msgstr "复制物理维护状态，不保留输出存储。"

msgid "Privileged unmasked Thread, serialized with all Flash operations."
msgstr "特权、未屏蔽中断的 Thread 模式，与全部 Flash 操作串行化。"

msgid "[in] Same exclusive owner as the ordinary Flash face."
msgstr "[in] 与普通 Flash face 相同的独占所有者。"

msgid "[out] Caller storage valid until this synchronous return."
msgstr "[out] 调用者存储，在本同步调用返回前有效。"

msgid "Actual facts, or invalid/context/busy/unsupported status."
msgstr "真实事实，或 invalid／context／busy／unsupported 状态。"

msgid "Read OTP data without exposing lock bytes as writable storage."
msgstr "读取 OTP 数据，不把 lock 字节暴露为可写存储。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized physical owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一串行化物理所有者。"

msgid "[in] Byte offset inside the exact OTP data geometry."
msgstr "[in] 精确 OTP 数据 geometry 内的字节 offset。"

msgid "[out] Caller storage borrowed only during this call."
msgstr "[out] 调用者存储只在本调用期间被借用。"

msgid "[in] Entire extent, checked without wrap or rounding."
msgstr "[in] 完整范围，检查不回绕、不取整。"

msgid "Success or rejection before data access."
msgstr "成功，或在数据访问之前拒绝。"

msgid "Program one-way OTP bits; partial irreversible progress is possible."
msgstr "编程只能单向改变的 OTP 位；可能产生部分不可逆进展。"

msgid "No erase exists. Timeout cannot abort a pulse. Single-bank Flash fetches and interrupts may stall; deadlines are not latency bounds. Effect declarations are not authentication or permission from tests."
msgstr "不存在 erase。超时不能中止脉冲。单 bank Flash 取指及中断可能停顿；deadline 不是延迟上界。效果声明不是认证，也不是测试授予的权限。"

msgid "[in] Exclusive privileged unmasked Thread owner."
msgstr "[in] 独占、特权且未屏蔽中断的 Thread 模式所有者。"

msgid "[in] Provider-aligned OTP data offset."
msgstr "[in] 按 provider 要求对齐的 OTP 数据 offset。"

msgid "[in] Stable source until synchronous return; never aliases OTP."
msgstr "[in] 同步返回前稳定的来源；绝不与 OTP 重叠。"

msgid "[in] Positive aligned complete extent."
msgstr "[in] 正的、对齐且完整的范围。"

msgid "[in] Explicit OTP_PROGRAM effect declaration."
msgstr "[in] 显式 OTP_PROGRAM 效果声明。"

msgid "[in] Finite absolute monotonic deadline."
msgstr "[in] 有限的绝对单调 deadline。"

msgid "Success or error after the last started physical pulse settles."
msgstr "最后一个已启动的物理脉冲静止后返回成功或错误。"

msgid "Permanently lock one exact OTP block with no automatic reset."
msgstr "永久锁定一个精确 OTP block，不自动复位。"

msgid "[in] Physical block index, never a main-array sector."
msgstr "[in] 物理 block 索引，绝不是主阵列 sector。"

msgid "[in] Explicit OTP_LOCK effect declaration."
msgstr "[in] 显式 OTP_LOCK 效果声明。"

msgid "Settled status; lock is irreversible even on a late timeout."
msgstr "脉冲静止后的状态；即使最终超时，锁定仍不可逆。"

msgid "Program a complete option image; activation requires external POR."
msgstr "编程完整 option image；激活需要外部 POR。"

msgid "Protected to open erases all user Flash and backup SRAM. The caller must execute that transition from independent RAM, with its vectors, code, constants, stack and return destination surviving mass erase. Level two permanently disables debug and further option changes. No automatic reset, power cycle, product policy or authentication."
msgstr "从受保护转为开放会擦除全部用户 Flash 和 backup SRAM。调用者必须从独立 RAM 执行该转换，vector、代码、常量、栈及返回目标均须在整阵列擦除后仍然有效。Level two 永久禁用 debug 及后续 option 更改。不提供自动复位、电源循环、产品策略或认证。"

msgid "[in] Exclusive privileged unmasked Thread maintenance owner."
msgstr "[in] 独占、特权且未屏蔽中断的 Thread 模式维护所有者。"

msgid "[in] Stable complete options copied during this call."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的完整 options，在本调用期间复制。"

msgid "[in] OPTIONS plus MASS_ERASE for protected to open, or PERMANENT for irreversible level two."
msgstr "[in] 从受保护转为开放须声明 OPTIONS 加 MASS_ERASE；不可逆 level two 须声明 PERMANENT。"

msgid "Settled status; a timeout never rolls back programmed options."
msgstr "脉冲静止后的状态；超时从不回滚已编程 options。"

msgid "Complete desired physical options; no product layout is implied."
msgstr "完整的目标物理 options；不隐含产品布局。"

msgid "Encoded BOR field: 0=level3 .. 3=disabled."
msgstr "编码的 BOR 字段：0=level3，依次到 3=禁用。"

msgid "Copied hardware facts; options take effect only after POR."
msgstr "复制的硬件事实；options 仅在 POR 后生效。"

msgid "Exact maintenance actions share the ordinary physical owner."
msgstr "精确维护操作共享普通物理所有者。"

msgid "Immutable optional face, absent unless explicitly assembled."
msgstr "不可变可选 face，只有显式装配才存在。"

msgid "frame_stream.h"
msgstr "frame_stream.h"

msgid "Complete framed blocks and strided DMA consumer loans."
msgstr "完整 framed block 与带 stride 的 DMA consumer 借用。"

msgid "Immutable consumer block retained through final DMA access."
msgstr "不可变 consumer block 保留到最后一次 DMA 访问。"

msgid "Zero-initialize before first acquisition. Keep this exact control live and exclusively owned until release; copied tokens never authorize earlier reuse or another instance."
msgstr "首次取得前置零初始化。本精确控制对象须持续有效并被独占，直到 release；复制的 token 从不授权提前复用或用于其他实例。"

msgid "Memory representations; these values never configure a wire."
msgstr "存储表示；这些值从不配置线路。"

msgid "Serial framing whose complete units determine block geometry."
msgstr "以完整单元确定 block geometry 的串行帧格式。"

msgid "Position of useful sample bits in each stored slot container."
msgstr "每个已存储 slot 容器中有效 sample 位的位置。"

msgid "Compute complete audio storage without touching payload."
msgstr "计算完整音频存储，不访问 payload。"

msgid "Task/IRQ bounded pure calculation. No format conversion, serializer configuration or codec negotiation is performed."
msgstr "任务／IRQ 中的有界纯计算。不进行格式转换、串行器配置或 codec 协商。"

msgid "[in] Explicit framing, sample and stored slot geometry."
msgstr "[in] 显式 framing、sample 与已存储 slot geometry。"

msgid "[out] Separate fresh output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立的新输出；拒绝时保持不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID for incompatible framing or EXHAUSTED on arithmetic overflow; never retains an input or allocates."
msgstr "SUCCESS；不兼容 framing 返回 INVALID，算术溢出返回 EXHAUSTED；从不保留输入或分配存储。"

msgid "Check and copy planar/strided frame geometry."
msgstr "检查并复制平面／stride frame geometry。"

msgid "Bounded pure calculation. Pixel/color meanings remain with the selected camera/display/DMA adapter."
msgstr "有界纯计算。Pixel／color 的含义由所选 camera／display／DMA adapter 定义。"

msgid "[in] 1..NX_FRAME_MAX_PLANES immutable plane descriptions."
msgstr "[in] 1..NX_FRAME_MAX_PLANES 个不可变 plane 描述。"

msgid "[in] Exact plane count, not a runtime pool maximum."
msgstr "[in] 精确 plane 数，不是运行期 pool 上限。"

msgid "[out] Fresh output, unchanged on every rejection."
msgstr "[out] 新输出；所有拒绝都保持不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID for empty/overlapping/short-stride planes, or EXHAUSTED on byte arithmetic overflow."
msgstr "SUCCESS；空 plane、重叠或 stride 太短返回 INVALID，字节算术溢出返回 EXHAUSTED。"

msgid "Cold-bind a complete-frame layout to an existing queue."
msgstr "将完整 frame 布局冷态绑定到既有队列。"

msgid "Task-only cold assembly, O(n squared) storage checks. No hardware or DMA-domain admission is inferred. Keep all queue/control/payload storage live through final stop."
msgstr "仅任务上下文的冷态装配，以 O(n²) 检查存储。不据此推断硬件或 DMA 域准入。全部 queue／control／payload 存储须持续有效，直到最终 stop。"

msgid "[out] Fresh control disjoint from queue and payloads."
msgstr "[out] 与 queue 和 payload 分离的新控制对象。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized unborrowed queue with all slots free."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、未被借用且全部 slot 空闲的 queue。"

msgid "[in] Checked complete-frame geometry, copied on success."
msgstr "[in] 已检查的完整 frame geometry，成功时复制。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID for aliases/short buffers/bad layout, BUSY for outstanding blocks or STATE while stopping."
msgstr "SUCCESS；重叠、缓冲区短或布局错误返回 INVALID；未结束的 block 返回 BUSY，正在 stop 返回 STATE。"

msgid "Publish one complete frame after final producer access."
msgstr "在 producer 最终访问之后发布一个完整 frame。"

msgid "Bounded task/IRQ metadata. Reserve/prepost/abort still use the existing stream; publication always has exact frame size."
msgstr "任务／IRQ 中的有界 metadata 操作。Reserve／prepost／abort 仍使用既有 stream；发布始终具有精确 frame 大小。"

msgid "[inout] Exclusive serialized producer binding."
msgstr "[inout] 独占串行化 producer binding。"

msgid "[in] Existing stream producer loan, detached from all DMA."
msgstr "[in] 既有 stream producer 借用，已从所有 DMA 分离。"

msgid "[in] Existing observed stream boundary flags."
msgstr "[in] 已观察到的既有 stream 边界 flags。"

msgid "Existing stream result; rejection retains the fill loan."
msgstr "既有 stream 结果；拒绝保留 fill 借用。"

msgid "Publish one complete frame from the existing posted FIFO."
msgstr "从既有 posted FIFO 发布一个完整 frame。"

msgid "Bounded task/IRQ metadata; preserves pending and FIFO counts."
msgstr "任务／IRQ 中的有界 metadata 操作；保留 pending 与 FIFO 计数。"

msgid "[inout] Same producer binding and complete-frame layout."
msgstr "[inout] 同一 producer binding 和完整 frame 布局。"

msgid "[inout] Existing posted producer bound to this stream."
msgstr "[inout] 已绑定此 stream 的既有 posted producer。"

msgid "[in] Oldest pending loan, absent from all hardware targets."
msgstr "[in] 最旧的 pending 借用，已不在任何硬件 target 中。"

msgid "[in] Observed existing stream boundary flags."
msgstr "[in] 已观察到的既有 stream 边界 flags。"

msgid "Existing posted-publication result, INVALID for foreign pool."
msgstr "既有 posted 发布结果；外部 pool 返回 INVALID。"

msgid "Acquire the next complete immutable DMA consumer loan."
msgstr "取得下一个完整且不可变的 DMA consumer 借用。"

msgid "Task/IRQ; output disjointness scans the fixed pool in O(n) before the O(1) guarded queue operation. Output cannot alias queue controls or any full-capacity pool payload. EMPTY creates no loan and never repeats a previous frame. Caller owns silence/blanking/stop policy. Do not use retries as additional observed boundaries."
msgstr "任务／IRQ 上下文；先以 O(n) 扫描固定 pool 检查输出是否分离，再执行有保护的 O(1) queue 操作。输出不能与 queue control 或任何 pool payload 的完整容量范围重叠。EMPTY 不建立借用，也从不重复上一 frame。调用者负责静音／blanking／stop 策略。不能把重试当作额外观察到的边界。"

msgid "[inout] Same serialized consumer, one call per observed output boundary when using underrun accounting."
msgstr "[inout] 同一串行化 consumer；使用 underrun 计数时，每个观察到的输出边界调用一次。"

msgid "[inout] Zero or previously released control, unchanged on error."
msgstr "[inout] 置零或已 release 的控制对象；错误时保持不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY with saturating underrun count, BUSY for a live loan, INVALID for output alias or STATE for an incomplete queued block."
msgstr "SUCCESS；EMPTY 同时饱和累计 underrun；活跃借用返回 BUSY，输出重叠返回 INVALID，队列 block 不完整返回 STATE。"

msgid "Derive a strided byte rectangle from a live frame loan."
msgstr "从活跃 frame 借用派生带 stride 的字节矩形。"

msgid "Task/IRQ; an O(n) immutable-pool output check precedes the O(1) guarded view calculation. Output cannot alias the loan, queue controls or any full-capacity pool payload. The adapter checks pixel alignment, resource and DMA domain."
msgstr "任务／IRQ 上下文；先以 O(n) 在不可变 pool 中检查输出，再执行有保护的 O(1) view 计算。输出不能与借用、queue control 或任何 pool payload 的完整容量范围重叠。Adapter 检查 pixel 对齐、资源及 DMA 域。"

msgid "[in] Exact live immutable DMA consumer loan."
msgstr "[in] 精确、活跃且不可变的 DMA consumer 借用。"

msgid "[in] Plane index in the bound layout."
msgstr "[in] 已绑定布局中的 plane 索引。"

msgid "[in] Byte column within a row, not a pixel count."
msgstr "[in] 行内字节列，不是 pixel 数。"

msgid "[in] First complete row."
msgstr "[in] 第一个完整行。"

msgid "[in] Positive bytes per selected row."
msgstr "[in] 每个所选行的正字节数。"

msgid "[in] Positive selected row count."
msgstr "[in] 正的所选行数。"

msgid "[out] Fresh output unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 新输出；失败时保持不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID for out-of-plane rectangles or STATE for stale/foreign loans; no DMA access begins here."
msgstr "SUCCESS；越出 plane 的矩形返回 INVALID，过期／外部借用返回 STATE；这里不启动 DMA 访问。"

msgid "Release only after the adapter proves final DMA access."
msgstr "只有 adapter 证明最终 DMA 访问后才能 release。"

msgid "Bounded task/IRQ metadata. Timeout/cancel is not quiescence; failed drain retains the queue borrow, including during stop. This helper checks proof facts and does not stop hardware."
msgstr "任务／IRQ 中的有界 metadata 操作。超时／取消不证明静止；排空失败保留 queue 借用，stop 期间也一样。此 helper 检查证明事实，不停止硬件。"

msgid "[inout] Original owner; another instance cannot release."
msgstr "[inout] 原所有者；其他实例不能 release。"

msgid "[inout] Exact acquired control, cleared only on success."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的已取得控制对象；仅成功时清除。"

msgid "[in] Actual provider observations of engine, IRQ and peripheral quiescence; counter completion alone is not proof."
msgstr "[in] Provider 对 engine、IRQ 和外设静止的真实观察；单独的计数器完成不是证明。"

msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY while any source remains, STATE for stale or foreign tokens, or INVALID for impossible drain counters."
msgstr "SUCCESS；仍有来源时为 BUSY；过期或外部 token 为 STATE，不可能的 drain 计数为 INVALID。"

msgid "Immutable audio memory format, independent of codec policy."
msgstr "不可变音频存储格式，独立于 codec 策略。"

msgid "PCM frames store every slot, including inactive slots, in ascending slot order; slot_bits is the container width. I2S has two 16/32-bit slots; SAI has 1..32 8/16/32-bit slots. PDM has 1..8 byte-interleaved lanes; each byte holds eight successive bits of one lane, so frames must divide by eight. active_slots selects valid lanes/slots without compacting storage. Sample byte order is explicitly declared."
msgstr "PCM frame 按 slot 递增顺序存储全部 slot，含不活跃 slot；slot_bits 是容器位宽。I2S 有两个 16／32-bit slot；SAI 有 1..32 个 8／16／32-bit slot。PDM 有 1..8 条按字节交错的 lane；每字节保存一条 lane 的八个连续 bit，因此 frame 数须可被八整除。active_slots 选择有效 lane／slot，不压缩存储。Sample 字节序须显式声明。"

msgid "One plane; the last row needs no trailing stride padding."
msgstr "一个 plane；最后一行不需要尾部 stride padding。"

msgid "row_bytes/stride are bytes, rows is a complete line count. A plane occupies (rows - 1) * stride + row_bytes bytes."
msgstr "row_bytes／stride 以字节计，rows 是完整行数。一个 plane 占用 (rows - 1) * stride + row_bytes 字节。"

msgid "Immutable frame geometry copied into a bound stream."
msgstr "复制进已绑定 stream 的不可变 frame geometry。"

msgid "Plane intervals, including inter-row padding, cannot overlap. bytes is the exact maximum plane end, not summed row bytes. Audio formats are separate immutable caller metadata; this layout represents their checked complete-unit storage."
msgstr "Plane 区间含行间 padding，不能重叠。bytes 是精确的最大 plane 末端，不是各行字节数之和。Audio format 是独立且不可变的调用者 metadata；此布局表示经检查的完整单元存储。"

msgid "Caller-owned binding; the existing stream owns every queue."
msgstr "调用者持有的 binding；既有 stream 拥有每个 queue。"

msgid "Initialize before publication. One serialized producer and consumer use framed publish/acquire exclusively until stop. Hardware, queue capacity and synchronization remain explicit."
msgstr "发布前初始化。一个串行化 producer 和 consumer 仅使用 framed publish／acquire，直到 stop。硬件、queue 容量和同步均须显式提供。"

msgid "Checked 2D byte rectangle for an explicit DMA adapter."
msgstr "供显式 DMA adapter 使用的已检查 2D 字节矩形。"

msgid "fwd.h"
msgstr "fwd.h"

msgid "Lightweight identities for typed I/O faces."
msgstr "类型化 I/O face 的轻量身份。"

msgid "Include the matching public header before accessing its layout, operations, requests or value types. Forward identities neither construct nor acquire any device."
msgstr "访问其布局、操作、请求或值类型前，须包含对应公共头文件。前置身份既不构造也不取得任何设备。"

msgid "Opaque identity; complete contracts live in its public header."
msgstr "不透明身份；完整合同位于其公共头文件。"

msgid "gpio.h"
msgstr "gpio.h"

msgid "Fixed GPIO authorization masks and bounded port operations."
msgstr "固定 GPIO 授权掩码与有界端口操作。"

msgid "Atomically set/reset one port's authorized output mask."
msgstr "原子设置／复位一个端口的授权输出掩码。"

msgid "Task/IRQ bounded, no wait. One serialized writer owns the binding. Stop/mode changes require writers and IRQ quiescence."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中均有界且不等待。一个串行化写入者拥有此绑定。停止或切换模式前必须使写入者及 IRQ 静默。"

msgid "[in] Fixed initialized binding, no registry or OS lock."
msgstr "[in] 固定且已初始化的绑定，无注册表或 OS 锁。"

msgid "[in] Authorized bits to set."
msgstr "[in] 获授权的置位位集。"

msgid "[in] Authorized bits to reset; disjoint from set_mask."
msgstr "[in] 获授权的复位位集；须与 set_mask 不相交。"

msgid "NX_SUCCESS or INVALID/PERMISSION before any register write."
msgstr "返回 NX_SUCCESS，或在任何寄存器写入前返回 INVALID/PERMISSION。"

msgid "Read one input snapshot restricted to the binding mask."
msgstr "读取受绑定掩码限制的单次输入快照。"

msgid "[in] Fixed initialized binding."
msgstr "[in] 固定且已初始化的绑定。"

msgid "[out] Masked input snapshot; unchanged on error."
msgstr "[out] 掩码处理后的输入快照；错误时保持不变。"

msgid "NX_SUCCESS or NX_ERROR_INVALID. No cross-port simultaneity."
msgstr "返回 NX_SUCCESS 或 NX_ERROR_INVALID。不保证跨端口同时采样。"

msgid "Toggle authorized outputs under the single-writer contract."
msgstr "在单写者合同下翻转授权输出。"

msgid "Read-modify-write is not atomic against unrelated writes."
msgstr "相对于无关写入，读改写不是原子操作。"

msgid "[in] Fixed output binding with a serialized writer."
msgstr "[in] 具有串行化写入者的固定输出绑定。"

msgid "[in] Authorized subset to toggle."
msgstr "[in] 获授权、需要翻转的子集。"

msgid "NX_SUCCESS or INVALID/PERMISSION before register writes."
msgstr "返回 NX_SUCCESS，或在寄存器写入前返回 INVALID/PERMISSION。"

msgid "i2c.h"
msgstr "i2c.h"

msgid "Address endpoints, repeated START and explicit STOP settlement."
msgstr "地址端点、重复 START 与显式 STOP 结清。"

msgid "Maintained finite-message admission bounds, checked before hardware access."
msgstr "维护范围内的有限消息准入边界，访问硬件之前检查。"

msgid "Execute a polling transaction at the endpoint's address."
msgstr "在端点的地址上执行轮询事务。"

msgid "Task-only, one executor. No hidden scan or GPIO recovery. Failed bus recovery is never reported as transfer success."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，由一个执行者负责。没有隐式扫描或 GPIO 恢复。总线恢复失败绝不报告为传输成功。"

msgid "[in] Fixed address/controller binding."
msgstr "[in] 固定的地址/控制器绑定。"

msgid "[inout] Message buffers; write data are not modified."
msgstr "[inout] 消息缓冲区；写入方向的数据不会被修改。"

msgid "[in] One through NX_I2C_MAX_MESSAGES."
msgstr "[in] 1..NX_I2C_MAX_MESSAGES 条。"

msgid "[out] Provider byte progress across messages, including error returns. TX may count bytes handed to the data register before their wire/ACK outcome is known."
msgstr "[out] provider 跨消息记录的字节进度，错误返回时也提供。TX 可能已统计交给数据寄存器的字节，而此时尚不知道线上传输或 ACK 结果。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/ NACK/ARBITRATION/IO. Each message has 1..NX_I2C_MAX_MESSAGE_BYTES bytes; any message may read or write. Return releases buffers after STOP/abort drain. Controller settlement does not establish bus recovery."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/NACK/ARBITRATION/IO。每条消息包含 1..NX_I2C_MAX_MESSAGE_BYTES 字节，可独立选择读或写。返回前完成 STOP/中止排空并归还缓冲区。控制器结清不代表总线已恢复。"

msgid "Recover an idle controller after a bus fault."
msgstr "总线故障后恢复空闲控制器。"

msgid "[inout] Single executor, no live transaction/buffer borrow."
msgstr "[inout] 唯一执行者；不存在活跃事务或缓冲区借用。"

msgid "Success only when hardware bus idle is observed; otherwise BUSY/IO/UNSUPPORTED. Does not replay a failed transaction."
msgstr "仅观察到硬件总线空闲时成功；否则返回 BUSY/IO/UNSUPPORTED。不重放失败事务。"

msgid "Prepare an unborrowed request without copying payload."
msgstr "准备未借用请求，不复制载荷。"

msgid "Payloads cannot overlap control storage, nor a read span overlap an immutable write span. Limits match polling."
msgstr "payload 不得与控制存储重叠，读取范围也不得与不可变的写入范围重叠。限制与轮询模式一致。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized READY or consumed SETTLED storage"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的 READY 存储，或已消费的 SETTLED 存储"

msgid "[inout] One through eight complete descriptors"
msgstr "[inout] 1..8 个完整描述符"

msgid "[in] Exact descriptor count"
msgstr "[in] 精确的描述符数量"

msgid "[in] Absolute provider-clock deadline"
msgstr "[in] provider 时钟域中的绝对 deadline"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, UNSUPPORTED or STATE; no new loan"
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID、UNSUPPORTED 或 STATE；不产生新借用"

msgid "Validate finite descriptors and payload/control separation."
msgstr "验证有限描述符以及载荷／控制存储分离。"

msgid "Bounded cold check. Provider separately validates state, context and DMA domains before acquiring any loan."
msgstr "有界冷态检查。provider 在取得任何借用前另行验证状态、上下文及 DMA 域。"

msgid "[in] Complete caller-owned request, not retained"
msgstr "[in] 完整且由调用方持有的请求，不予保留"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED without mutation"
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED，不修改输入"

msgid "Admit one finite asynchronous repeated-START transaction."
msgstr "准入一个有限、异步、重复 START 事务。"

msgid "Selected modes declare DMA domains. DMA completion alone never establishes wire/STOP drain or borrow release. Any admitted abort requires explicit local recover before reuse; recovery never replays or pulses Board GPIO lines."
msgstr "选中模式声明 DMA 域。仅 DMA 完成不能证明线上/STOP 排空或借用归还。任何已接受的中止均须先显式本地恢复才能复用；恢复不重放事务，也不在 Board GPIO 上产生脉冲。"

msgid "[in] Initialized fixed address and single executor"
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的固定地址及唯一执行者"

msgid "[inout] READY descriptor and all referenced storage"
msgstr "[inout] READY 描述符及其引用的全部存储"

msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; rejection retains no references"
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；拒绝不保留任何引用"

msgid "Start an already borrowed QUEUED request without readmission."
msgstr "启动已借用的 QUEUED 请求，不重复准入。"

msgid "Other errors require adapter settlement; no polling fallback."
msgstr "其他错误要求由适配器结清；不回退为轮询。"

msgid "[in] Fixed address on the adapter's exact controller"
msgstr "[in] 位于适配器精确控制器上的固定地址"

msgid "[inout] Adapter-admitted QUEUED storage"
msgstr "[inout] 经适配器准入的 QUEUED 存储"

msgid "SUCCESS hands execution to provider; BUSY retains QUEUED"
msgstr "SUCCESS 将执行权交给 provider；BUSY 保持 QUEUED"

msgid "Prove controller identity without hardware effects."
msgstr "证明控制器身份，不产生硬件效果。"

msgid "[in] Immutable addressed child"
msgstr "[in] 不可变的带地址子对象"

msgid "[in] Exact execution controller"
msgstr "[in] 精确的执行控制器"

msgid "True only for matching provider state and compatible methods"
msgstr "仅当 provider 状态匹配且方法兼容时为真"

msgid "Request cancellation without reclaiming any storage."
msgstr "请求取消，不回收任何存储。"

msgid "[in] Same single executor as submit/service"
msgstr "[in] 与 submit/service 相同的唯一执行者"

msgid "[inout] Exact active descriptor, never a stale raw pointer"
msgstr "[inout] 精确的活跃描述符，不得使用陈旧裸指针"

msgid "SUCCESS begins drain; STATE for another request"
msgstr "SUCCESS 开始排空；其他请求返回 STATE"

msgid "Advance deadline and STOP/DMA drain in bounded task context."
msgstr "在有界 Task 上下文处理截止时间，并推进 STOP/DMA 排空。"

msgid "Final publication follows source detach and local wire idle. Drain failure quarantines all storage. This invokes no payload completion callback and never automatically replays."
msgstr "最终发布发生在来源分离及本地线上空闲之后。排空失败会隔离全部存储。不调用 payload 完成回调，也绝不自动重放。"

msgid "[in] Live single executor, serviced throughout stop"
msgstr "[in] 仍然有效的唯一执行者，在整个停止过程中持续调用 service"

msgid "Close admission and stop only after every borrower drains."
msgstr "关闭准入，全部借用者排空后才停止。"

msgid "[in] Controller with external producers quiesced"
msgstr "[in] 外部生产者已静默的控制器"

msgid "SUCCESS releases sources; BUSY requires continued service"
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明来源已撤回；BUSY 要求继续 service"

msgid "Attach one optional hint sink after actual IRQ policy checks."
msgstr "检查实际 IRQ 策略后附加一个可选提示接收端。"

msgid "Task-only. Sink remains alive until successful stop/detach."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文。sink 须保持有效，直到成功停止或分离。"

msgid "[in] Initialized asynchronous controller"
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的异步控制器"

msgid "[in] Borrowed sink or NULL to detach after publisher exit"
msgstr "[in] 借用的 sink；或在发布者退出后使用 NULL 分离"

msgid "[in] Cannot weaken selected kernel policy"
msgstr "[in] 不得削弱选中的内核策略"

msgid "SUCCESS or rejection before replacing any live binding"
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS，或在替换任何活跃绑定前拒绝"

msgid "One message; a new message starts with repeated START, final with STOP."
msgstr "一个消息；新消息以重复 START 开始，最后以 STOP 结束。"

msgid "Caller-owned finite message sequence."
msgstr "调用者拥有的有限消息序列。"

msgid "Descriptors and payloads remain borrowed until SETTLED. Writes stay immutable; reads receive into caller storage. Cancellation, deadlines and quarantine never revoke loans."
msgstr "描述符与 payload 保持借用直到 SETTLED。写入数据保持不可变；读取数据写入调用方存储。取消、deadline 和隔离均不撤销借用。"

msgid "i2c_bus_clear.h"
msgstr "i2c_bus_clear.h"

msgid "Explicit open-drain I2C bus clear with retained leases."
msgstr "显式开漏 I2C 总线清理，保留租约。"

msgid "Maximum completed recovery low/high periods per attempt."
msgstr "每次尝试中允许完成的恢复低／高电平周期上限。"

msgid "Bind explicit electrical operations without touching pins."
msgstr "绑定显式电气操作，不接触引脚。"

msgid "[inout] Fresh zeroed session or a session with no lease."
msgstr "[inout] 新的清零会话，或没有租约的会话。"

msgid "[in] All five methods required; caller verifies electrical authorization rather than relying on generic GPIO APIs."
msgstr "[in] 必须具备全部五个方法；调用方须验证电气授权，不能依赖通用 GPIO API 推定。"

msgid "[in] Required bounded monotonic read in one boot domain."
msgstr "[in] 必需的、有界的同一启动域内单调时间读取。"

msgid "[in] Reviewed nonzero low/high/STOP/poll durations."
msgstr "[in] 已审查且非零的低电平/高电平/STOP/轮询时长。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or BUSY for a retained lease. Rejection leaves the session and external resources unchanged."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID，或因保留租约而返回 BUSY。拒绝使会话及外部资源保持不变。"

msgid "Clear one idle, authorized bus with at most nine pulses."
msgstr "用至多九个脉冲清理一个空闲、已授权总线。"

msgid "Task-only, all other bus users quiescent. Timing evidence and actual open-drain behavior require physical HIL."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，其他总线使用者均已静默。时序证据及实际开漏行为需要物理 HIL。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized session with no retained lease."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且无保留租约的会话。"

msgid "[in] Finite absolute primary-operation deadline."
msgstr "[in] 主要操作的有限绝对 deadline。"

msgid "[in] Finite absolute STOP/lease deadline in the same clock domain, at or after deadline."
msgstr "[in] 同一时钟域中的有限绝对 STOP/租约 deadline，不得早于 deadline。"

msgid "[out] Independent primary/cleanup and retained effects."
msgstr "[out] 独立的主要/清理结果及保留效果。"

msgid "Primary failure, otherwise cleanup result. Invalid inputs and an existing lease reject without callbacks or changing result. An expired primary deadline has no pin effects. Each released SCL must be physically HIGH before timing its high period. A frozen/reversed clock reports IO and exits rather than spinning. Every acquired attempt performs explicit STOP cleanup under its independent budget; failed STOP or release method retains the lease. If release succeeds after its deadline, cleanup reports TIMEOUT with lease_held false to preserve actual returned ownership. It never replays the failed I2C transaction or retries recovery pulses."
msgstr "主要操作失败时返回该失败，否则返回清理结果。无效输入或已有租约会被拒绝，不调用回调，也不改变 result。主要 deadline 已到期时不产生引脚效果。每次释放 SCL 后，必须先观察到物理 HIGH，再计其高电平时长。时钟冻结或倒退时报告 IO 并退出，不持续空转。每次已取得所有权的尝试均在独立预算内显式执行 STOP 清理；STOP 或 release 方法失败会保留租约。若 release 在其 deadline 之后成功，清理报告 TIMEOUT，但 lease_held 为 false，以保留实际已经归还所有权的事实。绝不重放失败的 I2C 事务，也不重试恢复脉冲。"

msgid "Retry only retained STOP cleanup and ownership return."
msgstr "仅重试保留的 STOP 清理与所有权归还。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized session with a retained lease."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且保留租约的会话。"

msgid "[in] New finite absolute cleanup deadline."
msgstr "[in] 新的有限绝对清理 deadline。"

msgid "[out] Preserved primary/pulse count and latest cleanup."
msgstr "[out] 保留的主要结果/脉冲数及最新清理结果。"

msgid "Latest cleanup result; INVALID/STATE rejects without effects. A proved STOP is not repeated after release fails. Failure retains the lease and must not trigger a new clear or transaction. Success does not change a failed primary operation into success."
msgstr "返回最新清理结果；INVALID/STATE 拒绝且无效果。release 失败后，不重复已经证明完成的 STOP。失败保留租约，不得因此开始新的总线清理或事务。成功不会将主要操作的失败改为成功。"

msgid "Read-only methods for an authorized two-pin GPIO handoff."
msgstr "授权双引脚 GPIO 交接的只读方法。"

msgid "Task-only, one executor. acquire is a bounded, nonblocking handoff: success proves the controller, DMA, IRQs, other masters and pin users quiescent, both physical pins exclusively leased in reviewed open-drain GPIO mode, with both lines released. Failure retains no lease or effects. drive only sinks LOW or releases a pin; false never means drive HIGH. When scl_low is true, drive establishes SCL LOW before changing SDA, including a retry from unknown previous pin state. sample reads physical levels, not output latches. Methods are bounded and preserve the lease on errors. release restores the saved peripheral/pin ownership only on success; failure retains all lease/storage responsibility. wait_until uses the injected clock's finite absolute domain and reaches target or reports an error within a caller- proved finite bound, even if the clock stops. Late waits cannot qualify an expired operation. No callback may recursively operate on this session or run a transaction. The adapter must verify reviewed open-drain, pull-up, voltage and two-pin authorization facts before acquire."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，由一个执行者负责。acquire 是有界、非阻塞的交接：成功证明控制器、DMA、IRQ、其他主机及引脚使用者均已静默；两个物理引脚已按审查过的开漏 GPIO 模式独占租用，且两根线均已释放。失败不保留租约或效果。drive 只拉 LOW 或释放引脚；false 绝不表示主动驱动 HIGH。scl_low 为 true 时，drive 先建立 SCL LOW，再改变 SDA，包括从未知先前引脚状态重试的情况。sample 读取物理电平，而不是输出锁存值。方法均有界，错误时保留租约。release 仅在成功时恢复保存的外设/引脚所有权；失败保留全部租约/存储责任。wait_until 使用注入时钟中的有限绝对时间域，即使时钟停止，也须在调用方已证明的有限上界内到达 target 或报告错误。迟到的等待不能使已到期操作获得资格。任何回调均不得递归操作本会话或运行事务。适配器在 acquire 前必须验证经过审查的开漏、上拉、电压及双引脚授权事实。"

msgid "Explicit immutable GPIO methods and caller-owned adapter state."
msgstr "显式不可变 GPIO 方法与调用者拥有的适配器状态。"

msgid "Caller-selected electrical timings in microseconds."
msgstr "调用者选择的电气时序，单位为微秒。"

msgid "All fields are nonzero. low/high bound each clear pulse; stop_setup bounds the observed SCL-high to SDA-release interval. stretch_poll bounds the interval between actual SCL samples. Values need board/device electrical review; the mechanism supplies no universal safe defaults."
msgstr "全部字段均非零。low/high 约束每个清理脉冲；stop_setup 约束观察到 SCL 高电平至释放 SDA 的间隔。stretch_poll 约束实际 SCL 采样之间的间隔。这些值需要板卡/器件电气审查；机制不提供通用安全默认值。"

msgid "Independent recovery and STOP/ownership-return results."
msgstr "分别记录恢复结果与 STOP／所有权归还结果。"

msgid "pulses counts completed recovery low/high periods, not the STOP preparation edge. stop_observed proves the requested STOP sequence ended with both sampled lines HIGH. lease_held means the adapter, session and context must remain alive and no controller transaction may start. A cleanup failure never replaces the primary failure."
msgstr "pulses 统计已完成的恢复低/高电平周期，不统计准备 STOP 的边沿。stop_observed 证明请求的 STOP 序列结束时，两根线的采样均为 HIGH。lease_held 表示适配器、会话及上下文必须保持有效，且不得启动控制器事务。清理失败绝不替换主要失败。"

msgid "Caller-owned, zero-initialized single-executor session."
msgstr "调用者拥有、零初始化的单执行者会话。"

msgid "Public fields are mechanism storage, not caller controls. Methods, context and clock outlive every retained lease. No allocation, worker, lock, transaction buffer or hidden retry exists. Abandoning a retained lease requires explicit product quarantine/reset responsibility."
msgstr "公共字段用于机制内部存储，不是调用方控制项。方法、上下文及 clock 的生命周期覆盖每个保留租约。不存在分配、worker、锁、事务缓冲区或隐式重试。放弃保留租约必须显式承接产品隔离/复位责任。"

msgid "i2c_long.h"
msgstr "i2c_long.h"

msgid "Optional bounded long I2C messages without extra START."
msgstr "可选的有界 I2C 长消息，不产生额外 START。"

msgid "Validate complete messages before acquiring any hardware."
msgstr "取得任何硬件之前验证完整消息。"

msgid "Each message has 1..65535 bytes. A mutable read cannot overlap a write span or descriptor storage. Write data and descriptors stay immutable throughout a transaction."
msgstr "每条消息包含 1..65535 字节。可修改的读取范围不得与写入范围或描述符存储重叠。写入数据和描述符在整个事务期间保持不可变。"

msgid "[in] Caller-owned finite descriptors and data"
msgstr "[in] 调用方持有的有限描述符及数据"

msgid "[in] One through NX_I2C_MAX_MESSAGES"
msgstr "[in] 1..NX_I2C_MAX_MESSAGES 条"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED; no references retained"
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED；不保留任何引用"

msgid "Execute finite messages without splitting address phases."
msgstr "执行有限消息，不拆分地址阶段。"

msgid "Task-only, one executor shared with base I2C. Each message issues one START; only a following message issues repeated START. Hardware reload does not split messages. Final STOP and bus-idle observation precede successful return. Failure never replays a prefix. Failed abort drain cannot return and release borrowed storage. No implicit bus recovery occurs."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，与基础 I2C 共用一个执行者。每条消息发出一次 START；只有后续消息发出重复 START。硬件 reload 不拆分消息。最终 STOP 和总线空闲观察先于成功返回。失败绝不重放前缀。中止排空失败时，不能返回并归还借用存储。不执行隐式总线恢复。"

msgid "[in] Selected optional long-message provider"
msgstr "[in] 选中的可选长消息 provider"

msgid "[inout] Descriptors and buffers borrowed until return"
msgstr "[inout] 借用至返回的描述符和缓冲区"

msgid "[out] Register byte progress, including failure; TX count does not prove those bytes were ACKed on wire"
msgstr "[out] 包含失败情况的寄存器字节进度；TX 计数不能证明这些字节已在线上获得 ACK"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/ NACK/ARBITRATION/IO after local controller drain"
msgstr "本地控制器排空后返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/NACK/ARBITRATION/IO"

msgid "Shared read-only optional long-message implementation."
msgstr "共享只读的可选长消息实现。"

msgid "Optional immutable face; controller state is shared with base I2C."
msgstr "可选不可变接口；控制器状态与基础 I2C 共享。"

msgid "Face and private context outlive callers. No queue or heap is owned."
msgstr "接口和私有上下文的生命周期覆盖所有调用方。不拥有队列或堆。"

msgid "i2c_target.h"
msgstr "i2c_target.h"

msgid "Finite I2C target exchanges and explicit SMBus responses."
msgstr "有限 I2C target 交换与显式 SMBus 响应。"

msgid "One addressed receive, transmit, or receive/repeated-START transmit."
msgstr "一次寻址后的接收、发送，或接收／repeated START 后发送。"

msgid "ALERT_RESPONSE explicitly requests the SMBus ARA transaction and its provider-owned address byte. Its descriptor remains borrowed while expected ARA arbitration retries until success or a finite deadline."
msgstr "ALERT_RESPONSE 显式请求 SMBus ARA 事务及 provider 拥有的地址字节。预期的 ARA 仲裁重试持续至成功或有限 deadline 到期；重试期间，其描述符始终被借用。"

msgid "Observed hardware/protocol diagnostics, independent of byte counts."
msgstr "观察到的硬件／协议诊断，与字节计数独立。"

msgid "ARA arbitration is an expected retry and can accompany SUCCESS."
msgstr "ARA 仲裁是预期重试，因而可能与 SUCCESS 同时出现。"

msgid "Bind unborrowed spans and a finite deadline to one live generation."
msgstr "将未被借用的 spans 和有限 deadline 绑定到一个活跃 generation。"

msgid "Observing the existing System clock can maintain its shared counter; it never arms I2C acknowledgement or acquires another clock owner."
msgstr "观察现有 System 时钟可以维护其共享计数器；它不启用 I2C 地址确认，也不取得另一份时钟 owner。"

msgid "[in] Prepared static controller, privileged unmasked executor."
msgstr "[in] 已准备的静态 controller，特权且未屏蔽中断的执行者。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized or consumed SETTLED descriptor."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化，或已消费 SETTLED 的描述符。"

msgid "[out] RX capacity bytes or NULL when the direction has no RX."
msgstr "[out] RX capacity 个字节；方向没有 RX 时为 NULL。"

msgid "[in] Positive bounded capacity, or zero without RX."
msgstr "[in] 正数、有界的 capacity；没有 RX 时为零。"

msgid "[in] Immutable response bytes, or NULL without caller TX."
msgstr "[in] 不可变响应字节；没有调用者 TX 时为 NULL。"

msgid "[in] Positive bounded response length, or zero without TX."
msgstr "[in] 正数、有界的响应长度；没有 TX 时为零。"

msgid "[in] Explicit finite wire sequence."
msgstr "[in] 显式、有限的线上序列。"

msgid "[in] Absolute Core deadline, including source withdrawal, in this live controller epoch. Expiry never revokes a retained borrow."
msgstr "[in] 当前活跃 controller epoch 中的绝对 Core deadline，包括源撤回。到期绝不撤销已保留的借用。"

msgid "SUCCESS or rejection with no new borrow or controller/pad writes."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或拒绝；不建立新借用，也不写 controller／pad。"

msgid "Accept one whole descriptor before enabling address acknowledgement."
msgstr "在启用地址确认之前接受一份完整描述符。"

msgid "Peer traffic begins after successful arming. SUCCESS transfers all spans until SETTLED, including start failures, cancellation and timeout. One privileged unmasked Thread executor calls service until settled."
msgstr "成功 arm 后开始对端通信。SUCCESS 移交所有 spans 的借用，持续到 SETTLED，包括启动失败、取消和超时期间。同一个特权、未屏蔽中断的 Thread 执行者持续调用 service，直到结算。"

msgid "Begin cancellation without revoking a borrow or replacing a result."
msgstr "开始取消，不撤销借用或替换结果。"

msgid "Bounded Thread progress; no worker, allocation or implicit replay."
msgstr "有界 Thread 进展；没有 worker、分配或隐式重放。"

msgid "Close admission and drain every source before controller release."
msgstr "关闭准入，在释放 controller 前排空全部源。"

msgid "Reset-based abort releases this controller's outputs/references; it does not certify shared-bus recovery or generate GPIO clock pulses."
msgstr "基于 reset 的中止释放本 controller 的输出／引用；不证明共享总线已经恢复，也不产生 GPIO 时钟脉冲。"

msgid "SUCCESS after withdrawal, BUSY/IO with retained cleanup duty."
msgstr "撤回成功后返回 SUCCESS；BUSY／IO 保留清理责任。"

msgid "Reinitialize an idle faulted owner without replaying old storage."
msgstr "重新初始化空闲的故障 owner，不重放旧存储。"

msgid "Once cold close starts, only close may release its retained receipt; recovery cannot rearm partially restored pads, clocks or IRQs."
msgstr "冷态 close 一旦开始，只有 close 能释放其保留的收条；recover 不能重新 arm 部分恢复的 pad、clock 或 IRQ。"

msgid "Complete caller-owned exchange borrowed through acquire-SETTLED."
msgstr "调用者拥有的完整交换，持续借用至 acquire 观察 SETTLED。"

msgid "All spans are disjoint from metadata, provider state and one another. RX capacity is 1..256 bytes; RECEIVE with PEC requires exactly this many payload bytes and a separate PEC. TX has 1..256 immutable bytes. WRITE_READ supplies a precomputed response after one repeated START; PEC spans both address directions and payloads, ending in TX PEC. Application register/protocol policy is external. ARA has no payload span. Counts exclude addresses/PEC; ARA completion counts one byte. Owner/generation/epoch are provider-written preparation identities. Result fields may be read only after acquire-observed SETTLED."
msgstr "所有 spans 与元数据、provider state 及彼此均不重叠。RX capacity 为 1..256 字节；启用 PEC 的 RECEIVE 恰好接收该数量的 payload 字节，另加独立 PEC。TX 为 1..256 个不可变字节。WRITE_READ 在一次 repeated START 后提供预计算响应；PEC 连续覆盖两个方向的地址及 payload，最终以 TX PEC 结束。应用寄存器／协议策略由外部提供。ARA 没有 payload span。计数排除地址／PEC；ARA 完成按一个字节统计。owner／generation／epoch 是 provider 写入的准备身份。结果字段仅可在 acquire 观察 SETTLED 后读取。"

msgid "Readonly methods shared by static single-executor controllers."
msgstr "静态、单执行者 controller 共享的只读方法表。"

msgid "Immutable existing controller face; lookup has no hardware effects."
msgstr "已有 controller 的不可变 face；查询不产生硬件效果。"

msgid "lptim.h"
msgstr "lptim.h"

msgid "Finite 16-bit counter shots in a distinct tick domain."
msgstr "在独立 tick 域中执行有限的 16 位计数。"

msgid "Prepare initialized unborrowed storage with copied shot metadata."
msgstr "把复制的计数元数据准备到已初始化且未借用的存储中。"

msgid "Complete spans must be aligned, nonwrapping and disjoint. No loan, clock access, unit conversion or physical rate qualification occurs."
msgstr "完整存储范围必须对齐、不发生地址回绕且互不重叠。该操作不建立借用、不访问时钟、不转换单位，也不证明物理速率。"

msgid "[inout] READY or consumed SETTLED with all observers joined."
msgstr "[inout] READY 或结果已消费的 SETTLED 存储，且所有观察者均已 join。"

msgid "[in] Separate nonzero owner/generation value copied here."
msgstr "[in] 在此复制独立、非零的 owner／代次值。"

msgid "[in] Exact positive count, 1..65536, in this domain's ticks."
msgstr "[in] 精确的正计数，范围为 1..65536，单位是该域的 tick。"

msgid "[in] Absolute Core monotonic deadline or NX_DEADLINE_NEVER."
msgstr "[in] 绝对 Core 单调 deadline 或 NX_DEADLINE_NEVER。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; failure leaves every request byte unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；失败保持请求的每个字节不变。"

msgid "Copy the live counter domain and declared units on one task owner."
msgstr "由一个任务 owner 复制当前计数域和声明单位。"

msgid "Open idle reports counter zero and not running. This finite interface does not reconstruct unobserved wraps or provide an absolute clock."
msgstr "开放且空闲时报告计数器为零且未运行。此有限接口不恢复未观察到的回绕，也不提供绝对时钟。"

msgid "[in] Serialized immutable face; no concurrent model/lifecycle."
msgstr "[in] 串行访问的只读接口面；不允许并发模型／生命周期操作。"

msgid "[out] Separate aligned writable snapshot."
msgstr "[out] 独立、对齐且可写的快照。"

msgid "SUCCESS, STATE if closed, or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED; rejected output is unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS、关闭时的 STATE 或 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED；拒绝时输出不变。"

msgid "Borrow one READY shot after all idle/domain/range checks."
msgstr "完成空闲／域／范围检查后借用一个 READY 计数请求。"

msgid "Expired finite deadline rejects TIMEOUT before source effects. Reserve a final nonwrapping domain increment before acceptance: EXHAUSTED never abandons a previously accepted loan. Clock context lifetime, complete extent/disjointness and non-reentry are assembly responsibilities."
msgstr "有限 deadline 已到期时，在产生请求源效果前返回 TIMEOUT。接受请求前预留最终不回绕的域递增：EXHAUSTED 绝不丢弃此前已经接受的借用。时钟上下文生命周期、完整范围／不重叠及不可重入由装配方负责。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized owner with a copied external Core clock."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行 owner，持有复制的外部 Core 时钟接口面。"

msgid "[inout] Caller request; no queue or hidden worker."
msgstr "[inout] 调用方请求；没有队列或隐藏 worker。"

msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; INVALID/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/EXHAUSTED/UNSUPPORTED rejects without retained references or effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；INVALID/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/EXHAUSTED/UNSUPPORTED 表示拒绝，不保留引用或效果。"

msgid "Accept cancellation, retaining the loan until proved withdrawal."
msgstr "接受取消，但保持借用直到证明已撤源。"

msgid "Cancel/stop may win before unobserved event/expiry. First cause stays fixed; transferred counts final source progress at actual withdrawal."
msgstr "cancel／stop 可以在尚未观察到事件／到期之前先锁存原因。首次原因保持不变；transferred 记录真实撤源时最终的请求源进度。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized executor; no implicit cross-task locking."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行执行者；没有隐式跨任务锁。"

msgid "[inout] Exact active identity; foreign identity is not read."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的活动请求身份；不读取其他请求身份指向的存储。"

msgid "SUCCESS may still mean QUARANTINED; rejection is STATE/INVALID/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS 仍可能表示 QUARANTINED；拒绝返回 STATE/INVALID/UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Observe deadline/event and continue bounded real withdrawal."
msgstr "观察 deadline／事件，并继续有界的真实撤源。"

msgid "First observed expiry wins over pending completion. Clear all source, pending and owner references before final release SETTLED publication."
msgstr "首次观察到的到期优先于 pending 完成事件。最终以 release 发布 SETTLED 前，清除全部请求源、pending 和 owner 引用。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized task owner; no implicit source advance."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行任务 owner；不隐式推进请求源。"

msgid "SUCCESS when idle/settled, BUSY while active or withdrawal is held; INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED may reject dispatch."
msgstr "空闲／已结清时返回 SUCCESS，活动或撤源被 hold 阻止时返回 BUSY；INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED 可以拒绝分发。"

msgid "Close admission; cancelled/expired is never a loan-release proof."
msgstr "关闭准入；取消／到期绝不是借用已归还的证明。"

msgid "Repeated clean stop is safe; it does not reset generation or lifetime. Tick rate/source and backup/Stop/VBAT continuity need separate hardware contracts; this interface establishes none of those qualifications."
msgstr "重复执行已完成的干净 stop 是安全的；它不重置代次或生命周期。tick 速率／请求源和备份／Stop／VBAT 连续性需要独立硬件合同；此接口不建立这些验证资格。"

msgid "[in] Serialized owner, with all external publishers quiescent."
msgstr "[in] 串行 owner，且所有外部发布者均已静止。"

msgid "SUCCESS after detachment, BUSY retains quarantined storage; INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED may reject dispatch."
msgstr "脱离引用后返回 SUCCESS，BUSY 保留隔离存储；INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED 可以拒绝分发。"

msgid "Owner and nonwrapping shot incarnation, never an RTC/Core token."
msgstr "owner 与不回绕的计数代次，绝不是 RTC/Core token。"

msgid "Identity is compared without dereference. Tokens/observers must be retired before the owner storage lifetime ends or its address is reused."
msgstr "仅比较身份，不解引用。结束 owner 存储生命周期或复用其地址前，必须退役所有 token／观察者。"

msgid "Declared units and modulo counter, not an absolute time estimate."
msgstr "声明单位与模计数值，不是绝对时间估计。"

msgid "A complete 65536-tick shot wraps counter to zero. Counter zero alone cannot establish completion, idle, missed wraps or low-power continuity. tick_hz is a fixed declared rate, not physical oscillator accuracy."
msgstr "完整的 65536 tick 计数会把计数器回绕到零。单凭计数器为零不能证明完成、空闲、遗漏回绕或低功耗连续性。tick_hz 是固定声明速率，不是物理振荡器精度。"

msgid "One caller-owned finite shot; transferred is final observed ticks."
msgstr "一次由调用方持有的有限计数；transferred 是最终观察到的 tick 数。"

msgid "Initialize base first. After ACCEPTED keep the entire request live and caller immutable until acquire-observed SETTLED and external joins. A latched CANCELLED/TIMEOUT fixes the cause, not the final progress: held withdrawal may allow further source ticks before detachment."
msgstr "先初始化 base。ACCEPTED 后，保持整个请求有效且调用方不可修改，直到以 acquire 观察到 SETTLED 并完成外部 join。锁存的 CANCELLED/TIMEOUT 固定终止原因，而不是最终进度：撤源被 hold 阻止时，脱离前请求源仍可能继续累计 tick。"

msgid "Shared readonly methods implement the corresponding public contract."
msgstr "共享只读方法实现相应公共合同。"

msgid "Immutable two-pointer face; provider storage remains private."
msgstr "只读双指针接口面；provider 存储保持私有。"

msgid "mdio.h"
msgstr "mdio.h"

msgid "Narrow Clause22 station management with absolute deadlines."
msgstr "使用绝对截止时间的窄接口 Clause22 站点管理。"

msgid "Read one Clause22 PHY register without retaining output storage."
msgstr "读取一个 Clause22 PHY 寄存器，不保留输出存储。"

msgid "Serialized privileged task, incoming masks clear; finite absolute deadline in the provider clock. Address and register are 0..31. BUSY rejects before new MMIO effects; timeout does not pretend busy cleared."
msgstr "串行化的特权任务调用，进入时中断屏蔽均清除；deadline 是 provider 时钟域中的有限绝对时间。地址和寄存器均为 0..31。BUSY 在产生新 MMIO 效果前拒绝；超时不伪称 busy 已清除。"

msgid "[in] Stable face and caller-owned execution context."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的接口及调用方持有的执行上下文。"

msgid "[in] Clause22 PHY address, from 0 through 31."
msgstr "[in] Clause22 PHY 地址，0..31。"

msgid "[in] Clause22 register address, from 0 through 31."
msgstr "[in] Clause22 寄存器地址，0..31。"

msgid "[out] Written only after timely observed completion."
msgstr "[out] 仅在及时观察到完成后写入。"

msgid "Success, BUSY without a new command, or timeout/input/context error."
msgstr "成功、不发出新命令的 BUSY，或超时/输入/上下文错误。"

msgid "Write one Clause22 PHY register, not a PHY-specific policy sequence."
msgstr "写入一个 Clause22 PHY 寄存器，不实现特定 PHY 策略序列。"

msgid "Same task/deadline rules as read. No IRQ-masked busy wait or fallback."
msgstr "与 read 相同的任务/deadline 规则。不在屏蔽 IRQ 时忙等，也不回退。"

msgid "[in] Exact 16-bit register value."
msgstr "[in] 精确的 16 位寄存器值。"

msgid "model.h"
msgstr "model.h"

msgid "Explicit host-model fixtures; no physical MCU qualification."
msgstr "显式主机模型夹具，不建立物理 MCU 资格。"

msgid "Switch host model to a deterministic clock domain."
msgstr "将主机模型切换到确定性时钟域。"

msgid "[in] True selects manual clock, false real monotonic."
msgstr "[in] true 选择手动时钟，false 选择真实单调时间。"

msgid "[in] Initial manual microsecond value, below UINT64_MAX."
msgstr "[in] 手动时钟的初始微秒值，须小于 UINT64_MAX。"

msgid "Success or INVALID. Caller must first settle every request; switching creates a new domain and invalidates old deadlines."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID。调用方必须先结清所有请求；切换会创建新时间域，使旧 deadline 失效。"

msgid "Advance deterministic time without an implicit hardware IRQ."
msgstr "推进确定性时间，不隐式触发硬件 IRQ。"

msgid "[in] Positive or zero microsecond increment."
msgstr "[in] 非负微秒增量。"

msgid "Success, STATE outside manual mode or EXHAUSTED on overflow."
msgstr "成功；非手动模式返回 STATE，溢出返回 EXHAUSTED。"

msgid "Configure the fixed GPIO model after writer quiescence."
msgstr "写者静止后配置固定 GPIO 模型。"

msgid "[in] Authorized input/output bit mask."
msgstr "[in] 获授权的输入/输出位掩码。"

msgid "[in] Initial output snapshot within mask."
msgstr "[in] 位于掩码范围内的初始输出快照。"

msgid "Success or INVALID; no fake Board/electrical qualification."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；不虚构 Board/电气资格。"

msgid "Inject one GPIO input snapshot in the deterministic model."
msgstr "在确定性模型中注入一个 GPIO 输入快照。"

msgid "[in] Physical-port snapshot; read masks unauthorized bits."
msgstr "[in] 物理端口快照；读取时屏蔽未授权位。"

msgid "Observe output state for a host behavioral assertion."
msgstr "观察输出状态，用于主机行为断言。"

msgid "Model output snapshot; no measured waveform semantics."
msgstr "模型输出快照；不具有实测波形语义。"

msgid "Configure exact RX/TX fixture capacities on the fixed UART."
msgstr "在固定 UART 上配置准确的 RX/TX 夹具容量。"

msgid "[in] Caller-owned selected-profile storage description."
msgstr "[in] 调用方持有的选中配置存储描述。"

msgid "Success, INVALID or BUSY if an active request remains."
msgstr "成功、INVALID，或因仍有活跃请求而返回 BUSY。"

msgid "Validate exact Native TX context for selected RS485 binding."
msgstr "为选定 RS485 绑定验证准确 Native TX 上下文。"

msgid "Task-only; no model IRQ, admission, GPIO or state mutation."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文；不产生模型 IRQ、准入、GPIO 或状态修改。"

msgid "[in] Configured Native UART face's exact context."
msgstr "[in] 已配置 Native UART 接口的精确上下文。"

msgid "[in] Live READY/QUEUED descriptor, never retained."
msgstr "[in] 仍然有效的 READY/QUEUED 描述符，不予保留。"

msgid "Same pure rejectable checks as Native submit/start."
msgstr "执行与 Native submit/start 相同的纯检查，且可拒绝。"

msgid "Copy explicit IRQ facts into a quiescent host UART model."
msgstr "将显式 IRQ 事实复制到静止的主机 UART 模型。"

msgid "Task-only cold configuration; caller has stopped publishers. No active request, stream or attached wake may remain. Default preparation explicitly models BASEPRI/four-bit IRQs; this entry can model Baseline without inventing a SoC/Board."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的冷态配置；调用方已停止发布者。不得残留活跃请求、stream 或已绑定的 wake。默认准备过程显式模拟 BASEPRI/四位 IRQ；此入口可以模拟 Baseline，不虚构 SoC/Board。"

msgid "[in] Configured Native UART face with no IRQ users."
msgstr "[in] 没有 IRQ 使用者的已配置 Native UART 接口。"

msgid "[in] Immutable CPU/kernel facts copied during this call."
msgstr "[in] 在本次调用中复制的不可变 CPU/内核事实。"

msgid "[in] Actual modeled publisher facts copied during call."
msgstr "[in] 在本次调用中复制的实际模型发布者事实。"

msgid "Success, INVALID, CONTEXT, STATE or BUSY before side effects."
msgstr "成功，或在产生效果前返回 INVALID、CONTEXT、STATE 或 BUSY。"

msgid "Execute one deterministic TX IRQ byte/TC event."
msgstr "执行一个确定性 TX IRQ 字节／TC 事件。"

msgid "No actual hardware IRQ, latency or wire timing is simulated."
msgstr "不模拟实际硬件 IRQ、时延或线上时序。"

msgid "Inject one RX IRQ fact into bounded selected-profile storage."
msgstr "将一个 RX IRQ 事实注入有界、选定配置的存储。"

msgid "[in] Received byte; ignored for NO_BYTE status facts."
msgstr "[in] 接收到的字节；NO_BYTE 状态事实时忽略此值。"

msgid "[in] NX_UART_EVENT_* error facts; zero for normal reception."
msgstr "[in] NX_UART_EVENT_* 错误事实；正常接收为零。"

msgid "Success, OVERFLOW or STATE if disabled."
msgstr "成功、OVERFLOW，或禁用时返回 STATE。"

msgid "Configure start failure or inability to prove hardware drain."
msgstr "配置启动失败或无法证明硬件排空。"

msgid "[in] Fail after direct admission, not as rejection."
msgstr "[in] 直接准入后失败，不作为拒绝。"

msgid "[in] Retain QUARANTINED request until explicitly released."
msgstr "[in] 保留 QUARANTINED 请求，直到显式解除。"

msgid "Observe captured TX bytes."
msgstr "观察捕获的 TX 字节。"

msgid "Number captured in caller-owned tx_log."
msgstr "捕获到调用方持有的 tx_log 中的数量。"

msgid "Configure a fixed SPI echo or register-file model."
msgstr "配置固定 SPI 回显或寄存器文件模型。"

msgid "[inout] Optional caller-owned register bytes; NULL is echo."
msgstr "[inout] 可选的调用方持有的寄存器字节；NULL 表示回显。"

msgid "[in] Register capacity; zero only for echo mode."
msgstr "[in] 寄存器容量；仅回显模式允许为零。"

msgid "Success or INVALID; fixture has one serialized executor."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；夹具只有一个串行化执行者。"

msgid "Inject bounded SPI partial failure or controller occupancy."
msgstr "注入有界 SPI 部分失败或控制器占用。"

msgid "[in] Byte index to fail at, SIZE_MAX disables fault."
msgstr "[in] 发生失败的字节索引；SIZE_MAX 禁用故障。"

msgid "[in] True rejects transactions without CS/buffer access."
msgstr "[in] true 表示不访问 CS/缓冲区即拒绝事务。"

msgid "Check the modeled CS level after a transaction."
msgstr "事务结束后检查模型 CS 电平。"

msgid "True while model transaction owns active CS."
msgstr "模型事务持有活跃 CS 时为真。"

msgid "Configure one 7-bit-address register-file I2C model."
msgstr "配置一个 7 位地址的寄存器文件 I2C 模型。"

msgid "[inout] Caller-owned register bytes retained by fixture."
msgstr "[inout] 由调用方持有、夹具保留的寄存器字节。"

msgid "[in] Positive register capacity, at most 256."
msgstr "[in] 正的寄存器容量，最多 256。"

msgid "[in] Valid nonreserved 7-bit address."
msgstr "[in] 有效且非保留的 7 位地址。"

msgid "Inject NACK, arbitration loss or a stuck bus."
msgstr "注入 NACK、仲裁丢失或总线卡死。"

msgid "[in] Success disables fault; NACK/ARBITRATION/IO supported."
msgstr "[in] Success 禁用故障；支持 NACK/ARBITRATION/IO。"

msgid "[in] True makes explicit recovery fail until released."
msgstr "[in] true 使显式恢复持续失败，直到解除。"

msgid "Configure physical-geometry RAM model, clearly nonpersistent."
msgstr "配置物理几何 RAM 模型，明确不具备持久性。"

msgid "[inout] Caller-owned geometry-sized bytes; erased to 0xff."
msgstr "[inout] 调用方持有、大小符合几何信息的字节存储；擦除为 0xff。"

msgid "[in] Caller-owned immutable contiguous sector geometry with program_flags = 0. This NOR model does not implement hidden ECC erase-history requirements."
msgstr "[in] 调用方持有的不可变连续扇区几何，program_flags = 0。此 NOR 模型不实现隐藏 ECC 擦除历史要求。"

msgid "Success, INVALID geometry or UNSUPPORTED program flags; no heap, product reserve or persistence."
msgstr "成功、因几何无效而返回 INVALID，或因编程标志不支持而返回 UNSUPPORTED；没有堆、产品预留或持久化。"

msgid "Inject program/erase failure after complete modeled pulses."
msgstr "完整模型脉冲之后注入编程／擦除失败。"

msgid "[in] Complete pulses allowed; SIZE_MAX disables fault."
msgstr "[in] 允许完成的完整脉冲数；SIZE_MAX 禁用故障。"

msgid "Reset the watchdog fixture as a simulated new boot."
msgstr "复位看门狗夹具，模拟新一次启动。"

msgid "Test-only; production IWDG cannot be disabled by this action."
msgstr "仅用于测试；此操作不能禁用真实 IWDG。"

msgid "[in] Latched reset cause mask."
msgstr "[in] 锁存的复位原因掩码。"

msgid "Observe expiration of the enabled deterministic IWDG."
msgstr "观察已启用确定性 IWDG 的到期。"

msgid "True once its nominal model deadline expires; latches IWDG."
msgstr "标称模型 deadline 到期后为真，并锁存 IWDG。"

msgid "Configure exact storage for one static EXTI line."
msgstr "为一个静态 EXTI 线路配置准确存储。"

msgid "[in] Zero through fifteen."
msgstr "[in] 0..15。"

msgid "[in] RISING/FALLING/BOTH selection."
msgstr "[in] RISING/FALLING/BOTH 选择。"

msgid "[inout] Fixture-owned queue storage."
msgstr "[inout] 夹具持有的队列存储。"

msgid "[in] Positive event capacity."
msgstr "[in] 正的事件容量。"

msgid "Success or INVALID; quiesce producer/consumer before reset."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；复位前须使生产者/消费者静默。"

msgid "Inject a timestamped selected edge fact."
msgstr "注入一个带时间戳的选定边沿事实。"

msgid "[in] Configured static line."
msgstr "[in] 已配置的静态线。"

msgid "[in] RISING or FALLING occurrence."
msgstr "[in] RISING 或 FALLING 事件。"

msgid "Success, INVALID/STATE/OVERFLOW; loss remains observable."
msgstr "成功，或 INVALID/STATE/OVERFLOW；丢失仍可被观察。"

msgid "Configure fixed PWM model timer facts after writer quiescence."
msgstr "写者静止后配置固定 PWM 模型定时器事实。"

msgid "[in] Positive post-prescaler frequency."
msgstr "[in] 预分频后的正频率。"

msgid "[in] Fixed shared-base positive period."
msgstr "[in] 固定共享时基的正周期。"

msgid "Configure fixed ADC raw-count sequence and format."
msgstr "配置固定 ADC 原始计数序列与格式。"

msgid "[in] Fixture-owned nominal sample sequence."
msgstr "[in] 夹具持有的标称样本序列。"

msgid "[in] Positive channel count."
msgstr "[in] 正的通道数。"

msgid "[in] One through sixteen."
msgstr "[in] 1..16。"

msgid "[in] Positive nominal reference voltage."
msgstr "[in] 正的标称参考电压。"

msgid "Inject ADC failure after a prefix of complete samples."
msgstr "若干完整样本之后注入 ADC 失败。"

msgid "[in] Complete samples allowed; SIZE_MAX disables."
msgstr "[in] 允许完成的完整样本数；SIZE_MAX 禁用故障。"

msgid "Operate on the selected Native model face only."
msgstr "仅操作选定的 Native 模型接口面。"

msgid "Null or foreign-provider faces return INVALID for status operations, zero/false for observations, and have no effect for injections. Referenced fixture storage remains owned by the caller; reconfiguration requires writer and IRQ quiescence and never revokes a live UART borrow."
msgstr "对于空接口或其他 provider 的接口，状态操作返回 INVALID，观察返回零/false，注入无效果。所引用的夹具存储仍由调用方持有；重新配置要求写入者和 IRQ 静默，绝不撤销活跃 UART 借用。"

msgid "Choose explicit or automatic modeled SPI IRQ stepping."
msgstr "选择显式或自动模型 SPI IRQ 推进。"

msgid "Quiesce the controller first. Automatic service advances at most one byte or a separate final idle fact per call; this does not model physical DMA or wire timing."
msgstr "先使控制器静默。自动 service 每次调用至多推进一个字节或一个独立的最终空闲事实；不模拟物理 DMA 或线上时序。"

msgid "Inject one bounded SPI byte/idle event on the exact Native bus."
msgstr "在准确 Native 总线上注入一个有界 SPI 字节／空闲事件。"

msgid "Inject inability to prove SPI hardware drain."
msgstr "注入无法证明 SPI 硬件排空的失败。"

msgid "Retained requests become QUARANTINED until hold is released and the executor services the bus again. No loan is revoked."
msgstr "保留请求转为 QUARANTINED，直到解除 hold，且执行者再次 service 总线。不撤销任何借用。"

msgid "Inject UART IDLE and publish its current valid byte prefix."
msgstr "注入 UART IDLE，并发布当前有效字节前缀。"

msgid "Success, EMPTY without a prefix, STATE outside a running block stream, BUSY while its modeled writer is active, or INVALID for a foreign provider. No producer loan is revoked."
msgstr "成功、无前缀时返回 EMPTY、未运行块流时返回 STATE、模型写入者活跃时返回 BUSY，或其他 provider 返回 INVALID。不撤销生产者借用。"

msgid "Inject one ADC timer-trigger scan into a free selected block."
msgstr "向选定空闲块注入一次 ADC 定时器触发扫描。"

msgid "Each success publishes one interleaved raw-count scan; partial failed scans are detached and never published."
msgstr "每次成功发布一次交错排列的原始计数扫描；失败的部分扫描先分离，绝不发布。"

msgid "Success, OVERFLOW while a required block remains held, IO for a failed scan, STATE after stop, or INVALID for a foreign provider. No hardware cadence or analog accuracy is claimed."
msgstr "成功、必需 block 仍被持有时返回 OVERFLOW、扫描失败返回 IO、停止后返回 STATE，或其他 provider 返回 INVALID。不声称硬件节拍或模拟精度。"

msgid "Variables"
msgstr "变量"

msgid "Fixed model bindings; no allocation, lookup, probe or construction."
msgstr "固定模型绑定；不分配、不查找、不探测、不构造。"

msgid "UART storage belongs to the fixture until port stop and IRQ quiescence."
msgstr "UART 存储归夹具所有，直到端口停止且 IRQ 静止。"

msgid "nand.h"
msgstr "nand.h"

msgid "Finite raw NAND page/OOB operations and hardware ECC codes."
msgstr "有限 raw NAND page／OOB 操作和硬件 ECC 码。"

msgid "Raw one-page, OOB-only, whole-block erase or device reset."
msgstr "Raw 单 page、仅 OOB、完整 block erase 或器件 reset。"

msgid "Query explicit raw geometry without starting device operations."
msgstr "查询显式 raw geometry，不启动器件操作。"

msgid "No ID inference or bad-block scan is performed."
msgstr "不按 ID 推断，也不执行坏块扫描。"

msgid "[in] Stable selected serialized face."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、已选择且串行化的 face。"

msgid "Immutable facts or NULL before successful prepare/invalid face."
msgstr "不可变事实；成功 prepare 之前或 face 无效时为 NULL。"

msgid "Read up to eight ID bytes while idle, retaining no output."
msgstr "空闲时最多读取八个 ID 字节，不保留输出。"

msgid "Read-ID does not authorize a geometry or command-set substitution."
msgstr "Read-ID 不授权替换 geometry 或 command set。"

msgid "[in] Idle selected privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 空闲、已选择的特权任务所有者。"

msgid "[out] Distinct writable internal output."
msgstr "[out] 独立、可写的内部存储输出。"

msgid "[in] Positive 1..8 raw signature bytes."
msgstr "[in] 正的 1..8 个原始签名字节。"

msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, INVALID or hardware error; no product identification."
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、INVALID 或硬件错误；不进行产品识别。"

msgid "Read raw device status bits while no finite request owns the bus."
msgstr "没有有限请求占有总线时，读取器件原始状态位。"

msgid "A status read alone never revokes any request or bank lease."
msgstr "单独读取状态从不撤销请求或 bank lease。"

msgid "[out] Raw status; bit6 ready, bit0 fail, bit7 write-protect."
msgstr "[out] 原始状态：bit6 为 ready，bit0 为 fail，bit7 为 write-protect。"

msgid "SUCCESS or exact rejected/hardware result, no retained output."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或精确的拒绝／硬件结果，不保留输出。"

msgid "Prepare metadata without touching page/OOB or hardware."
msgstr "准备 metadata，不访问 page／OOB 或硬件。"

msgid "Caller joins previous observers and fills every operation field before submission; provider checks complete spans/geometry before admission."
msgstr "调用者须在提交前 join 旧观察者并填写全部操作字段；provider 在准入前检查完整 span／geometry。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized READY or consumed SETTLED storage; operation/page/buffers are caller-filled afterward."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的 READY 或已消费的 SETTLED 存储；operation／page／buffer 随后由调用者填写。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; failure leaves descriptor unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID／STATE；失败保持描述符不变。"

msgid "Admit exactly one finite raw operation with borrowed spans."
msgstr "以借用 span 接纳恰好一次有限 raw 操作。"

msgid "Rejection retains nothing and issues no command. A deadline cannot revoke program/erase/reset or unsettled ECC hardware accesses."
msgstr "拒绝不保留任何引用，也不发出命令。Deadline 不能撤销 program／erase／reset 或尚未静止的 ECC 硬件访问。"

msgid "[in] Live selected privileged serialized task owner."
msgstr "[in] 活跃、已选择的特权串行化任务所有者。"

msgid "[inout] Exact READY immutable descriptor and spans."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的 READY 不可变描述符及 span。"

msgid "Stop further data/pulses and drain the currently accepted operation."
msgstr "停止后续数据／脉冲，并排空当前已接纳操作。"

msgid "A partial program-data load is reset and that reset must become ready."
msgstr "部分 program 数据装载会触发 reset，且该 reset 必须变为 ready。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行化特权任务所有者。"

msgid "[inout] Exact current live descriptor."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的当前活跃描述符。"

msgid "SUCCESS starts cancellation; SETTLED alone releases borrows."
msgstr "SUCCESS 开始取消；只有 SETTLED 才释放借用。"

msgid "Make bounded command, up to 32 bus units, ECC or ready progress."
msgstr "有界推进 command、最多 32 个 bus unit、ECC 或 ready 状态。"

msgid "Caller schedules service; no sleeping, replay or implicit rearm."
msgstr "调用者调度 service；不休眠、重放或隐式重新 arm。"

msgid "SUCCESS after progress/settlement; BUSY during device/ECC drain; IO with retained QUARANTINED storage on missing hardware."
msgstr "进展／SETTLED 后为 SUCCESS；器件／ECC 排空期间为 BUSY；缺失硬件时为 IO，并保留 QUARANTINED 存储。"

msgid "Seal admission and cancel/drain the current request."
msgstr "封闭准入，取消／排空当前请求。"

msgid "Cold bank close is separate and refuses any pending device operation."
msgstr "Cold bank close 是独立操作，任何器件操作未结束时都会拒绝。"

msgid "SUCCESS after final request detach; BUSY/IO retains bank and borrow."
msgstr "最终分离请求后才 SUCCESS；BUSY／IO 保留 bank 与借用。"

msgid "Explicit device geometry in bytes, independent of bus word width."
msgstr "显式器件 geometry，以字节表示，独立于总线字宽。"

msgid "Selected software facts, not discovered good-block capacity. No bad block policy, ECC correction/placement, FTL or filesystem is supplied."
msgstr "所选软件事实，不是探测到的好块容量。不提供坏块策略、ECC 纠正／放置、FTL 或文件系统。"

msgid "Finite raw request, no implicit bad-block or OOB interpretation."
msgstr "有限 raw 请求，不隐含坏块或 OOB 解释。"

msgid "page identifies an absolute physical page, including bad blocks. READ/PROGRAM_PAGE requires exactly page_bytes; optional OOB is exactly oob_bytes. OOB-only uses data=NULL and exact OOB. Erase names the first page of a block. Reset has no buffers/page. Optional ECC output has one uint32_t per main-data chunk; raw codes have no placement/correction policy. READ destinations, PROGRAM sources and ECC codes are borrowed through acquire-observed SETTLED. Cancellation cannot abort a pulse. base.transferred is complete main+OOB bytes on SUCCESS, zero on error; failed read storage can contain unqualified partial data."
msgstr "page 指定绝对物理 page，包含坏块。READ／PROGRAM_PAGE 要求恰好 page_bytes；可选 OOB 必须恰好为 oob_bytes。仅 OOB 操作使用 data=NULL 和精确 OOB。Erase 指定 block 的首 page。Reset 不使用 buffer／page。可选 ECC 输出为每个主数据 chunk 一个 uint32_t；raw code 不附带放置／纠错策略。READ 目标、PROGRAM 来源和 ECC code 持续被借用，直到通过 acquire 观察到 SETTLED。取消不能中止脉冲。SUCCESS 时 base.transferred 为完整主数据加 OOB 字节数，错误时为零；失败的 read 存储可能含未获准使用的部分数据。"

msgid "Same static physical owner, called by one privileged task."
msgstr "同一静态物理所有者，由一个特权任务调用。"

msgid "Immutable raw face; factory returns existing identity only."
msgstr "不可变 raw face；factory 只返回既有身份。"

msgid "State/facts/faces outlive all calls and retained requests. No hidden worker/queue/heap/IRQ exists. Calls are serialized with cold lifecycle."
msgstr "状态／事实／face 比全部调用和保留请求活得更久。没有隐藏 worker／queue／heap／IRQ。调用与 cold lifecycle 串行化。"

msgid "observation.h"
msgstr "observation.h"

msgid "Explicit timestamp provenance and checked service dispatch."
msgstr "显式时间戳来源与经过检查的服务派发。"

msgid "Observation location; software time never implies hardware SOF."
msgstr "观察位置；软件时间不表示硬件 SOF。"

msgid "A timing bound can straddle a budget without proving either side."
msgstr "时序界限可能跨越预算，无法证明满足预算或超出预算。"

msgid "Compare two explicitly related observed events."
msgstr "比较两个关系已明确的观察事件。"

msgid "Task/IRQ pure constant work; no clock, hardware, allocation, lock or reference retention. Inputs may coincide. The caller proves event pairing and timestamp provenance. Different explicit source kinds may be compared to observe delivery latency, without relabeling either observation."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中均为纯操作且工作量恒定；不读取时钟、不访问硬件、不分配、不加锁，也不保留引用。输入可以重合。调用方负责证明事件配对及时间戳来源。可以比较不同的显式来源种类以观察交付时延，但不得重新标记任一观察。"

msgid "[in] Stable aligned first fact, not concurrently modified."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、已对齐且未被并发修改的首个事实。"

msgid "[in] Stable last fact in the same domain, epoch and rate."
msgstr "[in] 同一时间域、epoch 和速率中稳定的末个事实。"

msgid "[out] Distinct aligned result, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立且已对齐的结果，拒绝时保持不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID for malformed/misaligned/overlapping storage, UNSUPPORTED for UNKNOWN source, STATE for incompatible domains or reversed ticks, EXHAUSTED for bound overflow."
msgstr "SUCCESS；存储参数无效、未对齐或重叠时返回 INVALID；来源为 UNKNOWN 时返回 UNSUPPORTED；时钟域不兼容或 ticks 逆序时返回 STATE；边界溢出时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

msgid "Compare a complete timing-error interval with a budget."
msgstr "将完整时序误差区间与预算比较。"

msgid "Pure O(1) Task/IRQ work with no clock access or retention. WITHIN requires upper <= maximum; EXCEEDED requires lower > maximum. An overlapping or unknown error interval gives UNKNOWN. SUCCESS alone does not mean within budget. The existing timestamp-owner/provenance contract applies: this does not extend raw DWT, validate epoch continuity, synchronize sampling, establish IRQ arrival or prove WCET."
msgstr "纯 O(1) Task／IRQ 操作，不访问时钟、不保留引用。WITHIN 要求 upper <= maximum；EXCEEDED 要求 lower > maximum。当 lower <= maximum < upper，或误差界未知时，结果为 UNKNOWN。SUCCESS 本身不表示满足预算。既有时间戳 owner／来源合同仍适用：本函数不扩展原始 DWT、不验证 epoch 连续性、不同步采样、不建立 IRQ 到达时刻，也不证明 WCET。"

msgid "[in] Stable aligned extended timestamp, causally paired."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且对齐的扩展时间戳，须与另一事实构成因果配对。"

msgid "[in] Stable aligned fact in the same domain/epoch/rate."
msgstr "[in] 同一 domain／epoch／rate 内稳定且对齐的事实。"

msgid "[in] Inclusive maximum, in the stated tick units."
msgstr "[in] 包含边界的最大值，单位为声明的 tick。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/STATE as elapsed, or EXHAUSTED when the uncertainty sum or upper bound cannot fit."
msgstr "与 elapsed 相同的 SUCCESS、INVALID／UNSUPPORTED／STATE；不确定度之和或上界不可表示时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

msgid "Dispatch the selected UART service or explain its absence."
msgstr "派发选定的 UART 服务，或说明服务缺失。"

msgid "Same context, serialization and lifetime rules as ordinary service. SUCCESS proves dispatch only, not progress, health, settlement or permission to reclaim storage. This reads no request and adds no state, lock or hidden worker."
msgstr "与普通 service 采用相同的上下文、串行化和生命周期规则。SUCCESS 仅证明已派发，不证明进展、健康、结清或允许回收存储。不读取请求，不增加状态、锁或隐藏 worker。"

msgid "[in] Live immutable face and initialized provider state."
msgstr "[in] 仍然有效的不可变接口及已初始化的 provider 状态。"

msgid "SUCCESS after one dispatch, INVALID for malformed face, UNSUPPORTED when no service method exists."
msgstr "一次派发后返回 SUCCESS；接口格式无效返回 INVALID，没有 service 方法返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Dispatch the selected SPI service or explain its absence."
msgstr "派发选定的 SPI 服务，或说明服务缺失。"

msgid "Same context and owner rules as nx_spi_port_service; SUCCESS establishes dispatch only, never settlement."
msgstr "与 nx_spi_port_service 采用相同的上下文和所有者规则；SUCCESS 仅证明已派发，绝不代表结清。"

msgid "SUCCESS after dispatch, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "派发后返回 SUCCESS，或返回 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Dispatch the selected I2C service or explain its absence."
msgstr "派发选定的 I2C 服务，或说明服务缺失。"

msgid "Same context and owner rules as nx_i2c_port_service; SUCCESS establishes dispatch only, never settlement."
msgstr "与 nx_i2c_port_service 采用相同的上下文和所有者规则；SUCCESS 仅证明已派发，绝不代表结清。"

msgid "Explicit, caller-supplied time fact without clock access."
msgstr "由调用者明确提供的时间事实，不访问时钟。"

msgid "ticks is extended, monotonically increasing within one nonzero domain/epoch. Its owner extends counter wrap and changes epoch on reset, discontinuity or rate change. Domain and epoch are assembly-local identities, not clocks synchronized across cores, security domains or devices. UNKNOWN carries no usable measurement. Frequency is exact stated ticks/second, not measured accuracy. A known zero uncertainty states zero error; unknown uncertainty has a separate flag. These facts do not establish physical precision, causal pairing or event identity by themselves."
msgstr "ticks 是扩展计数，在一个非零 domain/epoch 中单调递增。其所有者扩展计数器回绕，并在复位、不连续或速率变化时改变 epoch。domain 和 epoch 是装配内身份，不表示跨核、安全域或设备同步的时钟。UNKNOWN 不提供可用测量。频率是精确声明的 ticks/second，而非实测精度。已知且为零的不确定度表示零误差；未知不确定度使用独立标志。这些事实本身不能建立物理精度、因果配对或事件身份。"

msgid "Delta in one common clock domain, with stated error bound."
msgstr "同一时钟域内的差值，带明确的误差界。"

msgid "When uncertainty_known is false, uncertainty_ticks is zero and describes no error bound. No conversion, rounding or synchronization across clocks is implicit."
msgstr "uncertainty_known 为 false 时，uncertainty_ticks 为零，不描述任何误差界限。不隐含时间转换、舍入或跨时钟同步。"

msgid "Inclusive interval and budget comparison in the stated tick domain."
msgstr "在声明的 tick 域内比较包含边界的区间与预算。"

msgid "lower/upper are usable only when delta.uncertainty_known is true. Otherwise both are zero and verdict is UNKNOWN, never an exact zero."
msgstr "仅当 delta.uncertainty_known 为 true 时 lower／upper 才可使用。否则两者均为零，verdict 为 UNKNOWN，绝不表示精确的零。"

msgid "pin_state.h"
msgstr "pin_state.h"

msgid "Explicit static default and sleep pad states."
msgstr "显式静态默认态与睡眠态引脚配置。"

msgid "Only explicitly authored GPIO states; no implicit power policy."
msgstr "仅支持显式编写的 GPIO 状态；不隐含电源策略。"

msgid "Select one explicitly supported GPIO state without waiting."
msgstr "选择一个明确支持的 GPIO 状态，无需等待。"

msgid "Serialized same-CPU privileged Thread with incoming masks clear. No ISR/NMI, competing pad/RCC owner, AF switching, clock transition, wake or retention policy. Partial failure retains the lease; retry an explicit supported target or let the owner perform checked cleanup. This does not prove physical transients, external bias or PCB safety."
msgstr "在同一 CPU 的特权 Thread 上下文中串行调用，进入时中断屏蔽位须已清除。不得从 ISR/NMI 调用，不得有其他 pad/RCC 所有者竞争；不支持 AF 切换、时钟转换、唤醒或保持策略。部分失败仍保留租约；可重试一个明确支持的目标，或由所有者执行受检查的清理。这不证明物理瞬态、外部偏置或 PCB 安全。"

msgid "[in] Exclusive static pad/gate lease, with all writers quiescent."
msgstr "[in] 静态独占 pad/gate 租约，所有写者均已静止。"

msgid "[in] Default or sleep; neither name implies electrical safety."
msgstr "[in] 默认态或睡眠态；两种名称均不代表电气安全。"

msgid "SUCCESS after actual target readback, or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/ CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/IO while preserving provider ownership."
msgstr "实际读回目标状态后返回 SUCCESS；或在保留 provider 所有权的同时返回 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/ CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/IO。"

msgid "One statically owned provider; no discovery or per-register dispatch."
msgstr "一个静态拥有的 provider；不执行发现，也不按寄存器分派。"

msgid "Immutable face; provider storage and plans outlive every use."
msgstr "不可变公共接口对象；provider 存储与计划的生命周期须覆盖每次使用。"

msgid "pwm_adc.h"
msgstr "pwm_adc.h"

msgid "Optional finite coherent PWM / triggered ADC window."
msgstr "可选的有限相干 PWM／触发 ADC 窗口。"

msgid "Prepare distinct unborrowed request, frame and sample storage."
msgstr "准备彼此独立且尚未借用的请求、帧和采样存储。"

msgid "Request, sample span, source frame descriptor and duty span must be naturally aligned, nonwrapping and disjoint. The caller has consumed prior results and joined every adapter observer before preparing again. NX_DEADLINE_NEVER is rejected; an expired finite deadline can be prepared but cannot admit new physical effects. Preparation does not access sample contents, borrow hardware or establish rate/region support. Failure leaves the initialized request unchanged."
msgstr "请求、样本范围、源帧描述符及占空比范围必须自然对齐、地址不回绕且互不重叠。再次准备前，调用方已消费先前结果，并等待所有适配器观察者退出。拒绝 NX_DEADLINE_NEVER；可以准备已到期的有限 deadline，但不得因此准入新的物理效果。准备过程不访问样本内容、不借用硬件，也不建立速率/区域支持。失败使已初始化请求保持不变。"

msgid "[out] Naturally aligned writable caller sample array."
msgstr "[out] 自然对齐且可写的调用方样本数组。"

msgid "[in] Positive exact sample count; provider checks DMA."
msgstr "[in] 精确的正样本数；provider 检查 DMA。"

msgid "[in] Readable descriptor copied by value during this call only; its complete duty array remains live through SETTLED."
msgstr "[in] 仅在本次调用中按值复制的可读描述符；完整占空比数组须保持有效直到 SETTLED。"

msgid "[in] Finite absolute monotonic deadline for the whole window."
msgstr "[in] 整个窗口的有限绝对单调 deadline。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; no hardware access or provider borrow."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；不访问硬件，也不产生 provider 借用。"

msgid "Admit and arm one complete finite window on the unique task owner."
msgstr "由唯一任务所有者准入并布防一个完整有限窗口。"

msgid "Post-admission arm/prime failures drain under the accepted request. Normal completion stops the PWM sources before SETTLED and never rearms. DMA TC alone is insufficient for completion or safe output. An error/cancellation reports zero guaranteed valid samples; an aborted DMA remaining count cannot establish a valid prefix. A successful window reports exactly sample_count. After successful ordinary completion, another explicitly prepared submission may begin; an explicit stop or latched fault requires cold close/reinitialization. Provider checks context, fixed frame, region and overlap with all cold descriptors/MMIO before admission. The complete duty frame is constant for the window; sample count does not promise an exact PWM pulse count. Without a trusted completion timestamp, completion first observed at or after the request deadline reports TIMEOUT, even if DMA is already complete. This conservative observation rule promises no physical execution-time bound and never relaxes the required source drain."
msgstr "准入后的 arm/预转换失败在已接受请求之下排空。正常完成在 SETTLED 前停止 PWM 来源，且绝不自动重装。仅 DMA TC 不足以证明完成或输出安全。错误/取消报告的保证有效样本数为零；中止后的 DMA 剩余计数不能建立有效前缀。成功窗口恰好报告 sample_count。普通操作成功完成后，可以另行显式准备并提交；显式停止或锁存故障则需要冷关闭/重新初始化。准入前，provider 检查上下文、固定帧、区域，以及与全部冷态描述符/MMIO 的重叠。整个窗口的完整占空比帧保持恒定；样本数不承诺精确的 PWM 脉冲数。没有可信完成时间戳时，首次在请求 deadline 时刻或之后观察到完成会报告 TIMEOUT，即使 DMA 已经完成。这一保守观察规则不承诺物理执行时间上界，也绝不放宽必需的来源排空。"

msgid "[in] Initialized stable selected coupled face and cold leases."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化且稳定的选中耦合接口及冷租约。"

msgid "[inout] Exact READY window prepared by the caller."
msgstr "[inout] 调用方准备的精确 READY 窗口。"

msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED, including a possibly already SETTLED error. Rejection means no retained pointer, payload access or new effect."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED，包括可能已经 SETTLED 的错误。拒绝表示不保留指针、不访问 payload，也不产生新效果。"

msgid "Latch cancellation while retaining the exact live window loan."
msgstr "锁存取消，同时保留对应活动窗口的借用。"

msgid "Cancellation is task-local and does not provide a cross-task stable identity. Use the established adapter slot/epoch mechanism externally. A prior terminal fault is retained; cancellation never clears it."
msgstr "取消局限于本任务，不提供跨任务稳定身份。外部应使用既有适配器 slot/epoch 机制。先前终态故障保持保留；取消绝不清除它。"

msgid "[in] Same live coupled face and serialized privileged task."
msgstr "[in] 同一个仍然有效的耦合接口及串行化特权任务。"

msgid "[inout] Exact admitted request, still live until SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的已准入请求，须保持有效直到 SETTLED。"

msgid "SUCCESS starts/observes cancellation, never implies SETTLED."
msgstr "SUCCESS 开始或观察到取消，绝不代表已经 SETTLED。"

msgid "Advance bounded completion or source drain on the same task owner."
msgstr "由同一任务所有者推进有界完成或源排空。"

msgid "No hidden worker/wait/allocation. Only observed source/vector withdrawal permits final pointer detach and release publication."
msgstr "没有隐藏 worker、等待或分配。只有观察到来源/向量撤回后，才允许最终指针分离和 release 发布。"

msgid "SUCCESS after progress/settlement, BUSY while drain remains, or a fault requiring continued recovery service and explicit stop."
msgstr "推进或结清后返回 SUCCESS，排空尚未完成时返回 BUSY；或返回故障，要求继续恢复 service 并显式停止。"

msgid "Close admission and attempt final drain without revoking a loan."
msgstr "关闭准入并尝试最终排空，不撤销借用。"

msgid "Continue the unique service/stop until quiet. Cold close additionally joins vectors and restores saved leases. Fault recovery does not automatically restart PWM or resume acquisition. SUCCESS does not release pads, clocks or private storage. Those cold leases remain held until the platform's final joined close succeeds."
msgstr "继续由唯一执行者 service/stop，直到静默。冷关闭还需等待向量退出并恢复保存的租约。故障恢复不自动重新启动 PWM 或恢复采集。SUCCESS 不释放引脚、时钟或私有存储；这些冷租约保持持有，直到平台最终完成退出汇合并成功关闭。"

msgid "SUCCESS proves stopped sources; BUSY/IO retains recovery storage."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明来源已停止；BUSY/IO 保留恢复所需存储。"

msgid "Copy exact fixed facts and observed active/fault/quarantine state."
msgstr "复制精确的固定事实与观察到的活动／故障／隔离状态。"

msgid "State is an observation, not a source-drain or release operation."
msgstr "state 是观察操作，不是来源排空或归还操作。"

msgid "[out] Distinct aligned output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立且已对齐的输出，拒绝时保持不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT or UNSUPPORTED for a missing method."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT，或因缺少方法而返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "One finite window; transferred counts are raw samples, never bytes."
msgstr "一个有限窗口；传输数量以原始采样为单位，不以字节计。"

msgid "Initialize base before first preparation. After successful admission, the request and duty array remain live and caller-immutable through acquire-observed SETTLED. The writable sample span belongs exclusively to the provider; the caller neither reads nor writes it while borrowed. Frame metadata is copied at preparation. No later shadow commit, automatic rearm, control algorithm or engineering-unit conversion is part of this finite-window interface. Hardware-specific sample storage and integer encoding are reported by state.format."
msgstr "首次 prepare 前初始化 base。成功准入后，请求和占空比数组须保持有效且调用方不可修改，直到以 acquire 观察到 SETTLED。可写样本范围由 provider 独占；借用期间调用方既不读也不写。帧元数据在准备时复制。本有限窗口接口不包含后续影子提交、自动重装、控制算法或工程单位转换。硬件专有样本存储和整数编码由 state.format 报告。"

msgid "Borrow and release publication state."
msgstr "借用状态与释放发布状态。"

msgid "Exclusive writable raw sample storage."
msgstr "独占可写的原始采样存储。"

msgid "Positive number of requested samples."
msgstr "请求的采样数量，必须为正。"

msgid "Copied metadata; duty array is borrowed."
msgstr "复制的元数据；占空比数组保持借用。"

msgid "Exact selected facts and observed source/recovery state."
msgstr "精确的选定事实与观察到的源／恢复状态。"

msgid "Format describes actual supported hardware. It does not establish aperture timestamps, analog accuracy, PWM duty epochs, IRQ latency, the number of output pulses or an inspected physical circuit."
msgstr "format 描述实际支持的硬件，不建立采样孔径时间戳、模拟精度、PWM 占空比 epoch、IRQ 时延、输出脉冲数量或已检查物理电路的事实。"

msgid "Actual integer storage and provenance."
msgstr "实际整数存储表示与来源。"

msgid "PWM counter ticks per second."
msgstr "PWM 计数器每秒的计数刻度数。"

msgid "Fixed period in counter ticks."
msgstr "以计数器刻度表示的固定周期。"

msgid "Fixed phase in counter ticks."
msgstr "以计数器刻度表示的固定相位。"

msgid "Deadtime in separate deadtime_hz units."
msgstr "以独立的 deadtime_hz 单位表示的死区时间。"

msgid "Deadtime clock; never inferred from PSC."
msgstr "死区时钟；不得从 PSC 推断。"

msgid "Complete fixed-order frame width."
msgstr "完整、固定顺序的帧通道数。"

msgid "Provider/DMA finite-window count bound."
msgstr "提供者／DMA 的有限窗口计数上限。"

msgid "Observed source/counter activity."
msgstr "观察到的源／计数器活动状态。"

msgid "Latched fault requiring cold recovery."
msgstr "需要冷恢复的锁存故障。"

msgid "Incomplete withdrawal retains ownership."
msgstr "撤离未完成时保留所有权。"

msgid "Selected-only operations; no growth to ordinary PWM/ADC tables."
msgstr "仅选定实例具有的操作；普通 PWM／ADC 方法表不增加。"

msgid "Each callback implements its corresponding public function contract. One privileged task serializes submit/cancel/service/stop/state; IRQs only latch bounded physical facts into the same private owner. Missing callbacks return UNSUPPORTED. There is no allocating or hidden worker."
msgstr "每个回调实现对应的公共函数契约。一个特权任务串行化 submit/cancel/service/stop/state；IRQ 只向同一私有所有者锁存有界物理事实。缺失回调返回 UNSUPPORTED。不进行分配，也没有隐藏 worker。"

msgid "Immutable cold-selected identity, never an allocating factory."
msgstr "不可变的冷装配选定身份；工厂不执行分配。"

msgid "Face, operations, context and cold configuration outlive every request and IRQ publisher. One coupled face owns all selected hardware; no independently startable PWM-group or ADC face exposes that hardware."
msgstr "接口、方法表、上下文及冷配置的生命周期覆盖每个请求和 IRQ 发布者。一个耦合接口拥有全部选中硬件；不存在可独立启动的 PWM-group 或 ADC 接口暴露该硬件。"

msgid "pwm_group.h"
msgstr "pwm_group.h"

msgid "Fixed-base atomic multi-channel PWM shadow commits."
msgstr "固定时基、原子的多通道 PWM 影子提交。"

msgid "Stage a complete channel group and its internal trigger comparison."
msgstr "暂存完整通道组及其内部触发比较值。"

msgid "Provider declares exact channel count, trigger range and ISR budget. Duties include zero and period. All channels share one fixed base. A failed partial hardware write must disable output and retain fault responsibility rather than release a mixed group to the next update. Stop is explicit; automatic output recovery after break is prohibited."
msgstr "provider 声明精确的通道数、触发范围及 ISR 预算。占空比包含零与 period。所有通道共用一个固定时基。部分硬件写入失败时必须禁用输出并保留故障责任，不能让混合新旧值的通道组进入下一次更新。停止必须显式进行；禁止 break 后自动恢复输出。"

msgid "[in] One serialized privileged task/configurable-IRQ owner."
msgstr "[in] 一个串行化特权任务/可配置 IRQ 所有者。"

msgid "[in] Complete readable batch; no pointer is retained on return."
msgstr "[in] 完整且可读的批次；返回后不保留指针。"

msgid "SUCCESS means one coherent group is staged for a hardware update, not that this update already happened. Invalid input has no effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示一个一致的组已暂存，等待硬件更新，不代表更新已经发生。无效输入没有效果。"

msgid "Start only from disabled outputs and an inactive, cleared break."
msgstr "仅输出已禁用且刹车未激活、已清除时启动。"

msgid "[in] Serialized privileged task owner of all cold leases."
msgstr "[in] 拥有全部冷租约的串行化特权任务所有者。"

msgid "SUCCESS or an error retaining cleanup and any fault responsibility."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS，或返回错误并保留清理及相应故障责任。"

msgid "Withdraw master output, channels, counter and owned IRQ sources."
msgstr "撤离主输出、通道、计数器与拥有的 IRQ 源。"

msgid "This source-level promise does not certify the external circuit's electrical safety. Board idle and publisher join belong to assembly."
msgstr "此源码层承诺不认证外部电路的电气安全。Board 空闲电平和发布者汇合属于装配职责。"

msgid "[in] Same privileged task owner; cold pin/vector leases persist."
msgstr "[in] 同一个特权任务所有者；冷态引脚/向量租约保持持有。"

msgid "SUCCESS proves source withdrawal; failure retains responsibility."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明来源已撤回；失败保留责任。"

msgid "Explicitly clear fault while disabled after checking actual break."
msgstr "禁用期间检查实际刹车状态后显式清除故障。"

msgid "[in] Serialized privileged task recovery owner."
msgstr "[in] 串行化特权任务恢复所有者。"

msgid "SUCCESS only after coherent shadows and break acknowledgment; never enables outputs. Product power-stage recovery policy stays external."
msgstr "仅在影子值一致且 break 已确认后返回 SUCCESS；绝不使能输出。产品功率级恢复策略仍由外部负责。"

msgid "Read fixed units and observed enable/fault facts without starting."
msgstr "读取固定单位与观察到的启用／故障事实，不启动硬件。"

msgid "[in] Serialized privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 串行化特权任务所有者。"

msgid "[out] Separate writable output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写的输出，拒绝时保持不变。"

msgid "One synchronous shadow batch; channel order is fixed by assembly."
msgstr "一个同步影子批次；通道顺序由装配固定。"

msgid "Fixed units, software fault latch and actual hardware enable state."
msgstr "固定单位、软件故障锁存与实际硬件启用状态。"

msgid "Shared operations; commit must prevent partial shadow publication."
msgstr "共享操作；提交必须防止部分影子发布。"

msgid "Immutable identity with no default-device state or allocation."
msgstr "不可变身份；无默认设备状态或分配。"

msgid "rtc.h"
msgstr "rtc.h"

msgid "Raw calendar and one finite alarm in its own time domain."
msgstr "独立时间域中的原始日历与一次有限 alarm。"

msgid "Validate raw calendar fields without changing any storage."
msgstr "验证原始日历字段，不改变任何存储。"

msgid "[in] Readable naturally aligned value."
msgstr "[in] 可读且自然对齐的值。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; no clock or provider access."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；不访问时钟或 provider。"

msgid "Validate the finite alarm pattern's day and time ranges."
msgstr "验证有限 alarm 模式的日和时间范围。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; not a promise that a provider can arm it."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；不承诺 provider 能够 armed 该 alarm。"

msgid "Copy a domain/pattern into initialized unborrowed caller storage."
msgstr "把域／模式复制到已初始化且未被借用的调用方存储中。"

msgid "Inputs must be complete, aligned, nonwrapping spans disjoint from request. This cold operation takes no loan and cannot know the complete extent of an opaque provider or clock context. Admission checks the known provider spans; assembly owns opaque-context disjointness."
msgstr "输入必须是完整、对齐、不回绕且与请求不重叠的范围。该冷操作不建立借用，也无法获知不透明 provider 或时钟上下文的完整范围。准入检查已知 provider 范围；不透明上下文的不重叠由装配方负责。"

msgid "[inout] READY or consumed SETTLED storage, all joins complete."
msgstr "[inout] READY 或结果已消费的 SETTLED 存储，所有 join 已完成。"

msgid "[in] Nonzero owner/generation copied during this call."
msgstr "[in] 在本次调用中复制非零 owner／代次。"

msgid "[in] Valid pattern copied during this call."
msgstr "[in] 在本次调用中复制有效模式。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; every failure leaves request unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；所有失败均保持请求不变。"

msgid "Copy a set calendar/domain on the single serialized task executor."
msgstr "由唯一串行任务执行者复制已设置的日历／域。"

msgid "[in] Valid immutable live face; no concurrent lifecycle writer."
msgstr "[in] 有效、只读且存活的接口面；不允许并发生命周期写入者。"

msgid "[out] Separate aligned writable output."
msgstr "[out] 独立、对齐且可写的输出。"

msgid "SUCCESS or STATE for closed/unset, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED; failure leaves output unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS、关闭／未设置时的 STATE、INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED；失败保持输出不变。"

msgid "Set an idle calendar and advance its nonwrapping setting domain."
msgstr "设置空闲日历，并推进不回绕的设置域。"

msgid "Admission rejection changes no state. No implicit backup reset, synchronization, Core-time adjustment or authorization to overwrite retained hardware."
msgstr "准入拒绝不改变任何状态。不隐式复位备份域、同步、调整 Core 时间，也不授权覆盖保留的硬件状态。"

msgid "[in] Same single serialized privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一个唯一串行特权任务 owner。"

msgid "[in] Separate raw value, copied on successful validation."
msgstr "[in] 独立的原始值，通过验证后复制。"

msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY for a loan, STATE if closed, INVALID, EXHAUSTED or UNSUPPORTED. A physical provider can return IO/TIMEOUT after acquiring hardware; its explicit recovery contract then retains ownership and may prohibit further reads until recovery."
msgstr "SUCCESS；存在借用时返回 BUSY，已关闭时返回 STATE，也可能返回 INVALID、EXHAUSTED 或 UNSUPPORTED。物理 provider 取得硬件后可返回 IO/TIMEOUT；其显式恢复合同随后保留所有权，并可在恢复前禁止继续读取。"

msgid "Borrow and arm one future alarm; no queue, allocation or worker."
msgstr "借用并 armed 一个未来 alarm；没有队列、分配或 worker。"

msgid "Closed/stale/already-matching pattern returns STATE; active is BUSY. An observed expired finite deadline returns TIMEOUT before admission. Calendar, counter and Core deadline are separate domains. Assembly keeps the copied clock face's borrowed context live, disjoint and non-reentrant for the entire owner lifetime and all external joins."
msgstr "关闭／域过期／已匹配当前时刻的模式返回 STATE；已有活动请求返回 BUSY。观察到有限 deadline 已到期时，在准入前返回 TIMEOUT。日历、计数器和 Core deadline 分属不同域。在整个 owner 生命周期及所有外部 join 期间，装配方保持复制的时钟接口面所借用上下文有效、不重叠且不重入。"

msgid "[in] Initialized serialized owner with a valid copied Core clock."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的串行 owner，持有有效、复制的 Core 时钟接口面。"

msgid "[inout] Exact READY request for the current setting domain."
msgstr "[inout] 精确属于当前设置域的 READY 请求。"

msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; INVALID/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/UNSUPPORTED rejects without retained references or effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；INVALID/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/UNSUPPORTED 表示拒绝，不保留引用或效果。"

msgid "Latch cancellation of the exact borrowed request, without revocation."
msgstr "为精确借用的请求锁存取消，但不撤销借用。"

msgid "Cancel/stop executed before service may win over unobserved expiry or event. The first terminal cause never changes while withdrawal waits."
msgstr "在 service 前执行 cancel／stop，可以先于尚未观察的到期或事件锁存原因。等待撤源期间首次终止原因始终不变。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized executor; cross-task controls need an adapter."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行执行者；跨任务控制需要适配器。"

msgid "SUCCESS accepts cancellation; it may still be QUARANTINED/borrowed. Rejection is STATE/INVALID/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示已接受取消；请求仍可能处于 QUARANTINED／被借用状态。拒绝返回 STATE/INVALID/UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Observe deadline/event or continue actual source withdrawal."
msgstr "观察 deadline／事件，或继续真实撤源。"

msgid "At first observation expiry wins over pending event. Source/pending references detach before release SETTLED, the final provider access."
msgstr "首次观察时，到期优先于 pending 事件。先脱离请求源／pending 引用，再以 release 发布 SETTLED，作为 provider 的最终请求访问。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized task executor; bounded, no hidden wait."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行任务执行者；有界，不隐藏等待。"

msgid "Close admission and prove withdrawal before returning any loan."
msgstr "关闭准入，并在归还任何借用前证明已撤源。"

msgid "Clean repeated stop is idempotent. Stop does not reset identity or revoke pointers. Source/provider lifetime still covers external joins."
msgstr "重复执行已完成的干净 stop 是幂等的。stop 不重置身份，也不撤销指针。请求源／provider 的生命周期仍须覆盖外部 join。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized owner with external publishers quiescent."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行 owner，且外部发布者均已静止。"

msgid "SUCCESS when closed/joined; BUSY retains the quarantined request. INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED may reject dispatch."
msgstr "已关闭且完成 join 时返回 SUCCESS；BUSY 保留隔离请求。INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED 可以拒绝分发。"

msgid "Raw YY calendar; no UTC, century, timezone or oscillator policy."
msgstr "原始 YY 日历；没有 UTC、世纪、时区或振荡器策略。"

msgid "YY is 00..99 and leap years satisfy YY modulo 4 == 0. Weekday is an independent 1..7 value, not inferred from the date. Other fields use month/day 1-based and 24-hour hour/minute/second values, without leap seconds. Natural year99->00 wrap does not reset the setting domain."
msgstr "YY 为 00..99，YY 模 4 等于零时为闰年。星期是独立的 1..7 值，不根据日期推算。其他字段使用从 1 起算的月／日及 24 小时时／分／秒，不含闰秒。自然的 year99->00 回绕不重置设置域。"

msgid "Opaque owner identity and non-repeating setting incarnation."
msgstr "不透明的 owner 身份与不重复的设置代次。"

msgid "Compare identity without dereference. Valid only in that owner storage lifetime; retire all tokens/observers before ending or reusing it. This is neither authorization nor a cross-boot/backup-reset identity."
msgstr "只比较身份而不解引用。仅在该 owner 存储生命周期内有效；结束或复用前必须退役全部 token／观察者。它既不授予权限，也不是跨启动／备份复位身份。"

msgid "Calendar and setting domain copied in one serialized operation."
msgstr "在一次串行操作中复制日历与设置域。"

msgid "Exact future day/time match; no month/year or wildcard masks."
msgstr "精确的未来日／时间匹配；没有月／年或通配掩码。"

msgid "Caller-owned alarm, borrowed until acquire-observed SETTLED."
msgstr "调用方持有的 alarm，借用持续到以 acquire 观察到 SETTLED。"

msgid "Initialize base before first preparation. Domain and pattern are copied by value. After ACCEPTED the complete request remains live and caller immutable through SETTLED and any separate control/observer joins. transferred counts occurrences: SUCCESS is 1, every other result is 0."
msgstr "首次 prepare 前先初始化 base。域和模式按值复制。ACCEPTED 后，完整请求持续有效，且调用方不得修改，直到 SETTLED 及所有独立控制者／观察者 join 完成。transferred 以发生次数计：SUCCESS 为 1，其他结果均为 0。"

msgid "Shared immutable methods with the corresponding public contracts."
msgstr "共享只读方法实现相应公共合同。"

msgid "Two-pointer identity; face, ops and context outlive loans/observers."
msgstr "双指针身份；接口面、ops 和 context 的生命周期覆盖借用／观察者。"

msgid "rtc_aux.h"
msgstr "rtc_aux.h"

msgid "Optional raw RTC sources and backup storage ownership."
msgstr "可选的原始 RTC 来源与备份存储所有权。"

msgid "Optional methods share the exact RTC context and lifecycle owner."
msgstr "可选方法共享精确相同的 RTC context 和生命周期所有者。"

msgid "Raw periodic wake counter clock, independent of Core deadlines."
msgstr "原始周期 wake counter 时钟，独立于 Core deadline。"

msgid "Latched auxiliary events; reading never acknowledges a source."
msgstr "锁存的辅助事件；读取从不确认来源。"

msgid "Ordinary events/acknowledge exclude ALARM_A, whose finite request owns the flag. A joined Standby preparation can explicitly authorize discarding it; wake_route can select it independently."
msgstr "普通事件查询／确认排除 ALARM_A，该标志由其有限请求拥有。请求已 join 的 Standby 准备可以显式授权丢弃该事件；wake_route 可以独立选择它。"

msgid "Calibration method; smooth/coarse cannot run together."
msgstr "校准方法；smooth／coarse 不能同时运行。"

msgid "Explicit autonomous resources transferred to an external owner."
msgstr "显式转移给外部所有者的自主资源。"

msgid "Configure/disable Alarm B; no retained caller pointer or request."
msgstr "配置／禁用 Alarm B；不保留调用者指针或请求。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized privileged unmasked RTC task owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一串行化、特权且未屏蔽中断的 RTC 任务所有者。"

msgid "[in] Explicit comparator enable; no wildcards."
msgstr "[in] 显式 comparator enable；不使用通配。"

msgid "[in] Valid copied pattern, required even when disabling."
msgstr "[in] 复制的有效 pattern；禁用时也必须提供。"

msgid "SUCCESS or exact provider error; timeout/IO may retain hardware responsibility until stop succeeds. No implicit backup reset or retry."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或精确 provider 错误；超时／IO 可保留硬件责任，直到 stop 成功。不隐式复位备份域或重试。"

msgid "Configure the periodic counter with a bounded provider deadline."
msgstr "以有界 provider deadline 配置周期计数器。"

msgid "[in] Serialized RTC task owner."
msgstr "[in] 串行化 RTC 任务所有者。"

msgid "[in] Copied clock/reload facts, never a Core deadline."
msgstr "[in] 复制的 clock／reload 事实，绝不是 Core deadline。"

msgid "SUCCESS or provider error; failed withdrawal retains ownership."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 provider 错误；撤回失败保留所有权。"

msgid "Set explicitly owned timestamp/tamper inputs; no GPIO acquisition."
msgstr "设置显式持有的 timestamp／tamper 输入；不取得 GPIO。"

msgid "[in] Serialized RTC task owner with externally admitted pads."
msgstr "[in] 串行化 RTC 任务所有者，pad 已由外部准入。"

msgid "[in] Copied valid hardware choices; tamper erase authorized."
msgstr "[in] 复制的有效硬件选择；已授权 tamper 擦除。"

msgid "SUCCESS or rejection/error; no product erase or retention policy."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或拒绝／错误；不提供产品擦除或保持性策略。"

msgid "Copy the first captured event without clearing timestamp flags."
msgstr "复制首次捕获的事件，不清除 timestamp flag。"

msgid "[out] Disjoint output, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出；失败时保持不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY when no capture, or exact provider error."
msgstr "SUCCESS、没有捕获时的 BUSY，或精确 provider 错误。"

msgid "Copy latched auxiliary flags without acknowledging them."
msgstr "复制锁存的辅助 flag，不确认它们。"

msgid "SUCCESS or exact provider error."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或精确 provider 错误。"

msgid "Clear only selected observed auxiliary flags, preserving others."
msgstr "只清除所选、已观察的辅助 flag，保留其他位。"

msgid "Read a timestamp before acknowledging it. Hardware is a single latch, not an event queue; concurrent arrivals may be coalesced by hardware."
msgstr "确认 timestamp 之前先读取它。硬件只有一个 latch，不是事件队列；并发到达可能被硬件合并。"

msgid "[in] Explicit NX_RTC_EVENT mask; unknown bits reject."
msgstr "[in] 显式 NX_RTC_EVENT mask；未知位拒绝。"

msgid "SUCCESS or IO/BUSY when the source remains asserted."
msgstr "SUCCESS，或来源仍保持断言时的 IO／BUSY。"

msgid "Apply explicit hardware calibration, without changing Core time."
msgstr "应用显式硬件校准，不改变 Core 时间。"

msgid "[in] Serialized owner; no alarm/capture loans for coarse mode."
msgstr "[in] 串行化所有者；coarse 模式不允许 alarm／capture 借用。"

msgid "[in] Copied raw settings."
msgstr "[in] 复制的原始设置。"

msgid "SUCCESS or provider error; no measured ppm claim or auto tuning."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 provider 错误；不声称测得 ppm，也不自动调谐。"

msgid "Explicitly route sources to EXTI wake events, without NVIC handlers."
msgstr "将来源显式路由为 EXTI wake event，不安装 NVIC handler。"

msgid "Successful route enables source interrupt generation plus EXTI event delivery. Core time may stop in STOP; caller owns clock reconciliation."
msgstr "成功路由会启用来源 interrupt generation 与 EXTI event delivery。STOP 中 Core 时间可能停止；调用者负责时钟协调。"

msgid "[in] Serialized RTC task owner, external STOP owner joined."
msgstr "[in] 串行化 RTC 任务所有者，外部 STOP owner 已完成 join。"

msgid "[in] Alarm A/B, wakeup, timestamp and/or tamper event mask."
msgstr "[in] Alarm A/B、wakeup、timestamp 和/或 tamper 事件掩码。"

msgid "SUCCESS or provider error; zero withdraws the event route."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 provider 错误；零值撤回 event route。"

msgid "Read one of the exact provider's backup words, without allocation."
msgstr "读取精确 provider 的一个 backup word，不分配存储。"

msgid "[in] Hardware word index; F407 has 20 words."
msgstr "[in] 硬件 word 索引；F407 有 20 个 word。"

msgid "SUCCESS or exact provider error; no checksum/provenance policy."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或精确 provider 错误；不提供 checksum／来源策略。"

msgid "Write/read back one backup word without clearing other words."
msgstr "写入并回读一个 backup word，不清除其他 word。"

msgid "[in] Exact hardware word index."
msgstr "[in] 精确硬件 word 索引。"

msgid "[in] Literal data; UID or CRC grants no secret provenance."
msgstr "[in] 字面数据；UID 或 CRC 不授予秘密来源证明。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/IO; tamper may erase hardware words."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID／STATE／IO；tamper 可擦除硬件 word。"

msgid "Explicitly acquire SRAM gate and optional backup regulator."
msgstr "显式取得 SRAM gate 与可选 backup regulator。"

msgid "[in] Serialized RTC task owner, no competing DBP/BRE writer."
msgstr "[in] 串行化 RTC 任务所有者，没有竞争的 DBP／BRE 写者。"

msgid "[in] Request regulator enable/readiness, not proof of VBAT."
msgstr "[in] 请求 regulator enable／ready，不证明 VBAT。"

msgid "SUCCESS or provider error; failure retains acquired effects until stop. SRAM bytes are never cleared, tested or given a product layout."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 provider 错误；失败保留已取得效果直到 stop。SRAM 字节从不被清除、测试或赋予产品布局。"

msgid "Borrow the whole prepared CPU-only backup SRAM until exact release."
msgstr "借用整个已准备的 CPU-only backup SRAM，直到精确 release。"

msgid "[inout] Stable zero disjoint storage, retained until release."
msgstr "[inout] 稳定、置零且独立的存储，保留到 release。"

msgid "SUCCESS or rejection with no new loan; no DMA/execution permission."
msgstr "SUCCESS，或不建立新借用的拒绝；不授予 DMA／执行权限。"

msgid "Release the original SRAM loan after all derived users joined."
msgstr "全部派生用户完成 join 后，归还原 SRAM 借用。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized owner that granted the loan."
msgstr "[in] 授予借用的同一串行化所有者。"

msgid "[inout] Original stable loan storage, never a copied token."
msgstr "[inout] 原稳定借用存储，绝不能是复制的 token。"

msgid "[in] Exact generation returned on acquisition."
msgstr "[in] 取得时返回的精确 generation。"

msgid "SUCCESS or rejection retaining the original loan and all effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS，或保留原借用及全部效果的拒绝。"

msgid "Transfer retained provisioning effects after actual source stop."
msgstr "实际来源停止后，转移保留的 provisioning 效果。"

msgid "This is a responsibility transfer. It does not disable autonomous clocks or choose a later shutdown policy. Platform close may succeed only after this transfer. The receipt does not permit concurrent backup writers."
msgstr "这是责任转移，不禁用自主时钟，也不选择后续关闭策略。只有完成转移后，Platform close 才可能成功。收条不允许并发 backup 写者。"

msgid "[in] Closed serialized RTC owner; every external user joined."
msgstr "[in] 已关闭的串行化 RTC owner；全部外部用户已完成 join。"

msgid "[out] Disjoint receipt, unchanged on failure. The caller explicitly accepts continuing power/access/oscillator/calendar ownership."
msgstr "[out] 独立收条，失败时保持不变。调用者显式接收后续电源／访问／振荡器／日历所有权。"

msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY for live loans/sources, STATE without transferable effects, or exact provider error. No reset, erase or register write occurs."
msgstr "SUCCESS；活跃借用／来源为 BUSY，没有可转移效果为 STATE，或返回精确 provider 错误。不执行 reset、erase 或寄存器写入。"

msgid "Disable RTC wake front ends and explicitly discard observed events."
msgstr "禁用 RTC 唤醒前端，并显式丢弃已观察到的事件。"

msgid "Privileged unmasked Thread. Preserve EXTI route configuration and backup/calendar. Only explicitly authorized observed flags/PR clear. No Core deadline/tick, implicit event discard or backup reset occurs."
msgstr "特权、未屏蔽中断的 Thread。保留 EXTI 路线配置及备份域／日历。仅清除显式授权且已观察到的 flags／PR。不使用 Core deadline／tick，不隐式丢弃事件或复位备份域。"

msgid "[in] Suspended RTC owner; every request/SRAM user is joined."
msgstr "[in] 已挂起的 RTC owner；全部请求／SRAM 使用者均已 join。"

msgid "[in] Explicit NX_RTC_EVENT authorization, including ALARM_A only after its finite request is joined."
msgstr "[in] 显式的 NX_RTC_EVENT 授权；仅在 ALARM_A 的有限请求已 join 后才可包含该事件。"

msgid "[in] Positive finite write-ready observation budget."
msgstr "[in] 正数、有限的写就绪观察预算。"

msgid "[inout] Fresh zero stable internal disjoint caller storage."
msgstr "[inout] 全新清零、地址稳定、位于片内且不重叠的调用者存储。"

msgid "SUCCESS with sources disabled; BUSY for unauthorized pending events; IO/TIMEOUT can retain receipt and partial effects for restore."
msgstr "源已禁用时返回 SUCCESS；未授权的 pending 事件返回 BUSY；IO／TIMEOUT 可能保留收条与部分效果，供 restore 处理。"

msgid "Read-only proof of the exact disabled independent-clock RTC receipt."
msgstr "只读证明这份精确 RTC 收条仍处于独立时钟、源已禁用的状态。"

msgid "Masked or unmasked Thread; independent of any old Core epoch."
msgstr "中断屏蔽或未屏蔽的 Thread；独立于任何旧 Core epoch。"

msgid "[in] Same suspended serialized owner, privileged Thread."
msgstr "[in] 同一个已挂起、串行调用的 owner，特权 Thread。"

msgid "[in] Exact live original storage, never a copied token."
msgstr "[in] 仍有效的原始精确存储，绝不能是复制的 token。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/IO without hardware or receipt mutation."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID／STATE／IO，不修改硬件或收条。"

msgid "Reenable original RTC sources after the Power owner clears WUF."
msgstr "Power owner 清除 WUF 后，重新使能原有 RTC 源。"

msgid "Power owns the disable-EWUP/CWUF/reenable-EWUP/Standby sequence. This operation never clears RTC events, EXTI pending or PWR flags. Actual Standby resets the image; a returning entry needs restore."
msgstr "Power 负责禁用 EWUP／CWUF／重新使能 EWUP／Standby 序列。本操作绝不清除 RTC 事件、EXTI pending 或 PWR 标志。真实 Standby 会复位整个镜像；入口若返回，必须执行 restore。"

msgid "[in] Same suspended owner, privileged masked Thread."
msgstr "[in] 同一个已挂起的 owner，特权且屏蔽中断的 Thread。"

msgid "[inout] Exact prepared identity retained through entry."
msgstr "[inout] 在进入过程中持续保留的原始精确准备身份。"

msgid "SUCCESS after source readback, or retained error requiring restore."
msgstr "源读回成功后返回 SUCCESS；否则保留错误责任，必须执行 restore。"

msgid "Restore source controls and release the exact preparation receipt."
msgstr "恢复源控制，并释放精确的准备收条。"

msgid "Masked or unmasked, including a new System epoch. No old Core clock callback/deadline is used. Preserve every event arriving after prepare."
msgstr "中断屏蔽或未屏蔽均可，也适用于新的 System epoch。不调用旧 Core 时钟回调或使用旧 deadline。保留 prepare 之后到达的每个事件。"

msgid "[in] Same suspended serialized privileged Thread owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一个已挂起、串行调用的特权 Thread owner。"

msgid "[inout] Original live storage through cleanup/commit failure."
msgstr "[inout] 清理／commit 失败期间持续有效的原始存储。"

msgid "SUCCESS only after full readback and final detach; failure retains the receipt and responsibility for all partially restored sources."
msgstr "仅在完整读回并最终解绑后返回 SUCCESS；失败保留收条与全部部分恢复源的责任。"

msgid "Enabled counter reloads after reload+1 ticks; extended adds 65536."
msgstr "启用的 counter 每 reload+1 个 tick 重载；extended 另加 65536。"

msgid "Explicit capture pins and hardware tamper semantics."
msgstr "显式 capture pin 与硬件 tamper 语义。"

msgid "Pin 1 means RTC_AF1; pin 2 means RTC_AF2 and requires an exact fitted package/route. Tamper detection erases all hardware backup registers. filter is 0=edge, 1/2/3=2/4/8 consecutive level samples. trigger bits mean falling edge without filter or high active level with filter. sample_rate is RTCCLK/(32768 >> value), 0..7; precharge is 1<<value RTCCLK cycles, 0..3. No GPIO, pull resistor or PCB route is inferred."
msgstr "Pin 1 表示 RTC_AF1；pin 2 表示 RTC_AF2，需要精确实装封装／路线。Tamper 检测会擦除全部硬件 backup register。filter 为 0 时按边沿，1／2／3 对应 2／4／8 个连续电平 sample。无 filter 时 trigger 位表示下降沿，有 filter 时表示高有效电平。sample_rate 为 RTCCLK/(32768 >> value)，value 为 0..7；precharge 为 1<<value 个 RTCCLK 周期，value 为 0..3。不推断 GPIO、pull resistor 或 PCB route。"

msgid "Timestamp excludes year, which the hardware does not capture."
msgstr "Timestamp 不含 year，硬件未捕获该字段。"

msgid "subseconds is the captured downcounter, with explicit denominator. overflow means another event was lost. Domain is the setting domain, never the Core deadline clock and never an assertion of UTC."
msgstr "subseconds 是捕获的递减 counter，分母须显式给出。overflow 表示另一个事件已丢失。Domain 是 setting domain，绝不是 Core deadline clock，也不表示 UTC。"

msgid "Raw calibration facts, never measured oscillator accuracy."
msgstr "原始校准事实，绝不是实测振荡器精度。"

msgid "Smooth masks 0..511 pulses per 32-second base and optionally adds 512; window_seconds is 8,16,32. Short windows require low 2/1 mask bits zero. Coarse uses pulses 0..31, subtract selects the negative direction and window_seconds must be zero. Coarse restarts the calendar divider and therefore advances its setting domain."
msgstr "Smooth 在 32 秒基准中屏蔽 0..511 个脉冲，可选增加 512 个；window_seconds 为 8、16、32。短窗口要求 mask 最低 2／1 位为零。Coarse 使用 0..31 个脉冲，subtract 选择负方向，window_seconds 必须为零。Coarse 重启 calendar divider，因此推进其 setting domain。"

msgid "Copied transfer receipt, never proof of physical VBAT retention."
msgstr "复制的转移收条，绝不证明物理 VBAT 保持性。"

msgid "Exact caller-owned Standby preparation identity, initially zero."
msgstr "调用者拥有的精确 Standby 准备身份，初始清零。"

msgid "Never copy or alter a live receipt. The RTC owner retains this exact object through commit and until successful restore, or actual reset. It is not proof that Standby occurred or that backup power survived."
msgstr "绝不复制或修改仍有效的收条。RTC owner 在 commit 期间持续保留同一个精确对象，直到 restore 成功或真正复位。它不证明 Standby 已发生或备份供电已保持。"

msgid "rtc_lptim_model.h"
msgstr "rtc_lptim_model.h"

msgid "Explicit host source progression and withdrawal faults."
msgstr "显式主机请求源推进与撤源故障。"

msgid "Advance a set raw calendar by bounded explicit source seconds."
msgstr "按有界的显式请求源秒数推进已设置的原始日历。"

msgid "Constant bounded work, at most one date carry. A closed set calendar may advance; this does not reopen admission or prove backup retention. Does not read/advance Core clock, publish, settle or change terminal cause. Source changes are not an IRQ, worker or hardware qualification."
msgstr "工作量固定且有界，最多进位一天。已关闭但已设置的日历仍可推进；这不重新开放准入，也不证明备份保持。不读取／推进 Core 时钟，不发布、不结清，也不改变终止原因。请求源变化不是 IRQ、worker 或硬件验证资格。"

msgid "[in] Exact Native RTC face, serialized with every public call."
msgstr "[in] 精确的 Native RTC 接口面，与每个公共调用串行执行。"

msgid "[in] 0..86400; zero never creates an event."
msgstr "[in] 0..86400；零绝不创建事件。"

msgid "SUCCESS, STATE if unset/unconstructed, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS、未设置／未构造时的 STATE、INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Inject/remove the external inability to withdraw an armed source."
msgstr "注入／解除无法撤回已 armed 请求源的外部条件。"

msgid "[in] Exact Native RTC face on the same serialized owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行 owner 上精确的 Native RTC 接口面。"

msgid "[in] True prevents withdrawal; false only removes the fault."
msgstr "[in] true 阻止撤源；false 只解除故障。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED; never settles a request."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED；绝不结清请求。"

msgid "Advance a finite source, saturating at its exact shot limit."
msgstr "推进有限请求源，并在精确计数上限处饱和。"

msgid "At full65536 the sampled 16-bit counter is zero; pending completion is independent. Held withdrawal permits final progress beyond cancel/time observation. Does not touch the request, terminal cause or Core clock."
msgstr "达到完整的 65536 tick 时，采样的 16 位计数器为零；pending 完成标志与之独立。撤源被 hold 阻止时，进度可在观察到取消／时间条件后继续推进。不访问请求、终止原因或 Core 时钟。"

msgid "[in] Exact Native LPTIM face, serialized with all public calls."
msgstr "[in] 精确的 Native LPTIM 接口面，与全部公共调用串行执行。"

msgid "[in] 0..65536 source ticks; idle/unarmed does not accumulate."
msgstr "[in] 0..65536 个请求源 tick；空闲／未 armed 时不累计。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Inject/remove withdrawal hold; real public service still drains."
msgstr "注入／解除撤源 hold；仍由真实公共 service 执行排空。"

msgid "[in] Exact Native LPTIM face on the serialized executor."
msgstr "[in] 串行执行者上精确的 Native LPTIM 接口面。"

msgid "[in] False does not clear provider references or publish results."
msgstr "[in] false 不清除 provider 引用，也不发布结果。"

msgid "sdio_io.h"
msgstr "sdio_io.h"

msgid "Typed SDIO function control and finite CMD53 borrows."
msgstr "Typed SDIO function 控制与有限 CMD53 借用。"

msgid "Read bounded CCCR/FBR facts and CIS pointers into a copied snapshot."
msgstr "读取有界 CCCR／FBR 事实和 CIS pointer，复制到 snapshot。"

msgid "All control calls require one privileged unmasked Thread executor. Ordinary block activation/stop owns this same physical host. No function-specific register policy, CIS tuple interpretation or worker."
msgstr "全部控制调用都要求唯一的特权、未屏蔽中断的 Thread 模式执行者。普通 block activation／stop 拥有同一物理 host。不提供 function 专属寄存器策略、CIS tuple 解释或 worker。"

msgid "[in] Explicitly activated SDIO I/O session, same host owner."
msgstr "[in] 已显式激活的 SDIO I/O 会话，同一 host owner。"

msgid "[out] Distinct caller storage, retained only during this call."
msgstr "[out] 独立调用者存储，只在本调用期间保留。"

msgid "Success or actual control/protocol error, never invented functions."
msgstr "成功或真实 control／protocol 错误，从不虚构 function。"

msgid "Change IOEx and wait for the exact function's IORx transition."
msgstr "更改 IOEx，并等待精确 function 的 IORx 转换。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized idle session, no borrowed request."
msgstr "[in] 同一串行化空闲会话，没有被借用的请求。"

msgid "[in] Discovered function number one through seven."
msgstr "[in] 已探测到的 1..7 function 编号。"

msgid "[in] Explicit requested function state."
msgstr "[in] 显式请求的 function 状态。"

msgid "Actual ready outcome; a timeout can leave the function enabled."
msgstr "真实 ready 结果；超时可能仍留下已启用 function。"

msgid "Program and verify the function FBR's explicit power-of-two size."
msgstr "编程并验证 function FBR 的显式二次幂大小。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized idle session."
msgstr "[in] 同一串行化空闲会话。"

msgid "[in] Discovered nonzero function number."
msgstr "[in] 已探测到的非零 function 编号。"

msgid "[in] Exact block bytes, 1..2048, with no rounding."
msgstr "[in] 精确 block 字节数，1..2048，不取整。"

msgid "Success or error; a partial two-byte write is not atomic."
msgstr "成功或错误；两字节写入可能只完成一部分，不具原子性。"

msgid "Read one CMD52 register byte, including function-zero CCCR/FBR/CIS."
msgstr "读取一个 CMD52 寄存器字节，包含 function-zero CCCR／FBR／CIS。"

msgid "[in] Zero through the discovered function count."
msgstr "[in] 从零到已探测 function 总数。"

msgid "[in] Exact 17-bit function-local address."
msgstr "[in] 精确的 17-bit function 局部地址。"

msgid "[out] Stable distinct byte, borrowed only during this call."
msgstr "[out] 稳定且独立的 byte，只在本调用期间被借用。"

msgid "Strict R5/CRC/timeout outcome; failure may retain host uncertainty."
msgstr "严格的 R5／CRC／timeout 结果；失败可保留 host 不确定状态。"

msgid "Write one enabled function's register without implicit readback."
msgstr "写入一个已启用 function 的寄存器，不隐式回读。"

msgid "CCCR/FBR configuration stays with the typed host operations. Device interrupt acknowledgement belongs to the relevant function driver."
msgstr "CCCR／FBR 配置由 typed host 操作负责。器件 interrupt acknowledgement 属于对应 function driver。"

msgid "[in] Enabled nonzero function; function-zero writes refused."
msgstr "[in] 已启用的非零 function；拒绝 function-zero 写入。"

msgid "[in] Exact 17-bit function-local register address."
msgstr "[in] 精确的 17-bit function 局部寄存器地址。"

msgid "[in] Explicit device-register value, not a host command."
msgstr "[in] 显式器件寄存器值，不是 host 命令。"

msgid "Actual R5 status; write side effects are not rolled back on timeout."
msgstr "真实 R5 状态；超时不回滚写入的副作用。"

msgid "Set IENx and explicitly arm the selected host interrupt hint."
msgstr "设置 IENx，并显式 arm 所选 host interrupt hint。"

msgid "IRQ latches a hint and masks its level source. Read pending, service device registers, then explicitly rearm; no OS callback or worker. Successful data completion preserves an unconsumed arm. Error, cancellation and sync require an explicit new arm."
msgstr "IRQ 锁存 hint 并屏蔽其电平来源。读取 pending、处理器件寄存器后，显式重新 arm；没有 OS callback 或 worker。成功的数据完成保留尚未消费的 arm。错误、取消和 sync 都要求显式再次 arm。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized idle host owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一串行化空闲 host owner。"

msgid "[in] Function bits one through seven; zero disables all."
msgstr "[in] Function 的 bit1..7；零禁用全部。"

msgid "Actual programming outcome, with master enable derived from mask."
msgstr "真实编程结果，master enable 从 mask 派生。"

msgid "Read authoritative CCCR pending function bits without acknowledging."
msgstr "读取权威 CCCR pending function 位，不进行确认。"

msgid "[out] Copied pending bits, unchanged on rejection/error."
msgstr "[out] 复制的 pending 位；拒绝／错误时保持不变。"

msgid "Actual CMD52 outcome; host IRQ status is only a hint."
msgstr "真实 CMD52 结果；host IRQ 状态仅是 hint。"

msgid "Admit a finite byte/block CMD53 sequence to the same host executor."
msgstr "向同一 host 执行者接纳有限 byte／block CMD53 序列。"

msgid "Service advances polling, IRQ or DMA selection without a worker. DMA requires aligned whole four-word bursts; no bounce allocation. Cancellation and timeout retain all borrows until actual drain and SETTLED. Whole confirmed units form the transferred byte prefix."
msgstr "Service 推进所选 polling、IRQ 或 DMA，不创建 worker。DMA 要求对齐且完整的 four-word burst；不分配 bounce buffer。取消和超时保留全部借用，直到实际排空并 SETTLED。只有已确认的完整单元构成已传输字节前缀。"

msgid "[in] Activated single-owner session, no other live transfer."
msgstr "[in] 已激活的单 owner 会话，没有其他活跃传输。"

msgid "[inout] Complete READY enclosing descriptor and payload."
msgstr "[inout] 完整 READY 外层描述符和 payload。"

msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; rejection retains no reference or effect."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；拒绝不保留引用或效果。"

msgid "Begin cancellation without reclaiming the enclosing request."
msgstr "开始取消，不回收外层请求。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized execution owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一串行化执行所有者。"

msgid "[inout] Exact live stable request, not a stale pointer."
msgstr "[inout] 精确、活跃且稳定的请求，不能是过期指针。"

msgid "SUCCESS begins drain; STATE for a different request."
msgstr "SUCCESS 开始排空；不同请求为 STATE。"

msgid "Advance the selected engine, deadline and complete withdrawal."
msgstr "推进所选 engine、deadline 和完整撤回。"

msgid "QUARANTINED borrows remain live; later service may retry cleanup."
msgstr "QUARANTINED 借用继续有效；后续 service 可重试清理。"

msgid "Explicitly abort any uncertain function transfer and prove readiness."
msgstr "显式 abort 不确定的 function 传输，并证明 ready。"

msgid "Leaves the host function-interrupt hint disarmed. Explicitly rearm after device-register recovery; sync never replays device payloads."
msgstr "保持 host function-interrupt hint 为未 arm。器件寄存器恢复后须显式重新 arm；sync 从不重放器件 payload。"

msgid "[in] Same host, no request borrow, no implicit replay/reprobe."
msgstr "[in] 同一 host，没有 request 借用；不隐式重放或重新探测。"

msgid "Success after host drain and actual CCCR function-ready evidence."
msgstr "Host 排空并有真实 CCCR function-ready 证据后才成功。"

msgid "Copied function facts; device-specific CIS tuples belong to drivers."
msgstr "复制的 function 事实；器件专属 CIS tuple 由 driver 解释。"

msgid "Exact discovered card session, never inferred from an SDIO route."
msgstr "精确探测到的 card 会话，从不根据 SDIO route 推断。"

msgid "One finite CMD53 request, with the existing shared request storage."
msgstr "一个有限 CMD53 请求，使用既有共享 request 存储。"

msgid "Initialize and prepare transfer.base; configure transfer.data, data_bytes, blocks and write. transfer.first_block must remain zero. In byte mode blocks is one and unit_bytes is 1..512. In block mode unit_bytes matches the explicitly configured FBR size and blocks is positive and provider-bounded. The complete enclosing object and payload remain borrowed until acquire-observed transfer.base SETTLED. Payloads require four-byte alignment; DMA requires sixteen-byte alignment and a whole four-word burst in each unit. Never submit this interior transfer as an ordinary block request."
msgstr "初始化并 prepare transfer.base，再配置 transfer.data、data_bytes、blocks 与 write。transfer.first_block 必须保持零。Byte 模式下 blocks 为一，unit_bytes 为 1..512。Block 模式下 unit_bytes 匹配显式配置的 FBR 大小，blocks 为正且受 provider 上限约束。完整外层对象和 payload 持续被借用，直到通过 acquire 观察到 transfer.base SETTLED。Payload 要求四字节对齐；DMA 要求十六字节对齐，且每个单元都是完整 four-word burst。绝不能把此内部 transfer 作为普通 block 请求提交。"

msgid "One shared host owner controls standard functions one through seven."
msgstr "一个共享 host owner 控制标准 function 1..7。"

msgid "Immutable optional face; uses the same physical block controller ID."
msgstr "不可变可选 face；使用同一物理 block controller ID。"

msgid "spi.h"
msgstr "spi.h"

msgid "Single-executor polling SPI endpoints and complete CS transactions."
msgstr "单执行者轮询 SPI 端点与完整 CS 事务。"

msgid "Explicit single-cell DMA addresses, both borrowed until SETTLED."
msgstr "显式单元素 DMA 地址，两者均借用到 SETTLED。"

msgid "Execute one bounded full-duplex 8-bit polling transaction."
msgstr "执行一个有界、全双工、8 位轮询事务。"

msgid "Task-only single executor, no allocation/OS lock. One CS interval covers the entire transfer. Deadline cannot preempt an in-flight hardware byte; peripheral drain may exceed it."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，由唯一执行者负责，不分配，也无 OS 锁。一次 CS 有效区间覆盖整个传输。deadline 不能抢占正在传输的硬件字节；外设排空可能晚于 deadline。"

msgid "[in] Fixed CS/mode/rate binding on one controller."
msgstr "[in] 一个控制器上的固定 CS/模式/速率绑定。"

msgid "[in] Transmit bytes, or NULL to send 0xff."
msgstr "[in] 发送字节；NULL 表示发送 0xff。"

msgid "[out] Receive bytes, or NULL to discard."
msgstr "[out] 接收字节；NULL 表示丢弃。"

msgid "[in] Positive transfer length; at least one buffer exists."
msgstr "[in] 正的传输长度；至少提供一个缓冲区。"

msgid "[in] Absolute deadline; includes adapter queue residence."
msgstr "[in] 绝对 deadline；包含在适配器队列中的驻留时间。"

msgid "[out] Complete bytes; reset to zero before execution."
msgstr "[out] 完整字节数；执行前清零。"

msgid "Success, BUSY/INVALID/TIMEOUT/IO. Every return ends CPU access to the supplied buffers; polling is CPU-active, not IRQ/DMA async. SUCCESS requires complete wire drain and CS withdrawal. A provider that cannot withdraw GPIO CS/clock latches its owner fault, rejects further work and retains pin recovery responsibility until explicit recover/stop succeeds; it never retains payload pointers or reports that failure as successful release."
msgstr "Success、BUSY/INVALID/TIMEOUT/IO。每次返回都结束对所提供缓冲区的 CPU 访问；轮询占用 CPU，不是 IRQ/DMA 异步。SUCCESS 要求完整线端排空与 CS 撤出。无法撤出 GPIO CS/时钟的 provider 锁存所有者故障、拒绝后续工作，并保留引脚恢复责任，直至显式 recover/stop 成功；不保留载荷指针，也不将此失败报告为释放成功。"

msgid "Recover an idle SPI controller after its retained fault."
msgstr "保留故障后恢复空闲 SPI 控制器。"

msgid "[in] Single executor with no live transaction or payload borrow. A failed polling call may retain static CS recovery identity until this operation proves withdrawal."
msgstr "[in] 单一执行者，无活动事务或 payload 借用。polling 失败后可保留静态 CS 恢复身份，直至本操作证明撤回完成。"

msgid "Success only after reset/idle and retained CS withdrawal proof. Failure preserves recovery responsibility and never replays work. Latch readback does not prove external levels."
msgstr "只有证明复位／空闲和所保留 CS 的撤回完成后才返回成功。失败保留恢复责任，不重放工作。锁存器回读不证明外部电平。"

msgid "Prepare an unborrowed finite request without copying buffers."
msgstr "准备未借用的有限请求，不复制缓冲区。"

msgid "[inout] Fresh initialized or consumed SETTLED descriptor."
msgstr "[inout] 新初始化的描述符，或已消费的 SETTLED 描述符。"

msgid "[in] Nonempty TX bytes or NULL when the selected mode supports dummy transmission; immutable through final settlement."
msgstr "[in] 非空 TX 字节；所选模式支持 dummy 发送时可为 NULL；保持不可变直到最终结清。"

msgid "[out] RX buffer or NULL when the selected mode supports discard."
msgstr "[out] RX 缓冲区；所选模式支持丢弃时可为 NULL。"

msgid "[in] Positive byte count with at least one supplied buffer."
msgstr "[in] 正字节数，且至少提供一个缓冲区。"

msgid "[in] Absolute monotonic deadline including queue time."
msgstr "[in] 包含排队时间的绝对单调 deadline。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE; failure creates no buffer loan."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/STATE；失败不产生缓冲区借用。"

msgid "Submit one finite asynchronous whole-CS transaction."
msgstr "提交一个有限、异步、覆盖整个 CS 区间的事务。"

msgid "Task-only bounded admission. Selected modes declare DMA domain/length/buffer requirements. DMA TC alone never proves peripheral idle; the bus executor continues service to SETTLED."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的有界准入。所选模式声明 DMA 域/长度/缓冲区要求。仅 DMA TC 绝不证明外设空闲；总线执行者继续 service，直到 SETTLED。"

msgid "[in] Initialized endpoint on a single-executor bus."
msgstr "[in] 单执行者总线上的已初始化 endpoint。"

msgid "[inout] READY storage; retained only after NX_SUCCESS."
msgstr "[inout] READY 存储；仅在 NX_SUCCESS 后保留。"

msgid "Success means ACCEPTED; all rejection errors create zero retained references and zero residual hardware effects."
msgstr "成功表示 ACCEPTED；所有拒绝错误均不保留引用，也不产生残余硬件效果。"

msgid "Submit explicit incrementing or single-cell DMA memory."
msgstr "提交显式递增或单元素 DMA 内存。"

msgid "Fixed directions require one byte, other directions length bytes, within reviewed DMA domains. The actual spans must not overlap. All addresses remain borrowed through drain until acquire-observed SETTLED. No hidden scratch is used. Both fixed flags permit explicit clock-only transfers. Request preparation does not retain these flags; only this successful admission selects them. Ordinary submit and the existing owner continue their ordinary buffer contract."
msgstr "固定方向需要一个字节，其他方向需要 length 字节，均位于已审查 DMA 域。实际范围不得重叠。所有地址在排空期间持续借用，直到以 acquire 观察到 SETTLED。不使用隐藏 scratch。两个 fixed 标志可显式实现仅发时钟的传输。请求准备不保留这些标志；只有本次成功准入才选择它们。普通 submit 和既有所有者仍遵循原有缓冲区契约。"

msgid "[in] Initialized single-executor DMA endpoint"
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的单执行者 DMA endpoint"

msgid "[inout] READY request with two non-NULL caller addresses"
msgstr "[inout] 具有两个非 NULL 调用方地址的 READY 请求"

msgid "[in] TX_FIXED repeats one immutable dummy byte; RX_FIXED repeatedly writes one caller-owned discard byte; zero uses complete incrementing TX/RX buffers"
msgstr "[in] TX_FIXED 重复发送一个不可变 dummy 字节；RX_FIXED 重复写入调用方持有的一个丢弃字节；零表示使用完整且地址递增的 TX/RX 缓冲区"

msgid "ACCEPTED on SUCCESS; other results retain no references"
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；其他结果不保留任何引用"

msgid "Start an adapter-admitted QUEUED request without readmission."
msgstr "启动适配器已准入的 QUEUED 请求，不重复准入。"

msgid "[in] Initialized exact CS binding and bus executor."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的精确 CS 绑定及总线执行者。"

msgid "[inout] Live QUEUED storage already borrowed by its adapter."
msgstr "[inout] 活跃的 QUEUED 存储，已由其适配器借用。"

msgid "Success hands execution to the bus; BUSY retains QUEUED. Other errors must be settled by the adapter executor."
msgstr "成功将执行权交给总线；BUSY 保持 QUEUED。其他错误必须由适配器执行者结清。"

msgid "Verify an endpoint belongs to the serviced bus."
msgstr "验证端点属于所推进的总线。"

msgid "Task/IRQ bounded cold identity check, no lookup or ownership effects. An adapter checks this before hardware execution; asynchronous admission also checks before borrowing."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中均为有界冷态身份检查，不查找，也不产生所有权效果。适配器在执行硬件前检查；异步准入也在借用前检查。"

msgid "[in] Immutable endpoint identity kept alive by its caller."
msgstr "[in] 由调用方保持有效的不可变 endpoint 身份。"

msgid "[in] Exact execution bus bound to an adapter."
msgstr "[in] 绑定到适配器的精确执行总线。"

msgid "True only when the provider proves matching controller state and compatible bus methods; false for invalid/missing methods."
msgstr "仅当 provider 证明控制器状态匹配且总线方法兼容时为真；无效或缺少方法时为 false。"

msgid "Request cancellation without revoking DMA/CS buffer loans."
msgstr "请求取消，不撤销 DMA/CS 缓冲区借用。"

msgid "Cross-task controls use stable adapter slots and epochs."
msgstr "跨任务控制使用稳定的适配器 slot 和 epoch。"

msgid "[in] Same single execution owner as submit and service."
msgstr "[in] 与 submit 和 service 相同的唯一执行所有者。"

msgid "[inout] Exact live active request, never a stale raw pointer."
msgstr "[inout] 精确、仍然有效的活跃请求，不得使用陈旧裸指针。"

msgid "Success starts drain or observes prior settlement; STATE for another request, UNSUPPORTED for a polling-only provider."
msgstr "成功开始排空或观察到先前结清；其他请求返回 STATE，仅轮询 provider 返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Advance one asynchronous bus under its single task executor."
msgstr "由唯一 Task 执行者推进一个异步总线。"

msgid "Bounded no-wait service. Final publication follows DMA/IRQ detach and peripheral-idle proof; failed drain quarantines."
msgstr "有界且不等待的 service。最终发布发生在 DMA/IRQ 分离及证明外设空闲之后；排空失败会隔离。"

msgid "[in] Live provider; call while stopping and throughout drain."
msgstr "[in] 仍然有效的 provider；停止及整个排空期间持续调用。"

msgid "Close admission and retain active sources until full drain."
msgstr "关闭准入，完整排空之前保留活动源。"

msgid "[in] Live bus; all external producers already quiesced."
msgstr "[in] 仍然有效的总线；所有外部生产者均已静默。"

msgid "Success proves source release, BUSY requires service, or UNSUPPORTED when the provider has no asynchronous lifecycle."
msgstr "成功证明来源已撤回，BUSY 要求 service；provider 不提供异步生命周期时返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Attach an optional hint sink to asynchronous bus IRQ publishers."
msgstr "向异步总线 IRQ 发布者附加可选提示接收端。"

msgid "Join old publishers and waiters before freeing wake storage."
msgstr "释放唤醒存储前，等待旧发布者及等待者退出。"

msgid "[in] One initialized bus controlled by a task executor."
msgstr "[in] 由任务执行者控制的一个已初始化总线。"

msgid "Success, PERMISSION for unsafe actual priority, CONTEXT/STATE for illegal control or UNSUPPORTED for a polling-only bus."
msgstr "成功；实际优先级不安全时返回 PERMISSION，非法控制返回 CONTEXT/STATE，仅轮询总线返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Caller-owned finite SPI request with one whole-CS interval."
msgstr "调用者拥有的有限 SPI 请求，包含一个完整 CS 区间。"

msgid "Initialize base before prepare. Accepted requests borrow both non-NULL buffers until acquire-observed SETTLED, including cancellation and timeout drain. QUARANTINED retains the loan."
msgstr "prepare 前初始化 base。已接受请求持续借用 TX/RX 中所有非 NULL 缓冲区，直到以 acquire 观察到 SETTLED，包括取消和超时排空期间。QUARANTINED 保留借用。"

msgid "spi_dma_model.h"
msgstr "spi_dma_model.h"

msgid "Explicit Native segmented wire and drain fault controls."
msgstr "显式 Native 分段传输与排空故障控制。"

msgid "Move one modeled wire word or observe its final idle event."
msgstr "推进一个模型传输字，或观察最终空闲事件。"

msgid "Caller-scheduled task/model IRQ; no hidden worker. Facts latch before a bounded hint. Never invoke after publisher join. A stopped owner cannot drive a successor's model."
msgstr "由调用方安排任务/模型 IRQ；没有隐藏 worker。有界提示之前先锁存事实。发布者汇合后绝不再调用。已停止的所有者不能驱动后继实例的模型。"

msgid "[in] Exact live Native enhanced controller."
msgstr "[in] 精确、仍然有效的 Native 增强控制器。"

msgid "Select optional single-step progress during task service."
msgstr "选择在任务服务期间进行可选的单步推进。"

msgid "Task-only. Explicit stepping remains available. This model does not establish physical IRQ/DMA timing or HIL."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文。仍可显式逐步推进。此模型不建立物理 IRQ/DMA 时序或 HIL。"

msgid "[in] Exact live Native enhanced controller, quiescent."
msgstr "[in] 精确、仍然有效且已静默的 Native 增强控制器。"

msgid "[in] True for one modeled step per service."
msgstr "[in] true 表示每次 service 推进一个模型步骤。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, CONTEXT or BUSY while borrowed."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE、CONTEXT，或因借用未结束而返回 BUSY。"

msgid "Inject or remove inability to prove physical model drain."
msgstr "注入或解除无法证明模型物理排空的故障。"

msgid "Task-only, allowed while borrowed. Removing the fault does not settle; continue model stepping and unique service."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，借用期间允许调用。移除故障不等于结清；继续推进模型并由唯一执行者 service。"

msgid "[in] Keep all request/CS loans while true."
msgstr "[in] 为 true 时保留全部请求/CS 借用。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE or CONTEXT."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE 或 CONTEXT。"

msgid "Fail a phase before the selected zero-based wire word."
msgstr "在选定的零基传输字之前使阶段失败。"

msgid "Task-only model input; no replay or early loan release."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的模型输入；不重放，也不提前释放借用。"

msgid "[in] SIZE_MAX disables the injected fault."
msgstr "[in] SIZE_MAX 禁用注入故障。"

msgid "spi_dma_owner_binding.h"
msgstr "spi_dma_owner_binding.h"

msgid "Optional immutable segmented SPI ownership and IRQ binding."
msgstr "可选不可变的分段 SPI 所有权与 IRQ 绑定。"

msgid "Check exact endpoint membership without hardware effects."
msgstr "检查精确端点归属，不产生硬件效果。"

msgid "No acquisition, initialization, allocation or service."
msgstr "不获取资源、不初始化、不分配，也不执行 service。"

msgid "[in] Stable provider-owned immutable capability."
msgstr "[in] 由 provider 拥有、稳定且不可变的能力描述。"

msgid "[in] Stable enhanced endpoint on the selected bus."
msgstr "[in] 所选总线上的稳定增强端点。"

msgid "False for malformed or foreign identities."
msgstr "身份格式错误或归属不符时返回 false。"

msgid "Attach a borrowed hint to actual validated IRQ publishers."
msgstr "将借用的提示接收端附加到实际验证过的 IRQ 发布者。"

msgid "Task-only. Rejection leaves the previous binding intact. A hint is never completion. Detach alone does not join a publisher that has already captured the sink. Stop and join publishers and waiters before destroying notification data."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文。拒绝时保留原有绑定。提示不代表完成。仅 detach 不能等待已捕获接收器的发布者退出。销毁通知数据前，须停止并等待发布者和等待者退出。"

msgid "[in] Stable selected controller capability."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的所选控制器能力描述。"

msgid "[in] Immutable sink kept live through publisher join, NULL to detach under the provider's lifecycle contract."
msgstr "[in] 保持有效直到发布者退出的不可变接收器；按 provider 生命周期契约传入 NULL 可解除绑定。"

msgid "[in] Actual unshifted kernel threshold."
msgstr "[in] 实际的未移位内核阈值。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT, UNSUPPORTED or provider failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT、UNSUPPORTED 或 provider 失败。"

msgid "Selected-only provider capability without changing IO faces."
msgstr "仅选定实例具有的提供者能力，不修改 IO 接口。"

msgid "Stable immutable storage outlives executor and publishers. contains proves actual controller identity; a display name or a caller-assembled pair of pointers is not such proof. attach_wake validates actual IRQ sources before borrowing the sink. A missing hook permits explicit periodic service."
msgstr "稳定的不可变存储须比执行器和发布者存活更久。contains 证明实际控制器身份；显示名称或调用方拼装的一对指针不能证明归属。attach_wake 在借用接收器前验证实际 IRQ 源。缺少钩子时，可显式周期性执行 service。"

msgid "spi_dma_transaction.h"
msgstr "spi_dma_transaction.h"

msgid "Optional finite whole-CS segmented SPI DMA request contract."
msgstr "可选的有限、完整 CS 区间分段 SPI DMA 请求合同。"

msgid "Prepare unborrowed storage after validating every span."
msgstr "验证每个范围后准备尚未借用的存储。"

msgid "Descriptors and payload never overlap request storage. RX cannot overwrite any TX or descriptor. Repeated RX alias is allowed only for the exact same explicit FIXED discard cell. Provider-specific domains are checked at admission."
msgstr "描述符和载荷不得与请求存储重叠。RX 不得覆盖任何 TX 或描述符。仅当多次 RX 指向同一个显式 FIXED 丢弃单元时，才允许重复别名。准入时检查 provider 特有的内存域。"

msgid "[in] Immutable caller-owned array, at most MAX_SEGMENTS."
msgstr "[in] 调用方拥有的不可变数组，最多 MAX_SEGMENTS 项。"

msgid "[in] Positive segment count; every words count is positive."
msgstr "[in] 正数段数；每段的 words 均为正数。"

msgid "[in] Common hardware width of 8 or 16 bits."
msgstr "[in] 全部段共用的 8 位或 16 位硬件位宽。"

msgid "[in] Absolute monotonic deadline for the complete chain."
msgstr "[in] 整条链的绝对单调时限。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/STATE; no borrow on failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/STATE；失败时不建立借用。"

msgid "Validate immutable fields without admission or memory modification."
msgstr "验证不可变字段，不执行准入或修改内存。"

msgid "Admit one finite chain on a task-only single executor."
msgstr "在仅限任务的单一执行者上准入一个有限链。"

msgid "All domains and segments are validated before admission. One CS interval spans the chain; SCK gaps between segments are permitted. DMA TC alone never establishes wire idle."
msgstr "准入前验证全部内存域和段。整条链共用一个 CS 有效区间；允许段间出现 SCK 间隔。仅有 DMA TC 不能证明线路空闲。"

msgid "[in] Stable enhanced DMA endpoint and provider state."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的增强 DMA 端点及 provider 状态。"

msgid "[inout] READY descriptor, retained only on SUCCESS."
msgstr "[inout] READY 描述符；仅在 SUCCESS 时保留引用。"

msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED, possibly already SETTLED. Rejection retains no references and creates no hardware effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED，也可能已经 SETTLED。拒绝时不保留引用，也不产生硬件副作用。"

msgid "Cancel an exact live request while retaining all its loans."
msgstr "取消对应活动请求，同时保留全部借用。"

msgid "[in] Same single executor used by submit and service."
msgstr "[in] 与 submit 和 service 共用的同一个单执行者。"

msgid "[inout] Exact current request or acquire-observed SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的当前请求，或已通过 acquire 语义观测为 SETTLED 的请求。"

msgid "SUCCESS starts/observes cancellation; INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT rejects without revoking any existing loan."
msgstr "SUCCESS 启动或观测取消；INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT 拒绝操作，但不撤销任何已有借用。"

msgid "Advance a bounded phase boundary, completion or drain."
msgstr "推进一个有界阶段边界、完成或排空。"

msgid "No wait, allocation, payload copy, hidden task or OS lock. Failed drain/release retains QUARANTINED storage. SETTLED follows final hardware detach and CS release and is the provider's final access to caller request and descriptors."
msgstr "不等待、不分配、不复制载荷，也无隐藏任务或 OS 锁。排空或释放失败时保留 QUARANTINED 存储。最终硬件引用撤离且 CS 释放后才发布 SETTLED；这是 provider 对调用方请求和描述符的最后一次访问。"

msgid "[in] Task-only enhanced controller; continue during stop."
msgstr "[in] 仅限任务上下文的增强控制器；停止过程中仍须继续调用。"

msgid "Close admission and stop after complete source withdrawal."
msgstr "关闭准入，并在源完整撤离后停止。"

msgid "Repeated successful stop never touches hardware again; another owner may already have acquired the controller."
msgstr "成功停止后重复 stop 不再访问硬件；其他所有者可能已取得该控制器。"

msgid "[in] Stable single-executor state, producers quiesced."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的单执行者状态；生产者已静止。"

msgid "SUCCESS proves stop; BUSY needs further service and retains all outstanding storage, including quarantined requests."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明已停止；BUSY 表示仍须执行 service，并保留全部未完成存储，包括隔离中的请求。"

msgid "Explicit DMA words with caller-owned dummy/discard cells."
msgstr "显式 DMA 字，使用调用者拥有的填充值／丢弃单元。"

msgid "Both addresses are mandatory. A FIXED direction borrows one word; an incrementing direction borrows words elements. Width is common to all segments. DMA never uses the polling segment's implicit NULL/dummy representation or scratch. A 16-bit element is a native uint16_t numeric word, without byte-order conversion. NDTR and completion counts remain words."
msgstr "两个地址均必填。FIXED 方向借用一个 word，递增方向借用 words 个元素。所有段使用同一宽度。DMA 不使用 polling 段的隐式 NULL／dummy 表达，也不使用临时存储。16 位元素是本机格式的 uint16_t 数值，不进行字节序转换。NDTR 和完成数量仍按 word 计数。"

msgid "Caller-owned request retaining every segment through drain."
msgstr "调用者拥有的请求；每个分段持续借用至排空完成。"

msgid "Initialize base before prepare. ACCEPTED borrows this object, its descriptor array, all TX/RX spans and fixed cells until acquire-observed SETTLED. Intermediate segment completion, cancellation and timeout never release any of these loans. Completion counts words of successfully settled segments; partial effects in a failed segment remain unquantified."
msgstr "prepare 前先初始化 base。ACCEPTED 借用本对象、描述符数组、全部 TX/RX 范围和固定单元，直到通过 acquire 语义观测到 SETTLED。中间段完成、取消和超时都不释放这些借用。完成计数以成功结算的段中的字数为单位；失败段的部分副作用不作量化。"

msgid "spi_transaction.h"
msgstr "spi_transaction.h"

msgid "Optional multi-segment whole-CS 8/16-bit polling SPI."
msgstr "可选的多分段、完整 CS 区间 8／16 位轮询 SPI。"

msgid "Bounded descriptor count; no hidden concatenation buffer exists."
msgstr "描述符数量有界；不存在隐藏的拼接缓冲。"

msgid "Validate every descriptor and span without hardware effects."
msgstr "验证每个描述符与范围，不产生硬件效果。"

msgid "No memory is borrowed, copied, allocated or modified. NULL data pointers are legal dummy/discard operations. This does not validate provider-specific controller, rate or limits."
msgstr "不借用、复制、分配或修改内存。NULL 数据指针可表示合法的填充发送或接收丢弃操作。本检查不验证 provider 特有的控制器、速率或限制。"

msgid "[in] Aligned immutable array, retained by the caller."
msgstr "[in] 已对齐的不可变数组，由调用方保留。"

msgid "[in] Positive descriptor count, at most MAX_SEGMENTS."
msgstr "[in] 正数描述符数量，最多 MAX_SEGMENTS 个。"

msgid "[in] Exactly 8 or 16; fixed for the whole CS interval."
msgstr "[in] 只能为 8 或 16；整个 CS 有效区间保持不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID for malformed/overlapping/overflowing spans, or UNSUPPORTED for excess descriptor count or word width."
msgstr "SUCCESS；范围格式错误、重叠或溢出时为 INVALID；描述符数量或字宽超限时为 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Execute all segments under exactly one asserted CS interval."
msgstr "在同一个 CS 有效区间内执行全部分段。"

msgid "Task-only single executor; polling is CPU-active. Return releases descriptor/payload borrows after wire drain or provider reset and CS release. Deadline cannot preempt an in-flight word. Errors never replay prior segments. No allocation, OS lock, hidden scratch, width changes or CS toggles occur between phases. This is synchronous: existing finite DMA request and cancellation contracts are unchanged."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的单执行者；轮询持续占用 CPU。线路排空或 provider 复位，并释放 CS 后，函数返回并释放描述符及载荷借用。时限不能抢占正在传输的一个字。错误不重放先前的段。阶段之间不分配、不取得 OS 锁、不使用隐藏暂存区，也不改变位宽或切换 CS。这是同步操作：已有的有限 DMA 请求和取消契约保持不变。"

msgid "[in] Optional enhanced face with stable private state."
msgstr "[in] 可选增强接口，具有稳定的私有状态。"

msgid "[in] Caller-owned descriptors and their data spans."
msgstr "[in] 调用方拥有的描述符及其数据范围。"

msgid "[in] Number of phases, all validated before hardware use."
msgstr "[in] 阶段数量；所有阶段均须在硬件使用前验证。"

msgid "[in] Common hardware frame width, 8 or 16 bits."
msgstr "[in] 共用的硬件帧位宽，为 8 位或 16 位。"

msgid "[in] Absolute monotonic deadline for all phases."
msgstr "[in] 全部阶段共用的绝对单调时限。"

msgid "[out] Complete received words, never bytes; separate writable size_t storage, reset before provider execution."
msgstr "[out] 完整接收的字数，单位不是字节；独立可写的 size_t 存储，在执行 provider 前清零。"

msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/IO."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/IO。"

msgid "One phase within a single CS interval."
msgstr "单个 CS 区间内的一个阶段。"

msgid "Words have the transaction's common width of 8 or 16 bits. NULL TX repeats dummy; NULL RX discards. Both may be NULL for clock-only words. Non-NULL spans contain words elements; 16-bit spans are uint16_t-aligned. Descriptor and TX storage stay immutable until return. RX never overlaps descriptors, TX storage, other RX spans or the completion output. A 16-bit element is a numeric uint16_t in native storage; the selected bit order controls wire serialization. No byte-order conversion or implicit scratch buffer exists. Ordinary byte-span SPI remains a separate unchanged interface."
msgstr "所有 word 使用事务共同的 8 位或 16 位宽度。NULL TX 重复发送 dummy，NULL RX 丢弃接收；二者均为 NULL 时仅输出时钟。非空区间含 words 个元素；16 位区间须按 uint16_t 对齐。描述符和 TX 存储在返回前保持不变。RX 不得与描述符、TX 存储、其他 RX 区间或完成输出重叠。16 位元素是以本机格式存储的 uint16_t 数值，所选位序控制线上串行化顺序。不进行字节序转换，不存在隐式临时 buffer。普通字节区间 SPI 接口保持独立。"

msgid "Shared immutable methods; absent transfer reports UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "共享不可变方法；缺少传输方法时报告 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Optional face sharing the selected provider's existing bus state."
msgstr "可选接口，与选定提供者的现有总线状态共享。"

msgid "spi_frames.h"
msgstr "spi_frames.h"

msgid "Explicit master/slave SPI frames and borrowed requests."
msgstr "显式 master／slave SPI frame 与借用请求。"

msgid "Exact clock owner, independent of an application protocol."
msgstr "精确时钟所有者，独立于应用协议。"

msgid "Two data pads, a receive-only pad, or one bidirectional data pad."
msgstr "两个 data pad、一个 receive-only pad，或一个双向 data pad。"

msgid "Motorola whole-selection framing or TI frame-sync framing."
msgstr "Motorola 整段选择 framing，或 TI frame-sync framing。"

msgid "Bind unborrowed words and a deadline to one live port generation."
msgstr "将未被借用的 word 和 deadline 绑定到一个活跃 port generation。"

msgid "A cold restart or Core epoch change invalidates an old READY tuple. Prepare again against the live port with a new-domain deadline."
msgstr "Cold restart 或 Core epoch 改变使旧 READY 元组失效。须以新域 deadline 针对活跃 port 再次 prepare。"

msgid "[in] Initialized static owner in the current Core clock epoch."
msgstr "[in] 当前 Core clock epoch 中已初始化的静态 owner。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized fresh or consumed SETTLED descriptor."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的新描述符或已消费的 SETTLED 描述符。"

msgid "[in] Immutable words, or NULL for a supported dummy operation."
msgstr "[in] 不可变 word，或支持 dummy 操作时的 NULL。"

msgid "[out] Writable words, or NULL for supported discard."
msgstr "[out] 可写 word，或支持 discard 时的 NULL。"

msgid "[in] Positive count, at most 65535; width belongs to the port."
msgstr "[in] 正计数，最多 65535；位宽由 port 决定。"

msgid "[in] Absolute nx_time_now_us deadline, including wire tail."
msgstr "[in] 绝对 nx_time_now_us deadline，含 wire tail。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT; no provider borrow is created."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID／STATE／CONTEXT；不建立 provider 借用。"

msgid "Admit one complete frame sequence from unmasked Thread context."
msgstr "从未屏蔽中断的 Thread 模式上下文接纳一个完整 frame 序列。"

msgid "Slave peers must await successful arming before driving clocks/NSS. ISR moves bounded word data only; the owner calls service throughout completion, cancellation and stop. No worker or dynamic queue exists."
msgstr "Slave 的对端须等待成功 arm 后才驱动 clock／NSS。ISR 只搬移有界 word 数据；完成、取消和 stop 期间都由 owner 调用 service。没有 worker 或动态队列。"

msgid "[in] Initialized static controller, owned by one executor."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的静态 controller，由唯一执行者持有。"

msgid "[inout] READY descriptor and disjoint spans."
msgstr "[inout] READY 描述符及互不重叠的 span。"

msgid "Success means ACCEPTED, including later start failure; every reject retains no new reference and leaves no hardware effect."
msgstr "成功表示 ACCEPTED，包含后续启动失败；每次拒绝都不保留新引用，也不留下硬件效果。"

msgid "Stop future loading while retaining the active borrow until drain."
msgstr "停止后续装载，保留当前借用直到排空。"

msgid "Cancellation never revokes a borrow or overwrites a latched terminal."
msgstr "取消从不撤销借用，也不覆盖已锁存的终止结果。"

msgid "[in] The same single executor as submit and service."
msgstr "[in] 与 submit 和 service 相同的唯一执行者。"

msgid "[inout] The active request, or its observed SETTLED identity."
msgstr "[inout] 活跃请求，或其已观察到 SETTLED 的身份。"

msgid "Success requests cancellation; STATE means another request."
msgstr "成功表示请求取消；STATE 表示其他请求。"

msgid "Advance deadline/drain and publish only after source withdrawal."
msgstr "推进 deadline／排空，只有来源撤回后才发布。"

msgid "Failed drain/disable retains QUARANTINED storage; continue service."
msgstr "排空／禁用失败保留 QUARANTINED 存储；继续 service。"

msgid "[in] The unmasked Thread executor; bounded, no waiting callback."
msgstr "[in] 未屏蔽中断的 Thread 模式执行者；有界，不调用等待 callback。"

msgid "Close admission and join requests before returning hardware."
msgstr "归还硬件之前，先封闭准入并 join 请求。"

msgid "[in] Executor after producers and observers have joined."
msgstr "[in] Producer 和观察者完成 join 后的执行者。"

msgid "Success means stopped; BUSY retains state and requires service."
msgstr "成功表示已停止；BUSY 保留状态并要求继续 service。"

msgid "Recover an idle fault without replaying a previous request."
msgstr "恢复空闲故障，不重放旧请求。"

msgid "A changed Core epoch requires complete cold close and restart."
msgstr "Core epoch 改变要求完整 cold close 并重启。"

msgid "[in] Executor with no active borrow and unchanged static config."
msgstr "[in] 没有活跃借用且静态配置未改变的执行者。"

msgid "Success after reset/source proof; failures retain recovery duty."
msgstr "Reset／来源证明完成后成功；失败保留恢复责任。"

msgid "Immutable wire tuple selected before peripheral activation."
msgstr "外设激活前选择的不可变 wire tuple。"

msgid "The caller owns peer clocks, wiring and shared-line arbitration. irq_latency_us bounds IRQ latency and all nonwaiting software through source withdrawal; it is a declared integration budget, never a measured hardware qualification. Master receive-only and one-wire reception require a nonzero bound and finite clock progress. CRC uses an odd polynomial and an extra hardware CRC frame, excluded from request counts. TI derives its required clock phase/polarity. Slave maximum_hz is the external peer's upper clock bound; BR does not impose the master's divide-by-256 minimum on slave operation."
msgstr "调用者负责对端时钟、接线与共享线路仲裁。irq_latency_us 为 IRQ 延迟和直到来源撤回的全部非等待软件提供上界；它是声明的集成预算，绝不是实测硬件资格。Master receive-only 和 one-wire 接收要求非零上界及有限时钟进展。CRC 使用奇数 polynomial 和一个额外硬件 CRC frame，该 frame 不计入请求计数。TI 派生其要求的 clock phase／polarity。Slave 的 maximum_hz 是外部对端时钟上界；BR 不会将 master 的 divide-by-256 最低速率限制施加给 slave 操作。"

msgid "Caller-owned descriptor and word spans borrowed through SETTLED."
msgstr "调用者持有的描述符与 word span 持续被借用，直到 SETTLED。"

msgid "Word width belongs to the static port. Sixteen-bit spans contain aligned numeric uint16_t values. TWO_LINE permits NULL TX for dummy or NULL RX for discard, but not both. RECEIVE_ONLY requires RX only; ONE_WIRE requires exactly one span and selects its direction before activation. All spans, metadata and provider storage are disjoint. owner, generation and time_epoch are written only by port preparation; callers keep them unchanged until the descriptor is unborrowed."
msgstr "Word 位宽由静态 port 决定。16-bit span 包含对齐的数值 uint16_t。TWO_LINE 允许 NULL TX 作为 dummy，或 NULL RX 作为 discard，但不能同时为空。RECEIVE_ONLY 只允许 RX；ONE_WIRE 恰好要求一个 span，并在激活前选择方向。所有 span、metadata 与 provider 存储互不重叠。owner、generation 和 time_epoch 仅由 port preparation 写入；描述符未结束借用之前，调用者必须保持这些字段不变。"

msgid "Readonly shared methods; one executor owns each instance."
msgstr "只读共享方法；每个实例由唯一执行者持有。"

msgid "Immutable controller face; lookup acquires no resources."
msgstr "不可变 controller face；lookup 不取得资源。"

msgid "stream.h"
msgstr "stream.h"

msgid "Bounded caller-owned blocks with explicit producer/consumer loans."
msgstr "调用者拥有的有界块与显式生产者／消费者借用。"

msgid "Initialize an unborrowed stream and exact supplied block array."
msgstr "初始化未借用的 stream 与准确供给的块数组。"

msgid "Task-only cold assembly. This helper does not validate DMA domains; the hardware provider must validate every block."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的冷装配。本辅助函数不验证 DMA 内存域；硬件 provider 必须验证每个块。"

msgid "[out] Fresh storage, not visible to any producer/consumer."
msgstr "[out] 全新存储，尚未向任何生产者或消费者公开。"

msgid "[inout] Buffers distinct from all control and slot metadata."
msgstr "[inout] 与全部控制及槽元数据分离的缓冲。"

msgid "[in] Positive exact block count, not a maximum pool size."
msgstr "[in] 正数精确块数，不是缓冲池最大数量。"

msgid "Success or INVALID; never allocates or retains bad inputs."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；不分配，也不保留无效输入。"

msgid "Reserve the next free block for one serialized producer."
msgstr "为一个串行生产者预留下一个空闲块。"

msgid "Bounded task/IRQ metadata operation; payload writes occur outside the short interrupt mask, within the returned loan."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界元数据操作；载荷写入在短暂中断屏蔽区之外、返回的借用范围内执行。"

msgid "[inout] Live initialized stream with one producer."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的活动流，只有一个生产者。"

msgid "[out] Producer loan valid until publish or proved abort."
msgstr "[out] 生产者借用，在 publish 或经证明的 abort 前有效。"

msgid "Success, OVERFLOW without overwrite, STATE while stopping or EXHAUSTED when the monotonic loan identity cannot advance."
msgstr "成功；OVERFLOW 不覆盖数据；停止时返回 STATE；单调借用身份无法递增时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

msgid "Query the next physical slot without creating a loan or loss."
msgstr "查询下一个物理槽，不产生借用或丢失。"

msgid "Task/IRQ bounded hint. A producer still calls reserve before accessing payload; another context must not race admission."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界提示。生产者仍须先调用 reserve 才能访问载荷；其他上下文不得与准入并发竞争。"

msgid "[in] Live initialized stream with one serialized producer."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的活动流，只有一个串行化生产者。"

msgid "True only when admission is open and the next slot is free."
msgstr "仅在准入开放且下一个槽空闲时返回 true。"

msgid "Latch explicitly observed dropped producer boundaries."
msgstr "锁存明确观察到的生产者丢弃边界。"

msgid "Task/IRQ bounded. Saturates at UINT32_MAX; the next published block carries LOSS independently of its useful payload length."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界操作。在 UINT32_MAX 饱和；下一个发布块携带 LOSS，与其有效载荷长度无关。"

msgid "[inout] Live stream controlled by the serialized producer."
msgstr "[inout] 由串行化生产者控制的活动流。"

msgid "[in] Positive lost block/boundary count, never guessed bytes."
msgstr "[in] 丢失块或边界的正数数量，不能猜测字节数。"

msgid "Publish a complete block after all hardware writes detached."
msgstr "全部硬件写引用撤离后，发布完整块。"

msgid "Task/IRQ bounded. A DMA half/full flag is insufficient if the engine can still write the published block. Consumer-visible block bytes stay immutable until the consumer releases them."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界操作。如果引擎仍能写入所发布的块，DMA 半完成/全完成标志就不足以证明可发布。消费者可见的块字节在消费者释放前保持不可变。"

msgid "[inout] Same serialized producer as reserve."
msgstr "[inout] 与 reserve 相同的串行化生产者。"

msgid "[in] Current producer loan, not retained after publication."
msgstr "[in] 当前生产者借用；发布后不再保留该令牌引用。"

msgid "[in] Positive produced bytes within the reserved capacity."
msgstr "[in] 预留容量范围内的正数已生产字节数。"

msgid "[in] IDLE/TRIGGER boundaries observed by the provider."
msgstr "[in] provider 实际观测到的 IDLE/TRIGGER 边界。"

msgid "Success, INVALID or STATE; failure retains producer ownership."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 STATE；失败时保留生产者所有权。"

msgid "Acquire the next ready block for one serialized consumer."
msgstr "一个串行消费者取得下一个就绪块。"

msgid "Task/IRQ bounded metadata; consumer processing happens outside the mask. Release may occur out of order without overwrite."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界元数据操作；消费者在屏蔽区外处理载荷。可乱序释放，且不会覆盖仍被持有的数据。"

msgid "[inout] Live stream; consumer may drain during stop."
msgstr "[inout] 活动流；停止过程中消费者仍可排空。"

msgid "[out] Immutable consumer loan with exact incarnation token."
msgstr "[out] 带精确代次令牌的不可变消费者借用。"

msgid "Success, EMPTY or INVALID; empty creates no loan."
msgstr "成功、EMPTY 或 INVALID；空流不建立借用。"

msgid "Release only the matching consumer incarnation after final use."
msgstr "最终使用之后，仅释放匹配的消费者实例世代。"

msgid "Task/IRQ bounded; release is the consumer's final block access."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界操作；release 是消费者对该块的最后一次访问。"

msgid "[inout] Same consumer owner; no remaining observers of block."
msgstr "[inout] 同一消费者所有者；不再有该块的剩余观测者。"

msgid "[in] Exact acquired token, never a reconstructed pointer."
msgstr "[in] 精确的已获取令牌，不能重新拼装指针代替。"

msgid "Success, STATE for stale/double release or INVALID."
msgstr "成功；过期或重复释放返回 STATE；也可能返回 INVALID。"

msgid "Abort a producer loan only after memory write sources detach."
msgstr "仅内存写入源撤离之后中止生产者借用。"

msgid "Cancellation/deadline alone never establishes quiescence."
msgstr "仅取消或达到时限不能证明已静止。"

msgid "[inout] Same producer owner as reserve."
msgstr "[inout] 与 reserve 相同的生产者所有者。"

msgid "[in] Current exact loan."
msgstr "[in] 当前的精确借用。"

msgid "[in] True only after provider proves DMA/IRQ stopped."
msgstr "[in] 仅在 provider 证明 DMA/IRQ 已停止后才为 true。"

msgid "Success, BUSY without proven drain, STATE for a stale token."
msgstr "成功；排空未获证明时为 BUSY；令牌过期时为 STATE。"

msgid "Close producer admission while retaining every outstanding loan."
msgstr "关闭生产者准入，保留每一个未结清借用。"

msgid "Task/IRQ constant metadata work independent of block count. This operation does not stop hardware or revoke loans."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的常量元数据工作量，与块数无关。本操作不停止硬件，也不撤销借用。"

msgid "[inout] Live control kept alive until final successful stop."
msgstr "[inout] 活动控制对象，须保持有效直到最后一次 stop 成功。"

msgid "Success only when all blocks are free, BUSY until producers detach and consumers drain/release, INVALID for bad control."
msgstr "仅在全部块空闲时成功；生产者引用撤离且消费者排空并释放之前返回 BUSY；控制对象无效时返回 INVALID。"

msgid "Bind a posted producer to a quiescent initialized stream."
msgstr "将预提交生产者绑定到静止、已初始化的 stream。"

msgid "Task-only cold binding. Caller owns exclusive producer rights and retains control until all pending fills and IRQs drain."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的冷绑定。调用方拥有排他生产者权限，并保留控制对象直到全部待填充操作及 IRQ 排空。"

msgid "[out] Separate caller control, not aliased with buffers"
msgstr "[out] 独立的调用方控制对象，不得与缓冲建立别名"

msgid "[inout] Admission open, no outstanding producer/consumer loans"
msgstr "[inout] 准入已开放，且无未归还的生产者或消费者借用"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY or STATE; rejected output is untouched"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY 或 STATE；拒绝时输出不变"

msgid "Query the next preposted slot without a loan or guessed loss."
msgstr "查询下一个预提交槽，不产生借用或猜测丢失。"

msgid "Bounded task/IRQ hint; still reserve before writing payload."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界提示；写入载荷前仍须 reserve。"

msgid "[in] Same exclusive serialized producer"
msgstr "[in] 同一排他且串行化的生产者"

msgid "True when the next reservation can succeed"
msgstr "下次预留可以成功时返回 true"

msgid "Reserve a future fill without making earlier blocks ready."
msgstr "预留未来填充，不提前使更早的块就绪。"

msgid "O(1) task/IRQ. Failure leaves output and loss counters intact; only explicitly observed boundaries justify note_loss."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中为 O(1)。失败时输出和丢失计数不变；仅显式观测到边界后才可调用 note_loss。"

msgid "[inout] Live posted producer"
msgstr "[inout] 活动的预提交生产者"

msgid "[out] Exact pending loan until FIFO publish or LIFO abort"
msgstr "[out] 精确的待完成借用，在 FIFO 发布或 LIFO 中止前有效"

msgid "SUCCESS, OVERFLOW, STATE, EXHAUSTED or INVALID"
msgstr "SUCCESS、OVERFLOW、STATE、EXHAUSTED 或 INVALID"

msgid "Publish only the oldest pending detached producer loan."
msgstr "仅发布最早 pending 且已撤离引用的生产者借用。"

msgid "O(1) task/IRQ. Consumer acquire/release use the original stream."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中为 O(1)。消费者通过原有流执行 acquire/release。"

msgid "[inout] Same exclusive producer as reserve"
msgstr "[inout] 与 reserve 相同的排他生产者"

msgid "[in] Exact oldest token, absent from every hardware target"
msgstr "[in] 精确的最旧令牌，已从全部硬件目标中撤离"

msgid "[in] Positive valid bytes at most the block capacity"
msgstr "[in] 正数有效字节数，最多为块容量"

msgid "[in] Observed IDLE/TRIGGER/ERROR boundary facts"
msgstr "[in] 实际观测到的 IDLE/TRIGGER/ERROR 边界事实"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE; rejection retains the loan"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝时保留借用"

msgid "Cancel the newest pending fill after proof of memory drain."
msgstr "证明内存排空后，取消最新 pending 填充。"

msgid "O(1) task/IRQ. Does not advance consumer or published cursor; no FREE hole appears ahead of future publication. Stopping closes admission but still permits proved tail rollback."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中为 O(1)。不推进消费者或已发布游标，不会在后续发布位置前产生 FREE 空洞。停止会关闭准入，但仍允许经证明的尾部回滚。"

msgid "[inout] Same producer; rollback is strictly LIFO"
msgstr "[inout] 同一生产者；回滚严格遵循 LIFO"

msgid "[in] Exact newest pending token"
msgstr "[in] 精确的最新待完成令牌"

msgid "[in] Source detached, no remaining writes"
msgstr "[in] 源已撤离，不再有剩余写入"

msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, STATE or INVALID; failure retains the loan"
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、STATE 或 INVALID；失败时保留借用"

msgid "Caller-owned block metadata; initialize data and capacity only."
msgstr "调用者拥有的块元数据；仅初始化 data 与 capacity。"

msgid "Storage remains live through producer and consumer quiescence."
msgstr "存储须保持有效，直到生产者和消费者均已静止。"

msgid "Caller-owned stream control, initialized before publication."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 stream 控制，必须先初始化再发布。"

msgid "outstanding counts nonfree blocks, including filling, ready and borrowed states. Only stream operations mutate it."
msgstr "outstanding 统计非空闲块，包括填充中、就绪和已借用状态。仅流操作可修改该计数。"

msgid "Mutable producer loan; hardware must stop before abort or publish."
msgstr "可变生产者借用；中止或发布前必须停止硬件。"

msgid "Optional caller-owned preposted producer; no default cost."
msgstr "调用者显式选择的预提交生产者，不产生默认成本。"

msgid "One serialized producer owns this control and the stream. Do not mix ordinary reserve/publish/abort with a live posted producer. Two hardware targets remain FILLING until detached. Publication is FIFO; rollback is LIFO to avoid consumer holes."
msgstr "一个串行化生产者拥有本控制对象及流。预提交生产者活动期间，不得混用普通 reserve/publish/abort。两个硬件目标在引用撤离前保持 FILLING。发布遵循 FIFO，回滚遵循 LIFO，以免在消费者路径中留下空洞。"

msgid "Immutable consumer loan, valid until matching release succeeds."
msgstr "不可变消费者借用，直到匹配释放成功之前均有效。"

msgid "stream_budget.h"
msgstr "stream_budget.h"

msgid "Optional constant-work snapshot and checked cold sizing."
msgstr "可选恒定工作量快照与经过检查的冷态容量计算。"

msgid "Snapshot maintained metadata under one short IRQ guard."
msgstr "在一个短 IRQ 临界区内快照维护的元数据。"

msgid "Task/IRQ fixed work, no slot scan or payload access. Caller keeps all storage alive; no observer reference is retained. next_free is the ordinary stream cursor, not the private preposted cursor. Output is distinct from every payload."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的固定工作量，不扫描槽，也不访问载荷。调用方须保持全部存储有效；不保留观测者引用。next_free 是普通流游标，不是私有预提交游标。输出与全部载荷分离。"

msgid "[in] Live initialized storage, no concurrent destruction."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的活动存储，不得并发销毁。"

msgid "[out] Distinct output, unchanged on rejected metadata/alias."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出；元数据或别名检查拒绝时保持不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE for inconsistent control facts."
msgstr "SUCCESS；控制事实不一致时返回 INVALID 或 STATE。"

msgid "Checked cold calculation, no stream mutation or allocation."
msgstr "经过检查的冷态计算，不修改 stream 或分配存储。"

msgid "required = targets + spares + ceil(rate*release_delay / (block_units*1000000)); payload is required*block*unit_bytes. Finite math is conservative under the declared FIFO frontier release bound; out-of-order release may still block the next cursor. Latency requires target_delay_us < floor(units_per_block*1000000/units_per_second). This creates no backpressure or hardware qualification."
msgstr "required = targets + spares + ceil(rate*release_delay / (block_units*1000000))；载荷大小为 required*block*unit_bytes。在所声明的 FIFO 队首释放延迟界限下，此有限算术计算是保守的；乱序释放仍可能阻塞下一个游标。延迟要求 target_delay_us < floor(units_per_block*1000000/units_per_second)。本计算不建立背压，也不构成硬件资格证明。"

msgid "[in] Explicit rate, longest release delay and pipeline."
msgstr "[in] 显式速率、最长释放延迟和流水线配置。"

msgid "[out] Distinct output, unchanged on error or overflow."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出；错误或溢出时保持不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or EXHAUSTED for arithmetic overflow."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID；算术溢出时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

msgid "O(1) aggregate facts; free total does not imply cursor is free."
msgstr "O(1) 汇总事实；总空闲容量不证明游标位置空闲。"

msgid "Explicit engineering assumptions, no inferred hardware rate."
msgstr "显式工程假设，不推断硬件速率。"

msgid "release_delay includes queue/consumer delay until release of each published FIFO frontier. units convert to bytes using unit_bytes. targets/spares are actual selected hardware loans. All quantities are positive except delay/targets/spares."
msgstr "release_delay 包含每个已发布 FIFO 队首块直到释放为止的排队和消费者延迟。通过 unit_bytes 将单位转换为字节。targets/spares 是实际选择的硬件借用。除 delay/targets/spares 外，全部量均为正数。"

msgid "Conservative declared-assumption budget; never physical evidence."
msgstr "依据声明假设得到的保守预算，绝不作为物理证据。"

msgid "stream_profile.h"
msgstr "stream_profile.h"

msgid "Optional readonly continuous-stream cold admission profiles."
msgstr "可选只读的连续流冷准入配置。"

msgid "Validate an actual pool before the bound UART may borrow it."
msgstr "绑定的 UART 借用缓冲池之前验证实际缓冲池。"

msgid "Caller joins all pool users before this cold pool check. Failure before provider dispatch creates no borrow, epoch change or hardware effect. Rate, FIFO-frontier hold and IRQ latency remain declared assumptions, never measurements. This creates no external UART flow control or losslessness. Underlying unprofiled APIs retain their explicit contracts."
msgstr "调用方须在此次冷缓冲池检查前等待全部池用户退出。在 provider 派发前失败，不会建立借用、改变 epoch 或产生硬件副作用。速率、FIFO 队首持有时间及 IRQ 延迟始终是声明的假设，不是量测。本操作不建立外部 UART 流控，也不保证无丢失。底层未使用 profile 的 API 保留其显式契约。"

msgid "[in] Stable readonly reviewed binding and assumptions."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、只读且已经审核的绑定与假设。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized unborrowed pool with exact declared count and equal declared byte capacities, kept live through the original provider's stop and all consumer releases."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且尚未借出的缓冲池，块数及各块字节容量与声明精确一致；须保持有效，直到原 provider 停止且全部消费者释放借用。"

msgid "INVALID for mismatched geometry/alias, STATE for stopping metadata, BUSY for existing loans, CONTEXT outside an unmasked task, EXHAUSTED for overflow/insufficient budget, UNSUPPORTED for target latency; otherwise provider result."
msgstr "几何或别名不匹配时为 INVALID；停止中的元数据返回 STATE；已有借用时为 BUSY；不在中断未屏蔽任务上下文中时为 CONTEXT；溢出或预算不足时为 EXHAUSTED；目标延迟不满足要求时为 UNSUPPORTED；其余情况返回 provider 结果。"

msgid "Validate pool and whole-scan rate before ADC admission."
msgstr "ADC 准入之前验证缓冲池与完整扫描速率。"

msgid "ADC stopping its trigger creates a sampling gap. No budget makes that pause preserve wall-clock samples or prove the future consumer/IRQ bounds. No observer/queue is created."
msgstr "ADC 停止触发会产生采样缺口。任何预算都不能使这一暂停保留按实际时间连续发生的采样，也不能证明未来消费者或 IRQ 的界限。不会创建观测者或队列。"

msgid "[in] Stable readonly binding to the selected ADC face."
msgstr "[in] 到所选 ADC 接口的稳定只读绑定。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized unborrowed exact pool, as for UART."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且未借出的精确缓冲池，要求同 UART。"

msgid "[in] Positive nominal complete scans per second, no greater than the declared production-rate upper bound."
msgstr "[in] 每秒完整扫描的正数标称次数，不大于所声明的生产速率上界。"

msgid "Cold-check errors as for UART, or the original info/start result. Provider scan, timer, DMA/cache and alias checks still apply; no rejected operation retains new references."
msgstr "冷检查错误同 UART，否则返回原 info/start 结果。provider 的扫描、定时器、DMA/cache 及别名检查仍然适用；任何被拒绝的操作都不保留新引用。"

msgid "Selected UART face and immutable byte-stream assumptions."
msgstr "选定的 UART 接口与不可变的字节流假设。"

msgid "Reviewed assembly binds the actual continuous provider. Two hardware targets and one replacement are required. A profile never allocates or owns the caller's pool. The normal byte face and provider state retain their layouts. Cold admission rechecks payload disjointness in O(n^2); no additional check enters the IRQ or steady I/O path."
msgstr "已审核的装配绑定实际连续 provider。要求两个硬件目标及一个替补块。profile 不分配也不拥有调用方的缓冲池。普通字节接口及 provider 状态布局保持不变。冷准入以 O(n^2) 重新检查载荷互不重叠；IRQ 或稳定 I/O 路径不增加额外检查。"

msgid "Selected ADC face and complete-scan stream assumptions."
msgstr "选定的 ADC 接口与完整扫描流假设。"

msgid "One unit is a complete selected scan, stored as one uint16_t per channel. Resolution bits never replace storage width. Geometry and rates are reviewed assembly inputs; they establish neither sample accuracy nor an aperture time."
msgstr "一个单位是一轮完整的所选扫描，每通道存储一个 uint16_t。分辨率位数不能替代存储位宽。几何和速率是已审核的装配输入，不能据此证明采样准确度或孔径时刻。"

msgid "timer.h"
msgstr "timer.h"

msgid "Fixed timer/channel PWM with one shared base configuration."
msgstr "固定定时器／通道 PWM，共享同一个基准配置。"

msgid "Atomically stage a reviewed fixed-base PWM duty."
msgstr "原子暂存已审查固定基准 PWM 的占空比。"

msgid "Shadow update becomes effective at next update event; do not infer immediate electrical change from successful staging."
msgstr "影子更新在下一次更新事件生效；成功暂存不代表电气输出立即改变。"

msgid "[inout] Fixed timer/channel with one serialized writer."
msgstr "[inout] 固定定时器/通道，只有一个串行化写入者。"

msgid "[in] Positive maintained shared-base period."
msgstr "[in] 已维护共享时基的正数周期。"

msgid "[in] Zero through period_ticks, inclusive."
msgstr "[in] 从零到 period_ticks，包含两端。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE/BUSY. Zero/100 percent are explicit constant levels. Shared channels must use one PSC/ARR/base; changing another channel's base is rejected by configuration."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/STATE/BUSY。零及 100% 对应显式恒定电平。共享通道必须使用同一 PSC/ARR/时基；配置会拒绝改变其他通道的时基。"

msgid "Enable a previously configured fixed PWM output."
msgstr "启用此前已配置的固定 PWM 输出。"

msgid "[inout] Execution owner after Board inactive level setup."
msgstr "[inout] Board 已设置无效电平后的执行所有者。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/STATE。"

msgid "Stop PWM at its declared Board inactive electrical level."
msgstr "以声明的 Board 非活动电气电平停止 PWM。"

msgid "[inout] Quiesced execution owner; no concurrent set/start."
msgstr "[inout] 已静止的执行所有者；不得并发 set/start。"

msgid "Success or INVALID; no advanced break/capture promise."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；不承诺高级 break/capture 能力。"

msgid "Query staged PWM counts and selected timer clock."
msgstr "查询暂存 PWM 计数与选定定时器时钟。"

msgid "[in] Fixed initialized channel."
msgstr "[in] 固定且已初始化的通道。"

msgid "[out] Staged counts, clock and running state."
msgstr "[out] 已暂存的计数、时钟及运行状态。"

msgid "PWM counts refer to the fixed declared post-prescaler timer clock."
msgstr "PWM 计数对应固定声明的预分频后定时器时钟。"

msgid "timer_capture.h"
msgstr "timer_capture.h"

msgid "Optional raw timer edge capture with caller-owned events."
msgstr "可选原始定时器边沿捕获与调用者拥有的事件。"

msgid "Observable loss incidents, not an exact count of physical edges."
msgstr "可观察丢失事件，不是准确的物理边沿总数。"

msgid "Borrow an exact event ring and enable the fixed capture channel."
msgstr "借用准确事件环并启用固定捕获通道。"

msgid "Ring remains borrowed until successful stop. ISR access is confined to this ring. Caller must not modify it or its provider while borrowed. Counter wrap is modulo the reported width; observation time is not an absolute edge timestamp or a clock accuracy qualification."
msgstr "环一直被借用，直到 stop 成功。ISR 对事件存储的访问仅限于该环。借用期间调用方不得修改环或其 provider。计数器按已报告位宽取模回卷；观测时间不是绝对边沿时间戳，也不构成时钟准确度资格证明。"

msgid "[in] One privileged task owner, serialized with stop/read."
msgstr "[in] 单一特权任务所有者，与 stop/read 串行执行。"

msgid "[inout] Aligned writable ring, capacity positive."
msgstr "[inout] 已对齐的可写环，容量为正数。"

msgid "[in] Number of events; no hidden buffer or worker."
msgstr "[in] 事件数量；无隐藏缓冲或工作任务。"

msgid "SUCCESS transfers the ring borrow; rejection retains nothing."
msgstr "SUCCESS 转移环的借用；拒绝时不保留任何引用。"

msgid "Disable and read back channel/IRQ sources before returning storage."
msgstr "归还存储之前禁用并读回通道／IRQ 源。"

msgid "Read drains events after capture stops. Failed detach never frees storage. Board pins, timer clock and shared vector leases are released by cold assembly only after successful stop and publisher quiescence."
msgstr "捕获停止后，read 仍可排空事件。撤离失败绝不释放存储。仅在 stop 成功且发布者静止后，冷装配才释放 Board 引脚、定时器时钟及共享向量租约。"

msgid "[in] Privileged task owner, with generated IRQ owner retained."
msgstr "[in] 特权任务所有者，并保留生成的 IRQ 所有者。"

msgid "SUCCESS is the final access to the ring; BUSY retains the borrow while queued events or failed hardware detachment remain."
msgstr "SUCCESS 是对环的最后一次访问；仍有排队事件或硬件撤离失败时，BUSY 保留借用。"

msgid "Copy the oldest event in a short saved-mask metadata section."
msgstr "在短且保存原屏蔽状态的元数据临界区内复制最早事件。"

msgid "[in] Single privileged task consumer."
msgstr "[in] 单一特权任务消费者。"

msgid "[out] Separate writable output, unchanged on EMPTY/rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写输出；EMPTY 或拒绝时保持不变。"

msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY, STATE or INVALID; no block release is required."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EMPTY、STATE 或 INVALID；无需另行释放块。"

msgid "Query counter units and observable queue/loss facts."
msgstr "查询计数器单位与可观察队列／丢失事实。"

msgid "Hardware overcapture and ring saturation can coalesce edges. A loss incident does not estimate edges, edge frequency or actual IRQ WCET."
msgstr "硬件过捕获和环饱和可能合并边沿。丢失事件不用于估算边沿数量、边沿频率或实际 IRQ WCET。"

msgid "[in] Privileged task owner; no concurrent lifecycle writer."
msgstr "[in] 特权任务所有者；不得并发执行生命周期写操作。"

msgid "[out] Separate writable snapshot."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写快照。"

msgid "Hardware modulo counter and the separate IRQ observation time."
msgstr "硬件模计数器与独立的 IRQ 观察时间。"

msgid "Fixed counter units and current software retention state."
msgstr "固定计数器单位与当前软件保留状态。"

msgid "Shared immutable methods; no per-call acquisition or allocation."
msgstr "共享不可变方法；不逐次取得资源或分配。"

msgid "Immutable identity; state and methods outlive calls and IRQs."
msgstr "不可变身份；状态和方法必须在所有调用与 IRQ 完全退出前保持有效。"

msgid "timer_pulse.h"
msgstr "timer_pulse.h"

msgid "Finite hardware one-pulse output with explicit final access."
msgstr "具有显式最终访问边界的有限硬件单脉冲输出。"

msgid "The same typed face when operations are invoked directly."
msgstr "直接调用 ops 时使用的同一个 typed face。"

msgid "One complete pulse period on the statically ordered channels."
msgstr "按静态顺序排列的通道上的一个完整脉冲周期。"

msgid "Initialize/prepare base before submit. Each width is in the selected post-prescaler ticks, from zero through period_ticks minus one. The remaining leading ticks are inactive; all pulses finish at the same hardware one-pulse boundary. Zero width remains inactive throughout. A full-period active level has no inactive one-pulse end and rejects. ACCEPTED borrows this request and the complete immutable width array through acquire-observed SETTLED. Error/cancel reports zero completed periods. SUCCESS reports one period, not a measured electrical edge."
msgstr "提交前先初始化／准备 base。每个 width 使用所选预分频后的 tick，范围为零到 period_ticks 减一。前面的剩余 ticks 为不活动电平；所有脉冲在同一个硬件单脉冲边界结束。零宽度全程不活动。完整周期的活动电平没有不活动的单脉冲尾部，因而拒绝。ACCEPTED 借用该 request 与完整不可变 width 数组，直到 acquire 观察 SETTLED。错误／取消报告零个完成周期；SUCCESS 报告一个周期，不代表测量过的电气边沿。"

msgid "Nominal units and actual source/recovery observations."
msgstr "名义单位及实际源／恢复观察。"

msgid "One static owner, driven by a serialized privileged unmasked task."
msgstr "同一个静态 owner，由串行调用的特权、未屏蔽中断 task 推进。"

msgid "Platform prepare leaves counter and outputs off. Factory returns the existing face. submit accepts a READY request before enabling any source; rejection retains no references or new hardware effects. Hardware stops the counter after the one-pulse update. Explicit service still joins outputs and actual IRQ observers before SETTLED. If an internal master is selected, arm the slave before starting that master and supply only one start event until settlement. There is no worker, task or implicit clock owner. A completion first observed at or after the absolute deadline reports TIMEOUT. Failed stop, clock history loss and quarantine never revoke a borrow. Platform close withdraws admission and must complete the same join before System resources can be released. state output must be disjoint from every accepted control and width span; it remains unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "Platform prepare 保持 counter 和输出关闭。factory 返回已有 face。submit 在启用任何源前接受 READY 请求；拒绝不保留引用或新硬件效果。硬件在单脉冲 update 后停止 counter。显式 service 仍须 join 输出和真实 IRQ 观察者，才发布 SETTLED。若选择内部 master，先 arm slave 再启动 master，并在结算前只提供一次启动事件。没有 worker、task 或隐式时钟 owner。首次在绝对 deadline 当时或之后观察到完成，报告 TIMEOUT。停止失败、时钟历史丢失及隔离都不撤销借用。Platform close 撤回准入，并须完成同一个 join，才可释放 System 资源。state 输出须与每份已接受的控制及 width 范围不重叠；拒绝时保持原值。"

msgid "Immutable identity with private retained controller storage."
msgstr "不可变身份与私有保留的 controller 存储。"

msgid "timer_sequence.h"
msgstr "timer_sequence.h"

msgid "Native finite update-DMA rows and complete source loans."
msgstr "原生有限 update-DMA 行与完整源借用。"

msgid "Selected native row layout; every item occupies one DMA transfer."
msgstr "选定的原生行布局；每项占用一次 DMA 传输。"

msgid "The same typed face for direct operations."
msgstr "直接调用 ops 时使用的同一个 typed face。"

msgid "One immutable whole frame loan containing complete native rows."
msgstr "包含完整原生行的不可变整份 frame 借用。"

msgid "Initialize/prepare base first. source must be the exact outstanding frame consumer control. Its single plane has offset zero, contiguous rows, no padding between rows, and the reported items_per_frame times native_bits/8 bytes in each row. ARR_RCR_CCR1_CCR4 contains ARR, RCR/reserved-zero, then CCR1..CCR4 in that order. Unselected compares and RCR/reserved are zero. ARR plus one meets min_period_ticks; each selected compare fits that row's period and the native register bits. ACCEPTED borrows request, control and the whole source through acquire-observed SETTLED. No source conversion or per-row copy occurs. SUCCESS reports source storage bytes staged by DMA; it does not count electrical pulses. Cancellation/error reports zero guaranteed bytes."
msgstr "先初始化／准备 base。source 必须是仍未归还的精确 frame consumer 控制对象。它的单 plane 使用零 offset、连续 rows、无行间 padding；每行字节数为所报告的 items_per_frame 乘以 native_bits/8。ARR_RCR_CCR1_CCR4 依次包含 ARR、RCR／reserved-zero、CCR1..CCR4。未选 compare 及 RCR／reserved 必须为零。ARR 加一满足 min_period_ticks；每个所选 compare 均适合该行 period 和原生寄存器位宽。ACCEPTED 借用 request、control 和完整源，直到 acquire 观察 SETTLED。不转换源，也不逐行复制。SUCCESS 报告 DMA 已 staged 的源存储字节，不统计电脉冲数。取消／错误报告零个保证字节。"

msgid "Nominal format, declared transfer budget and observed owner state."
msgstr "名义格式、声明的传输预算及观察到的 owner 状态。"

msgid "The budget is an application-declared upper bound, not a physical measurement. native_bits describes DMA item storage, independently of counter width. Tail values may repeat until explicit service joins."
msgstr "预算是应用声明的上界，不是物理测量。native_bits 描述 DMA 项存储，与 counter 位宽独立。尾值可能重复，直到显式 service 完成 join。"

msgid "Hardware UPDATE requests advance normal DMA without per-row service."
msgstr "硬件 UPDATE 请求推进 normal DMA，不需要逐行 service。"

msgid "Platform prepare leaves source and DMA off; factory returns only the existing immutable face. One privileged unmasked task serializes all methods. submit rejects without retained references or new effects; acceptance precedes every source/DMA effect. Explicit service handles terminal status and full withdrawal; no hidden worker exists. Each complete native burst must finish before the next update. The selected declared bus budget must be validated under actual load. Breaking that condition can publish mixed compare values; the API makes no unconditional cross-update atomicity or continuity claim. DMA TC/zero NDTR alone cannot release the loan. The owner withdraws requests and DMA bus activity, observes fresh updates for final shadow application and its tail period, then joins output/IRQ/address access. Tail repetitions and initial idle cycles do not imply missing DMA rows. An absolute deadline includes all final withdrawal. Failed stop retains the complete borrow and resources; old clock/reset history cannot be recreated by restoring register appearances. Platform close must join the same owner before ending the System/time domain. state output cannot overlap any accepted source or control and is unchanged on rejection. Physical waveform and throughput qualification is separate."
msgstr "Platform prepare 保持源与 DMA 关闭；factory 只返回已有不可变 face。同一个特权、未屏蔽中断的 task 串行调用所有方法。submit 拒绝不保留引用或新效果；接受先于全部源／DMA 效果。显式 service 处理终态和完整撤回；没有隐藏 worker。每个完整原生 burst 必须在下一次 update 前结束。所选声明总线预算须在实际负载下验证。违反该条件可能发布混合 compare 值；API 不承诺无条件的跨 update 原子性或连续性。单凭 DMA TC／NDTR 为零不能归还 loan。owner 撤回请求与 DMA 总线活动，观察新的 update 以证明最后 shadow 生效及其尾周期，再 join 输出／IRQ／地址访问。尾部重复与初始 idle 周期不表示 DMA 行丢失。绝对 deadline 包括全部最终撤回。停止失败保留完整借用与资源；恢复寄存器外观不能重建旧时钟／复位历史。Platform close 必须 join 同一 owner 后才可结束 System／时间域。state 输出不能与任何已接受的源或控制存储重叠，拒绝时保持原值。物理波形和吞吐资格单独建立。"

msgid "Immutable typed identity; vendor state and mutable handles are private."
msgstr "不可变 typed 身份；厂商状态和可变 Handle 保持私有。"

msgid "uart.h"
msgstr "uart.h"

msgid "IRQ TX requests and independently budgeted byte/event reception."
msgstr "IRQ TX 请求与分别预算的字节／事件接收。"

msgid "Exact transport's side-effect-free TX admission validator."
msgstr "准确传输端口的无副作用 TX 准入验证器。"

msgid "Reads clock/hardware facts but never writes GPIO/MMIO, admits, starts or retains a reference. One executor owns adapter and transport; no external direct TX is permitted."
msgstr "读取时钟/硬件事实，但不写 GPIO/MMIO，不准入、不启动，也不保留引用。一个执行者拥有适配器及传输接口；不允许外部直接 TX。"

msgid "Param context"
msgstr "参数 context"

msgid "[in] The immutable transport face's exact context."
msgstr "[in] 不可变传输接口的精确 context。"

msgid "Param request"
msgstr "参数 request"

msgid "[in] Live READY or QUEUED descriptor, never retained."
msgstr "[in] 活动的 READY 或 QUEUED 描述符；绝不保留引用。"

msgid "Return"
msgstr "返回值"

msgid "Same rejectable checks used by the transport submit/start."
msgstr "采用与传输接口 submit/start 相同的可拒绝检查。"

msgid "Prepare an unborrowed IRQ TX descriptor without copying data."
msgstr "准备未借用 IRQ TX 描述符，不复制数据。"

msgid "[inout] Fresh initialized or consumed SETTLED request."
msgstr "[inout] 新初始化的请求，或已经消费的 SETTLED 请求。"

msgid "[in] Nonempty payload retained unchanged through SETTLED."
msgstr "[in] 非空载荷，保持不变直到 SETTLED。"

msgid "[in] Positive byte count."
msgstr "[in] 正数字节数。"

msgid "[in] Absolute deadline in nx_time_now_us clock domain."
msgstr "[in] nx_time_now_us 时钟域中的绝对时限。"

msgid "NX_SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; failure retains no buffer."
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；失败时不保留缓冲引用。"

msgid "Submit one direct request to a single-executor UART."
msgstr "向单执行者 UART 提交一个直接请求。"

msgid "Task-only, bounded admission. TX completion waits for true TC (wire idle). IRQ only moves bytes/publishes hardware facts; the owner calls service to observe deadlines and settle. The first observed terminal fact latches its result. Later service, deadline or cancellation does not overwrite an already observed TC. IRQ/service latency bounds remain provider and product qualification inputs."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的有界准入。TX 完成须等待真正的 TC，即线路空闲。IRQ 仅搬运字节或发布硬件事实；所有者调用 service 以观测时限并结算请求。最先观测到的终态事实锁定其结果。后续 service、时限或取消不会覆盖已观测到的 TC。IRQ/service 延迟界限仍是 provider 与产品资格验证的输入。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized idle port owned by this execution context."
msgstr "[inout] 由当前执行上下文拥有、已初始化且空闲的端口。"

msgid "[inout] READY descriptor; borrowed only on NX_SUCCESS."
msgstr "[inout] READY 描述符；仅在 NX_SUCCESS 时借用。"

msgid "NX_SUCCESS means ACCEPTED, including a later start failure. BUSY/INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/TIMEOUT means REJECTED with zero borrow; an already expired direct request is not admitted."
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED，包括随后启动失败的情况。BUSY/INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/TIMEOUT 表示 REJECTED，借用为零；直接提交时已经过期的请求不获准入。"

msgid "[inout] Single-executor initialized port."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的单执行者端口。"

msgid "[inout] QUEUED descriptor already borrowed by adapter."
msgstr "[inout] 已由适配器借用的 QUEUED 描述符。"

msgid "BUSY retains QUEUED; NX_SUCCESS transfers execution to port. Other start errors must be settled by the adapter executor."
msgstr "BUSY 保留 QUEUED；NX_SUCCESS 将执行权转给端口。其他启动错误须由适配器执行者结算。"

msgid "Request cancellation; acceptance does not mean settlement."
msgstr "请求取消；接受取消不表示请求结清。"

msgid "[inout] Same single execution owner as submit/service."
msgstr "[inout] 与 submit/service 相同的单一执行所有者。"

msgid "[inout] Active live descriptor; cross-task callers use a stable adapter slot and expected epoch instead of this pointer."
msgstr "[inout] 当前活动且有效的描述符；跨任务调用方应使用稳定的适配器槽及期望 epoch，不能使用此指针。"

msgid "NX_SUCCESS for pending/already settled cancellation; STATE for a different request. Borrow continues until SETTLED."
msgstr "取消仍待完成或已结算时返回 NX_SUCCESS；请求不匹配时为 STATE。借用持续到 SETTLED。"

msgid "Observe time/hardware completion and drain one active request."
msgstr "观察时间／硬件完成并排空一个活动请求。"

msgid "Bounded, no wait/callback; call throughout stop/drain and at the declared maximum service interval. Publication is final request access. Hardware unable to drain retains QUARANTINED."
msgstr "有界操作，无等待或回调；在 stop/drain 全程及所声明的最大 service 间隔内持续调用。发布完成是对请求的最后一次访问。硬件不能排空时保留 QUARANTINED。"

msgid "[inout] Single task/loop execution owner."
msgstr "[inout] 单一任务/主循环执行所有者。"

msgid "Read buffered RX events from the selected event profile."
msgstr "从选定事件配置读取缓冲的 RX 事件。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized event-profile port; one consumer."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的事件 profile 端口；只有一个消费者。"

msgid "[out] Caller-owned destination; not retained."
msgstr "[out] 调用方拥有的目标存储；不保留引用。"

msgid "[out] Events copied, including explicit loss/error flags."
msgstr "[out] 已复制的事件，包含显式丢失/错误标志。"

msgid "NX_SUCCESS, EMPTY or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED. IRQ produces only into configured storage; overflow never silently overwrites."
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS、EMPTY 或 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED。IRQ 只向已配置存储生产数据；溢出绝不静默覆盖。"

msgid "Read buffered bytes from the selected byte profile."
msgstr "从选定字节配置读取缓冲字节。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized byte-profile port; one consumer."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的字节 profile 端口；只有一个消费者。"

msgid "[in] Destination capacity in bytes."
msgstr "[in] 目标容量，单位为字节。"

msgid "[out] Bytes copied; valid on OVERFLOW and on a provider IO failure after copying bytes and attempting RX rearm."
msgstr "[out] 已复制的字节数；返回 OVERFLOW 时仍有效；提供者在复制字节并尝试重新启用 RX 后发生 IO 失败时也仍有效。"

msgid "NX_SUCCESS, EMPTY, OVERFLOW or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED. Byte profile reports aggregate loss without invented timestamps. A provider can return IO if RX source rearm fails after copying; count and copied bytes remain valid. Admission closes and retained hardware requires verified stop."
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS、EMPTY、OVERFLOW 或 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED。字节模式报告累计丢失，不虚构时间戳。提供者若在复制后重新启用 RX 源失败，可以返回 IO；count 和已复制字节仍有效。准入关闭，仍保留责任的硬件必须经验证停止。"

msgid "Close admission and drain TX before releasing hardware."
msgstr "关闭准入，并在释放硬件之前排空 TX。"

msgid "RX/IRQ and external consumers must quiesce before storage reclamation. No automatic task/notification destruction."
msgstr "回收存储前，RX/IRQ 和外部消费者必须静止。不自动销毁任务或通知对象。"

msgid "[inout] Owner; producers must already have quiesced."
msgstr "[inout] 所有者；生产者必须已经静止。"

msgid "NX_SUCCESS when stopped; BUSY while service must continue."
msgstr "停止后返回 NX_SUCCESS；仍须继续 service 时返回 BUSY。"

msgid "Attach or detach one explicit IRQ wake target."
msgstr "附加或解除一个显式 IRQ 唤醒目标。"

msgid "Quiesce every previous publisher before reclaiming an old target. IRQ events latch RX/completion facts before notifying. Detachment removes future publications; notification storage still requires joining external waiters and callbacks."
msgstr "回收旧目标前，须等待全部先前发布者静止。IRQ 事件在通知前锁存 RX/完成事实。解除绑定阻止未来发布；通知存储仍须等待外部等待者和回调退出。"

msgid "[in] Initialized provider, controlled by one task executor."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的 provider，由单一任务执行者控制。"

msgid "[in] Immutable live target or NULL to detach."
msgstr "[in] 不可变的活动目标；NULL 表示解除绑定。"

msgid "Success, CONTEXT outside task control, PERMISSION for unsafe actual IRQ priority, or provider STATE/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "成功；不在任务控制上下文时返回 CONTEXT；实际 IRQ 优先级不安全时返回 PERMISSION；也可能返回 provider 的 STATE/UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Start the selected RX block mode using exact caller storage."
msgstr "使用调用者准确存储启动选定 RX 块模式。"

msgid "Provider boundaries and gaps are explicit capability facts. The provider must never overwrite a borrowed consumer block."
msgstr "provider 的边界和缺口是显式能力事实。provider 绝不能覆盖被消费者借用的块。"

msgid "[in] Block-capable provider, one task execution owner."
msgstr "[in] 支持块的 provider，只有一个任务执行所有者。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized block stream retained until RX stops and all acquired consumer blocks are released."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的块流；保留到 RX 停止且全部已获取的消费者块被释放。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/BUSY/UNSUPPORTED with zero failed admission loan; selected hardware modes validate every DMA block domain."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/BUSY/UNSUPPORTED；失败准入的借用为零。所选硬件模式验证每个 DMA 块的内存域。"

msgid "Stop RX block production without revoking consumer loans."
msgstr "停止 RX 块生产，不撤销消费者借用。"

msgid "Consumers separately drain READY blocks and release loans; successful RX stop does not destroy stream or wake storage."
msgstr "消费者单独排空 READY 块并释放借用；RX stop 成功不会销毁流或 wake 存储。"

msgid "[in] Same executor as RX start; storage stays live on BUSY."
msgstr "[in] 与 RX start 相同的执行者；BUSY 时存储继续有效。"

msgid "Success proves memory sources detached; BUSY retains producer loan, UNSUPPORTED for a byte/event-only provider."
msgstr "成功证明内存访问源已撤离；BUSY 保留生产者借用；仅支持字节/事件的 provider 返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Timestamp belongs to provider clock; precision is hardware-specific."
msgstr "时间戳属于提供者时钟；精度由硬件决定。"

msgid "NO_BYTE marks status-only IRQ facts: byte is invalid. LOSS is an independent NO_BYTE boundary marker, ordered after older buffered facts and before later reception. Its timestamp is provider detection/report time, never a reconstructed timestamp for missing bytes. Byte-profile reads report aggregate loss and omit status-only facts."
msgstr "NO_BYTE 标识仅含状态的 IRQ 事实：byte 无效。LOSS 是独立的 NO_BYTE 边界标记，排在更旧的已缓冲事实之后、后续接收之前。其时间戳是 provider 检测或报告的时间，绝不是为丢失字节重建的时间戳。字节 profile 读取报告累计丢失，并省略仅含状态的事实。"

msgid "Caller-owned TX descriptor; initialize base before first prepare."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 TX 描述符；第一次 prepare 之前必须初始化 base。"

msgid "uart_format.h"
msgstr "uart_format.h"

msgid "Explicit payload, parity, stop and hardware-flow format."
msgstr "显式的载荷、校验、停止位与硬件流控格式。"

msgid "Validate the common USART-v1 subset without hardware access."
msgstr "验证公共 USART-v1 子集，不访问硬件。"

msgid "Pure, bounded, task/IRQ safe; Board admission remains separate."
msgstr "纯函数、有界，任务/IRQ 安全；Board 准入仍单独处理。"

msgid "[in] Explicit payload width, parity, stop and flow selection."
msgstr "[in] 显式载荷位宽、奇偶校验、停止位和流控选择。"

msgid "Success for 7E/O, 8N/E/O or 9N with one/two stop bits; INVALID for unknown values, UNSUPPORTED for a known incompatible combination."
msgstr "7E/O、8N/E/O 或 9N 配合一个或两个停止位时成功；未知值返回 INVALID，已知但不兼容的组合返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Immutable wire format; data_bits excludes the parity bit."
msgstr "不可变的线上格式；data_bits 不含校验位。"

msgid "RTS/CTS needs independently reviewed Board routing and peer wiring."
msgstr "RTS/CTS 需要单独审核 Board 路由及对端接线。"

msgid "uart_rs485.h"
msgstr "uart_rs485.h"

msgid "Optional single-owner RS485 direction and wire-tail adapter."
msgstr "可选单所有者 RS485 方向与线尾适配器。"

msgid "Bind exclusive transport and establish inactive DE."
msgstr "绑定独占传输端口并建立非活动 DE。"

msgid "Task-only, no wait. No physical transceiver is inferred. Setup starts after successful DE assertion; hold starts after acquire-observed true transport settlement. Transfer deadline includes setup and wire completion; mandatory drain/hold may extend the borrow beyond that deadline. Rejected TX leaves DE and transport unchanged. Failed drain or DE withdrawal keeps QUARANTINED outer storage and DE ownership until service retry."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，不等待。不推定物理收发器存在。成功置有效 DE 后开始 setup；通过 acquire 语义观测到传输真正结算后才开始 hold。传输时限包括 setup 和线路完成；必须执行的 drain/hold 可使借用持续到该时限之后。TX 被拒绝时 DE 和传输接口均不变。排空或 DE 撤离失败时，保留 QUARANTINED 外层存储及 DE 所有权，直到 service 重试。"

msgid "[inout] Fresh zero-initialized caller control."
msgstr "[inout] 调用方拥有的全新零初始化控制对象。"

msgid "[in] Immutable lifetime binding; one authorized DE bit, real board polarity, setup/hold in nx_time_now_us domain."
msgstr "[in] 生命周期内不可变的绑定；一个获授权的 DE 位、实际板级极性，以及 nx_time_now_us 域中的 setup/hold。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/GPIO failure, no TX loan."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/GPIO 失败；无 TX 借用。"

msgid "Immutable selected electrical/timing facts, no task or heap."
msgstr "不可变的选定电气／时序事实，不含任务或堆。"

msgid "Configuration, faces, ops and context identities cannot change while bound. They are disjoint from mutable adapter, request and payload storage; exact pin ownership is external."
msgstr "绑定期间，配置、接口、ops 及 context 身份不得改变。它们与可变适配器、请求及载荷存储分离；精确引脚所有权由外部负责。"

msgid "Caller-owned opt-in adapter, zero-initialize before init."
msgstr "调用者显式选择的适配器，init 前零初始化。"

msgid "Control is private after initialization. Immutable config, both faces, pin ownership and all storage outlive successful stop plus external observers. Default UART state is unchanged."
msgstr "初始化后控制对象为私有。不可变配置、两个接口、引脚所有权及全部存储，须保持有效直到 stop 成功且外部观测者退出。默认 UART 状态不变。"

msgid "uart_word.h"
msgstr "uart_word.h"

msgid "Independent nine-bit face and caller-owned word requests."
msgstr "独立的九位接口与调用者拥有的字请求。"

msgid "Prepare an unborrowed nine-bit payload, without admitting it."
msgstr "准备尚未借用的九位载荷，不执行准入。"

msgid "Task owner; payload values are checked before provider admission."
msgstr "任务所有者；载荷值在 provider 准入前检查。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized READY or consumed SETTLED descriptor."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的 READY 或已消费的 SETTLED 描述符。"

msgid "[in] Aligned immutable words, disjoint from the descriptor."
msgstr "[in] 已对齐的不可变字数组，与描述符分离。"

msgid "[in] Positive word count, representable as a byte extent."
msgstr "[in] 正数字数，可表示为字节范围。"

msgid "[in] Absolute nx_time_now_us monotonic transfer deadline."
msgstr "[in] nx_time_now_us 单调域中的绝对传输时限。"

msgid "Success, INVALID or STATE; rejection retains no references/effects."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝时不保留引用，也不产生副作用。"

msgid "Admit one READY request to the single unmasked task executor."
msgstr "将一个 READY 请求准入唯一、未屏蔽中断的任务执行者。"

msgid "Counts use words; completion requires actual wire TC."
msgstr "计数以字为单位；完成要求实际线路 TC。"

msgid "[in] Live initialized face, private state and IRQ binding."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的活动接口、私有状态及 IRQ 绑定。"

msgid "[inout] Caller-owned descriptor, borrowed on success."
msgstr "[inout] 调用方拥有的描述符；成功时借用。"

msgid "Success means ACCEPTED; rejection has no borrow/hardware effects."
msgstr "成功表示 ACCEPTED；拒绝时不借用，也不产生硬件副作用。"

msgid "Transfer an adapter's QUEUED borrow without readmission."
msgstr "接管适配器的 QUEUED 借用，不再次准入。"

msgid "[in] Live single-owner face."
msgstr "[in] 活动的单所有者接口。"

msgid "[inout] Existing adapter borrow."
msgstr "[inout] 已有适配器借用。"

msgid "Success transfers execution; BUSY leaves QUEUED and its borrow."
msgstr "成功转移执行权；BUSY 保留 QUEUED 及其借用。"

msgid "Request cancellation without revoking request/payload ownership."
msgstr "请求取消，不撤销请求／载荷的所有权。"

msgid "Continue service through drain; failed drain stays QUARANTINED."
msgstr "排空期间继续 service；排空失败时保留 QUARANTINED。"

msgid "[in] Same unmasked task executor as submit/service."
msgstr "[in] 与 submit/service 相同的中断未屏蔽任务执行者。"

msgid "[inout] Live request; cross-task control uses a stable slot."
msgstr "[inout] 活动请求；跨任务控制使用稳定的槽。"

msgid "Success for this request, STATE for a different live request."
msgstr "当前请求返回成功；其他活动请求返回 STATE。"

msgid "Perform bounded owner-driven deadline, drain and settlement work."
msgstr "由所有者执行有界的截止时间、排空与结清工作。"

msgid "IRQ only publishes facts; SETTLED is final provider access. No wait, hidden worker or callback; obey the declared maximum service gap."
msgstr "IRQ 仅发布事实；SETTLED 是 provider 的最后一次访问。无等待、隐藏工作任务或回调；须遵守所声明的最大 service 间隔。"

msgid "[in] Single unmasked task owner, kept alive through stop."
msgstr "[in] 单一中断未屏蔽任务所有者，保持有效直到 stop 完成。"

msgid "Copy words without retaining destination storage."
msgstr "复制字，不持续借用目标存储。"

msgid "Loss does not invent a hardware timestamp or missing word count."
msgstr "丢失不会虚构硬件时间戳，也不会虚构缺失字数。"

msgid "[in] Initialized face, one consumer under the task executor."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的接口，由任务执行者控制且只有一个消费者。"

msgid "[out] Aligned destination, disjoint from provider/RX storage."
msgstr "[out] 已对齐的目标，与 provider/RX 存储分离。"

msgid "[in] Positive destination capacity in words."
msgstr "[in] 正数目标容量，单位为字。"

msgid "[out] Number copied, including on OVERFLOW."
msgstr "[out] 已复制数量；OVERFLOW 时也有效。"

msgid "Success, EMPTY, OVERFLOW, INVALID, CONTEXT or STATE."
msgstr "成功、EMPTY、OVERFLOW、INVALID、CONTEXT 或 STATE。"

msgid "Close admission and stop after active TX and IRQ sources drain."
msgstr "关闭准入，并在活动 TX 与 IRQ 源排空后停止。"

msgid "Caller joins any in-flight IRQ before reclaiming provider storage."
msgstr "回收 provider 存储前，调用方须等待全部正在执行的 IRQ 退出。"

msgid "[in] One task owner; external producers/observers quiesced."
msgstr "[in] 单一任务所有者；外部生产者和观测者已静止。"

msgid "Success after hardware detach; BUSY while service must continue."
msgstr "硬件引用撤离后成功；仍须继续 service 时返回 BUSY。"

msgid "Each uint16_t contains 0..511; count excludes bytes and parity."
msgstr "每个 uint16_t 包含 0..511；按字计数，不以字节计且不包含校验位。"

msgid "Request and unchanged payload are borrowed until acquire SETTLED."
msgstr "请求及保持不变的载荷持续被借用，直到以 acquire 语义观测到 SETTLED。"

msgid "Independent immutable face; default byte face/state do not grow."
msgstr "独立不可变接口；默认字节接口／状态不增加。"

msgid "Static identity; lookup does not allocate, discover or initialize."
msgstr "静态身份；查找不分配、不发现设备，也不初始化。"

msgid "uart_wire.h"
msgstr "uart_wire.h"

msgid "Explicit USART wire personalities and LIN break requests."
msgstr "显式 USART wire personality 与 LIN break 请求。"

msgid "A controller personality, independent of an application protocol."
msgstr "一种 controller personality，独立于应用协议。"

msgid "Prepare an unborrowed descriptor for one LIN 13-bit break."
msgstr "为一个 LIN 13-bit break 准备未被借用的描述符。"

msgid "Submit only to an explicitly selected LIN provider. The ordinary UART submit/cancel/service/stop contract applies, including retained borrow until real TC and withdrawal precede SETTLED. No LIN data is appended."
msgstr "只能提交给显式选择的 LIN provider。普通 UART submit／cancel／service／stop 合同仍适用，包括持续保留借用，直到真实 TC 和来源撤回都先于 SETTLED 完成。不追加 LIN 数据。"

msgid "[in] Absolute nx_time_now_us deadline including wire tail."
msgstr "[in] 绝对 nx_time_now_us deadline，含 wire tail。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE. No payload is retained by preparation."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID／STATE。Prepare 不保留 payload。"

msgid "Immutable cold wire settings; unused fields must be zero."
msgstr "不可变冷态 wire 设置；未使用字段必须为零。"

msgid "Synchronous mode is master only; RX requires transmitting clock data. Half duplex and Smartcard require an authorized open-drain TX pad. LIN exposes raw break and byte events, without a LIN schedule/stack. IrDA uses SIR up to 115200 baud. The product owns optical turnaround, external transceiver settling and exclusion of concurrent reception. Smartcard uses one 8E1.5 character per TX request, with NACK/error reporting; card power, reset, ATR and retries belong to the product."
msgstr "同步模式只支持 master；RX 要求发送时钟数据。半双工和 Smartcard 要求已授权的 open-drain TX pad。LIN 提供原始 break 和 byte event，不提供 LIN schedule／stack。IrDA 使用最高 115200 baud 的 SIR。产品负责光学 turnaround、外部 transceiver settling 以及排除并发接收。Smartcard 每个 TX 请求使用一个 8E1.5 character，并报告 NACK／错误；卡电源、reset、ATR 和重试由产品负责。"

msgid "usb_activation.h"
msgstr "usb_activation.h"

msgid "Optional explicit nonzero USB endpoint activation."
msgstr "可选的非零 USB endpoint 显式激活接口。"

msgid "Explicitly activate or deactivate one selected nonzero direction."
msgstr "显式激活或反激活一个已选定的非零 endpoint 方向。"

msgid "No request or buffer is borrowed. Existing loans must be explicitly cancelled and drained before target changes; failure never revokes other loans. Configuration/class policy remains external."
msgstr "不借用任何 request 或 buffer。目标变更之前，必须显式取消并排空该目标的既有借用；失败从不撤销其他借用。配置／类策略仍由外部负责。"

msgid "[in] Started serialized privileged Task owner, IRQ masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 已启动；由序列化特权 Task owner 调用，进入时 IRQ masks 须 clear。"

msgid "[in] Current software USB epoch; cold epoch zero is valid."
msgstr "[in] 当前软件 USB epoch；冷态 epoch 0 合法。"

msgid "[in] USB address byte; EP0 is not admitted."
msgstr "[in] USB 地址字节；不准入 EP0。"

msgid "[in] Requested active state, never packet submission."
msgstr "[in] 请求的 active 状态；此操作从不提交 packet。"

msgid "Success after proof; UNSUPPORTED when the operation is absent. INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY reject before writes. IO may have partial effects and closes controller admission until explicit recovery."
msgstr "证明成立后成功；操作缺失时返回 UNSUPPORTED。INVALID／CONTEXT／STATE／BUSY 在写入前拒绝。IO 可能已有部分效果，并关闭 controller 准入，直到显式恢复。"

msgid "Optional controller operation; absence means UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "可选的 controller 操作；操作缺失时返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

msgid "Immutable borrowed face, using the existing controller context."
msgstr "不可变的借用 face，使用既有 controller context。"

msgid "usb_device.h"
msgstr "usb_device.h"

msgid "Full-speed device packets and caller-owned endpoint loans."
msgstr "全速设备数据包与调用者拥有的端点借用。"

msgid "Prepare one IN packet without reading or borrowing its bytes."
msgstr "准备一个 IN 数据包，不读取或借用其字节。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized unborrowed request."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且未借出的请求。"

msgid "[in] Immutable packet bytes, NULL only for zero length."
msgstr "[in] 不可变报文字节；仅在长度为零时允许 NULL。"

msgid "[in] Packet length, no automatic terminating ZLP."
msgstr "[in] 报文长度；不自动追加终止 ZLP。"

msgid "[in] DATA or control STATUS; STATUS must be zero length."
msgstr "[in] DATA 或控制 STATUS；STATUS 长度必须为零。"

msgid "[in] Current SETUP epoch for EP0, zero for nonzero endpoints."
msgstr "[in] EP0 使用当前 SETUP epoch；非零端点使用零。"

msgid "[in] Absolute independent monotonic clock deadline."
msgstr "[in] 独立单调时钟中的绝对时限。"

msgid "Success, INVALID or STATE; rejection retains no references."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝时不保留引用。"

msgid "Prepare an OUT packet capacity without modifying its storage."
msgstr "准备 OUT 数据包容量，不修改其存储。"

msgid "[out] Borrowed until SETTLED only after accepted submission."
msgstr "[out] 仅在提交被接受后借用，持续到 SETTLED。"

msgid "[in] At most endpoint MPS; short packets complete normally."
msgstr "[in] 最多为端点 MPS；短包正常完成。"

msgid "[in] DATA or zero-capacity control STATUS."
msgstr "[in] DATA 或容量为零的控制 STATUS。"

msgid "Success, INVALID or STATE; rejection creates no borrow."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝时不建立借用。"

msgid "Admit one packet, never a hidden queue or complete USB transaction."
msgstr "仅准入一个数据包，不隐式建立队列或执行完整 USB 事务。"

msgid "[in] Stable endpoint face and private state."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的端点接口及私有状态。"

msgid "[inout] READY packet, buffers alive until acquire SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] READY 报文；缓冲须保持有效，直到以 acquire 语义观测到 SETTLED。"

msgid "Success means ACCEPTED; fourth-party buffers are not copied early."
msgstr "成功表示 ACCEPTED；第四方缓冲不会被提前复制。"

msgid "Request endpoint disable/drain without revoking a buffer loan."
msgstr "请求端点禁用／排空，不撤销缓冲区借用。"

msgid "Control OUT0 has no hardware disable command: cancellation may require full device stop to settle. Missing proof becomes QUARANTINED. Reset/SETUP invalidates epochs but releases only after actual source drain."
msgstr "控制 OUT0 没有硬件禁用命令：取消可能需要完整停止设备才能结算。缺少证明时进入 QUARANTINED。Reset/SETUP 使 epoch 失效，但只有实际源排空后才释放借用。"

msgid "[inout] Live request accepted by this exact endpoint."
msgstr "[inout] 由此精确端点接受的活动请求。"

msgid "Success requests drain; failures retain all prior accepted loans."
msgstr "成功表示请求排空；失败时保留全部先前接受的借用。"

msgid "Set/clear STALL only after the endpoint has no live transfer."
msgstr "仅端点无存活传输时设置／清除 STALL。"

msgid "[in] Serialized owner, started and IRQ masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 已启动的串行化所有者，IRQ 屏蔽须解除。"

msgid "[in] Desired STALL; clearing bulk/interrupt resets DATA0."
msgstr "[in] 期望的 STALL；清除 bulk/interrupt STALL 时同时复位 DATA0。"

msgid "Task-only bounded progress; deadline never depends on USB SOF."
msgstr "仅 Task 有界推进；截止时间绝不依赖 USB SOF。"

msgid "[in] Serialized privileged owner with incoming IRQ masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 串行化特权所有者；进入时 IRQ 屏蔽须解除。"

msgid "Success requests progress; no clock/endpoint loan is released early."
msgstr "成功表示请求推进；不提前释放时钟或端点借用。"

msgid "Consume bounded value events; output is never retained."
msgstr "消费有界值事件，绝不保留输出。"

msgid "Invalid/STATE rejection leaves both outputs unchanged."
msgstr "Invalid/STATE 拒绝时，两个输出均保持不变。"

msgid "[in] Single task consumer and stable controller."
msgstr "[in] 单一任务消费者及稳定控制器。"

msgid "[out] Caller records disjoint from provider and live loans."
msgstr "[out] 调用方记录，与 provider 及活动借用分离。"

msgid "[in] Positive output count."
msgstr "[in] 正数输出数量。"

msgid "[out] Disjoint count output; EMPTY means zero."
msgstr "[out] 独立的计数输出；EMPTY 表示零。"

msgid "Success, EMPTY or rejection; authoritative latest SETUP is in state."
msgstr "成功、EMPTY 或拒绝；state 中的最新 SETUP 才是权威事实。"

msgid "Task-only authoritative snapshot, independent of event-ring space."
msgstr "仅 Task 的权威快照，与事件环可用空间无关。"

msgid "[in] Serialized privileged owner with IRQ masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 串行化特权所有者，IRQ 屏蔽须解除。"

msgid "[out] Disjoint caller snapshot, never retained."
msgstr "[out] 与其他存储分离的调用方快照；不保留引用。"

msgid "Success copies state; alias/context rejection leaves output unchanged."
msgstr "成功时复制状态；别名或上下文检查拒绝时输出不变。"

msgid "Stage SET_ADDRESS for the matching zero-data standard SETUP."
msgstr "为匹配的零数据标准 SETUP 暂存 SET_ADDRESS。"

msgid "[in] Serialized privileged controller owner."
msgstr "[in] 串行化特权控制器所有者。"

msgid "[in] Current SETUP identity."
msgstr "[in] 当前 SETUP 身份。"

msgid "[in] 0..127, matching SETUP wValue."
msgstr "[in] 0..127，与 SETUP wValue 匹配。"

msgid "Success stages only; address applies after real status-IN XFRC."
msgstr "成功仅暂存地址；实际 status-IN XFRC 后地址才生效。"

msgid "Attach/detach a borrowed task/IRQ-compatible wake hint."
msgstr "附加／解除被借用且兼容 Task/IRQ 的唤醒提示。"

msgid "[in] Started serialized owner with IRQ masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 已启动的串行化所有者，IRQ 屏蔽须解除。"

msgid "[in] Immutable target, or NULL to detach."
msgstr "[in] 不可变目标；NULL 表示解除绑定。"

msgid "[in] Additional numerical IRQ priority floor."
msgstr "[in] 附加的 IRQ 优先级数值下限。"

msgid "Success after actual priority policy checks, BUSY while publisher remains live; rejection retains no new sink."
msgstr "实际优先级策略检查通过后成功；发布者仍活动时返回 BUSY；拒绝时不保留新接收器。"

msgid "Disconnect, disable, drain, detach IRQs, then release clock consumer."
msgstr "断开连接、禁用、排空、撤离 IRQ，再释放时钟消费者。"

msgid "PIO OUT0 may remain enabled: successful global stop proves disconnect, OUT NAK, no DMA, empty RX FIFO, IRQ withdrawal and publisher join before final SETTLED. No forced reset revokes an unproved accepted borrow."
msgstr "PIO OUT0 可以继续启用：全局 stop 成功意味着在最终 SETTLED 前已证明断开连接、OUT NAK、无 DMA、RX FIFO 为空、IRQ 引用撤离且发布者退出。强制复位不能撤销尚未证明安全释放的已接受借用。"

msgid "Success ends provider access to endpoint/ring/wake storage; BUSY retains all storage and 48MHz ownership until actual progress."
msgstr "成功结束 provider 对端点/环/wake 存储的访问；BUSY 保留全部存储及 48MHz 所有权，直到实际推进。"

msgid "UNKNOWN after reset; ENUMERATED publishes the observed speed."
msgstr "复位后为 UNKNOWN；ENUMERATED 发布观察到的速度。"

msgid "Shared readonly packet methods; context is a selected endpoint."
msgstr "共享只读数据包方法；上下文为选定端点。"

msgid "Controller identity remains separate from endpoint identities."
msgstr "控制器身份与端点身份保持分离。"

msgid "usb_host.h"
msgstr "usb_host.h"

msgid "Explicit USB host channels and caller-owned packet loans."
msgstr "显式 USB Host 通道与调用者拥有的包借用。"

msgid "Prepare a host packet without accessing or borrowing its bytes."
msgstr "准备 Host 包，不访问或借用其字节。"

msgid "[inout] Initialized unborrowed storage."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且未被借用的存储。"

msgid "[inout] Packet buffer; NULL only for zero OUT packets."
msgstr "[inout] 包 buffer；仅零长度 OUT 包允许 NULL。"

msgid "[in] Actual writable IN storage or readable OUT extent."
msgstr "[in] 实际可写 IN 存储或可读 OUT 范围。"

msgid "[in] Requested packet bytes, at most the configured MPS."
msgstr "[in] 所请求的包字节数，最多为已配置 MPS。"

msgid "[in] Eight-byte SETUP token on an OUT control channel."
msgstr "[in] OUT control 通道上的八字节 SETUP token。"

msgid "[in] Explicit data toggle for a DATA transaction."
msgstr "[in] DATA 事务的显式 data toggle。"

msgid "[in] Absolute Core deadline, independent of USB SOF."
msgstr "[in] 绝对 Core deadline，独立于 USB SOF。"

msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE; rejection retains no storage."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝不保留存储。"

msgid "Configure an idle selected hardware channel for one endpoint target."
msgstr "为空闲的所选硬件通道配置一个 endpoint 目标。"

msgid "Serialized privileged unmasked task; no hub split transaction policy."
msgstr "串行调用的特权、未屏蔽中断 task；不提供 hub split 事务策略。"

msgid "[in] Stable controller face, successful external power handover."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的 controller face，外部供电交接已成功。"

msgid "[in] Selected physical channel index, separate from endpoint."
msgstr "[in] 所选物理通道索引，与 endpoint 独立。"

msgid "[in] Readable target facts, copied before return."
msgstr "[in] 可读目标事实，返回前复制。"

msgid "SUCCESS or rejection; no transfer buffer is borrowed."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或拒绝；不借用传输 buffer。"

msgid "Release an idle channel after its IRQ and hardware references drain."
msgstr "IRQ 和硬件引用排空后释放空闲通道。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized controller owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行调用的 controller owner。"

msgid "[in] Selected hardware index."
msgstr "[in] 所选硬件索引。"

msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY or rejection; failure retains channel responsibility."
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY 或拒绝；失败保留通道责任。"

msgid "Admit one packet with no implicit retry or terminating ZLP."
msgstr "准入一个包，不隐式重试或发送结束 ZLP。"

msgid "IN capacity must cover MPS. DMA buffers also require aligned reviewed DMA-visible storage. NAK/NYET settles as NACK for explicit caller retry."
msgstr "IN capacity 必须覆盖 MPS。DMA buffer 还须使用已审、对齐且 DMA 可达的存储。NAK／NYET 以 NACK 结算，由调用者显式重试。"

msgid "[in] Stable started controller and privileged task executor."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、已启动的 controller 与特权 task 执行者。"

msgid "[in] Configured selected hardware channel."
msgstr "[in] 已配置的所选硬件通道。"

msgid "[inout] READY request alive until acquire-observed SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] READY 请求，持续有效直到 acquire 观察 SETTLED。"

msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; rejection has no retained references."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；拒绝不保留引用。"

msgid "Request channel halt without revoking a packet loan."
msgstr "请求通道 halt，不撤销包借用。"

msgid "[in] Original selected hardware channel."
msgstr "[in] 原所选硬件通道。"

msgid "[inout] Exact accepted incarnation, still alive."
msgstr "[inout] 已被接受且仍有效的精确 incarnation。"

msgid "SUCCESS requests drain; failed drain retains the same request."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示已请求排空；排空失败保留同一个 request。"

msgid "Advance all selected channels with bounded task work."
msgstr "以有界 task 工作推进全部所选通道。"

msgid "A callback alone never proves buffer release. No worker is created."
msgstr "单凭 callback 不能证明 buffer 已归还。不创建 worker。"

msgid "[in] Stable privileged unmasked task owner."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、特权且未屏蔽中断的 task owner。"

msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY; late hardware progress can settle quarantine."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 BUSY；迟到的硬件进展可能使隔离请求结算。"

msgid "Read host connection and frame facts without retaining output."
msgstr "读取 Host 连接与 frame 事实，不保留输出。"

msgid "After successful stop, cold facts are copied without gated MMIO."
msgstr "成功 stop 后复制冷态事实，不访问已门控的 MMIO。"

msgid "[out] Disjoint caller storage, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 不重叠的调用者存储，拒绝时保持原值。"

msgid "SUCCESS or rejection; no physical speed qualification is inferred."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或拒绝；不据此推导物理速度资格。"

msgid "Reset a connected idle port using the independent absolute deadline."
msgstr "使用独立的绝对 deadline 复位已连接的空闲端口。"

msgid "[in] Same controller owner; all channel loans are settled."
msgstr "[in] 同一个 controller owner；全部通道借用均已结算。"

msgid "[in] Finite absolute Core deadline."
msgstr "[in] 有限的绝对 Core deadline。"

msgid "SUCCESS or failure; reset never revokes an active request."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或失败；reset 不撤销活跃 request。"

msgid "Suspend or resume an idle host port without stopping Core time."
msgstr "挂起或恢复空闲 Host 端口，不停止 Core 时间。"

msgid "[in] Same serialized owner with settled channel loans."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行调用的 owner，通道借用已结算。"

msgid "[in] Requested suspended state."
msgstr "[in] 所请求的挂起状态。"

msgid "SUCCESS after readback or failure retaining controller ownership."
msgstr "读回成功后返回 SUCCESS；失败保留 controller 所有权。"

msgid "Halt, drain FIFOs/DMA, detach IRQ and release the host transport."
msgstr "Halt、排空 FIFO／DMA、解绑 IRQ，再释放 Host transport。"

msgid "External VBUS power must remain authorized until successful stop. Power switch control belongs to the explicit role/power owner."
msgstr "外部 VBUS 供电授权必须持续到 stop 成功。电源开关控制由显式 role／power owner 负责。"

msgid "[in] Same owner, observers independently joined by caller."
msgstr "[in] 同一 owner，观察者由调用者独立 join。"

msgid "SUCCESS ends transport access; failure retains all required state."
msgstr "SUCCESS 结束 transport 访问；失败保留全部所需状态。"

msgid "A single USB packet; no automatic retry, queue or class policy."
msgstr "单个 USB 包；没有自动重试、队列或 class 策略。"

msgid "IN capacity covers a complete MPS rounded up to four bytes, even for a shorter requested length. OUT capacity covers length rounded to four bytes; DMA zero-length OUT also supplies four readable bytes, since the core rounds HCTSIZ to whole packets. The provider may report OVERFLOW while safely draining a packet larger than requested length."
msgstr "即使请求 length 更短，IN capacity 也须覆盖向上取整为四字节倍数的完整 MPS。OUT capacity 覆盖向上取整为四字节倍数的 length；DMA 零长度 OUT 还须提供四个可读字节，因为 core 将 HCTSIZ 向上取整到整包。provider 可以在安全排空超出请求 length 的包后报告 OVERFLOW。"

msgid "usb_otg.h"
msgstr "usb_otg.h"

msgid "Explicit managed USB role and generation-bound face access."
msgstr "显式 managed USB 角色与按 generation 约束的 face 访问。"

msgid "Request an explicit role using the acquire-observed generation."
msgstr "使用 acquire 观察到的 generation 请求显式角色。"

msgid "[in] Stable initialized composite owner, serialized task only."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且已初始化的 composite owner，仅由 task 串行调用。"

msgid "[in] Current generation; stale controls reject purely."
msgstr "[in] 当前 generation；旧控制纯拒绝。"

msgid "[in] OFF, DEVICE or HOST; no ID/SRP/HNP policy is inferred."
msgstr "[in] OFF、DEVICE 或 HOST；不推定 ID／SRP／HNP 策略。"

msgid "[in] Finite absolute Core deadline for the handover."
msgstr "[in] 交接的有限绝对 Core deadline。"

msgid "SUCCESS accepts; failed drain never revokes old packet loans."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示接受；排空失败绝不撤销旧包借用。"

msgid "Advance one bounded role, drain and power observation step."
msgstr "推进一个有界角色、排空与供电观察步骤。"

msgid "[in] Same privileged unmasked task and stable owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一个特权、未屏蔽中断的 task 与稳定 owner。"

msgid "BUSY while pending, or final transition/latched power error."
msgstr "pending 时返回 BUSY，否则返回最终转换结果／锁存的供电错误。"

msgid "Copy authoritative role facts without hardware side effects."
msgstr "复制权威角色事实，不产生硬件副作用。"

msgid "[in] Stable owner; factory lookup never initializes it."
msgstr "[in] 稳定 owner；factory 查询不初始化它。"

msgid "SUCCESS or rejection before modifying caller storage."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或在修改调用者存储前拒绝。"

msgid "Return the stable Device face only in its ready current generation."
msgstr "仅在当前 generation 已 ready 时返回稳定的 Device face。"

msgid "[in] Stable initialized owner."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且已初始化的 owner。"

msgid "[in] Current generation obtained from state."
msgstr "[in] 从 state 获取的当前 generation。"

msgid "Existing immutable face or NULL; never starts a transport."
msgstr "已有不可变 face 或 NULL；不启动 transport。"

msgid "Return the stable Host face only in its ready current generation."
msgstr "仅在当前 generation 已 ready 时返回稳定的 Host face。"

msgid "usb_profile.h"
msgstr "usb_profile.h"

msgid "Selected-only immutable USB facts."
msgstr "仅针对选定实例的不可变 USB 事实。"

msgid "Selection facts are not observed physical qualification."
msgstr "选定事实不构成经实际观测建立的物理资格。"

msgid "Validate exact selected FS/HS facts without observing the controller."
msgstr "校验精确的选定 FS/HS 事实，不观测 controller。"

msgid "[in] Stable readable immutable facts, faces and endpoint array."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、可读且不可变的事实、face 及 endpoint 数组。"

msgid "Success or INVALID, including misaligned public metadata; no allocation, MMIO, discovery or lifecycle effect."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID，公共元数据未对齐也会拒绝；不分配内存，不访问 MMIO，不发现设备，也不影响生命周期。"

msgid "Find a direction in a previously validated immutable profile."
msgstr "在先前已校验的不可变 profile 中查找一个方向。"

msgid "Task/ISR read-only bounded lookup; all input lifetimes remain external."
msgstr "在 Task／ISR 中执行只读有界查找；所有输入的生命周期仍由外部管理。"

msgid "[in] Stable validated selected facts and endpoint array."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、已校验的选定事实及 endpoint 数组。"

msgid "[in] Endpoint number, independent of direction."
msgstr "[in] 与方向独立的 endpoint 编号。"

msgid "[in] IN direction when true; OUT when false."
msgstr "[in] true 表示 IN 方向；false 表示 OUT 方向。"

msgid "Selected stable member or NULL, including misaligned profile/array metadata. No new endpoint can be discovered."
msgstr "返回选定的稳定成员或 NULL；profile／array 元数据未对齐时也返回 NULL。不能发现新 endpoint。"

msgid "Reject one published SETUP epoch by a checked EP0 IN STALL."
msgstr "通过经检查的 EP0 IN STALL 拒绝一个已发布的 SETUP epoch。"

msgid "Same privileged unmasked single task executor. The provider checks its published epoch and performs STALL in one local IRQ critical section, preserving the incoming mask. This excludes an already software-published replacement SETUP; it does not promise atomicity with physical bus packets not yet collected by the IRQ. No cancellation, global stop, allocation, class policy or address commit is implicit."
msgstr "使用同一个特权单 Task 执行者，进入时中断未屏蔽。provider 在同一局部 IRQ 临界区中检查其已发布的 epoch 并执行 STALL，保留进入时的 mask。该保护排除已由软件发布的替代 SETUP；不保证与尚未被 IRQ 采集的物理总线包之间的原子性。不隐含取消、全局停止、内存分配、class 策略或地址提交。"

msgid "[in] Stable selected decision face, same controller owner."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的选定 decision face，使用同一个 controller owner。"

msgid "[in] Nonzero software-published SETUP identity to reject."
msgstr "[in] 要拒绝的非零、已由软件发布的 SETUP 身份。"

msgid "Success after guarded STALL readback; STATE for a superseded epoch/closing source, BUSY while either EP0 packet is live, INVALID for malformed metadata, CONTEXT for an invalid executor, IO for failed STALL readback, or UNSUPPORTED without the optional operation. Rejection retains no loan."
msgstr "guard 检查及 STALL 读回成功后返回成功；epoch 已被替代或源正在 closing 时返回 STATE，任一 EP0 packet 仍活动时返回 BUSY，元数据不合法时返回 INVALID，执行者不合法时返回 CONTEXT，STALL 读回失败时返回 IO，未提供可选操作时返回 UNSUPPORTED。拒绝不保留借用。"

msgid "Optional epoch-bound EP0 rejection, separate from generic ops."
msgstr "可选的 epoch 绑定 EP0 拒绝接口，与 generic ops 独立。"

msgid "wake.h"
msgstr "wake.h"

msgid "Explicit borrowed IRQ wake target and syscall-ceiling check."
msgstr "显式借用 IRQ 唤醒目标与系统调用阈值检查。"

msgid "Explicit kernel interrupt-mask policy, independent of any RTOS."
msgstr "显式内核中断屏蔽策略，独立于任何 RTOS。"

msgid "Validate actual IRQ facts against an explicit kernel policy."
msgstr "依据显式内核策略验证实际 IRQ 事实。"

msgid "Cold check without attachment or callback effects. No kernel target is accepted by NONE. PRIMASK permits every valid configurable IRQ with its fixed zero priority group. Kernel-calling BASEPRI targets require the maintained preemption grouping and a numerical priority at least the ceiling. Nonkernel hints do not impose kernel grouping. Binding does not authorize future CPU-context violations."
msgstr "无绑定或回调副作用的冷检查。NONE 不接受任何会调用内核的目标。PRIMASK 在固定为零的优先级分组下允许全部有效可配置 IRQ。会调用内核的 BASEPRI 目标要求已维护的抢占分组，且优先级数值不小于阈值。非内核提示不强制内核分组。绑定不授权后续违反 CPU 上下文要求的操作。"

msgid "[in] Optional immutable target; NULL disables notification."
msgstr "[in] 可选不可变目标；NULL 禁用通知。"

msgid "[in] Immutable validated CPU and kernel configuration."
msgstr "[in] 已验证的不可变 CPU 和内核配置。"

msgid "[in] External IRQ number, unshifted priority and group."
msgstr "[in] 外部 IRQ 编号、未移位的优先级及分组。"

msgid "Success, INVALID for malformed facts/target, PERMISSION for a kernel-calling target in an unsafe interrupt domain."
msgstr "成功；事实或目标格式错误时返回 INVALID；会调用内核的目标处于不安全中断域时返回 PERMISSION。"

msgid "Deliver one bounded hint after authoritative state is latched."
msgstr "权威状态锁存后发送一个有界提示。"

msgid "Task/IRQ as allowed by the target, no hidden task or retry. A failed wake does not revoke state or request ownership."
msgstr "按目标允许的任务/IRQ 上下文执行，无隐藏任务或重试。wake 失败不撤销状态，也不撤销请求所有权。"

msgid "[in] Previously validated live target or NULL."
msgstr "[in] 先前已验证的活动目标或 NULL。"

msgid "Callback result, success for NULL, INVALID for a bad target."
msgstr "回调结果；NULL 返回成功；无效目标返回 INVALID。"

msgid "Optional immutable wake target borrowed by an IRQ provider."
msgstr "IRQ 提供者借用的可选不可变唤醒目标。"

msgid "notify runs in publisher context and must be bounded and legal in that IRQ. Storage and context outlive all publishers. Stop and join publishers before destroying the sink. A wake is only a hint; latched RX/request predicates stay authoritative."
msgstr "notify 在发布者上下文中运行，必须有界且在该 IRQ 中合法。存储及 context 须比全部发布者存活更久。销毁接收器前，须停止并等待发布者退出。wake 仅为提示；已锁存的 RX/请求谓词仍为权威依据。"

msgid "Immutable CPU and kernel facts for cold wake binding."
msgstr "用于冷态唤醒绑定的不可变 CPU 与内核事实。"

msgid "NONE and PRIMASK require a zero syscall ceiling. BASEPRI requires a nonzero unshifted ceiling. Configuration owns these facts; a wake target cannot weaken them."
msgstr "NONE 和 PRIMASK 要求 syscall 阈值为零。BASEPRI 要求非零且未移位的阈值。配置拥有这些事实；wake 目标不能放宽它们。"

msgid "Actual publisher facts read before attaching any borrowed sink."
msgstr "附加任何被借用的接收端之前读取实际发布者事实。"

msgid "watchdog.h"
msgstr "watchdog.h"

msgid "Irreversible watchdog effects and neutral hardware reset causes."
msgstr "不可逆的看门狗效应与中立的硬件复位原因。"

msgid "Enable the selected watchdog and report its effect and known timing bounds; activation is irreversible."
msgstr "启用所选看门狗，报告其效应及已知时间界限；激活不可逆。"

msgid "Success establishes nominal hardware programming, not a guaranteed deadline. Both timeout bounds remain zero when oscillator limits are unknown. A product requiring bounded timing must admit the oscillator profile before activation. Enable runs in a privileged task and is serialized with feed, state and platform stop. Install IRQ feeding only after this call returns; activation does not support a concurrent reload during shadow-register programming. A window provider rejects timeouts that leave no admitted feed window. Counter ticks and unknown prescaler phase do not establish an exact wall-clock interval."
msgstr "成功证明标称硬件编程已完成，不保证时限。振荡器界限未知时，两个超时界限均保持零。需要有界时序的产品必须在激活前准入振荡器配置。Enable 在特权任务中执行，并与 feed、state 和 platform stop 串行化。仅在本调用返回后才可安装 IRQ 喂狗；激活不支持在影子寄存器编程期间并发重载。 窗口 provider 会拒绝不能留下合法喂狗窗口的 timeout。计数器 tick 与未知预分频相位不能建立精确的实际时间间隔。"

msgid "[inout] Fixed provider; product owns feed/recovery policy."
msgstr "[inout] 固定 provider；产品拥有喂狗和恢复策略。"

msgid "[in] Requested nominal timeout in maintained range."
msgstr "[in] 所请求的标称超时，须处于已维护范围内。"

msgid "[in] Requested CPU-managed debug-freeze setting; external debugger configuration is outside this request."
msgstr "[in] 请求由 CPU 管理的调试冻结设置；外部调试器配置不属于此请求。"

msgid "[out] Actual timeout bounds and remaining effect, including enabled=true when later setup reports failure after enabling."
msgstr "[out] 实际超时界限及剩余副作用；若启用后后续配置失败，也包括 enabled=true。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED/IO; never claims enabled hardware was disabled during rollback. Existing enable is identified. A provider without CPU debug-control access rejects true with UNSUPPORTED before activation; it neither queries nor changes external debugger control."
msgstr "成功，或返回 INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED/IO；绝不声称回滚禁用了已启用的硬件。已有启用状态会被识别。无法由 CPU 访问调试控制的提供者在激活前以 UNSUPPORTED 拒绝 true；它既不查询，也不改变外部调试器控制。"

msgid "Feed an enabled watchdog without changing product health policy."
msgstr "对已启用的看门狗执行喂狗，不改变产品健康策略。"

msgid "[inout] Fixed enabled provider with one serialized feed owner."
msgstr "[inout] 固定且已启用的 provider，只有一个串行化喂狗所有者。"

msgid "Success, INVALID/CONTEXT, or STATE when no feed is admitted. A window provider returns BUSY for an early feed and STATE for its guarded late boundary; neither reloads or waits. Task/IRQ execution is bounded and allocation-free."
msgstr "成功；INVALID/CONTEXT，或未准入喂狗时的 STATE。窗口 provider 对过早喂狗返回 BUSY，对受保护的迟喂边界返回 STATE；两者都不会 reload 或等待。任务／IRQ 执行有界且不分配内存。"

msgid "Query current watchdog effect and timeout uncertainty."
msgstr "查询当前看门狗效果与超时不确定性。"

msgid "[in] Fixed provider."
msgstr "[in] 固定 provider。"

msgid "[out] Current hardware/remembered initialization state."
msgstr "[out] 当前硬件状态或已记忆的初始化状态。"

msgid "Success or INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE; UNSUPPORTED retains observed hardware effects with both timeout bounds zero when those bounds cannot be established. Never infer a disabled watchdog from a failed query or unknown timeout."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE；无法建立时限界限时，UNSUPPORTED 仍保留已观察到的硬件效应，并把两个 timeout 界限保持为零。绝不能根据查询失败或未知 timeout 推断看门狗已经关闭。"

msgid "Read latched boot reset causes captured before clearing flags."
msgstr "读取清除标志前捕获的锁存启动复位原因。"

msgid "No implicit acknowledgement, reboot or product classification."
msgstr "不隐式确认、不重启，也不作产品分类。"

msgid "Bitmask of NX_RESET_*; multiple causes may be reported."
msgstr "NX_RESET_* 位掩码；可同时报告多个原因。"

msgid "Hardware-selected timeout bounds, including declared clock uncertainty."
msgstr "硬件所选 timeout 界限，包含已声明的时钟不确定性。"

msgid "A zero minimum and maximum mean the timeout bounds are unknown, for example while hardware shadow updates remain pending or no oscillator limits have been reviewed. The enabled and irreversible facts remain valid. debug_freeze reports the provider-supported firmware configuration. Providers with CPU-readable debug control observe its setting. A provider without CPU debug-control access supports false only; that value does not observe or describe an external debugger's setting. An unproved activation write may retain enabled and irreversible effects; the provider never retries it implicitly or infers safe shutdown from failed readback."
msgstr "最小值和最大值均为零表示超时边界未知，例如硬件影子寄存器更新尚未完成，或振荡器限制尚未复核。enabled 和 irreversible 事实仍然有效。debug_freeze 报告提供者支持的固件配置。能够由 CPU 读取调试控制的提供者会观察该设置。不具备 CPU 调试控制访问能力的提供者仅支持 false；该值既未观察，也不描述外部调试器的设置。 未证实的激活写入也可保留 enabled 与 irreversible 效应；provider 不会隐式重试，也不会依据回读失败推断能够安全关闭。"

msgid "One privileged task executor, IRQ masks clear. IN FIFO writes do not prove host ACK. OUT overrun drains all packet words without overflow. Selected F407 ISO packets require a remaining Core deadline at most one second, observed ULPI speed and exactly one transaction. Hardware selects next frame/microframe parity; it does not implement interval scheduling, retries or receive acknowledgment. An incomplete ISO opportunity settles IO only after source/FIFO/AHB withdrawal. Long execution stalls expire by Core time before modular frame comparison."
msgstr "单一特权任务执行者，IRQ 屏蔽须解除。写入 IN FIFO 不能证明主机已 ACK。OUT 包超长时仍排空全部 FIFO 数据字，不越界写目标缓冲。选定的 F407 ISO packet 要求剩余 Core deadline 至多一秒、选用 ULPI 时须先观察实际速度，且每次只有一个 transaction。硬件选择下一个 frame／microframe 的奇偶，不实现 interval 调度、重试或接收确认。不完整 ISO 机会只有在 source／FIFO／AHB 撤回后才以 IO 结清。执行长停顿时，先按 Core time 判断超时，再进行模帧计数比较。"

msgid "Success after readback, BUSY retains a pending request; a selected ISO direction returns UNSUPPORTED without an endpoint write."
msgstr "回读验证后成功；BUSY 保留待完成请求。选定的 ISO 方向返回 UNSUPPORTED，不写 endpoint 寄存器。"

msgid "Task/ISR bounded and read-only. Facts identify selected software support; they never imply PCB routing, VBUS wiring or physical qualification. Public metadata, endpoint arrays, faces and operations tables require their natural C alignment and nonwrapping extents. Numeric rejection is not a probe of arbitrary addresses or opaque private contexts. EP0 selects control/64; nonzero bulk selects 8/16/32/64-byte MPS at FS or 512 at HS. Interrupt selects nonzero IN/OUT with 1..64-byte MPS at FS or 1..1024 at HS. ISO selects 1..1023 bytes at FS or 1..1024 at HS, with one transaction per opportunity; full FIFO admission remains the controller's duty. ISO never supports STALL or ACK guarantees. Its request selects next-frame parity, keeps a finite remaining deadline of at most one second and never retries a missed opportunity. ULPI ISO submission requires an observed speed; FS fallback caps MPS at 1023. External descriptors own interval and synchronization; this profile does not schedule a periodic stream."
msgstr "在 Task／ISR 中有界且只读。事实标识选定的软件支持；绝不表示 PCB 布线、VBUS 接线或物理资格。公共元数据、endpoint 数组、face 及 operations table 须按其 C 类型自然对齐，存储范围不能回绕。数值检查中的拒绝不能用于探测任意地址或不透明的私有 context。EP0 选择 control/64；非零 bulk 在 FS 选择 8/16/32/64-byte MPS，在 HS 选择 512-byte MPS。interrupt 选择非零 IN/OUT，FS MPS 为 1..64-byte，HS 为 1..1024。ISO 在 FS 选择 1..1023-byte、HS 选择 1..1024-byte，每次机会一个 transaction；完整 FIFO 准入仍由 controller 负责。ISO 不支持 STALL 或 ACK 保证。请求选择下一帧奇偶，剩余有限 deadline 至多一秒，错过机会不重试。ULPI ISO 提交要求已经观察到 speed；FS 回退将 MPS 限为 1023。interval 与同步由外部 descriptor 负责，该 profile 不调度周期流。"
